const dailyHadithRoman = <String, String>{
  "abudawud|4782": "jab tum mein se kisi ko ghussa aaye aur wo khara ho to chahiye ke baitth jaye, ab agar us ka ghussa rafa ho jaye ( to behtar hai ) warna phir let jaye.",
  "abudawud|4786": "Umm almominin Aishah razi Allah anha kehti hain ke Rasool Allah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne na kabhi kisi khaadim ko mara, aur na kabhi kisi aurat ko.",
  "abudawud|4807": "Allah rafiq hai, rafq aur narmi pasand karta hai, aur us par wo deta hai, jo sakhti par nahin deta 1؎.",
  "abudawud|4895": "Allah ne mujh ko wahi ki hai ke tum log toaza ikhtiyar karo yahan tak ke tum mein se koi kisi par ziadati na kare aur na koi kisi par fakhr kare.",
  "abudawud|5198": "chhota bare ko salaam kare ga, chalne waala baithe hue ko, aur thoday log zyada logon ko.",
  "bukhari|1": "ko hamidi ne ye hadees bayan ki, unhon ne kaha ke hum ko Sufyan ne ye hadees bayan ki, wo kehte hain hum ko Yahya bin Saeed Ansari ne ye hadees bayan ki, unhon ne kaha ke mujhe ye hadees Muhammad bin Ibrahim timi se hasil hui. unhon ne us hadees ko alqmah bin waqaas lisi se suna, un ka bayan hai ke mein ne masjid nabwi mein manbar Rasool sallallahu alaihi wasallam par Umar bin khatab razi Allah anhu ki zabaan se suna, wo farma rahe the ke mein ne janab Rasool Allah sallallahu alaihi wasallam se suna aap sallallahu alaihi wasallam farma rahe the ke tamam aamaal ka darumdar niyyat par hai aur har amal ka natijah har insaan ko us ki niyyat ke mutabiq hi mile ga. pas jis ki hijrat ( tark watan ) daulat duniya hasil karne ke liye ho ya kisi aurat se shadi ki gharaz ho. pas us ki hijrat un hi chizon ke liye ho gi jin ke hasil karne ki niyyat se us ne hijrat ki hai.",
  "bukhari|10": "musalman wo hai jis ki zabaan aur haath se musalman bachche rahein aur muhajir wo hai jo un kaamon ko chhor de jin se Allah ne mana farmaya. abwabdallah ( Imam Bukhari rahimahu Allah ) ne farmaya aur abumaaoia ne ke hum ko hadees bayan ki daud bin Abi hind ne, unhon ne riwayat ki amir shabi se, unhon ne kaha ke mein ne suna Abdullah bin amru bin aas se, wo hadees bayan karte hain janab Nabi kareem sallallahu alaihi wasallam se ( wahi mazkorah hadees ) aur kaha ke abdalaali ne riwayat kiya daud se, unhon ne amir se, unhon ne Abdullah bin amru bin aas se, unhon ne Nabi kareem sallallahu alaihi wasallam se.",
  "bukhari|1000": "hum se Musa bin Ismail ne bayan kiya, kaha ke hum se jaweria bin asma ne bayan kiya, un se Nafi ne aur un se Abdullah bin Umar razi Allah anhuma ne ke Nabi kareem sallallahu alaihi wasallam safar mein apni soari hi par raat ki namaz isharon se parh lete the khwah soari ka rukh kisi taraf ho jata aap sallallahu alaihi wasallam isharon se parhte rehte magar faraiz us tarah nahin parhte the aur Witr apni oontni par parh lete.",
  "bukhari|106": "mujh par jhoot mat bolo. kyunki jo mujh par jhoot bandhay wo dozakh mein dakhil ho.",
  "bukhari|108": "jo shakhs mujh par jaan bojh kar jhoot bandhay to wo apna thikana jahannam mein bina lay.",
  "bukhari|109": "hum se makki Ibn Ibrahim ne bayan kiya, un se yazid bin Abi abeed ne Salamah bin alako razi Allah anhu ke waste se bayan kiya, wo kehte hain ke mein ne Rasool Allah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ko ye farmate hue suna ke jo shakhs mere naam se wo baat bayan kare jo mein ne nahin kahi to wo apna thikana jahannam mein bina lay.",
  "bukhari|11": "hum ko Saeed bin Yahya bin Saeed amwi qureshi ne ye hadees sunayi, unhon ne us hadees ko apne walid se naqal kiya, unhon ne abubardah bin Abdullah bin Abi bardah se, unhon ne Abi bardah se, unhon ne Abu Musa razi Allah anhu se, wo kehte hain ke logon ne puchha ya Rasool Allah! kaun sa Islam afzal hai? to Nabi kareem sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne farmaya wo jis ke manne wale musalmanon ki zabaan aur haath se sare musalman salamati mein rahein.",
  "bukhari|110": "hum se Musa ne bayan kiya, un se abooanah ne Abi haseen ke wastah se naqal kiya, wo abusaleh se riwayat karte hain, wo Abu Hurairah razi Allah anhu se wo Rasool Allah sallallahu alaihi wasallam se ke ( apni aulad ) ka mere naam ke oopar naam rakho. magar meri kanit ikhtiyar na karo aur jis shakhs ne mujhe khawab mein dekha to blashbah us ne mujhe dekha. kyunki shaitan meri soorat mein nahin aao sakta aur jo shakhs mujh par jaan bojh kar jhoot bole wo dozakh mein apna thakana talash kare.",
  "bukhari|1123": "hum se Abu al-Yaman ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha ke humein Shuaib ne Zuhri se khabar di, unhon ne kaha ke mujhe Urwah ne khabar di aur unhein Umm almominin Aishah sadiqah razi Allah anha ne khabar di ke Rasool Allah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ( raat mein ) gayarah rakaatein parhte the. aap sallallahu alaihi wasallam ki yahi namaz thi. lekin us ke sajde itne lambe hua karte ke tum mein se koi Nabi kareem sallallahu alaihi wasallam ke sir athane se qabal pachas aaiteyn parh sakta tha ( aur tulu Fajr hone par ) Fajr ki namaz se pehle aap sallallahu alaihi wasallam do rakaat sunnat parhte. us ke baad dayein pehlu par let jate. aaqar mozan aap sallallahu alaihi wasallam ko namaz ke liye balaane aata.",
  "bukhari|1125": "walzhi * wallil aza saji * ma wadak rabak wama qali».",
  "bukhari|1126": "subhanallah! aaj raat kiya kiya bulain utari hain aur saath hi ( rahmat aur inayat ke ) kaise khazaney nazil hue hain. un hujre waliyon ( azwaj matahraat rizwan Allah alihan ) ko koi jagane waala hai afsos! ke duniya mein bahut see kapde pahanne wali auratein aakhirat mein nangi hoon gi.",
  "bukhari|1128": "hum se Abdullah bin Yusuf tanisi ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha ke hum se Imam Malik ne Ibn Shihab Zuhri se bayan kiya, un se Urwah ne, un se Aishah razi Allah anha ne farmaya ke Rasool Allah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ek kaam ko chhor dete aur aap sallallahu alaihi wasallam ko us ka karna pasand hota. us khayal se tark kar dete ke doosre sahabah bhi us par ( aap ko dekh kar ) amal sharwa kar dein aur us tarah wo kaam un par farz ho jaye. chunaanchah Rasool Allah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne chaasht ki namaz kabhi nahin parhi lekin mein parhti hoon.",
  "bukhari|113": "hum se Ali bin Abdullah ne bayan kiya, un se Sufyan ne, un se amru ne, wo kehte hain ke mujhe wahab bin manba ne apne bhai ke waste se khabar di, wo kehte hain ke mein ne Abu Hurairah razi Allah anhu ko kehte hue suna ke Rasool Allah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ke sahabah mein Abdullah bin amru razi Allah anhuma ke alawah mujh se zyada koi hadees bayan karne waala nahin tha. magar wo likh liya karte the aur mein likhta nahin tha. doosri sanad se mamar ne wahab bin manba ki matabat ki, wo Hammam se riwayat karte hain, wo Abu Hurairah razi Allah anhu se.",
  "bukhari|1131": "sab namazon mein Allah ta'ala ke nazdeek pasandeedah namaz daud alaihi assalam ki namaz hai aur rozon mein bhi daud alaihi assalam hi ka roza. aap adhi raat tak sote, us ke baad tihai raat namaz parhne mein guzarte. phir raat ke chhatay hissay mein bhi sau jate. isi tarah aap ek din roza rakhte aur ek din iftaar karte the.",
  "bukhari|1134": "hum se yaqub bin Ibrahim ne bayan kiya, kaha ke hum se rooh bin ibadah ne bayan kiya, kaha ke hum se Saeed bin Abi arubah ne bayan kiya, un se Qatadah ne, un se Anas bin Malik razi Allah anhu ne ke Nabi kareem sallallahu alaihi wasallam aur Zaid bin Sabit razi Allah anhu donon ne mil kar sehri khayi, sehri se farigh ho kar aap sallallahu alaihi wasallam namaz ke liye khare ho gaye aur donon ne namaz parhi. hum ne Anas razi Allah anhu se puchha ke sehri se faraghat aur namaz sharwa karne ke darmiyan kitna faaslah raha ho ga? aap ne jawaab diya ke itni der mein ek aadmi pachas aaiteyn parh sakta hai.",
  "bukhari|1135": "hum se sulaiman bin harab ne bayan kiya, kaha ke hum se Shubah ne Aamash se bayan kiya, un se abooail ne aur un se Abdullah bin Masood razi Allah anhu ne farmaya ke mein ne Rasool Allah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ke saath ek martabah raat ko namaz parhi. aap sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne itna lamba qiyam kiya ke mere dil mein ek ghalat khayal paida ho gaya. hum ne puchha ke wo ghalat khayal kiya tha to aap ne bataya ke mein ne socha ke baitth jaon aur Nabi kareem sallallahu alaihi wasallam ka saath chhor doon.",
  "bukhari|1136": "hum se hifas bin Umar ne bayan kiya, kaha ke hum se Khalid bin Abdullah ne bayan kiya, un se haseen bin Abdur Rahman ne un se abooail ne aur un se Huzaifah razi Allah anhu ne ke Nabi kareem sallallahu alaihi wasallam jab raat ko Tahajjud ke liye khare hote to pehle apna munh masoak se khub saaf karte.",
  "bukhari|1137": "do, do rakaat aur jab tulu subah hone ka andeshah ho to ek rakaat Witr parh kar apni sari namaz ko taaq bina lay.",
  "bukhari|1138": "hum se masdad ne bayan kiya, kaha ke hum se Yahya bin Saeed Qattan ne bayan kiya, un se Shubah ne kaha ke mujh se abuhamzah ne bayan kiya aur un se Ibn abbas razi Allah anhuma ne ke Nabi kareem sallallahu alaihi wasallam ki raat ki namaz terah rakaat hoti thi.",
  "bukhari|1139": "aap sallallahu alaihi wasallam saat, nau aur gayarah tak rakaatein parhte the. Fajr ki sunnat us ke siwa hoti.",
  "bukhari|1140": "hum se Ubaidullah bin Musa ne bayan kiya, kaha ke humein hanzlah bin Abi Sufyan ne khabar di, unhein Qasim bin Muhammad ne aur unhein Aishah sadiqah razi Allah anha ne, aap ne batlaia ke Nabi kareem sallallahu alaihi wasallam raat ko terah rakaatein parhte the. Witr aur Fajr ki do sunnat rakaatein isi mein hotin.",
  "bukhari|1145": "hamara parwardigar buland barkat waala hai har raat ko us waqt aasmaan duniya par aata hai jab raat ka aakhri tihai hissah rah jata hai. wo kehta hai koi mujh se dua karne waala hai ke mein us ki dua qubool karun, koi mujh se mangne waala hai ke mein use doon koi mujh se bakhshish talab karne waala hai ke mein us ko bakhsh doon.",
  "bukhari|1146": "hum se aboalolid ne bayan kiya, kaha ke hum se Shubah ne bayan kiya, (doosri sanad) aur mujh se sulaiman bin harab ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha ke hum se Shubah ne bayan kiya, un se aboashaq amru bin Abdullah ne, un se aswad bin yazid ne, unhon ne batlaia ke mein ne Aishah sadiqah razi Allah anha se puchha ke Nabi kareem sallallahu alaihi wasallam raat mein namaz keunkr parhte the? aap ne batlaia ke sharwa raat mein sau rehte aur aaqar raat mein bedar ho kar Tahajjud ki namaz parhte. us ke baad bistar par aao jate aur jab mozan azaan deta to jaldi se uth bethte. agar ghusl ki zaroorat hoti to ghusl karte warna wuzu kar ke bahar tashreef lay jate.",
  "bukhari|1148": "hum se Muhammad bin Musanna ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha ke hum se Yahya bin Saeed Qattan ne bayan kiya aur unhon ne kaha ke hum se Hisham bin Urwah ne bayan kiya ke mujhe mere baap Urwah ne khabar di ke Aishah sadiqah razi Allah anha ne batlaia ke mein ne Nabi kareem sallallahu alaihi wasallam ko raat ki kisi namaz mein baitth kar Quran parhte nahin dekha. yahan tak ke aap sallallahu alaihi wasallam boodhay ho gaye to baitth kar Quran parhte the lekin jab tees chalis aaiteyn rah jatin to khare ho jate phir us ko parh kar ruku karte the.",
  "bukhari|115": "subhanallah! aaj ki raat kis qadr fatne ataray gaye hain aur kitne hi khazaney bhi khole gaye hain. un hajrah waliyon ko jagao. kyunki bahut see auratein ( jo ) duniya mein ( barik ) kapda pahanne wali hain wo aakhirat mein nangi hoon gi.",
  "bukhari|1160": "hum se Abdullah bin yazid ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha ke hum se Saeed bin Abi Ayyub ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha ke mujh se aboalasod Muhammad bin Abdur Rahman ne bayan kiya, un se Urwah bin Zubair razi Allah anhu ne aur un se Aishah sadiqah razi Allah anha ne, unhon ne farmaya ke Nabi kareem sallallahu alaihi wasallam Fajr ki do sunnat rakaatein parhne ke baad dayein karwat par let jate.",
  "bukhari|1161": "hum se bashr bin hukm ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha ke hum se Sufyan ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha ke mujh se salim aboalanzar ne Abu Salamah bin Abdur Rahman se bayan kiya aur un se Aishah razi Allah anha ne ke Nabi kareem sallallahu alaihi wasallam jab Fajr ki suntein parh chakte to agar mein jaagti hoti to aap sallallahu alaihi wasallam mujh se baatein karte warna let jate jab tak namaz ki azaan hoti.",
  "bukhari|1162": "hum se Ali bin Abdullah madini ne bayan kiya, un se Sufyan bin Uyainah ne bayan kiya, un se aboalanzar salim ne bayan kiya ke mujh se mere baap aboamiah ne bayan kiya, un se Abu Salamah ne aur un se Aishah razi Allah anha ne ke Nabi kareem sallallahu alaihi wasallam jab do rakaat ( Fajr ki sunnat ) parh chakte to us waqt agar mein jaagti hoti to aap sallallahu alaihi wasallam mujh se baatein karte warna let jate. mein ne Sufyan se kaha ke baaz raawi Fajr ki do rakaatein use batatey hain to unhon ne farmaya ke haan ye wahi hain.",
  "bukhari|1165": "mujh se Muhammad bin bashar ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha ke hum se Muhammad bin jafar ne bayan kiya, un se Shubah ne bayan kiya, un se Muhammad bin Abdur Rahman ne, un se un ki phuphi amrah bint Abdur Rahman ne aur un se Aishah sadiqah razi Allah anha ne ke Rasool Allah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ( doosri sanad ) aur hum se ahmd bin yunis ne bayan kiya, kaha ke hum se Zuhair ne bayan kiya, kaha ke hum se Yahya bin Saeed Ansari ne bayan kiya, un se Muhammad bin Abdur Rahman ne, un se amrah bint Abdur Rahman ne aur un se Aishah sadiqah razi Allah anha ne ke Nabi kareem sallallahu alaihi wasallam subah ki ( farz ) namaz se pehle ki do ( sunnat ) rakaaton ko bahut mukhtasar rakhte the. aap ne un mein surat fathaa bhi parhi ya nahin mein ye bhi nahin keh sakti.",
  "bukhari|1167": "jab koi tum mein se masjid mein aaye to na baithe jab tak do rakaat ( tahiat almsajd ki ) na parh lay.",
  "bukhari|1170": "jo shakhs bhi ( masjid mein ) aaye aur Imam khatba de raha ho ya khatba ke liye nikal chuka ho to wo do rakaat namaz ( tahiat almsajd ki ) parh lay.",
  "bukhari|1175": "nahin. mein ne puchha aur Umar parhte the? aap ne farmaya ke nahin. mein ne puchha aur Abu Bakr razi Allah anhu? farmaya nahin. mein ne puchha aur Nabi kareem sallallahu alaihi wasallam? farmaya nahin. mera khayal yahi hai.",
  "bukhari|1176": "fatah makkah ke din aap sallallahu alaihi wasallam un ke ghar tashreef laye, aap sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne ghusl kiya aur phir aath rakaat ( chaasht ki ) namaz parhi. to mein ne aisi halki phalki namaz kabhi nahin dekhi. albatah aap sallallahu alaihi wasallam ruku aur sajdah poori tarah ada karte the.",
  "bukhari|1183": "Maghrib ke farz se pehle ( sunnat ki do rakaatein ) parha karo. teesri martabah aap sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne yun farmaya ke jis ka ji chahe kyunki aap sallallahu alaihi wasallam ko ye baat pasand na thi ke log use lazmi samajh bethin.",
  "bukhari|1184": "hum bhi Rasool Allah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ke zamanah mein use parhte the. mein ne kaha phir ab us ke chhodne ki kiya wajah hai? unhon ne farmaya ke duniya ke karubar maane hain.",
  "bukhari|1187": "apne gharon mein bhi kuchh namazein parha karo aur unhein bilkul qabren na bina low ( ke jahan namaz hi na parhi jati ho ) wahib ke saath us hadees ko abdalohab saqfi ne bhi Ayyub se riwayat kiya hai.",
  "bukhari|12": "tum khana khilao, aur jis ko pahchano us ko bhi aur jis ko na pahchano us ko bhi, algharaz sab ko salaam karo.",
  "bukhari|129": "jo shakhs Allah se us kefiat ke saath mulaqat kare ke us ne Allah ke saath kisi ko sharik na kiya ho, wo ( yaqeenan ) jannat mein dakhil ho ga, Muadh bole, ya Rasool Allah! kiya mein us baat ki logon ko basharat na suna doon? aap sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne farmaya nahin, mujhe khauf hai ke log us par baharosa kar bethin ge.",
  "bukhari|13": "Nabi kareem sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne farmaya tum mein se koi shakhs imaandaar na ho ga jab tak apne bhai ke liye wo na chahe jo apne nafs ke liye chahta hai.",
  "bukhari|132": "hum se masdad ne bayan kiya, un se Abdullah Ibn daud ne Aamash ke waste se bayan kiya, unhon ne manzar Sauri se naqal kiya, unhon ne Muhammad Ibn alhanfiah se naqal kiya, wo Ali razi Allah anhu se riwayat karte hain ke mein isa shakhs tha jise jarian mazi ki shikayat thi, to mein ne ( apne shagird ) muqdaad ko hukm diya ke wo Rasool Allah sallallahu alaihi wasallam se daryaft karein. to unhon ne aap sallallahu alaihi wasallam se us baare mein puchha. aap sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne farmaya ke us ( marz ) mein ghusl nahin hai ( haan ) wuzu farz hai.",
  "bukhari|136": "hum se Yahya bin bakir ne bayan kiya, un se lais ne Khalid ke waste se naqal kiya, wo Saeed bin Abi halal se naqal karte hain, wo naeem almajmar se, wo kehte hain ke mein ( ek martabah ) Abu Hurairah razi Allah anhu ke saath masjid ki chhat par chadha. to aap ne wuzu kiya aur kaha ke mein ne Rasool Allah sallallahu alaihi wasallam se suna tha ke aap sallallahu alaihi wasallam farma rahe the ke meri ummat ke log wuzu ke nishanat ki wajah se qiyamat ke din safed peshani aur safed haath paaon walon ki shakal mein balae jayein ge. to tum mein se jo koi apni chamak badhana chahta hai to wo badha lay ( yaani wuzu achhi tarah kare ).",
  "bukhari|14": "qasam hai us zaat ki jis ke haath mein meri jaan hai. tum mein se koi bhi imaandaar na ho ga jab tak mein us ke walid aur aulad se bhi zyada us ka mahbub na bin jaon.",
  "bukhari|1409": "hum se Muhammad bin Musanna ne bayan kiya ‘ kaha ke hum se Yahya bin Saeed ne Ismail bin Abi Khalid se bayan kiya, kaha ke mujh se Qais bin Abi Hazim ne bayan kiya aur un se Ibn Masood razi Allah anha ne bayan kiya ke hasad ( rushk ) karna sirf do hi aadmiyon ke saath jaiz ho sakta hai. ek to us shakhs ke saath jise Allah ne maal diya aur use haq aur munasib jaghon mein kharch karne ki tufiq di. doosre us shakhs ke saath jise Allah ta'ala ne hikmat ( aqal ilm Quran wa hadees aur muamalah fahmi ) di aur wo apni hikmat ke mutabiq haq faislay karta hai aur logon ko us ki taleem deta hai.",
  "bukhari|1410": "jo shakhs halaal kamai se ek khajoor ke barabar sadaqah kare aur Allah ta'ala sirf halaal kamai ke sadaqah ko qubool karta hai to Allah ta'ala use apne dahne haath se qubool karta hai phir sadaqah karne wale ke faide ke liye us mein ziadati karta hai. bilkul isi tarah jaise koi apne janwar ke bachche ko khila pala kar badhata hai taanka us ka sadaqah pahad ke barabar ho jata hai. Abdur Rahman ke saath us riwayat ki matabat sulaiman ne Abdullah bin dinar ki riwayat se ki hai aur warqa ne Ibn dinar se kaha ‘ un se Saeed bin yasar ne ‘ un se Abu Hurairah razi Allah anhu ne aur un se Nabi kareem sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne aur us ki riwayat Muslim bin Abi maryam ‘ Zaid bin aslam aur saheel ne abusaleh se ki ‘ un se Abu Hurairah razi Allah anhu ne aur un se Nabi kareem sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne.",
  "bukhari|1411": "hum se Adam bin Abi yas ne bayan kiya ‘ unhon ne kaha ke hum se Shubah ne bayan kiya ‘ unhon ne kaha ke hum se Saeed bin Khalid ne bayan kiya ‘ unhon ne kaha ke mein ne harsa bin wahab razi Allah anhu se suna ‘ unhon ne farmaya ke mein ne Nabi kareem sallallahu alaihi wasallam se suna tha ke sadaqah karo ‘ ek isa zamanah bhi tum par aanay waala hai jab ek shakhs apne maal ka sadaqah lay kar niklay ga aur koi use qubool karne waala nahin paye ga.",
  "bukhari|1414": "logon par zaroor ek zamanah isa aao jaye ga ke ek shakhs sone ka sadaqah lay kar niklay ga lekin koi use lene waala nahin mile ga aur ye bhi ho ga ke ek mard ki panah mein chalis chalis auratein ho jayein gi kyunki mardon ki kami ho jaye gi aur auraton ki ziadati ho gi.",
  "bukhari|1416": "hum se Saeed bin Yahya ne bayan kiya, kaha mujh se mere walid ne bayan kiya, kaha ke hum se Aamash ne bayan kiya, un se shaqiq ne aur un se abumsaud Ansari razi Allah ta'ala anhu ne kaha ke Rasool Allah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne jab humein sadaqah karne ka hukm diya to hum mein se bahut se bazar ja kar bojh athane ki mazduri karte aur us tarah ek mudd ( ghalah ya khajoor wagairah ) hasil karte. ( jise sadaqah kar dete ) lekin aaj hum mein se bahut son ke pass lakh lakh ( darham ya dinar ) mojod hain.",
  "bukhari|1417": "hum se sulaiman bin harab ne bayan kiya ‘ kaha ke hum se Shubah ne bayan kiya aur un se aboashaq amru bin Abdullah sabii ne kaha ke mein ne Abdullah bin maql se suna ‘ unhon ne kaha ke mein ne adi bin hatim razi Allah anhu se suna ‘ unhon ne kaha ke mein ne Rasool Allah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ko ye kehte suna ke jahannam se bacho agarchah khajoor ka ek tukda de kar hi sahi ( magar zaroor sadaqah kar ke dozakh ki aag se bachne ki koshish karo ).",
  "bukhari|1424": "sadaqah kiya karo pas anqrib ek isa zamanah aanay waala hai jab aadmi apna sadaqah lay kar niklay ga ( koi use qubool kar lay magar jab wo kisi ko de ga to wo ) aadmi kahe ga ke agar use tum kal laye hote to mein lay leta lekin aaj mujhe us ki hajat nahin rahi.",
  "bukhari|1426": "behtareen khairaat wo hai jis ke dene ke baad aadmi maldar rahe. phir sadaqah pehle unhein do jo tumhari zer parwarish hain.",
  "bukhari|1429": "jab ke aap manbar par tashreef rakhte the. aap ne sadaqah aur kisi ke samne haath na phelane ka aur doosron se mangne ka zikr farmaya aur farmaya ke oopar waala haath neeche wale haath se behtar hai. oopar ka haath kharch karne wale ka hai aur neeche ka haath mangne wale ka.",
  "bukhari|143": "Allahumma faqha fi aldeen» ay Allah! us ko deen ki samajh ata farmayo.",
  "bukhari|1430": "mein ghar ke andar sadaqah ke sone ka ek tukda chhor aaya tha mujhe ye baat pasand nahin aayi ke use taqsim ke bina raat guzaron pas mein ne us ko bant diya.",
  "bukhari|1431": ". chunaanchah auratein kangan aur baliyan ( Bilal razi Allah anhu ke kapde mein ) dalne lagin.",
  "bukhari|1433": "khairaat ko mat rok warna tera rizq bhi rok diya jaye ga.",
  "bukhari|1434": "( maal ko ) theli mein band kar ke na rakhna warna Allah paak bhi tumhare liye apne khazaney mein bandsh laga de ga. jahan tak ho sakay logon mein khair khairaat taqsim karti rah.",
  "bukhari|1438": "khazan» musalman amantadar jo kuchh bhi kharch karta hai aur baaz dafah farmaya wo cheez poori tarah deta hai jis ka use sarmaya ke Malik ki taraf se hukm diya gaya aur us ka dil bhi us se khush hai aur isi ko diya hai jise dene ke liye Malik ne kaha tha to wo dene waala bhi sadaqah dene walon mein se ek hai.",
  "bukhari|1439": "hum se Adam bin Abi yas ne bayan kiya ‘ kaha ke humein Shubah ne khabar di ‘ kaha ke hum se mansoor bin mamar aur Aamash donon ne bayan kiya ‘ un se abooail ne ‘ un se masrooq ne aur un se Aishah razi Allah anha ne Nabi kareem sallallahu alaihi wasallam ke hawala se ke jab koi aurat apne shohar ke ghar ( ke maal ) se sadaqah kare.",
  "bukhari|144": "jab tum mein se koi bit alkhla mein jaye to qiblah ki taraf munh kare na us ki taraf pusht kare ( balkeh ) mashriq ki taraf munh kar low ya Maghrib ki taraf.",
  "bukhari|1442": "koi din isa nahin jata ke jab bande subah ko uthte hain to do farishte aasmaan se na utartay hoon. ek farshta to ye kehta hai ke ay Allah! kharch karne wale ko us ka badlah de. aur doosra kehta hai ke ay Allah! «mamask» aur bakhil ke maal ko talif kar de.",
  "bukhari|145": "hum se Abdullah bin Yusuf ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha ke hum ko Imam Malik ne Yahya bin Saeed se khabar di. wo Muhammad bin Yahya bin haban se, wo apne chicha wasa bin haban se riwayat karte hain, wo Abdullah bin Umar razi Allah anhuma se riwayat karte hain. wo farmate the ke log kehte the ke jab qaza hajat ke liye betho to na qiblah ki taraf munh karo na bit almaqdas ki taraf ( ye sun kar ) Abdullah bin Umar razi Allah anhuma ne farmaya ke ek din mein apne ghar ki chhat par chadha to mein ne Nabi kareem sallallahu alaihi wasallam ko dekha ke aap bit almaqdas ki taraf munh kar ke do anton par qaza hajat ke liye baithe hain. phir Abdullah bin Umar razi Allah anhuma ne ( wasa se ) kaha ke shayad tum un logon mein se ho jo apne chotadon ke bill namaz parhte hain. tab mein ne kaha Allah ki qasam! mein nahin janta ( ke aap ka matlab kiya hai ) Imam Malik rahimahu Allah ne kaha ke Abdullah bin Umar razi Allah anhuma ne us se wo shakhs murad liya jo namaz mein zamin se uncha na rahe, sajdah mein zamin se chamt jaye.",
  "bukhari|1455": "hum se Muhammad bin Abdullah ne bayan kiya ‘ unhon ne kaha ke mujh se mere baap ne bayan kiya ‘ unhon ne kaha mujh se samama ne bayan kiya ‘ un se Anas bin Malik razi Allah anhu ne bayan kiya ke Abu Bakr razi Allah anhu ne unhein Rasool Allah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ke bayan kardah ahkaam zakaat ke mutabiq likha ke zakaat mein boodhay, aibi aur nar na liye jayein ‘ albatah agar sadaqah wasool karne waala munasib samjhe to lay sakta hai.",
  "bukhari|1467": "haan un par kharch kar. to jo kuchh bhi un par kharch kare gi us ka sawaab tajah ko mile ga.",
  "bukhari|147": "tumhein qaza hajat ke liye bahar nikalnay ki ijazat hai. Hisham kehte hain ke hajat se murad pakhane ke liye ( bahar ) jana hai.",
  "bukhari|1471": "tum mein se koi bhi agar ( zaroorat mand ho to ) apni rasi lay kar aaye aur lakdiyon ka gatha bandh kar apni peeth par rakh kar laye. aur use beche. us tarah Allah ta'ala us ki izzat ko mehfooz rakh lay to ye us se achha hai ke wo logon se sawaal karta pharay ‘ use wo dein ya na dein.",
  "bukhari|1476": "miskeen wo nahin jise ek do luqmay dar dar pharain. miskeen to wo hai jis ke pass maal nahin. lekin use sawaal se sharm aati hai aur wo logon se chamt kar nahin mangta ( miskeen wo jo kamae magar baqdari zaroorat na pa sakay ).",
  "bukhari|1486": "hai jab tak us ki pakhtagi zahr na ho. aur Ibn Umar razi Allah anhuma se jab poochtay ke us ki pakhtagi kiya hai, wo kehte ke jab ye maloom ho jaye ke ab ye phal afat se bach rahe ga.",
  "bukhari|1487": "jab tak un ki pakhtagi khal na jaye.",
  "bukhari|1488": "hai. unhon ne bayan kiya ke murad ye hai ke jab tak wo pak kar surkh na ho jayein.",
  "bukhari|1491": ". chahi chahi! nakalo use. phir aap sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne farmaya ke kiya tumhein maloom nahin ke hum log sadaqah ka maal nahin khate.",
  "bukhari|15": "tum mein se koi shakhs imaandaar na ho ga jab tak us ke walid aur us ki aulad aur tamam logon se zyada us ke dil mein meri mohabbat na ho jaye.",
  "bukhari|150": "hum se aboalolid Hisham bin Abdul Malik ne bayan kiya, un se Shubah ne abumaaz se jin ka naam Ata bin Abi Maimunah tha naqal kiya, unhon ne Anas bin Malik razi Allah anhu se suna, wo kehte the ke jab Rasool Allah sallallahu alaihi wasallam rafa hajat ke liye nikaltay to mein aur ek larka apne saath paani ka bartan lay aate the. matlab ye hai ke us paani se Rasool Allah sallallahu alaihi wasallam taharat kiya karte the.",
  "bukhari|1505": "jo“ ka sadaqah diya karte the.",
  "bukhari|1506": "hum se Abdullah bin Yusuf ne bayan kiya ‘ unhon ne kaha ke humein Imam Malik ne khabar di ‘ un se Zaid bin aslam ne bayan kiya ‘ un se yaz bin Abdullah bin Saad bin Abi sarh amri ne bayan kiya ‘ ke unhon ne Abu Saeed khadri razi Allah anhu se suna. aap farmate the ke hum fatra ki zakaat ek saa anaj ya gehoon ya ek saa jo ya ek saa khajoor ya ek saa paneer ya ek saa zabib ( khashak angoor ya anjir ) nikala karte the.",
  "bukhari|1507": "tha. Abdullah bin Umar razi Allah anhuma ne bayan kiya ke phir logon ne isi ke barabar do mudd ( adha saa ) gehoon kar liya tha.",
  "bukhari|1509": "hum se Adam bin Abi yas ne bayan kiya unhon ne kaha ke hum se hifas bin misra ne bayan kiya ‘ unhon ne kaha ke mujh se Musa bin aqbah ne bayan kiya ‘ un se Nafi ne aur un se Abdullah bin Umar razi Allah anhuma ne ke Nabi kareem sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne sadaqah fitar namaz ( Eid ) ke liye jane se pehle pehle nikalnay ka hukm diya tha.",
  "bukhari|151": "hum se sulaiman bin harab ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha hum se Shubah ne bayan kiya, wo Ata bin Abi Maimunah se naqal karte hain, unhon ne Anas razi Allah anhu se suna, wo kehte hain ke jab Nabi kareem sallallahu alaihi wasallam qaza hajat ke liye nikaltay, mein aur ek larka donon aap sallallahu alaihi wasallam ke peeche jate the aur hamare saath paani ka ek bartan hota tha.",
  "bukhari|1510": "hum se Muadh bin fazalah ne bayan kiya ‘ unhon ne kaha ke hum se aboamr hifas bin misra ne bayan kiya ‘ un se Zaid bin aslam ne bayan kiya ‘ un se yaz bin Abdullah bin Saad ne ‘ un se Abu Saeed khadri razi Allah anhu ne bayan kiya ke hum Nabi kareem sallallahu alaihi wasallam ke zamanah mein idalftar ke din ( khane ke ghalah se ) ek saa nikaltay the. Abu Saeed razi Allah anhu ne bayan kiya ke hamara khana ( un dinon ) jo, zabib, paneer aur khajoor tha.",
  "bukhari|152": "hum se Muhammad bin bashar ne bayan kiya, un se Muhammad bin jafar ne, un se Shubah ne Ata bin Abi Maimunah ke waste se bayan kiya, unhon ne Anas bin Malik se suna, wo kehte the ke Rasool Allah sallallahu alaihi wasallam bit alkhla mein jate to mein aur ek larka paani ka bartan aur nezah lay kar chalte the. paani se aap taharat karte the, ( doosri sanad se ) nazar aur shazan ne us hadees ki Shubah se matabat ki hai. anzah laathi ko kehte hain jis par phalka laga hua ho.",
  "bukhari|156": "mein teen patthar talash kar ke aap ke pass laun. lekin mujhe do patthar mile. tisra dhonda magar mil na saka. to mein ne khashak gobar utha liya. us ko lay kar aap sallallahu alaihi wasallam ke pass aao gaya. aap sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne patthar ( to ) lay liye ( magar ) gobar phenk diya aur farmaya ye khud naapaak hai. ( aur ye hadees ) abrahm bin Yusuf ne apne baap se bayan ki. unhon ne aboashaq se suna, un se Abdur Rahman ne bayan kiya.",
  "bukhari|16": "teen khaslaten aisi hain ke jis mein ye paida ho jayein us ne imaan ki mathas ko pa liya. awal ye ke Allah aur us ka Rasool us ke nazdeek sab se zyada mahbub bin jayein, doosre ye ke wo kisi insaan se mehaz Allah ki raza ke liye mohabbat rakhe. teesaray ye ke wo kafar mein wapas lotne ko isa bura jane jaisa ke aag mein dalay jane ko bura janta hai.",
  "bukhari|161": "jo shakhs wuzu kare use chahiye ke naak saaf kare aur jo patthar se istinja kare use chahiye ke taaq adad ( yaani ek ya teen ya paanch hi ) se kare.",
  "bukhari|163": "well lalaaqab min alnar» ”ediyon ke liye aag ka azaab hai“ do martabah ya teen martabah farmaya.",
  "bukhari|165": "( khashak ) ediyon ke liye aag ka azaab hai.",
  "bukhari|167": "tha ke ghusl dahni taraf se do, aur aaza wuzu se ghusl ki abtadaa karo.",
  "bukhari|17": "Ansaar se mohabbat rakhna imaan ki nishani hai aur Ansaar se keenah rakhna nifaq ki nishani hai.",
  "bukhari|172": "jab kutta tum mein se kisi ke bartan mein se ( kuchh ) pi lay to us ko saat martabah dho low ( to paak ho jaye ga ).",
  "bukhari|176": "bandah us waqt tak namaz hi mein rehta hai jab tak wo masjid mein namaz ka intizaar karta hai. tauqitaka wo hadas na kare. ek ajmi aadmi ne puchha ke ay Abu Hurairah! hadas kiya cheez hai? unhon ne farmaya ke hua jo peeche se kharij ho. ( jise arf aam mein guz marna kehte hain ).",
  "bukhari|178": "hum se qatibah ne bayan kiya, kaha hum se Jarir ne Aamash ke waste se bayan kiya, wo manzar se, wo aboyali Sauri se, wo Muhammad Ibn alhanfiah se naqal karte hain ke Ali razi Allah anhu ne farmaya ke mein isa aadmi tha jis ko silan mazi ki shikayat thi, magar Rasool Allah sallallahu alaihi wasallam se daryaft karte hue mujhe sharm aayi. to mein ne Ibn alsud ko hukm diya, unhon ne aap sallallahu alaihi wasallam se puchha, aap sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne farmaya ke us mein wuzu karna farz hai. us riwayat ko Shubah ne bhi Aamash se riwayat kiya.",
  "bukhari|181": "namaz ka maqam tumhare samne ( yaani mazdalfah mein ) hai. wahan namaz parhi jaye gi.",
  "bukhari|188": "(aur ek doosri hadees mein) Abu Musa ashari razi Allah anhu kehte hain ke Nabi akram sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne ek pyalah mangwaya. jis mein paani tha. us se aap sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne apne haath dhoye aur isi pyalah mein munh dhoya aur us mein kuli farmayi, phir farmaya, to tum log us ko pi low aur apne chahron aur sinon par daal low.",
  "bukhari|189": "hum se Ali bin Abdullah ne bayan kiya, kaha hum se yaqub bin Ibrahim bin Saad ne, kaha hum se mere baap ne, unhon ne Salih se suna. unhon ne Ibn Shihab se, kaha unhein mehmood bin alrbia ne khabar di, Ibn Shihab kehte hain mehmood wahi hain ke jab wo chhote the to Rasool Allah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne un hi ke kanveen ( ke paani ) se un ke munh mein kuli dali thi aur Urwah ne isi hadees ko masor wagairah se bhi riwayat kiya hai aur har ek ( raawi ) un donon mein se ek doosre ki tasdiq karte hain ke jab Rasool Allah sallallahu alaihi wasallam wuzu farmate to aap sallallahu alaihi wasallam ke bachche hue wuzu ke paani par sahabah razi Allah anhum jhagadnay ke qareeb ho jate the.",
  "bukhari|1892": "hum se masdad bin masrhad ne bayan kiya, kaha hum se Ismail bin alaihi ne bayan kiya un se Ayyub ne, un se Nafi ne aur un se Ibn Umar razi Allah anhuma ne bayan kiya ke Rasool Allah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne yom ashorah ka roza rakha tha aur aap sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne us ke rakhne ka sahabah razi Allah anhum ko abtadaa Islam mein hukm diya tha, jab mah Ramazan ke roze farz ho gaye to ashorah ka roza bataur farz chhor diya gaya, Abdullah bin Umar razi Allah anhuma ashorah ke din roza na rakhte magar jab un ke roze ka din hi yom ashorah aan parta.",
  "bukhari|1893": "jis ka ji chahe yom ashorah ka roza rakhe aur jis ka ji chahe na rakhe.",
  "bukhari|1896": "jannat ka ek darwazah hai jise rian kehte hain qiyamat ke din us darwazah se sirf roza dar hi jannat mein dakhil hoon ge, un ke siwa aur koi us mein se nahin dakhil ho ga, pukara jaye ga ke roza dar kahan hai? wo khare ho jayein ge un ke siwa us se aur koi nahin andar jane paye ga aur jab ye log andar chale jayein ge to ye darwazah band kar diya jaye ga phir us se koi andar na ja sakay ga.",
  "bukhari|1898": "jab Ramazan aata hai to jannat ke darwaze khol diye jate hain.",
  "bukhari|1899": "jab Ramazan ka mahina aata hai to aasmaan ke tamam darwaze khol diye jate hain, jahannam ke darwaze band kar diye jate hain aur shiatin ko zanjiron se jakad diya jata hai.",
  "bukhari|19": "hum se (us hadees ko) Abdullah bin muslma ne bayan kiya, unhon ne use Malik rahimahu Allah se naqal kiya, unhon ne Abdur Rahman bin Abdullah bin Abi sasaa se, unhon ne apne baap (Abdullah rahimahu Allah) se, wo Abu Saeed khadri se naqal karte hain ke Rasool Allah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne farmaya wo waqt qareeb hai jab musalman ka ( sab se ) umdah maal ( us ki bakrian hoon gi ). jin ke peeche wo pahadon ki chotiyon aur barsati wadiyon mein apne deen ko bachanay ke liye bhag jaye ga.",
  "bukhari|1900": "jab Ramazan ka chaand dekho to roza sharwa kar do aur jab shawal ka chaand dekho to roza iftaar kar do aur agar abar ho to andazah se kaam karo. ( yaani tees roze poore kar low ) aur baaz ne lais se bayan kiya ke mujh se aqeel aur yunis ne bayan kiya ke ”Ramazan ka chaand“ murad hai.",
  "bukhari|1901": "jo koi shab qadr mein imaan ke saath aur hasool sawaab ki niyyat se ibadat mein khara ho us ke tamam pichhle gunah bakhsh diye jayein ge aur jis ne Ramazan ke roze imaan ke saath aur sawaab ki niyyat se rakhe us ke uglay tamam gunah maaf kar diye jayein ge.",
  "bukhari|1902": "hum se Musa bin Ismail ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha hum se Ibrahim bin Saad ne bayan kiya, unhein Ibn Shihab ne khabar di, unhein Ubaidullah bin Abdullah bin atba ne ke Abdullah bin abbas razi Allah anhuma ne kaha Nabi kareem sallallahu alaihi wasallam sakhawat aur khair ke muamalah mein sab se zyada sakhi the aur aap sallallahu alaihi wasallam ki sakhawat us waqt aur zyada badh jati thi jab Jibreel alaihi assalam aap sallallahu alaihi wasallam se Ramazan mein milte, Jibreel alaihi assalam Nabi kareem sallallahu alaihi wasallam se Ramazan sharif ki har raat mein milte yahan tak ke Ramazan guzar jata. Nabi kareem sallallahu alaihi wasallam Jibreel alaihi assalam se Quran ka door karte the, jab Jibreel alaihi assalam aap sallallahu alaihi wasallam se milne lagte to aap sallallahu alaihi wasallam chalti hua se bhi zyada bhalai pahunchane mein sakhi ho jaya karte the.",
  "bukhari|1903": "agar koi shakhs jhoot bolna aur daga bazi karna ( roze rakh kar bhi ) na chhode to Allah ta'ala ko us ki koi zaroorat nahin ke wo apna khana peena chhor de.",
  "bukhari|1906": "jab tak chaand na dekho roza sharwa na karo, isi tarah jab tak chaand na dekh low roza moqof na karo aur agar badal chha jaye to tees din poore kar low.",
  "bukhari|1907": "mahina kabhi untis raton ka bhi hota hai us liye ( untis poore ho jane par ) jab tak chaand na dekh low roza na sharwa karo aur agar badal ho jaye to tees din ka shumar poora kar low.",
  "bukhari|1909": "ya yun kaha ke aboalqasm sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne farmaya chaand hi dekh kar roze sharwa karo aur chaand hi dekh kar roza moqof karo aur agar badal ho jaye to tees din poore kar low.",
  "bukhari|1911": "mahina untis din ka bhi hota hai.",
  "bukhari|1912": "donon mahine naqis nahin rehte. murad Ramazan aur zee alhajah ke donon mahine hain.",
  "bukhari|1914": "tum mein se koi shakhs Ramazan se pehle ( shaban ki aakhri tarikhon mein ) ek ya do din ke roze na rakhe albatah agar kisi ko un mein roze rakhne ki adat ho to wo us din bhi roza rakh lay.",
  "bukhari|1920": "hum se Muhammad bin Ubaidullah ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha hum se Abdul Aziz bin Abi Hazim ne bayan kiya, un se abuhazam ne bayan kiya aur un se sahal bin Saad razi Allah anhu ne bayan kiya ke mein sehri apne ghar khata phir jaldi karta takeh namaz Nabi kareem sallallahu alaihi wasallam ke saath mil jaye.",
  "bukhari|1921": "hum se Muslim bin Ibrahim ne bayan kiya, kaha hum se Hisham ne bayan kiya, kaha hum se Qatadah ne bayan kiya, un se Anas razi Allah anhu ne aur un se Zaid bin Sabit razi Allah anhu ne ke Nabi kareem sallallahu alaihi wasallam ke saath hum ne sehri khayi, phir aap sallallahu alaihi wasallam subah ki namaz ke liye khare hue. mein ne puchha ke sehri aur azaan mein kitna faaslah hota tha to unhon ne kaha ke pachas aaiteyn ( parhne ) ke muafaq faaslah hota tha.",
  "bukhari|1922": "mein tumhari tarah nahin hoon. mein to barabar khilaya aur pilaya jata hoon.",
  "bukhari|1923": "sehri khao ke sehri mein barkat hoti hai.",
  "bukhari|1924": "hum se aboasm ne bayan kiya, kaha ke hum se yazid bin Abi abeed ne bayan kiya, un se Salamah bin akwa ne ke Nabi kareem sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne ashorah ke din ek shakhs ko ye ailan karne ke liye bheja ke jis ne khana kha liya wo ab ( din dubne tak roza ki halat mein ) poora kare ya ( ye farmaya ke ) roza rakhe aur jis ne na khaya ho ( to wo roza rakhe ) khana na khaye.",
  "bukhari|1927": "yaqbal» ( bosa lena ) wa mubashirat ( apne jism se laga lena ) bhi kar lete the. Nabi kareem sallallahu alaihi wasallam tum sab se zyada apni khwahishaat par qabu rakhne wale the, bayan kiya ke Ibn abbas razi Allah anhuma ne kaha ke ( surat tah mein jo «marb» ka lafz hai wo ) hajat wa zaroorat ke mani mein hai, taus ne kaha ke lafz «auli alarbat» ( jo surat alnoor mein hai ) us ahmakh ko kahin ge jise auraton ki koi zaroorat na ho.",
  "bukhari|1928": "hum se Muhammad bin Musanna ne bayan kiya, kaha hum se Yahya bin Saeed Qattan ne bayan kiya, un se Hisham ne bayan kiya ke mujhe mere walid Urwah ne khabar di aur unhein Aishah razi Allah anha ne Nabi kareem sallallahu alaihi wasallam ke hawala se (doosri sanad Imam Bukhari rahimahu Allah ne kaha ke) aur hum se Abdullah bin muslma ne bayan kiya, un se Imam Malik rahimahu Allah ne, un se Hisham bin Urwah ne, un se un ke baap ne aur un se Aishah razi Allah anha ne bayan kiya ke Rasool Allah sallallahu alaihi wasallam apni baaz azwaj ka roza dar hone ke bawajood bosa lay liya karte the. phir aap hansein.",
  "bukhari|1930": "hum se ahmd bin Salih ne bayan kiya, kaha hum se Abdullah bin wahab ne bayan kiya, un se yunis ne bayan kiya, un se Ibn Shihab ne, un se Urwah aur Abu Bakr ne ke Aishah razi Allah anha ne kaha Ramazan mein Fajr ke waqt Nabi kareem sallallahu alaihi wasallam ahtlam se nahin ( balkeh apni azwaj ke saath sohbat karne ki wajah se ) ghusl karte aur roza rakhte the. ( maloom hua ke ghusl janabat roza dar Fajr ke baad kar sakta hai ).",
  "bukhari|1933": "jab koi bhool gaya aur kuchh kha pi liya to use chahiye ke apna roza poora kare. kyunki us ko Allah ne khilaya aur pilaya.",
  "bukhari|194": "hum se aboalolid ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha hum se Shubah ne Muhammad bin almankdar ke waste se, unhon ne Jabir razi Allah anhu se suna, wo kehte the ke Rasool Allah sallallahu alaihi wasallam meri mizaj percy ke liye tashreef laye. mein bimar tha isa ke mujhe hosh tak nahin tha. aap sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne wuzu kiya aur apne wuzu ka paani mujh par chahadka, to mujhe hosh aao gaya. mein ne arz kiya, ya Rasool Allah! mera waris kaun ho ga? mera to sirf ek kalala waris hai. us par aayat miraas nazil hui.",
  "bukhari|1940": "hum se Adam bin Abi yas ne bayan kiya, hum se Shubah ne bayan kiya, kaha ke mein ne Sabit banani se suna, unhon ne Anas bin Malik razi Allah anhu se puchha tha ke kiya aap log roza ki halat mein pachhna lagwaney ko makruh samjha karte the? aap ne jawaab diya ke nahin albatah kamzori ke khayal se ( roza mein nahin lagwate the ) shababa ne ye ziadati ki hai ke hum se Shubah ne bayan kiya ke ( isa hum ) Nabi kareem sallallahu alaihi wasallam ke ahd mein ( karte the ).",
  "bukhari|1942": "hum se masdad ne bayan kiya, kaha hum se Yahya bin Qattan ne bayan kiya, un se Hisham bin Urwah ne bayan kiya ke mujh se mere baap Urwah ne bayan kiya, un se Aishah razi Allah anha ne ke hamza bin amru aslami razi Allah anhu ne arz ki ya Rasool Allah! mein safar mein lagatar roza rakhta hoon.",
  "bukhari|1943": "agar ji chahe to roza rakh aur ji chahe iftaar kar.",
  "bukhari|1944": "hum se Abdullah bin Yusuf tanisi ne bayan kiya, kaha ke hum ko Imam Malik ne khabar di, unhein Ibn Shihab ne, unhein Ubaidullah bin Abdullah bin atba ne aur unhein Ibn abbas razi Allah anhuma ne ke Nabi kareem sallallahu alaihi wasallam ( fatah makkah ke mauqa par ) makkah ki taraf Ramazan mein chale to aap sallallahu alaihi wasallam roza se the lekin jab kadid pahunche to roza rakhna chhor diya. abwabdallah ( Imam Bukhari rahimahu Allah ) ne kaha ke asfan aur qadid ke darmiyan kadid ek talab hai.",
  "bukhari|1946": "kiya baat hai? logon ne kaha ke ek roza dar hai, aap sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne farmaya ke safar mein ro zaa rakhna achha kaam nahin hai.",
  "bukhari|1947": "hum se Abdullah bin muslma ne bayan kiya, kaha hum se Imam Malik ne, un se Humaid tavil ne aur un se Anas bin Malik razi Allah anhu ne ke hum Nabi kareem sallallahu alaihi wasallam ke saath ( Ramazan mein ) safar kiya karte the. ( safar mein bahut se roze se hote aur bahut se be roza hote ) lekin roze dar be roza dar par aur be roza dar roze dar par kisi qasam ki aib joyi nahin kiya karte the.",
  "bukhari|1949": "fadyah taam miskeen» parhi aur farmaya ye mansukh hai.",
  "bukhari|1950": "hum se ahmd bin yunis ne bayan kiya, kaha ke hum se Zuhair ne bayan kiya, un se Yahya bin Abi kaseer ne bayan kiya, un se Abu Salamah ne bayan kiya ke mein ne Aishah razi Allah anha se suna wo farmatin ke Ramazan ka roza mujh se chhot jata. shaban se pehle us ki qaza ki tufiq na hoti. Yahya ne kaha ke ye Nabi kareem sallallahu alaihi wasallam ki khidmat mein mashghul rahne ki wajah se tha.",
  "bukhari|1951": "kiya jab aurat haizah hoti hai to namaz aur roze nahin chhor deti? yahi us ke deen ka nuqsaan hai.",
  "bukhari|1952": "agar koi shakhs mar jaye aur us ke zamah roze wajib hoon to us ka wali us ki taraf se roze rakh de, Musa ke saath us hadees ko Ibn wahab ne bhi amru se riwayat kiya aur Yahya bin Ayyub sakhtiyani ne bhi Ibn Abi jafar se.",
  "bukhari|1957": "meri ummat ke logon mein us waqt tak khair baqi rahe gi, jab tak wo iftaar mein jaldi karte rahein ge.",
  "bukhari|1958": "( oont se ) utar kar mere liye sato ghol, us ne kaha: ya Rasool Allah! agar shaam hone ka kuchh aur intizaar farmayen to behtar ho, aap sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne farmaya, utar kar mere liye sato ghol ( waqt ho gaya hai ) jab tum ye dekh low ke raat idhar mashriq se aao gayi to roza dar ke roza kholne ka waqt ho gaya.",
  "bukhari|196": "hum se Muhammad bin alala ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha hum se aboasama ne barid ke waste se bayan kiya, wo abubardah se, wo Abu Musa razi Allah anhu se riwayat karte hain ke Rasool Allah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne ek pyalah mangaya jis mein paani tha. phir us mein aap sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne apne donon haathon aur chehre ko dhoya aur isi mein kuli ki.",
  "bukhari|1962": ". sahabah razi Allah anhum ne arz ki ke aap to wisaal karte hain? aap sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne farmaya ke mein tumhari tarah nahin hoon, mujhe to khilaya aur pilaya jata hai.",
  "bukhari|1969": "hum se Abdullah bin Yusuf ne bayan kiya, kaha ke hum ko Imam Malik rahimahu Allah ne khabri di, unhein aboalanzar ne, unhein Abu Salamah ne aur un se Aishah razi Allah anha ne bayan kiya, ke Rasool Allah sallallahu alaihi wasallam nafil roza rakhne lagte to hum ( aapas mein ) kehte ke ab aap sallallahu alaihi wasallam roza rakhna chhoden ge hi nahin. aur jab roza chhor dete to hum kehte ke ab aap roza rakhen ge hi nahin. mein ne Ramazan ko chhor kar Rasool Allah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ko kabhi poore mahine ka nafli roza rakhte nahin dekhta aur jitne roze aap shaban mein rakhte mein ne kisi mahina mein us se zyada roze rakhte aap ko nahin dekha.",
  "bukhari|1971": "hum se Musa bin Ismail ne bayan kiya, un se abooanah ne bayan kiya, un se abubshar ne, un se Saeed bin jabeer ne aur un se Ibn abbas razi Allah anhuma ne bayan kiya ke Ramazan ke siwa Nabi kareem sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne kabhi poore mahine ka roza nahin rakha. aap sallallahu alaihi wasallam nafil roza rakhne lagte to dekhne waala keh uthtaa ke bakhda, ab aap be roza nahin rahein ge aur isi tarah jab nafil roza chhor dete to kehne waala kehta ke wallah! ab aap sallallahu alaihi wasallam roza nahin rakhen ge.",
  "bukhari|1974": "Rasool Allah sallallahu alaihi wasallam mere yahan tashreef laye. phir unhon ne poori hadees bayan ki, yaani tumhare mulaqation ka bhi tum par haq hai aur tumhari biwi ka bhi tum par haq hai. us par mein ne puchha aur daud alaihi assalam ka roza kaisa tha? to aap ne farmaya ke ek din roza rakhna aur ek din be roza rehna sum dawoodi hai.",
  "bukhari|1984": "hai? unhon ne jawaab diya ke haan! aboasm ke alawah ravion ne ye izafah kiya hai ke khali ( ek Jumuah hi ke din ) roza rakhne se aap sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne mana farmaya.",
  "bukhari|1985": "koi bhi shakhs Jumuah ke din us waqt tak roza na rakhe jab tak us se ek din pehle ya us ke ek baad roza na rakhta ho.",
  "bukhari|1986": "ke kal ke din bhi to ne roza rakha tha? unhon ne jawaab diya ke nahin. phir aap sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne daryaft farmaya kiya aaindah kal roza rakhne ka irada hai? jawaab diya ke nahin. aap sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne farmaya ke phir roza tod do. Hammad bin jad ne bayan kiya ke unhon ne Qatadah se suna, un se aboayob ne bayan kiya aur un se jaweria razi Allah anha ne bayan kiya ke Nabi kareem sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne hukm diya aur unhon ne roza tod diya.",
  "bukhari|1987": "hum se masdad ne bayan kiya, kaha ke hum se Yahya ne bayan kiya, un se Sufyan ne, un se mansoor ne, un se Ibrahim ne, un se alqmah ne, unhon ne Aishah razi Allah anha se puchha ke kiya Rasool Allah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne ( roza wagairah ibaadaat ke liye ) kuchh din khas taur par maqrar kar rakhe the? unhon ne kaha nahin. balkeh aap ke har amal mein hamishgi hoti thi aur doosra kaun hai jo Rasool Allah sallallahu alaihi wasallam jitni taqat rakhta ho?",
  "bukhari|1994": "hai. ( goya Ibn Umar razi Allah anhuma ne koi qatayi faislah nahin diya ).",
  "bukhari|1996": "abwabdallah (Imam Bukhari rahimahu Allah) farmate hain ke mujh se Muhammad bin Musanna ne bayan kiya, kaha ke hum se Yahya bin Saeed ne bayan kiya, un se Hisham ne bayan kiya ke mujhe mere baap Urwah ne khabar di ke Aishah razi Allah anha ayam mani ( ayam tashriq ) ke roze rakhti thin aur Hisham ke baap ( Urwah ) bhi un dinon mein roza rakhte the.",
  "bukhari|200": ". to aap sallallahu alaihi wasallam ke liye ek chooday munh ka pyalah laya gaya jis mein kuchh thora paani tha, aap sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne apni anglian us mein daal dein. Anas kehte hain ke mein paani ki taraf dekhne laga. paani aap sallallahu alaihi wasallam ki ungliyon ke darmiyan se phot raha tha. Anas razi Allah anhu kehte hain ke us ( ek pyalah ) paani se jin logon ne wuzu kiya, wo sattar ( 70 ) se isi ( 80 ) tak the.",
  "bukhari|2000": "ashorah ke din agar koi chahe to roza rakh lay.",
  "bukhari|2001": "hum se Abu al-Yaman ne bayan kiya, kaha ke hum ko Shuaib ne khabar di, un se Zuhri ne bayan kiya ke mujhe Urwah bin Zubair razi Allah anhu ne khabar di, un se Aishah razi Allah anha ne bayan kiya ke ( sharwa Islam mein ) Rasool Allah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne aashura ke din ka roza rakhne ka hukm diya tha. phir jab Ramazan ke roze farz ho gaye to jis ka dil chahta us din roza rakhta aur jo na chahta nahin rakha karta tha.",
  "bukhari|2002": "ab jis ka ji chahe us din roza rakhe aur jis ka chahe na rakhe.",
  "bukhari|2004": "phir Musa alaihi assalam ke ( sharik masrat hone mein ) hum tum se zyada masthaq hain. chunaanchah aap sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne us din roza rakha aur sahabah razi Allah anhum ko bhi us ka hukm diya.",
  "bukhari|2005": "tum bhi us din roza rakha karo.",
  "bukhari|201": "hum se abunim ne bayan kiya, kaha hum se masar ne, kaha mujh se Ibn jabeer ne, unhon ne Anas razi Allah anhu ko ye farmate hue suna ke Rasool Allah sallallahu alaihi wasallam jab dhote ya ( ye kaha ke ) jab nahate to ek saa se lay kar paanch mudd tak ( paani istemaal farmate the ) aur jab wuzu farmate to ek mudd ( paani ) se.",
  "bukhari|202": "hum se asbagh Ibn alfaraj ne bayan kiya, wo Ibn wahab se karte hain, kaha mujh se amru ne bayan kiya, kaha mujh se aboalanzar ne Abu Salamah bin Abdur Rahman ke waste se naqal kiya, wo Abdullah bin Umar se, wo Saad bin Abi waqaas se, wo Rasool Allah sallallahu alaihi wasallam se naqal karte hain ke Rasool Allah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne mozon par masah kiya. Abdullah bin Umar razi Allah anhuma ne apne walid majid Umar razi Allah anhu se us ke baare mein puchha to unhon ne kaha ( sach hai aur yaad rakho ) jab tum se Saad Rasool Allah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ki koi hadees bayan farmayen. to us ke mutalliq un ke siwa ( kisi ) doosre aadmi se mat poocho aur Musa bin aqbah kehte hain ke mujhe aboalanzar ne batlaia, unhein Abu Salamah ne khabar di ke Saad bin Abi waqaas ne un se ( Rasool Allah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ki ye ) hadees bayan ki. phir Umar razi Allah anhu ne ( apne bete ) Abdullah se isa kaha.",
  "bukhari|205": "hum se abdan ne bayan kiya, kaha humein Abdullah ne khabar di, kaha hum ko ozai ne Yahya ke waste se khabar di, wo Abu Salamah se, wo jafar bin amru se, wo apne baap se riwayat karte hain ke mein ne Rasool Allah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ko apne amame aur mozon par masah karte dekha. us ko riwayat kiya mamar ne Yahya se, wo Abu Salamah se, unhon ne amru se matabat ki aur kaha ke mein ne Rasool Allah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ko dekha ( aap waqi isa hi kiya karte the ).",
  "bukhari|206": "hum se abunim ne bayan kiya, kaha hum se zakriya ne Yahya ke waste se naqal kiya, wo amir se wo Urwah bin Mughirah se, wo apne baap (Mughirah) se riwayat karte hain ke mein ek safar mein Rasool Allah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ke saath tha, to mein ne chaha ( ke wuzu karte waqt ) aap sallallahu alaihi wasallam ke moze utaar dalon. aap sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne farmaya ke unhein rahne do. choonkeh jab mein ne unhein pahna tha to mere paaon paak the. ( yaani mein wuzu se tha ) pas aap sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne un par masah kiya.",
  "bukhari|208": "hum se Yahya bin bakir ne bayan kiya, kaha humein lais ne aqeel se khabar di, wo Ibn Shihab se riwayat karte hain, unhein jafar bin amru bin amia ne apne baap amru se khabar di ke unhon ne Rasool Allah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ko dekha ke aap sallallahu alaihi wasallam bakri ke shanah se kat kat kar kha rahe the, phir aap sallallahu alaihi wasallam namaz ke liye balae gaye to aap sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne chari daal di aur namaz parhi, naya wuzu nahin kiya.",
  "bukhari|21": "jis shakhs mein ye teen baatein hoon gi wo imaan ka mazah pale ga, ek ye ke wo shakhs jise Allah aur us ka Rasool un ke masva se zyada aziz hoon aur doosre ye ke jo kisi bande se mehaz Allah hi ke liye mohabbat kare aur teesri baat ye ke jise Allah ne kafar se najaat di ho, phir dubarah kafar ikhtiyar karne ko wo isa bura samjhe jaisa aag mein gar jane ko bura janta hai.",
  "bukhari|211": "hum se Yahya bin bakir aur qatibah ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha hum se lais ne bayan kiya, wo aqeel se, wo Ibn Shihab se, wo Ubaidullah bin Abdullah bin atba se, wo Abdullah bin abbas razi Allah anhuma se riwayat karte hain ke Rasool Allah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne doodh piya, phir kuli ki aur farmaya us mein chiknai hoti hai. us hadees mein aqeel ki yunis aur Salih bin kisan ne Zuhri se matabat ki hai.",
  "bukhari|212": "jab namaz parhte waqt tum mein se kisi ko ungh aao jaye, to chahiye ke wo sau rahe yahan tak ke neend ( ka asar ) us se khatm ho jaye. us liye ke jab tum mein se koi shakhs namaz parhne lage aur wo ungh raha ho to wo kuchh nahin jane ga ke wo ( Allah ta'ala se ) maghfirat talab kar raha hai ya apne nafs ko baddua de raha hai.",
  "bukhari|213": "jab tum namaz mein unghane lago to sau jana chahiye. phir us waqt namaz padhe jab jaan lay ke wo kiya parh raha hai.",
  "bukhari|214": "karte the. mein ne kaha tum log kis tarah karte the, kehne lage hum mein se har ek ko us ka wuzu us waqt tak kaafi hota, jab tak koi wuzu todne wali cheez pesh na aao jati. ( yaani peshab, pakhana, ya neend wagairah ).",
  "bukhari|215": "hum se Khalid bin mukhlid ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha hum se sulaiman ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha mujhe Yahya bin Saeed ne khabar di, unhein bashir bin yasar ne khabar di, unhon ne kaha mujhe soed bin Numan razi Allah anhu ne batlaia unhon ne kaha ke hum khaibar wale saal Rasool Allah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ke hamraah jab sahba mein pahunche to Rasool Allah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne humein Asr ki namaz padhai. jab namaz parh chakay to aap sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne khane mangwaye. magar ( khane mein ) sirf sato hi laya gaya. sau hum ne ( isi ko ) khaya aur piya. phir Rasool Allah sallallahu alaihi wasallam Maghrib ki namaz ke liye khare ho gaye. to aap sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne kuli ki, phir humein Maghrib ki namaz padhai aur ( naya ) wuzu nahin kiya.",
  "bukhari|217": "hum se yaqub bin Ibrahim ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha hum ko Ismail bin Ibrahim ne khabar di, kaha mujhe rooh bin alqasim ne batlaia, kaha mujh se Ata bin Abi Maimunah ne bayan kiya, wo Anas bin Malik razi Allah anhu se riwayat karte hain ke Rasool Allah sallallahu alaihi wasallam jab rafa hajat ke liye bahar tashreef lay jate to mein aap sallallahu alaihi wasallam ke pass paani lata. aap sallallahu alaihi wasallam us se istinja farmate.",
  "bukhari|2320": "koi bhi musalman jo ek darakht ka pauda lagaye ya kheti mein bej boye, phir us mein se parand ya insaan ya janwar jo bhi khate hain wo us ki taraf se sadaqah hai Muslim ne bayan kiya ke hum se aban ne bayan kiya, un se Qatadah ne bayan kiya, aur un se Anas razi Allah anhu ne Nabi kareem sallallahu alaihi wasallam ke hawala se.",
  "bukhari|2321": "jis qaum ke ghar mein ye cheez dakhil hoti hai to apne saath zillat bhi lati hai.",
  "bukhari|2325": "hum se hukm bin Nafi ne bayan kiya, kaha ke hum ko Shuaib ne khabar di, un se Abu az-Zinad ne bayan kiya, un se Aaraj ne aur un se Abu Hurairah razi Allah anhu ne bayan kiya ke Ansaar ne Nabi kareem sallallahu alaihi wasallam se kaha ke hamare bagat aap hum mein aur hamare ( muhajir ) bhaiyon mein taqsim farma dein. aap sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne inkaar kiya to Ansaar ne ( muhajirin se ) kaha ke aap log darakhton mein mehnat karo. hum tum meve mein sharik rahein ge. unhon ne kaha achha hum ne suna aur qubool kiya.",
  "bukhari|2326": "hum se Musa bin Ismail ne bayan kiya, ke hum se jaweria ne bayan kiya, un se Nafi ne, aur un se Abdullah bin Umar razi Allah anhuma ne bayan kiya ke Nabi kareem sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne bani nazir ke khajooron ke bagh jala diye aur kat diye. un hi ke bagat ka naam boirah tha. aur hasan razi Allah anhu ka ye shar isi ke mutalliq hai. bani loi ( quraish ) ke sardaron par ( ghalbah ko ) boirah ki aag ne aasan bina diya jo har taraf phailti hi ja rahi thi.",
  "bukhari|2329": "hum se masdad ne bayan kiya, kaha ke hum se Yahya bin Saeed ne bayan kiya, un se Ubaidullah ne, un se Nafi ne, aur un se Abdullah bin Umar razi Allah anhuma ne ke Nabi kareem sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne khaibar ke phal aur anaj ki adhi paidawar par wahan ke rahne walon se muamalah kiya tha.",
  "bukhari|2334": "hum se sadaqah ne bayan kiya, kaha ke hum ko Abdur Rahman bin mehdi ne khabar di, unhein Imam Malik ne, unhein Zaid bin aslam ne, un se un ke walid ne bayan kiya ke hum se sadaqah ne bayan kiya, kaha ke hum ko Abdur Rahman bin mehdi ne khabar di, unhein Imam Malik ne, unhein Zaid bin aslam ne, un se un ke walid ne bayan kiya ke Umar ne farmaya, agar mujhe baad mein aanay wale musalmanon ka khayal na hota to jitne shehar bhi fatah karta, unhein fatah karne walon mein taqsim karta jata, bilkul isi tarah jis tarah Nabi kareem sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne khaibar ki zamin taqsim farma di thi. … hadees matalqah abwab: maftuha shehar ki ghazion mein taqsim ki sunnat.",
  "bukhari|2335": "jis ne koi aisi zamin aabad ki, jis par kisi ka haq nahin tha to us zamin ka wahi haqdaar hai. Urwah ne bayan kiya ke Umar razi Allah anhu ne apne ahd khilafat mein yahi faislah kiya tha.",
  "bukhari|2345": "hum se Yahya bin bakir ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha ke hum se lais bin Saad ne bayan kiya, un se aqeel ne bayan kiya, un se Ibn Shihab ne, unhein salim ne khabar di ke Abdullah bin Umar razi Allah anhuma ne bayan kiya ke Rasool Allah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ke zamanah mein mujhe maloom tha ke zamin ko batai par diya jata tha. phir unhein dar hua ke mumkin hai ke Nabi kareem sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne us silsile mein koi nayi hidayat farmayi ho jis ka ilm unhein na hua ho. chunaanchah unhon ne ( ahtiyata ) zamin ko batai par dena chhor diya.",
  "bukhari|2354": "faltu paani se kisi ko us gharaz se na ruko ke jo ghas zaroorat se zyada ho use bhi rok low.",
  "bukhari|236": "hum se Ali bin Abdullah ne bayan kiya, kaha hum se muan ne, kaha hum se Malik ne Ibn Shihab ke waste se bayan kiya, wo Ubaidullah Ibn Abdullah bin atba bin Masood se, wo Ibn abbas razi Allah anhuma se wo Maimunah razi Allah anha se naqal karte hain ke Rasool Allah sallallahu alaihi wasallam se chuhay ke baare mein daryaft kiya gaya jo ghi mein gar gaya tha. aap sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne farmaya ke us chuhay ko aur us ke aas pass ke ghi ko nikal kar phenk do. muan kehte hain ke Malik ne itni baar ke mein gun nahin sakta ( ye hadees ) Ibn abbas se aur unhon ne Maimunah razi Allah anha se riwayat ki hai.",
  "bukhari|2365": "ek aurat ko azaab, ek billi ki wajah se hua jise us ne itni der tak bandhay rakha tha ke wo bhook ki wajah se mar gayi. aur wo aurat isi wajah se dozakh mein dakhil hui. Nabi kareem sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne farmaya ke Allah ta'ala ne us se farmaya tha aur Allah ta'ala hi zyada janane waala hai ke jab to ne us billi ko bandhay rakha us waqt tak na to ne use khilaya na pilaya aur na chhora ke wo zamin ke kidey makore hi kha kar apna pait bhar leti.",
  "bukhari|237": "har zakham jo Allah ki rah mein musalman ko lage wo qiyamat ke din isi halat mein ho ga jis tarah wo laga tha. us mein se khun bahta ho ga. jis ka rang ( to ) khun ka sa ho ga aur khushboo mashak ki see ho gi.",
  "bukhari|2370": "charagaa Allah aur us ka Rasool hi mehfooz kar sakta hai. ( Ibn Shihab ne ) bayan kiya ke hum tak ye bhi pahuncha hai ke Nabi kareem sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne naqia mein charagaa banoai thi aur Umar razi Allah anhu ne sarf aur rabzah ko charagaa banaya.",
  "bukhari|2373": "agar koi shakhs rasi lay kar lakdiyon ka ghataa laye, phir use beche aur us tarah Allah ta'ala us ki aabru mehfooz rakhe to ye us se behtar hai ke wo logon ke samne haath philaye aur ( bhik ) use di jaye ya na di jaye. us ki bhi koi umeed na ho.",
  "bukhari|2374": "agar koi shakhs lakdiyon ka gatha apni peeth par ( bechnay ke liye ) liye pharay to wo us se achha hai ke kisi ke samne haath philaye. phir khwah use kuchh de ya na de.",
  "bukhari|238": "hum se Abu al-Yaman bayan kiya, kaha hum ko Shuaib ne khabar di, kaha mujhe Abu az-Zinad ne khabar di ke un se Abdur Rahman bin harmzalaarj ne bayan kiya, unhon ne Abu Hurairah razi Allah anhu se suna, unhon ne Rasool Allah sallallahu alaihi wasallam se suna, aap sallallahu alaihi wasallam farmate the ke hum ( log ) duniya mein pichhle zamane mein aaye hain ( magar aakhirat mein ) sab se aage hain.",
  "bukhari|24": "Abdullah bin Yusuf ne hum se bayan kiya, wo kehte hain ke humein Malik bin Anas ne Ibn Shihab se khabar di, wo salim bin Abdullah se naqal karte hain, wo apne baap (Abdullah bin Umar razi Allah anhuma) se ke ek dafah Rasool Allah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ek Ansari shakhs ke pass se guzre us hal mein ke wo apne ek bhai se keh rahe the ke tum itni sharm kyun karte ho. aap sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne us Ansari se farmaya ke us ko us ke hal par rahne do kyunki hea bhi imaan hi ka ek hissah hai.",
  "bukhari|242": "peene ki har wo cheez jo nasha lane wali ho haraam hai.",
  "bukhari|243": "hum se Muhammad ne bayan kiya, kaha hum se Sufyan bin Uyainah ne Ibn Abi Hazim ke waste se naqal kiya, unhon ne sahal bin Saad alsaadi se suna ke logon ne un se puchha, aur ( mein us waqt sahal ke itna qareeb tha ke ) mere aur un ke darmiyan koi doosra haail na tha ke Rasool Allah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ke ( ahad ke ) zakham ka ilaj kis dawa se kiya gaya tha. unhon ne kaha ke us baat ka janane waala ( ab ) mujh se zyada koi nahin raha. Ali razi Allah anhu apni dhal mein paani late aur fatima razi Allah anha aap sallallahu alaihi wasallam ke munh se khun dhotin phir ek boria ka tukda jalaya gaya aur aap sallallahu alaihi wasallam ke zakham mein bhar diya gaya.",
  "bukhari|244": "hum se aboalnaman ne bayan kiya, kaha hum se Hammad bin Zaid ne ghilan bin Jarir ke waste se naqal kiya, wo abubardah se wo apne baap se naqal karte hain ke mein ( ek martabah ) Rasool Allah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ki khidmat mein hazir hua to mein ne aap ko apne haath se masoak karte hue paia aur aap sallallahu alaihi wasallam ke munh se aa aa ki aawaz nikal rahi thi aur masoak aap sallallahu alaihi wasallam ke munh mein thi jis tarah aap sallallahu alaihi wasallam qay kar rahe hoon.",
  "bukhari|2443": "apne bhai ki madad karo wo zalim ho ya mazloom.",
  "bukhari|2444": "apne bhai ki madad karo khwah wo zalim ho ya mazloom. sahabah ne arz kiya, ya Rasool Allah! hum mazloom ki to madad kar sakte hain. lekin zalim ki madad kis tarah karein? aap sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne farmaya ke zulm se us ka haath pakad low ( yahi us ki madad hai ).",
  "bukhari|2446": "ek momin doosre momin ke saath ek imarat ke hukm mein hai ke ek ko doosre se quwwat pahunchti hai. aur aap sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne apne ek haath ki ungliyon ko doosre haath ki ungliyon ke andar kiya.",
  "bukhari|2447": "zulm qiyamat ke din andhere hoon ge.",
  "bukhari|2448": "hum se Yahya bin Musa ne bayan kiya, kaha hum se wakia ne bayan kiya, kaha hum se zakriya bin Ishaq makki ne bayan kiya, un se Yahya bin Abdullah sifi ne, un se Ibn abbas razi Allah anhuma ke ghulam abomabd ne, aur un se Ibn abbas razi Allah anhuma ne ke Nabi kareem sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne Muadh razi Allah anhu ko jab ( aamil bina kar ) yaman bheja, to aap sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne unhein hidayat farmayi ke mazloom ki baddua se darte rehna ke us ( dua ) ke aur Allah ta'ala ke darmiyan koi pardah nahin hota.",
  "bukhari|245": "hum se Usman bin Abi shibah ne bayan kiya, kaha hum se Jarir ne mansoor ke waste se, wo abooail se, wo Huzaifah se riwayat karte hain ke Rasool Allah sallallahu alaihi wasallam jab raat ko uthte to apne munh ko masoak se saaf karte.",
  "bukhari|2452": "jis ne kisi ki zamin zulm se lay li, use qiyamat ke din saat zaminon ka toq pehnaya jaye ga.",
  "bukhari|2453": "agar kisi shakhs ne ek balshat bhar zamin bhi kisi doosre ki zulm se lay li to saat zaminon ka toq ( qiyamat ke din ) us ke gardan mein dala jaye ga.",
  "bukhari|2454": "jis shakhs ne nahaq kisi zamin ka thora sa hissah bhi lay liya, to qiyamat ke din use saat zaminon tak dhansaya jaye ga. abwabdallah ( Imam Bukhari rahimahu Allah ) ne kaha ke ye hadees Abdullah bin mubarak ki us kitaab mein nahin hai jo kharasan mein thi. balkeh us mein thi jise unhon ne basra mein apne shagirdon ko amla karaya tha.",
  "bukhari|2455": "hai magar ye ke tum mein se koi shakhs apne bhai se ijazat lay lay.",
  "bukhari|2457": "Allah ta'ala ke yahan sab se zyada napasand wo aadmi hai jo sakhat jhagdalo ho.",
  "bukhari|246": "mein ne dekha ke ( khawab mein ) masoak kar raha hoon to mere pass do aadmi aaye. ek un mein se doosre se bara tha, to mein ne chhote ko masoak de di phir mujh se kaha gaya ke bare ko do. tab mein ne un mein se bare ko di. abwabdallah ( Imam Bukhari rahimahu Allah ) kehte hain ke us hadees ko naeem ne Ibn almubarak se, wo asama se, wo Nafi se, unhon ne Ibn Umar razi Allah anhuma se mukhtasar taur par riwayat kiya hai.",
  "bukhari|2461": "agar tumhara qiyam kisi qabeele mein ho aur tum se isa bartao kiya jaye jo kisi mehman ke liye munasib hai to tum use qubool kar low, lekin agar wo na karein to tum khud mahmani ka haq un se wasool kar low.",
  "bukhari|2462": "saqefat» chopal mein jama hue. mein ne Abu Bakr razi Allah anhu se kaha ke aap humein bhi waheen lay chale. chunaanchah hum Ansaar ke yahan saqefah bano saadah mein pahunche.",
  "bukhari|2463": "koi shakhs apne padosi ko apni deewar mein khonti garne se na roke. phir Abu Hurairah razi Allah anhu kaha karte the, ye kiya baat hai ke mein tumhein us se munh phirne waala pata hoon. qasam Allah! us khonti ko tumhare kandhon ke darmiyan gad doon ga.",
  "bukhari|2472": "ek shakhs raaste par chal raha tha ke us ne wahan kante dar dali dekhi. us ne use utha liya to Allah ta'ala ne us ka ye amal qubool kiya aur us ki maghfirat kar di.",
  "bukhari|2474": "hum se Adam bin Abi yas ne bayan kiya, kaha hum se Shubah ne bayan kiya, kaha hum se adi bin Sabit ne bayan kiya, kaha ke mein ne Abdullah bin yazid Ansari razi Allah anhu se suna, jo adi bin Sabit ke nana the. ke Nabi kareem sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne lot mar karne aur maslah karne se mana farmaya tha.",
  "bukhari|2477": "bartan dho low. abwabdallah ( Imam Bukhari rahimahu Allah ) kehte hain Ibn Abi awais «alhamr alansiat» ko alif aur non ko nasab ke saath kaha karte the.",
  "bukhari|2479": "hum se Ibrahim bin almanzar ne bayan kiya, kaha hum se Anas bin yaz ne bayan kiya, un se Ubaidullah umri ne, un se Abdur Rahman bin Qasim ne, un se un ke walid Qasim ne aur un se Aishah razi Allah anha ne ke unhon ne apne hujre ke saiban par ek pardah latka diya jis mein tasveerein bani hui thin. Nabi kareem sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne ( jab dekha to ) use utaar kar phar dala. ( Aishah razi Allah anha ne bayan kiya ke ) phir mein ne us parde se do gade bina dalay. wo donon gade ghar mein rehte the aur Nabi kareem sallallahu alaihi wasallam un par baitha karte the.",
  "bukhari|2566": "ay musalman orto! hargaz koi padosan apni doosri padosan ke liye ( mamuli hadyah ko bhi ) haqeer na samjhe, khwah bakri ke khar ka hi kyun na ho.“",
  "bukhari|2568": "agar mujhe bazu aur paye ( ke gosht ) par bhi dawat di jaye to mein qubool kar lon ga aur mujhe bazu ya paye ( ke gosht ) ka tahfa bheja jaye to use bhi qubool kar lon ga.“",
  "bukhari|2573": "mein ne ye tahfa sirf us liye wapas kiya hai ke hum ahraam bandhay hue hain.",
  "bukhari|2574": "hum se Ibrahim bin Musa ne bayan kiya, kaha hum se abdah bin sulaiman ne bayan kiya, kaha hum se Hisham bin Urwah ne bayan kiya, un se un ke walid ne aur un se Aishah razi Allah anha ne ke log ( Rasool Allah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ki khidmat mein ) tahayif bhejne ke liye Aishah razi Allah anha ki bari ka intizaar kiya karte the. apne hidaya se, ya us khas din ke intizaar se ( raawi ko shak hai ) log Rasool Allah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ki khushi hasil karna chahte the.",
  "bukhari|2577": "hum se Muhammad bin bashar ne bayan kiya, kaha hum se ghandar ne bayan kiya, kaha hum se Shubah ne bayan kiya, un se Qatadah ne aur un se Anas razi Allah anhu ne bayan kiya ke Rasool Allah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ki khidmat mein ek martabah gosht pesh kiya gaya aur ye bataya gaya ke ye barirah razi Allah anha ko kisi ne bataur sadaqah ke diya hai. Nabi kareem sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne farmaya ”un ke liye ye sadaqah hai aur hamare liye ( jab un ke yahan se pahuncha to ) hadyah hai.“",
  "bukhari|2580": "hum se sulaiman bin harab ne bayan kiya, kaha ke hum se Hammad bin Zaid ne bayan kiya Hisham se, un se un ke walid ne, un se Aishah razi Allah anha ne bayan kiya ke log tahayif bhejne ke liye meri bari ka intizaar kiya karte the. aur Umm Salamah razi Allah anha ne kaha meri suknin ( amahat almominin rizwan Allah alihan ) jama thin us waqt unhon ne Nabi kareem sallallahu alaihi wasallam se ( bataur shikayat logon ki us rosh ka ) zikr kiya. to aap sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne unhein koi jawaab nahin diya.",
  "bukhari|2582": "hum se abumamar ne bayan kiya, kaha hum se abdalwars ne bayan kiya, un se azra bin Sabit Ansari ne bayan kiya, kaha ke mujh se samama bin Abdullah ne bayan kiya, azra ne kaha ke mein samama bin Abdullah ki khidmat mein hazir hua to unhon ne mujhe khushboo inayat farmayi aur bayan kiya ke Anas razi Allah anhu khushboo ko wapas nahin karte the. samama ne kaha ke Anas razi Allah anhu ka guman tha ke Nabi kareem sallallahu alaihi wasallam khushboo ko wapas nahin farmaya karte the.",
  "bukhari|2589": "apna haba wapas lene waala us kutte ki tarah hai jo qay kar ke phir chat jata hai.“",
  "bukhari|2590": "sadaqah karo, jod ke na rakho, kahin tum se bhi. ( Allah ki taraf se na ) rok liya jaye.“",
  "bukhari|2591": "kharch kiya kar, ganna na kar, takeh tumhein bhi gun ke na mile aur jod ke na rakho, takeh tum se bhi Allah ta'ala ( apni nematon ko ) na chhapa lay.“",
  "bukhari|2593": "hum se haban bin Musa ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha hum ko Abdullah bin mubarak ne khabar di, unhein yunis ne khabar di Zuhri se, wo Urwah se aur un se Aishah razi Allah anha ne bayan kiya ke Rasool Allah sallallahu alaihi wasallam jab safar ka irada karte to apni azwaj ke liye qarah andazi karte aur jin ka qarah nikal aata unhein ko apne saath lay jate. aap sallallahu alaihi wasallam ka ye bhi tareeqa tha ke apni tamam azwaj ke liye ek ek din aur raat ki bari maqrar kar di thi, albatah ( aaqar mein ) sodah bint zamaah razi Allah anha ne apni bari Aishah razi Allah anha ko de di thi, us se un ka maqsad Rasool Allah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ki raza hasil karni thi.",
  "bukhari|2595": "jis ka darwazah tum se qareeb ho.“",
  "bukhari|2603": "aur Sabit bin Muhammad ne bayan kiya ke hum se masar ne bayan kiya, un se maharb ne aur un se Jabir razi Allah anhu ne ke aur Sabit bin Muhammad ne bayan kiya ke hum se masar ne bayan kiya, un se maharb ne aur un se Jabir razi Allah anhu ne ke",
  "bukhari|2605": "kiya tumhari taraf se us ki ijazat hai ke mein bacha hua paani un buzurgon ko de doon? to us bachche ne kaha ke nahin qasam Allah ki! mein aap se milne wale apne hissah ka hargaz aisar nahin kar sakta. phir aap sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne mashroob un ki taraf jhatkay ke saath badha diya.",
  "bukhari|2616": "( tumhein us par hairat hai ) us zaat ki qasam jis ke haath mein Muhammad sallallahu alaihi wasallam ki jaan hai, jannat mein Saad bin Muadh razi Allah anhu ke rumal us se bhi zyada khubsurat hain.",
  "bukhari|2621": "apna diya hua hadyah wapas lene waala isa hai jaise apni ki hui qay ko chatne waala.“",
  "bukhari|2622": "hum musalmanon ko buri misal na ikhtiyar karni chahiye. us shakhs ki see jo apna diya hua hadyah wapas lay lay, wo us kutte ki tarah hai jo apni qay khud chatta hai.“",
  "bukhari|2623": "mein ne ek ghoda Allah ke raaste mein jihad ke liye ( ek shakhs ko ) diya ). jise mein ne wo ghoda diya tha, us ne use dabla kar diya. us liye mera irada hua ke us se apna wo ghoda kharid lon, mera ye bhi khayal tha ke wo shakhs wo ghoda saste damon par beach de ga. lekin jab mein ne us ke baare mein Nabi kareem sallallahu alaihi wasallam se puchha to aap ne farmaya ke tum use na kharido, khwah tumhein wo ek hi darham mein kyun na de. kyunki apne sadaqah ko wapas lene waala shakhs us kutte ki tarah hai jo apni hi qay khud chatta hai.",
  "bukhari|2626": "umri jaiz hai.“ aur Ata ne kaha ke mujh se Jabir razi Allah anhu ne Nabi kareem sallallahu alaihi wasallam se isi tarah bayan kiya.",
  "bukhari|2627": "humein to koi khatrah ki cheez nazar na aayi, albatah ye ghoda samandar ki tarah ( tez dodta ) paia.",
  "bukhari|2632": "jis ke pass zamin ho to use khud buni chahiye ya phir kisi apne bhai ko hadyah kar dini chahiye aur agar isa nahin karta to phir zamin apne pass rakhe rahe.“",
  "bukhari|2636": "hum se hamidi ne bayan kiya, kaha hum ko Sufyan ne khabar di, kaha ke mein ne Malik se suna, unhon ne Zaid bin aslam se puchha tha to unhon ne bayan kiya ke mein ne apne baap se suna wo bayan karte the ke Umar razi Allah anhu ne kaha mein ne ek ghoda Allah ke raaste mein jihad ke liye ek shakhs ko de diya tha, phir mein ne dekha ke wo use beach raha hai. us liye mein ne Rasool Allah sallallahu alaihi wasallam se puchha ke use wapas mein hi kharid lon? aap sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne farmaya ”us ghode ko na kharid. apna diya hua sadaqah wapas na low.“",
  "bukhari|2692": "hum se Abdul Aziz bin Abdullah ne bayan kiya, kaha hum se Ibrahim bin Saad ne bayan kiya Salih bin kisan se, un se Ibn Shihab ne, unhein Humaid bin Abdur Rahman ne khabar di ke un ki walida Umm kulsoom bint aqbah ne unhein khabar di aur unhon ne Nabi kareem sallallahu alaihi wasallam ko ye farmate suna tha ke jhoota wo nahin hai jo logon mein baham sulh karane ki koshish kare aur us ke liye kisi achhi baat ki chughli khaye ya isi silsilah ki aur koi achhi baat keh de.",
  "bukhari|2693": "chalo hum un mein sulh karaen ge.“",
  "bukhari|2706": "ay kaab! aur apne haath se isharah kiya, jaise aap keh rahe hoon ke adha ( qarz kam kar de ) chunaanchah unhon ne adha qarz chhor diya aur adha liya.",
  "bukhari|2707": "insaan ke badan ke ( teen sau saath jodon mein se ) har jod par har us din ka sadaqah wajib hai jis mein sooraj tulu hota hai aur logon ke darmiyan insaaf karna bhi ek sadaqah hai.“",
  "bukhari|28": "hum se qatibah ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha hum se lais ne bayan kiya, unhon ne yazid bin Abi Habib se, unhon ne abulkhair se, unhon ne Abdullah bin amru razi Allah anhuma se ke ek aadmi ne Rasool Allah sallallahu alaihi wasallam se puchha kaun sa Islam behtar hai? aap sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne farmaya ke to khana khalaye aur har shakhs ko salaam kare khwah us ko to janta ho ya na janta ho.",
  "bukhari|32": "un alshrk lazlam azeem» ke beshak shark bara zulm hai.",
  "bukhari|35": "jo shakhs shab qadr imaan ke saath mehaz sawaab aakhirat ke liye zikr wa ibadat mein guzare, us ke guzashta gunah bakhsh diye jate hain.",
  "bukhari|351": "hum se Musa bin Ismail ne bayan kiya, kaha hum se yazid bin Ibrahim ne bayan kiya, wo Muhammad se, wo Umm atiyah se, unhon ne farmaya ke humein hukm hua ke hum eiden ke din haizah aur pardah nasheen auraton ko bhi bahar lay jayein. takeh wo musalmanon ke ajtamaa aur un ki duaon mein sharik ho skin. albatah haizah auraton ko namaz parhne ki jagah se door rakhen. ek aurat ne kaha ya Rasool Allah! hum mein baaz auratein aisi bhi hoti hain jin ke pass ( pardah karne ke liye ) chadar nahin hoti. aap sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne farmaya ke us ki saathi aurat apni chadar ka ek hissah use adha de. aur Abdullah bin raja ne kaha hum se Imran Qattan ne bayan kiya, kaha hum se Muhammad bin siren ne, kaha hum se Umm atiyah ne, mein ne Nabi kareem sallallahu alaihi wasallam se suna aur yahi hadees bayan ki.",
  "bukhari|352": "hum se ahmd bin yunis ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha hum se asm bin Muhammad ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha ke mujh se waqad bin Muhammad ne Muhammad bin manakadar ke hawala se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha ke Jabir bin Abdullah razi Allah anhuma ne tahbnd bandh kar namaz parhi. jise unhon ne sir tak bandh rakha tha aur aap ke kapde khonti par tange hue the. ek kehne wale ne kaha ke aap ek tahbnd mein namaz parhte hain? aap ne jawaab diya ke mein ne isa us liye kiya ke tajah jaisa koi ahmakh mujhe dekhay. bhala Rasool Allah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ke zamanah mein do kapde bhi kis ke pass the?",
  "bukhari|353": "hum se abumsab bin Abdullah matraf ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha hum se Abdur Rahman bin Abi almoali ne bayan kiya, unhon ne Muhammad bin manakadar se, unhon ne kaha ke mein ne Jabir razi Allah anhu ko ek kapde mein namaz parhte dekha aur unhon ne batlaia ke mein ne Nabi kareem sallallahu alaihi wasallam ko bhi ek hi kapde mein namaz parhte dekha tha.",
  "bukhari|358": "( kuchh bura nahin ) bhala kiya tum sab mein har shakhs ke pass do kapde hain?",
  "bukhari|359": "kisi shakhs ko bhi ek kapde mein namaz us tarah na parhni chahiye ke us ke kandhon par kuchh na ho.",
  "bukhari|360": "hum se abunim fazal bin dakin ne bayan kiya, kaha hum se shiban bin Abdur Rahman ne Yahya bin Abi kaseer ke wastah se, unhon ne akramah se, Yahya ne kaha mein ne akramah se sunaya mein ne un se puchha tha to akramah ne kaha ke mein ne Abu Hurairah razi Allah anhu se suna, wo farmate the. mein us ki goahi deta hoon ke Rasool Allah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ko mein ne ye irshad farmate suna tha ke jo shakhs ek kapde mein namaz padhe use kapde ke donon kanaron ko us ke mukhalif samat ke kandhe par daal lena chahiye.",
  "bukhari|362": "hum se masdad ne bayan kiya, kaha hum se Yahya bin Saeed Qattan ne, unhon ne Sufyan Sauri se, unhon ne kaha mujh se abuhazam Salamah bin dinar ne bayan kiya sahal bin Saad saadi se, unhon ne kaha ke kayi aadmi Nabi kareem sallallahu alaihi wasallam ke saath bachchon ki tarah apni gardanon par azarin bandhay hue namaz parhte the aur auraton ko ( aap ke zamane mein ) hukm tha ke apne saron ko ( sajde se ) us waqt tak na uthayen jab tak mard sidhe ho kar baitth na jayein.",
  "bukhari|367": "aur us se bhi mana farmaya ke aadmi ek kapde mein ahtaba kare aur us ki sharmagaa par alehdah koi doosra kapda na ho.",
  "bukhari|372": "hum se Abu al-Yaman ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha ke hum ko Shuaib ne Zuhri se khabar di, kaha ke mujhe Urwah bin Zubair ne khabar di ke Aishah razi Allah anha ne farmaya ke Nabi kareem sallallahu alaihi wasallam Fajr ki namaz parhte aur aap sallallahu alaihi wasallam ke saath namaz mein kayi musalman auratein apni chaadarein orhe hue sharik namaz hotin, phir apne gharon ko wapas chali jati thin, us waqt unhein koi pehchaan nahin sakta tha.",
  "bukhari|375": "hum se Abdullah bin Yusuf ne bayan kiya, kaha ke hum se lais bin Saad ne yazid bin Habib se bayan kiya, unhon ne abulkhair marsad se, unhon ne aqbah bin amir se, unhon ne kaha ke Nabi kareem sallallahu alaihi wasallam ko ek resham ki qabah tahfa mein di gayi. use aap sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne pahna aur namaz parhi lekin aap sallallahu alaihi wasallam jab namaz se farigh hue to bari tezi ke saath use utaar diya. goya aap sallallahu alaihi wasallam use pahan kar nagoari mahsus kar rahe the. phir aap sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne farmaya ye parhezgaron ke laeq nahin hai.",
  "bukhari|384": "hum se Abdullah bin Yusuf ne bayan kiya kaha hum se lais bin Saad ne hadees bayan ki yazid se, unhon ne arak se, unhon ne Urwah bin Zubair se ke Nabi kareem sallallahu alaihi wasallam us bachone par namaz parhte jis par aap sallallahu alaihi wasallam aur Aishah razi Allah anha sote aur Aishah razi Allah anha aap sallallahu alaihi wasallam ke aur qiblah ke darmiyan us bistar par leti rehtein.",
  "bukhari|385": "hum se aboalolid Hisham bin Abdul Malik ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha hum se bashr bin mafzal ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha mujhe ghalb Qattan ne bakr bin Abdullah ke waste se bayan kiya, unhon ne Anas bin Malik razi Allah anhu se kaha ke hum Nabi kareem sallallahu alaihi wasallam ke saath namaz parhte the. phir sakhat garmi ki wajah se koi koi hum mein se apne kapde ka kinarah sajde ki jagah rakh leta.",
  "bukhari|386": "hum se Adam bin Abi yas ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha ke hum se Shubah ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha hum se abumslmah Saeed bin yazid azdi ne bayan kiya, kaha mein ne Anas bin Malik razi Allah anhu se puchha ke kiya Nabi kareem sallallahu alaihi wasallam apni jutian pahan kar namaz parhte the? to unhon ne farmaya ke haan!.",
  "bukhari|390": "hum se Yahya bin bakir ne bayan kiya, kaha mujh se hadees bayan ki bakr bin mazar ne jafar se, wo Ibn harmaz se, unhon ne Abdullah bin Malik bin bahina se ke Nabi kareem sallallahu alaihi wasallam jab namaz parhte to apne bazoon ke darmiyan us qadr kashadgi kar dete ke donon baghlon ki safedi zahr hone lagti thi aur lais ne yun kaha ke mujh se jafar bin rabiyah ne isi tarah hadees bayan ki.",
  "bukhari|398": "hum se Ishaq bin nasr ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha hum se abdalrzaq bin Hammam ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha humein Ibn jarij ne khabar pahunchayi Ata Ibn Abi rabah se, unhon ne kaha mein ne Ibn abbas razi Allah anhuma se suna ke jab Nabi kareem sallallahu alaihi wasallam kaaba ke andar tashreef lay gaye to us ke charon konon mein aap sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne dua ki aur namaz nahin parhi. phir jab bahar tashreef laye to do rakaat namaz kaaba ke samne parhi aur farmaya ke yahi qiblah hai.",
  "bukhari|400": "hum se Muslim bin Ibrahim ne bayan kiya, kaha hum se Hisham bin Abdullah dastoai ne, kaha hum se Yahya bin Abi kaseer ne Muhammad bin Abdur Rahman ke wastah se, unhon ne Jabir bin Abdullah se, unhon ne farmaya ke Nabi kareem sallallahu alaihi wasallam apni soari par khwah us ka rukh kisi taraf ho ( nafil ) namaz parhte the lekin jab farz namaz parhna chahte to soari se utar jate aur qiblah ki taraf munh kar ke namaz parhte.",
  "bukhari|404": "phir aap ne apne paaon mor liye aur ( saho ke ) do sajde ke.",
  "bukhari|406": "jab koi shakhs namaz mein ho to apne munh ke samne na thooke kyunki namaz mein munh ke samne Allah azujal hota hai.",
  "bukhari|41": "Imam Malik rahimahu Allah kehte hain mujhe Zaid bin aslam ne khabar di, unhein Ata bin yasar ne, un ko Abu Saeed khadri razi Allah anhu ne bataya ke unhon ne Rasool Allah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ko ye irshad farmate hue suna ke jab ( ek ) bandah musalman ho jaye aur us ka Islam umdah ho ( yaqeen wa khuloos ke saath ho ) to Allah us ke gunah ko jo us ne us ( Islam lane ) se pehle kiya maaf farma deta hai aur ab us ke baad ke liye badla sharwa ho jata hai ( yaani ) ek neki ke ewaj das ganna se lay kar saat sau ganna tak ( sawaab ) aur ek burai ka isi burai ke mutabiq ( badla diya jata hai ) magar ye ke Allah ta'ala us burai se bhi darguzar kare. ( aur use bhi maaf farma de. ye bhi us ke liye aasan hai.)",
  "bukhari|412": "tum apne samne ya apni dayein taraf na thooka karo, albatah bayein taraf ya bayein qadam ke neeche thook sakte ho.",
  "bukhari|413": "momin jab namaz mein hota hai to wo apne Rabb se sargoshi karta hai. us liye wo apne samne ya dayein taraf na thooke, haan bayein taraf ya paaon ke neeche thook lay.",
  "bukhari|414": "koi shakhs samne ya dayein taraf na thooke, albatah bayein taraf ya bayein paaon ke neeche thook lena chahiye. doosri riwayat mein Zuhri se yun hai ke unhon ne Humaid bin Abdur Rahman se Abu Saeed khadri ke wastah se isi tarah ye hadees sunni.",
  "bukhari|415": "masjid mein thookna gunah hai aur us ka kafarah use ( zamin mein ) chhapa dena hai.",
  "bukhari|416": "jab koi shakhs namaz ke liye khara ho to samne na thooke kyunki wo jab tak apni namaz ki jagah mein hota hai to Allah ta'ala se sargoshi karta rehta hai aur dayein taraf bhi na thooke kyunki us taraf farshta hota hai, haan bayein taraf ya qadam ke neeche thook lay aur use mitti mein chhapa de.",
  "bukhari|42": "tum mein se koi shakhs jab apne Islam ko umdah bina lay ( yaani nifaq aur riya se paak kar lay ) to har nek kaam jo wo karta hai us ke ewaj das se lay kar saat sau ganna tak nekiyan likhi jati hain aur har bura kaam jo karta hai to wo itna hi likha jata hai ( jitna ke us ne kiya hai ).",
  "bukhari|420": "hum se Abdullah bin Yusuf ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha ke humein Imam Malik ne khabar di, unhon ne Nafi ke wastah se bayan kiya, unhon ne Abdullah bin Umar razi Allah anhuma se ke Rasool Allah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne un ghodon ki janhin ( jihad ke liye ) tayar kiya gaya tha maqam hafia se dod karayi, us dod ki had saniat aludaa thi aur jo ghode abhi tayar nahin hue the un ki dod saniat aludaa se masjid bani zariq tak karayi. Abdullah bin Umar razi Allah anhuma ne bhi us ghor dod mein sharkat ki thi.",
  "bukhari|422": "chalo, sab hazrat chalne lage aur mein un ke aage aage chal raha tha.",
  "bukhari|424": "hum se Abdullah bin muslma qanbi ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha hum se Ibrahim bin Saad ne Ibn Shihab ke wastah se bayan kiya, unhon ne mehmood bin rabi se unhon ne atban bin Malik se (jo nabeena the) ke Nabi kareem sallallahu alaihi wasallam un ke ghar tashreef laye. aap sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne puchha ke tum apne ghar mein kahan pasand karte ho ke tumhare liye namaz padhon. atban ne bayan kiya ke mein ne ek jagah ki taraf isharah kiya. phir Nabi kareem sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne takbeer kahi aur hum ne aap sallallahu alaihi wasallam ke peeche saf bandhi phir aap sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne do rakaat namaz ( nafil ) padhai.",
  "bukhari|426": "hum se sulaiman bin harab ne bayan kiya, kaha hum ko Shubah ne khabar di ashas bin Sulaim ke wastah se, unhon ne masrooq se, unhon ne Aishah razi Allah anha se, aap farmati hain ke Rasool Allah sallallahu alaihi wasallam apne tamam kaamon mein jahan tak mumkin hota dayein taraf se sharwa karne ko pasand farmate the. taharat ke waqt bhi, kangha karne aur juta pahanne mein bhi.",
  "bukhari|427": "hum se Muhammad bin Musanna ne bayan kiya, kaha hum se Yahya bin Saeed Qattan ne Hisham bin Urwah ke wastah se bayan kiya, kaha ke mujhe mere baap ne Aishah razi Allah anha se ye khabar pahunchayi ke Umm habibah aur Umm Salamah razi Allah anhuma donon ne ek kalisa ka zikr kiya jise unhon ne habshah mein dekha to us mein mortin ( tasveerein ) thin. unhon ne us ka tazkarah Nabi kareem sallallahu alaihi wasallam se bhi kiya. aap sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne farmaya ke un ka ye qaida tha ke agar un mein koi nikokar ( nek ) shakhs mar jata to wo log us ki qabar par masjid banatay aur us mein yahi mortin ( tasveerein ) bina dete pas ye log Allah ki dargaa mein qiyamat ke din tamam makhlooq mein bure hoon ge.",
  "bukhari|429": "hum se sulaiman bin harab ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha hum se Shubah ne aboaltiah ke waste se, unhon ne Anas bin Malik razi Allah anhu se, unhon ne kaha ke Nabi kareem sallallahu alaihi wasallam bakrion ke badon mein namaz parhte the, aboaltiah ya Shubah ne kaha, phir mein ne Anas ko ye kehte hue suna ke Nabi kareem sallallahu alaihi wasallam bakrion ke badah mein masjid ki tamir se pehle namaz parha karte the.",
  "bukhari|431": "mujhe ( aaj ) dozakh dikhai gayi, us se zyada bhyank manzar mein ne kabhi nahin dekha.",
  "bukhari|432": "apne gharon mein bhi namazein parha karo aur unhein bilkul maqbra na bina low.",
  "bukhari|433": "hum se Ismail bin Abdullah ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha ke mujh se Imam Malik rahimahu Allah ne bayan kiya, unhon ne Abdullah bin dinar ke wastah se bayan kiya, unhon ne Abdullah bin Umar razi Allah anhuma se ke Rasool Allah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne farmaya, un azaab walon ke aasar se agar tumhara guzar ho to rote hue gazro, agar tum us mauqa par ro na sako to un se gazro hi nahin. isa na ho ke tum par bhi un ka sa azaab aao jaye.",
  "bukhari|434": ") nek aadmi mar jata to us ki qabar par masjid banatay aur us mein ye bat rakhte. ye log Allah ke nazdeek sari makhloqaat se badtar hain.",
  "bukhari|437": "yahudion par Allah ki lanat ho unhon ne apne anbia ki qabron ko masajid bina liya.",
  "bukhari|440": "hum se masdad ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha ke hum se Yahya ne Ubaidullah ke wastah se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha ke mujh ko Nafi ne bayan kiya, kaha ke mujhe Abdullah bin Umar razi Allah anhuma ne khabar di ke wo apni nojawani mein jab ke un ke biwi bachche nahin the Nabi kareem sallallahu alaihi wasallam ki masjid mein soya karte the.",
  "bukhari|442": "mein ne sattar ashaab safah ko dekha ke un mein koi isa na tha jis ke pass chadar ho. faqat taha band hota, ya raat ko odhane ka kapda janhin ye log apni gardanon se bandh lete. ye kapde kisi ke adhi pandli tak aate aur kisi ke takhnon tak. ye hazrat un kapdon ko us khayal se ke kahin sharmagaa na khal jaye apne haathon se samite rehte the.",
  "bukhari|443": "( pehle ) do rakaat namaz parh aur mera Nabi kareem sallallahu alaihi wasallam par kuchh qarz tha. jise aap sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne ada kiya aur zyada hi diya.",
  "bukhari|444": "jab tum mein se koi shakhs masjid mein dakhil ho to bethne se pehle do rakaat namaz parh lay.",
  "bukhari|445": "jab tak tum apne masley par jahan tum ne namaz parhi thi, baithe raho aur riyah kharij na karo to malaika tum par barabar darod bhejte rehte hain. kehte hain «Allahumma aghfar lahu Allahumma arhma» ”ay Allah! us ki maghfirat kijiye, ay Allah! us par raham kijiye.‘‘",
  "bukhari|451": "hum se qatibah bin Saeed ne bayan kiya, kaha hum se Sufyan bin Uyainah ne, unhon ne kaha ke mein ne amru bin dinar se puchha kiya tum ne Jabir bin Abdullah se ye hadees sunni hai ke ek shakhs masjid nabwi mein aaya aur wo teer liye hue tha, Rasool Allah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne us se farmaya ke un ki nokin thame rakho.",
  "bukhari|452": "agar koi shakhs hamari masajid ya hamare bazaron mein teer liye hue chale to un ke phal thame rahe, isa na ho ke apne haathon se kisi musalman ko zakhmi kar de.",
  "bukhari|453": "haan ( mein gawah hoon. beshak mein ne Nabi kareem sallallahu alaihi wasallam se ye suna hai ).",
  "bukhari|458": ". logon ne bataya ke wo to inteqal kar gayi. aap sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne us par farmaya ke tum ne mujhe kyun na bataya, phir aap sallallahu alaihi wasallam qabar par tashreef laye aur us par namaz parhi.",
  "bukhari|460": "hum se ahmd bin waqad ne bayan kiya ke, kaha hum se Hammad bin Zaid ne Sabit banani ke wastah se, unhon ne aburafa se, unhon ne Abu Hurairah razi Allah anhu se ke ek aurat ya mard masjid mein jahado diya karta tha. aburafa ne kaha, mera khayal hai ke wo aurat hi thi. phir unhon ne Nabi kareem sallallahu alaihi wasallam ki hadees naqal ki ke aap sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne us ki qabar par namaz parhi.",
  "bukhari|475": "hum se Abdullah bin muslma qanbi ne bayan kiya Imam Malik ke wastah se, unhon ne Ibn Shihab Zuhri se, unhon ne abad bin tamim se, unhon ne apne chicha (Abdullah bin Zaid bin asm mazni razi Allah anhu) se ke unhon ne Rasool Allah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ko chat lete hue dekha. aap sallallahu alaihi wasallam apna ek paaon doosre par rakhe hue the. Ibn Shihab Zuhri se marwi hai, wo Saeed bin masib se riwayat karte hain ke Umar aur Usman razi Allah anhuma bhi isi tarah lettey the.",
  "bukhari|480": "Abdullah bin amru tumhara kiya hal ho ga jab tum bure logon mein rah jao ge us tarah ( yaani aap sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne ek haath ki anglian doosre haath mein kar ke dakhalain ).",
  "bukhari|481": "ek momin doosre momin ke liye imarat ki tarah hai ke us ka ek hissah doosre hissah ko quwwat pahunchata hai. aur aap sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne ek haath ki ungliyon ko doosre haath ki ungliyon mein dakhil kiya.",
  "bukhari|494": "hum se Ishaq bin mansoor ne bayan kiya, kaha hum se Abdullah bin Numair ne kaha ke hum se Ubaidullah bin Umar ne Nafi ke wastah se bayan kiya. unhon ne Abdullah bin Umar razi Allah anhuma se ke Rasool Allah sallallahu alaihi wasallam jab Eid ke din ( madinah se ) bahar tashreef lay jate to chhote nezah ( barchha ) ko garne ka hukm dete wo jab aap sallallahu alaihi wasallam ke aage gad diya jata to aap sallallahu alaihi wasallam us ki taraf rukh kar ke namaz parhte aur log aap sallallahu alaihi wasallam ke peeche khare hote. yahi aap sallallahu alaihi wasallam safar mein bhi kiya karte the. ( musalmanon ke ) khalfa ne isi wajah se barchha saath rakhne ki adat bina li hai.",
  "bukhari|495": "hum se aboalolid ne bayan kiya, kaha hum se Shubah ne bayan kiya aon bin Abi hajifa se, kaha mein ne apne baap (wahab bin Abdullah) se suna ke Nabi kareem sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne logon ko bathaa mein namaz padhai. aap sallallahu alaihi wasallam ke samne anzah ( danda jis ke neeche phal laga hua ho ) gad diya gaya tha. ( choonkeh aap sallallahu alaihi wasallam musafir the us liye ) Zuhr ki do rakaat aur Asr ki do rakaat ada kein. aap sallallahu alaihi wasallam ke samne se auratein aur gadhe guzar rahe the.",
  "bukhari|498": "hum se masdad bin masrhad ne bayan kiya, kaha hum se Yahya bin Saeed Qattan ne Ubaidullah ke waste se bayan kiya, kaha mujhe Nafi ne Abdullah bin Umar razi Allah anhuma ke wastah se khabar di ke Nabi kareem sallallahu alaihi wasallam ke liye barchha gad diya jata aap sallallahu alaihi wasallam us ki taraf namaz parhte the.",
  "bukhari|4981": "har Nabi ko aise aise majzaat ata ke gaye ke ( unhein dekh kar log ) un par imaan laye ( baad ke zamane mein un ka koi asar nahin raha ) aur mujhe jo majazah diya gaya hai wo wahi ( Quran ) hai jo Allah ta'ala ne mujh par nazil ki hai. ( us ka asar qiyamat tak baqi rahe ga ) us liye mujhe umeed hai ke qiyamat ke din mere taba farman log doosre pighambaron ke taba farmanon se zyada hoon ge.",
  "bukhari|4983": "qasam hai din ki roshni ki aur raat ki jab wo qarar pakade ke aap ke parwardigar ne na aap ko chhor a hai aur na wo aap se khafa hua hai.“",
  "bukhari|4988": "min almominin rajaal sadqua ma ahdua Allah alaihi» chunaanchah hum ne us aayat ko surat alahzab mein laga diya.",
  "bukhari|499": "hum se Adam bin Abi yas ne bayan kiya, kaha hum se Shubah ne bayan kiya, kaha ke hum se aon bin Abi hajifa ne bayan kiya, kaha ke mein ne apne baap abuhajifa wahab bin Abdullah se suna unhon ne kaha ke Rasool Allah sallallahu alaihi wasallam dopahar ke waqt bahar tashreef laye. aap sallallahu alaihi wasallam ki khidmat mein wuzu ka paani pesh kiya gaya, jis se aap sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne wuzu kiya. phir humein aap sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne Zuhr ki namaz padhai aur Asr ki, aap sallallahu alaihi wasallam ke samne anzah gad diya gaya tha aur auratein aur gadhe par soar log us ke peeche se guzar rahe the.",
  "bukhari|4991": "Jibreel alaihi assalam ne mujh ko ( pehle ) arab ke ek hi muhaware par Quran padhaya. mein ne un se kaha ( us mein bahut sakhti ho gi ) mein barabar un se kehta raha ke aur muhavaron mein bhi parhne ki ijazat do. yahan tak ke saat muhavaron ki ijazat mali.",
  "bukhari|4997": "hum se Yahya bin qazaa ne bayan kiya, kaha hum se Ibrahim bin Saad ne bayan kiya, un se Zuhri ne un se Abdullah bin Abdullah ne aur un se Ibn abbas razi Allah anhuma ne bayan kiya ke Nabi kareem sallallahu alaihi wasallam khair khairaat karne mein sab se zyada sakhi the aur Ramazan mein aap ki sakhawat ki to koi had hi nahin thi kyunki Ramazan ke mahinon mein Jibreel alaihi assalam aap se aao kar har raat milte the yahan tak ke Ramazan ka mahina khatm ho jata wo un raton mein Nabi kareem sallallahu alaihi wasallam ke saath Quran majid ka dorah kiya karte the. jab Jibreel alaihi assalam aap se milte to us zamanah mein Nabi kareem sallallahu alaihi wasallam tez hua se bhi badh kar sakhi ho jate the.",
  "bukhari|4998": "hum se Khalid bin yazid ne bayan kiya, kaha hum se Abu Bakr bin yash ne bayan kiya, un se abuhsin ne, un se abusaleh ne aur un se Abu Hurairah razi Allah anhu ne bayan kiya ke Jibreel alaihi assalam Rasool Allah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ke saath har saal ek martabah Quran majid ka dorah kiya karte the lekin jis saal Nabi kareem sallallahu alaihi wasallam ki wafat hui us mein unhon ne Nabi kareem sallallahu alaihi wasallam ke saath do martabah dorah kiya. Nabi kareem sallallahu alaihi wasallam har saal das din ka aetkaf kiya karte the lekin jis saal aap ki wafat hui us saal aap ne bis din ka aetkaf kiya.",
  "bukhari|4999": "hum se hifas bin Umar ne bayan kiya, kaha hum se Shubah ne bayan kiya, un se amru bin marah ne, un se Ibrahim nakhi ne, un se masrooq ne ke Abdullah bin amru bin alaas ne Abdullah bin Masood razi Allah anhu ka zikr kiya aur kaha ke us waqt se un ki mohabbat mere dil mein ghar kar gayi hai jab se mein ne Nabi kareem sallallahu alaihi wasallam ko ye kehte hue suna ke Quran majid ko chaar ashaab se hasil karo jo Abdullah bin Masood, salim, Muadh aur Abi bin kaab hain.",
  "bukhari|500": "hum se Muhammad bin hatim bin baziya ne bayan kiya, kaha ke hum se shazan bin amir ne Shubah bin hajjaj ke wastah se bayan kiya, unhon ne Ata bin Abi Maimunah se, unhon ne kaha ke mein ne Anas bin Malik razi Allah anhu se suna ke Nabi kareem sallallahu alaihi wasallam jab rafa hajat ke liye nikaltay to mein aur ek aur larka aap sallallahu alaihi wasallam ke peeche peeche jate. hamare saath akazah ( danda jis ke neeche lohe ka phal laga hua ho ) ya chadi ya anzah hota. aur hamare saath ek chhagal bhi hota tha. jab Nabi kareem sallallahu alaihi wasallam hajat se farigh ho jate to hum aap sallallahu alaihi wasallam ko wo chhagal de dete the.",
  "bukhari|5003": "hum se hifas bin Umar bin ghias ne bayan kiya, kaha hum se Hammam bin Yahya ne bayan kiya, kaha hum se Qatadah ne bayan kiya, kaha ke mein ne Anas bin Malik razi Allah anhu se puchha ke Rasool Allah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ke zamanah mein Quran ko kun logon ne jama kiya tha, unhon ne batlaia ke chaar sahabiyon ne, ye charon qabeelah Ansaar se hain. Abi bin kaab, Muadh bin jabal, Zaid bin Sabit aur abuzed. us riwayat ki matabat fazal ne Husain bin waqad se ki hai. un se samama ne aur un se Anas razi Allah anhu ne.",
  "bukhari|5009": "jis ne surat albaqrah ki do aakhri aaiteyn raat mein parh lein wo use har afat se bachanay ke liye kaafi ho jayein gi.",
  "bukhari|5013": "qal ho Allah ahad» barbar parh rahe hain. subah hui to wo sahabi ( Abu Saeed razi Allah anhu ) Rasool Allah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ki khidmat mein hazir hue aur Nabi kareem sallallahu alaihi wasallam se us ka zikr kiya goya unhon ne samjha ke us mein koi bara sawaab na ho ga. Nabi kareem sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne farmaya ke us zaat ki qasam jis ke haath mein meri jaan hai! ye surat Quran majid ke ek tihai hissah ke barabar hai.",
  "bukhari|5016": "hum se Abdullah bin Yusuf tanisi ne bayan kiya, kaha hum ko Imam Malik ne khabar di, unhein Ibn Shihab ne, unhein Urwah bin Zubair ne aur unhein Aishah razi Allah anha ne ke Rasool Allah sallallahu alaihi wasallam jab bimar padtay to muzat ki sorten parh kar use apne oopar dam karte ( us tarah ke hua ke saath kuchh thook bhi nikalta ) phir jab ( marz almot mein ) aap ki takleef badh gayi to mein un surton ko parh kar Nabi kareem sallallahu alaihi wasallam ke haathon se barkat ki umeed mein aap ke jasd mubarak par phirti thi.",
  "bukhari|5017": "qal ho Allah ahad», «qal auz barb alfalaq» aur «qal auz barb alnas» ( teenon sorten makmal ) parh kar un par phonkte aur phir donon hathilion ko jahan tak mumkin hota apne jism par pherte the. pehle sir aur chehra par haath pherte aur samne ke badan par. ye amal aap sallallahu alaihi wasallam teen dafah karte the.",
  "bukhari|5022": "hum se Muhammad bin Yusuf fariyabi ne bayan kiya, kaha hum se Malik bin maghul ne, kaha hum se Talhah bin masraf ne bayan kiya, ke mein ne Abdullah bin Abi Awfa razi Allah anhu se sawaal kiya: kiya Nabi kareem ne koi wasiyat farmayi thi? unhon ne kaha ke nahin. mein ne arz kiya: phir logon par wasiyat kaise farz ki gayi ke musalmanon ko to wasiyat ka hukm hai aur khud Nabi kareem sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne koi wasiyat nahin farmayi. unhon ne kaha ke Nabi kareem sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne kitaab Allah ko mazbuti se thame rahne ki wasiyat farmayi thi.",
  "bukhari|5023": "Allah ne koi cheez itni tawajjah se nahin sunni jitni tawajjah se us ne Nabi kareem sallallahu alaihi wasallam ka Quran behtareen aawaz ke saath parhte hue suna hai. Abu Salamah bin Abdur Rahman ka ek dost abdalhamid bin Abdur Rahman kehta tha ke us hadees mein «yataghni balqaran» se ye murad hai ke achhi aawaz se use pukaar kar padhe.",
  "bukhari|5027": "tum mein sab se behtar wo hai jo Quran majid padhe aur padhaye. Saad bin abidah ne bayan kiya ke abwabdalrhman salmi ne logon ko Usman razi Allah anhu ke zamanah khilafat se hajjaj bin Yusuf ke iraq ke governor hone tak Quran majid ki taleem di. wo kaha karte the ke yahi hadees hai jis ne mujhe us jagah ( Quran majid padhane ke liye ) bitha rakha hai.",
  "bukhari|5028": "tum sab mein behtar wo hai jo Quran majid padhe aur padhaye.",
  "bukhari|5035": "mujh se Musa bin Ismail ne bayan kiya, kaha hum se abooanah ne bayan kiya, un se abubshar ne, un se Saeed bin jabeer ne bayan kiya ke jin surton ko tum mufsil kehte ho wo sab mahkam hain. unhon ne bayan kiya ke Ibn abbas razi Allah anhuma ne kaha jab Rasool Allah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ki wafat hui to meri Umar das saal ki thi aur mein ne mahkam sorten sab parh li thin.",
  "bukhari|5038": "Allah ta'ala us shakhs par raham kare, us ne mujhe falan aaiteyn yaad dila dein jo mujhe falan falan surton mein se bhala di gayi thin.",
  "bukhari|5039": "kisi ke liye ye munasib nahin ke ye kahe ke mein falan falan aaiteyn bhool gaya balkeh use ( yun kehna chahiye ) ke mein falan falan ayiton ko bhala diya gaya.",
  "bukhari|504": "hum se Musa bin Ismail ne bayan kiya, kaha hum se jaweria bin asma ne Nafi se, unhon ne Abdullah bin Umar razi Allah anhuma se, unhon ne kaha ke Nabi kareem sallallahu alaihi wasallam bit Allah ke andar tashreef lay gaye aur asama bin Zaid Usman bin Talhah aur Bilal razi Allah anhum bhi aap ke saath the. aap sallallahu alaihi wasallam der tak andar rahe. phir bahar aaye. aur mein sab logon se pehle aap sallallahu alaihi wasallam ke peeche hi wahan aaya. mein ne Bilal razi Allah anhu se puchha ke Nabi kareem sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne kahan namaz parhi thi. unhon ne bataya ke aage ke do satunon ke beach mein aap sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne namaz parhi thi.",
  "bukhari|5040": "surat albaqrah ke aaqar ki do ayiton ko jo shakhs raat mein parh lay ga wo us ke liye kaafi hoon gi.",
  "bukhari|5042": "Allah us aadmi par raham kare us ne mujhe falan falan aaiteyn yaad dila dein janhein mein ne falan falan surton mein se chhor rakha tha.",
  "bukhari|5043": "hum se aboalnaman ne bayan kiya, kaha hum se mehdi bin maimun ne, kaha hum se waasil ahdab ne, un se abooail ne Abdullah bin Masood razi Allah anhu se bayan kiya ke hum un ki khidmat mein subah sawere hazir hue. haazrin mein se ek saheb ne kaha ke raat mein ne ( tamam ) mufsil sorten parh dalin. us par Abdullah bin Masood razi Allah anhu bole jaise ashaar jaldi jaldi parhte hain tum ne waise hi parh li ho gi. hum se qaraat sunni hai aur mujhe wo jod wali sorten bhi yaad hain jin ko mila kar namazon mein Nabi kareem sallallahu alaihi wasallam parha karte the. ye atharah sorten mufsil ki hain aur wo do sorten jin ke sharwa mein «ham.» hai.",
  "bukhari|5045": "hum se Muslim bin Ibrahim ne bayan kiya, kaha hum se Jarir bin Hazim azdi ne bayan kiya, kaha ke hum se Qatadah ne bayan ke mein ne Anas bin Malik razi Allah anhu se Nabi kareem sallallahu alaihi wasallam ki telawat Quran majid ke mutalliq sawaal kiya to unhon ne batlaia ke Nabi kareem sallallahu alaihi wasallam un alfaaz ko khinch kar parhte the jin mein mudd hota tha.",
  "bukhari|5046": "Bism Allah ar-Rahman alraheem» parha aur kaha ke «Bism Allah» ( mein Allah ki laam ) ko mudd ke saath parhte «ar-Rahman» ( mein mem ) ko mudd ke saath parhte aur «alraheem.» ( mein haa ko ) mudd ke saath parhte.",
  "bukhari|5048": "ay Abu Musa! tujhe daud alaihi assalam jaisi behtareen aawaz ata ki gayi hai.“",
  "bukhari|5053": "Quran majid tum kitne din mein khatm kar lete ho?",
  "bukhari|5054": "har mahine mein Quran ka ek khatm kiya karo mein ne arz kiya mujh ko to zyada parhne ki taqat hai. aap sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne farmaya ke achha saat raton mein khatm kiya karo us se zyada mat parh.",
  "bukhari|5056": "mujhe Quran majid parh kar sunao. mein ne arz kiya: kiya mein sanaon? aap par to Quran majid nazil hota hai. Nabi kareem sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne farmaya ke mein kisi se sunna mahbub rakhta hoon.",
  "bukhari|5061": "hum se amru bin Ali falas ne bayan kiya, kaha hum se Abdur Rahman bin mehdi ne bayan kiya, un se salaam bin Abi mati ne bayan kiya, un se aboamran juni ne aur un se jandab bin Abdullah razi Allah anhuma ne bayan kiya ke Nabi kareem sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne farmaya ke us Quran ko jab hi tak parho jab tak tumhare dil mile jale ya lage rahein. jab ikhtelaaf aur jhagda karne lago to uth khare ho. ( Quran majid parhna moqof kar do ) salaam ke saath us hadees ko Haris bin abeed aur Saeed bin Zaid ne bhi aboamran juni se riwayat kiya aur Hammad bin Salamah aur aban ne us ko marfua nahin balkeh moqofa riwayat kiya hai aur ghandar Muhammad bin jafar ne bhi Shubah se, unhon ne aboamran se yun riwayat kiya ke mein ne jandab se suna, wo kehte the. ( lekin moqofa riwayat kiya ) aur Abdullah bin aon ne us ko aboamran se, unhon ne Abdullah bin saamat se, unhon ne Umar razi Allah anhu se un ka qol riwayat kiya ( marfua nahin kiya ) aur jandab ki riwayat zyada sahih hai.",
  "bukhari|5062": "tum donon sahih ho ( us liye apne apne taur par parho. ) ( Shubah kehte hain ke ) mera ghalb guman ye hai ke Nabi kareem sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne ye bhi farmaya ke ( ikhtelaaf wa nazaa na kiya karo ) kyunki tum se pehle ki ummaton ne ikhtelaaf kiya aur isi wajah se Allah ta'ala ne unhein halak kar diya.",
  "bukhari|508": "tum logon ne hum auraton ko katon aur gidhon ke barabar bina diya. halanka mein charpai par leti rehti thi. aur Nabi kareem sallallahu alaihi wasallam tashreef laye aur charpai ke beach mein aao jate ( ya charpai ko apne aur qable ke beach mein kar lete ) phir namaz parhte. mujhe aap sallallahu alaihi wasallam ke samne para rehna bura maloom hota, us liye mein painti ki taraf se khasak ke lahaf se bahar nikal jati.",
  "bukhari|512": "hum se masdad bin masrhad ne bayan kiya, kaha ke hum se Yahya bin Saeed Qattan ne bayan kiya, kaha ke hum se Hisham bin Urwah ne bayan kiya, kaha mujh se mere baap ne Aishah razi Allah anha ke waste se bayan kiya, wo farmati thin ke Nabi kareem sallallahu alaihi wasallam namaz parhte rehte aur mein ( aap sallallahu alaihi wasallam ke samne ) bachone par aadi soti hui padi hoti. jab aap sallallahu alaihi wasallam Witr parhna chahte to mujhe bhi jaga dete aur mein bhi Witr parh leti thi.",
  "bukhari|515": "Nabi kareem sallallahu alaihi wasallam khare ho kar raat ko namaz parhte aur mein aap sallallahu alaihi wasallam ke samne aap sallallahu alaihi wasallam ke aur qiblah ke darmiyan arz mein bistar par leti rehti thi.",
  "bukhari|517": "hum se amru bin zaraarah ne bayan kiya, kaha ke hum se hashim ne sheebani ke waste se bayan kiya, unhon ne Abdullah bin shadad bin had se, kaha mujhe meri khala Maimunah bint alhars razi Allah anha ne khabar di ke mera bistar Nabi kareem sallallahu alaihi wasallam ke masley ke barabar mein hota tha. aur baaz dafah aap sallallahu alaihi wasallam ka kapda ( namaz parhte mein ) mere oopar aao jata aur mein apne bistar par hi hoti thi.",
  "bukhari|519": "tum ne bura kiya ke hum ko katon aur gidhon ke hukm mein kar diya. khud Nabi kareem sallallahu alaihi wasallam namaz parh rahe the. mein aap sallallahu alaihi wasallam ke samne leti hui thi. jab sajdah karna chahte to mere paaon ko chhu dete aur mein unhein sakid leti thi.",
  "bukhari|526": "nahin balkeh meri tamam ummat ke liye yahi hukm hai.",
  "bukhari|528": "yahi hal panchon waqt ki namazon ka hai ke Allah paak un ke zariya se gunahon ko mita deta hai.",
  "bukhari|529": "Nabi kareem sallallahu alaihi wasallam ke ahd ki koi baat us zamanah mein nahin pata. logon ne kaha, namaz to hai. farmaya us ke andar bhi tum ne kar rakha hai jo kar rakha hai.",
  "bukhari|532": "sajdah karne mein aetadaal rakho ( sidhi tarah par karo ) aur koi shakhs tum mein se apne bazoon ko kutte ki tarah na philaye. jab kisi ko thookna hi ho to samne ya dahni taraf na thooke, kyunki wo namaz mein apne Rabb se poshidah baatein karta rehta hai aur Saeed ne Qatadah razi Allah anhu se riwayat kar ke bayan kiya hai ke aage ya samne na thooke albatah bayein taraf paaon ke neeche thook sakta hai aur Shubah ne kaha ke apne samne aur dayein janib na thooke, balkeh bayein taraf ya paaon ke neeche thook sakta hai. aur Humaid ne Anas bin Malik razi Allah anhu se wo Nabi kareem sallallahu alaihi wasallam se riwayat karte hain ke qiblah ki taraf na thooke aur na dayein taraf albatah bayein taraf ya paaon ke neeche thook sakta hai.",
  "bukhari|535": "thanda kar, thanda kar, ya ye farmaya ke intizaar kar, intizaar kar, aur farmaya ke garmi ki tezi jahannam ki aag ki bhaap se hai. us liye jab garmi sakhat ho jaye to namaz thanday waqt mein parha karo, phir Zuhr ki azaan us waqt kahi gayi jab hum ne telon ke saaye dekh liye.",
  "bukhari|5352": "Allah ta'ala farmata hai ke ay Ibn Adam! to kharch kar to mein tajah ko diye jaon ga.",
  "bukhari|5353": "bewaon aur miskeenon ke kaam aanay waala Allah ke raaste mein jihad karne wale ke barabar hai, ya raat bhar ibadat aur din ko roze rakhne wale ke barabar hai.",
  "bukhari|5356": "behtareen khairaat wo hai jise dene par aadmi maldar hi rahe aur abtadaa un se karo jo tumhari nigrani mein hain jin ke khalane pahnane ke tum zamah dar ho.",
  "bukhari|5357": "hum se Muhammad bin salaam ne bayan kiya, kaha hum ko wakia ne khabar di, un se Ibn Uyainah ne kaha ke mujh se mamar ne bayan kiya ke un se Sauri ne puchha ke tum ne aise shakhs ke baare mein bhi suna hai jo apne ghar walon ke liye saal bhar ka ya saal se kam ka kharch jama kar lay. mamar ne bayan kiya ke us waqt mujhe yaad nahin aaya phir baad mein yaad aaya ke us baare mein ek hadees Ibn Shihab ne hum se bayan ki thi, un se Malik bin os ne aur un se Ibn Umar razi Allah anhuma ne ke Nabi kareem sallallahu alaihi wasallam bani nazir ke bagh ki khajorin beach kar apne ghar walon ke liye saal bhar ki rozi jama kar diya karte the.",
  "bukhari|5359": "nahin, lekin dastur ke mutabiq hona chahiye.",
  "bukhari|5363": "hum se Muhammad bin ararah ne bayan kiya, kaha hum se Shubah ne bayan kiya, un se hukm bin atba ne, un se Ibrahim ne, un se aswad bin yazid ne ke mein ne Aishah razi Allah anha se puchha ke ghar mein Nabi kareem sallallahu alaihi wasallam kiya kiya karte the? Umm almominin razi Allah anha ne bayan kiya ke Nabi kareem sallallahu alaihi wasallam ghar ke kaam kiya karte the, phir aap jab azaan ki aawaz sunte to bahar chale jate the.",
  "bukhari|5364": "tum dastur ke muafaq itna lay sakti ho jo tumhare aur tumhare bachchon ke liye kaafi ho sakay.",
  "bukhari|5370": "dastur ke mutabiq lay liya karo.",
  "bukhari|5373": "bhooke ko khilao pilao, bimar ki mizaj percy karo aur qaidi ko chahadao. Sufyan Sauri ne kaha ke ( hadees mein ) lafz «aani» se murad qaidi hai.",
  "bukhari|5376": "bete! Bism Allah parh liya karo, dahne haath se khaya karo aur bartan mein wahan se khaya karo jo jagah tajah se nazdeek ho. chunaanchah us ke baad mein hamesha isi hidayat ke mutabiq khata raha.",
  "bukhari|5377": "mujh se Abdul Aziz bin Abdullah awaisi ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha ke mujh se Muhammad bin jafar ne bayan kiya, un se Muhammad bin amru bin halhalah dili ne bayan kiya, un se wahab bin kisan abunim ne bayan kiya, un se Umar bin Abi Salamah razi Allah anhu ne, wo Nabi kareem sallallahu alaihi wasallam ki zujah mataharah Umm Salamah razi Allah anha ke (Abu Salamah se) bete hain. bayan kiya ke ek din mein ne Rasool Allah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ke saath khana khaya aur bartan ke charon taraf se khane laga to Nabi kareem sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne mujh se farmaya ke apne nazdeek se kha.",
  "bukhari|5378": "Bism Allah parh aur apne samne se kha.",
  "bukhari|5379": "hum se qatibah bin Saeed ne bayan kiya, un se Imam Malik ne, un se Ishaq bin Abdullah bin Abi Talhah ne, unhon ne Anas bin Malik razi Allah anhu se suna, unhon ne bayan kiya ke ek darzi ne Rasool Allah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ki khane ki dawat ki jo unhon ne Nabi kareem sallallahu alaihi wasallam ke liye tayar kiya tha. Anas razi Allah anhu ne bayan kiya ke Nabi kareem sallallahu alaihi wasallam ke saath mein bhi gaya, mein ne dekha ke Nabi kareem sallallahu alaihi wasallam pyalah mein charon taraf kadu talash karte the ( khane ke liye ) bayan kiya ke isi din se kadu mujh ko bhi bahut bhaanay laga.",
  "bukhari|538": "( ke garmi ke musam mein ) Zuhr ko thanday waqt mein parha karo, kyunki garmi ki shiddat jahannam ki bhaap se paida hoti hai. us hadees ki matabat Sufyan Sauri, Yahya aur abooanah ne Aamash ke wastah se ki hai.",
  "bukhari|5385": "hum se Muhammad bin sanan ne bayan kiya, un se Hammam ne bayan kiya, un se Qatadah ne kaha ke hum Anas razi Allah anhu ki khidmat mein baithe hue the, us waqt un ka roti pakane waala khaadim bhi mojod tha. unhon ne kaha ke Nabi kareem sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne kabhi chapati ( midah ki roti ) nahin khayi aur na sari dam pukhtah bakri khayi yahan tak ke aap Allah se ja mile.",
  "bukhari|5392": "do aadmiyon ka khana teen ke liye kaafi hai aur teen ka chaar ke liye kaafi hai.",
  "bukhari|5394": "momin ek aant mein khata hai aur kafir ya munafiq ( abdah ne kaha ke ) mujhe yaqeen nahin ke un mein se kis ke mutalliq Ubaidullah ne bayan kiya ke wo saton aantein bhar leta hai aur Ibn bakir ne bayan kiya, un se Imam Malik ne bayan kiya, un se Nafi ne, un se Ibn Umar razi Allah anhuma aur un se Nabi kareem sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne isi hadees ki tarah bayan farmaya.",
  "bukhari|5395": "hai ke kafir saton aanton mein khata hai. abunhik ne us par arz kiya ke mein Allah aur us ke Rasool par imaan rakhta hoon.",
  "bukhari|5396": "musalman ek aant mein khata hai aur kafir saton aanton mein khata hai.",
  "bukhari|5397": "momin ek aant mein khata hai aur kafir saton aanton mein khata hai.",
  "bukhari|5399": "mein tek laga kar nahin khata.",
  "bukhari|54": "amal niyyat hi se sahih hote hain ( ya niyyat hi ke mutabiq un ka badla milta hai ) aur har aadmi ko wahi mile ga jo niyyat kare ga. pas jo koi Allah aur us ke Rasool ki raza ke liye hijrat kare us ki hijrat Allah aur us ke Rasool ki taraf ho gi aur jo koi duniya kamaanay ke liye ya kisi aurat se shadi karne ke liye hijrat kare ga to us ki hijrat un hi kaamon ke liye ho gi.",
  "bukhari|5402": "hum se Muslim bin Ibrahim ne bayan ki, unhon ne kaha hum se Shubah ne bayan kiya, un se abubshar ne, un se Saeed ne aur un se Abdullah bin abbas razi Allah anhuma ne bayan kiya ke meri khala ne Nabi kareem sallallahu alaihi wasallam ki khidmat mein sahna ka gosht, paneer aur doodh hadita pesh kiya to sahna ka gosht aap ke dastar khawan par rakha gaya aur agar sahna haraam hota to aap ke dastar khawan par nahin rakha ja sakta tha lekin aap ne doodh piya aur paneer khaya.",
  "bukhari|5409": "hum se Muhammad bin kaseer ne bayan kiya, kaha hum ko Sufyan ne khabar di, unhein Aamash ne, unhein abuhazam ne aur un se Abu Hurairah razi Allah anhu ne bayan kiya ke Nabi kareem sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne kabhi kisi khane mein koi aib nahin nikala. agar pasand hua to kha liya aur agar napasand hua to chhor diya.",
  "bukhari|5414": "mujh se Ishaq bin Ibrahim ne bayan kiya, unhein rooh bin ibadah ne khabar di, un se Ibn Abi zib ne bayan kiya, un se Saeed bin maqbri ne aur un se Abu Hurairah razi Allah anhu ne ke wo kuchh logon ke pass se guzre jin ke samne bahani hui bakri rakhi thi. unhon ne un ko khane par bulaya lekin unhon ne khane se inkaar kar diya aur kaha ke Rasool Allah sallallahu alaihi wasallam us duniya se rukhsat ho gaye aur aap ne kabhi jo ki roti bhi aasodah ho kar nahin khayi.",
  "bukhari|5415": "hum se Abdullah bin Abi alsud ne bayan kiya, kaha hum se Muadh bin Hisham ne bayan kiya, un se un ke walid ne bayan kiya, un se yunis bin Abi alfarat ne, un se Qatadah ne aur un se Anas bin Malik razi Allah anhu ne ke Nabi kareem sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne kabhi mez par khana nahin khaya aur na tashtari mein do chaar qasam ki cheezain rakh kar khain aur na kabhi chapati khayi. mein ne Qatadah se puchha, phir aap kis cheez par khana khate the? batlaia ke safrah ( chamde ke dastar khawan ) par.",
  "bukhari|5418": "mardon mein to bahut se kamil hue lekin auraton mein maryam bint Imran aur firaun ki biwi aasiyah ke siwa aur koi kamil nahin hua aur Aishah ki fazilat tamam auraton par aisi hai jaise tamam khanon par sarid ki fazilat hai.",
  "bukhari|5419": "auraton par Aishah ki fazilat aisi hai jaise tamam khanon par sarid ki fazilat hai.",
  "bukhari|542": "jab hum ( garmiyon mein ) Nabi kareem sallallahu alaihi wasallam ke peeche Zuhr ki namaz dopahar din mein parhte the to garmi se bachne ke liye kapdon par sajdah kiya karte.",
  "bukhari|5421": "hum se hadba bin Khalid ne bayan kiya, kaha hum se Hammam bin Yahya ne bayan kiya, un se Qatadah ne bayan kiya ke hum Anas razi Allah anhu ki khidmat mein hazir hue to un ki roti pakane waala un ke pass hi khara tha. unhon ne kaha ke khao. mein nahin janta ke Nabi kareem sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne kabhi patli roti ( chapati ) dekhi ho. yahan tak ke aap Allah se ja mile aur na Nabi kareem sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne kabhi Muslim bahani hui bakri dekhi.",
  "bukhari|5428": "auraton par Aishah ki fazilat aisi hai jaise tamam khanon par sarid ki fazilat hai.",
  "bukhari|5429": "safar azaab ka ek tukda hai, jo insaan ko sone aur khane se rok deta hai. pas jab kisi shakhs ki safri zaroorat hasab mansha poori ho jaye to use jild hi ghar wapas aao jana chahiye.",
  "bukhari|543": "hum se aboalnaman ne bayan kiya, kaha hum se Hammad bin Zaid ne bayan kiya amru bin dinar se. unhon ne Jabir bin Zaid se, unhon ne Ibn abbas razi Allah anhuma se ke Nabi kareem sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne madinah mein rah kar saat rakaat ( ek saath ) aur aath rakaat ( ek saath ) padhen. Zuhr aur Asr ( ki aath rakaat ) aur Maghrib aur Isha ( ki saat rakaat ) Ayyub sakhtiyani ne Jabir bin Zaid se puchha shayad barsat ka musam raha ho. Jabir bin Zaid ne jawaab diya ke ghalban isa hi ho ga.",
  "bukhari|5438": "ho. sirf us saal ye hukm diya tha jis saal qahat ki wajah se log faqe mein mabatla the. maqsad ye tha ke jo log gani hain wo gosht muhtajon ko khalayin ( aur jama kar ke na rakhen ) aur hum to bakri ke paye mehfooz kar ke rakh lete the aur pandrah din baad tak ( khate the ) aur aal Muhammad sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne kabhi salan ke saath gehoon ki roti teen din tak barabar sair ho kar nahin khayi.",
  "bukhari|544": "hum se Ibrahim bin almanzar ne bayan kiya, kaha hum se Anas bin yaz lisi ne Hisham bin Urwah ke wastah se bayan kiya, unhon ne apne walid se ke maayi Aishah sadiqah razi Allah anha ne farmaya ke Nabi kareem sallallahu alaihi wasallam Asr ki namaz aise waqt parhte the ke un ke hajrah mein se abhi dhoop bahar nahin nikalti thi.",
  "bukhari|5442": "aur Muhammad bin Yusuf ne bayan kiya, un se Sufyan ne bayan kiya, un se mansoor Ibn safiah ne, un se un ki walida ne bayan kiya aur un se Aishah razi Allah anha ne bayan kiya ke Rasool Allah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ki wafat ho gayi aur hum paani aur khajoor hi se ( aksar dinon mein ) pait bharte rahe.",
  "bukhari|5445": "jis ne har din subah ke waqt saat ajua khajorin kha lein, use us din na zahar nuqsaan pahuncha sakay ga aur na jadu.",
  "bukhari|5451": "jo shakhs ( lehsun ) khaye to wo hamari masjid ke qareeb na aaye.",
  "bukhari|5452": "jis ne lehsun ya pyaz khayi ho to use chahiye ke hum se door rahe, ya ye farmaya ke hamari masjid se door rahe.",
  "bukhari|5453": "jo khub kaala ho wo todo kyunki wo zyada laziz hota hai. Jabir razi Allah anhu ne arz kiya aap ne bakrian charai hain? Nabi kareem sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne farmaya ke haan aur koi Nabi isa nahin guzra jis ne bakrian na charai hoon.",
  "bukhari|5454": ". khane mein sato ke siwa aur koi cheez nahin lai gayi, phir hum ne khana khaya aur Nabi kareem sallallahu alaihi wasallam kuli kar ke namaz ke liye khare ho gaye, hum ne bhi kuli ki.",
  "bukhari|5456": "jab koi shakhs khana khaye to haath chatne ya kisi ko chatane se pehle haath na punche.",
  "bukhari|5458": "tamam tarifein Allah ke liye, bahut zyada pakeezah barkat wali, hum us khane ka haq poori tarah ada na kar sakay aur ye hamesha ke liye rukhsat nahin kiya gaya hai ( aur ye us liye kaha takeh ) us se hum ko beparwahi ka khayal na ho, ay hamare Rabb!.“",
  "bukhari|5459": "tamam tarifein us Allah ke liye hain jis ne hamari kafayat ki aur humein serab kiya. hum us khane ka haq poori tarah ada na kar sakay warna hum us nemat ke munkar nahin hain. aur ek martabah farmaya ”tere hi liye tamam tarifein hain ay hamare Rabb! us ka haq ada nahin kar sakay aur na ye hamesha ke liye rukhsat kiya gaya hai. ( ye us liye kaha takeh ) us se hum ko be niyazi ka khayal na ho. ay hamare Rabb!“.",
  "bukhari|546": "Nabi kareem sallallahu alaihi wasallam jab Asr ki namaz parhte to sooraj abhi mere hujre mein jahankta rehta tha. abhi saaya na phela hota tha. abwabdallah ( Imam Bukhari rahimahu Allah ) kehte hain ke Imam Malik aur Yahya bin Saeed, Shuaib rahmaham Allah aur Ibn Abi hafsa ke rawaiyton mein ( Zuhri se ) «walshms qabal un tazhr» ke alfaaz hain, ( jin ka matlab ye hai ke dhoop abhi oopar na chadhi hoti ).",
  "bukhari|5460": "jab tum mein kisi shakhs ka khaadim us ka khana laye to agar wo use apne saath nahin bitha sakta to kam az kam ek ya do luqmah us khane mein se use khila de ( kyunki ) us ne ( pakatay waqt ) us ki garmi aur tyari ki mashaqat bardasht ki hai.",
  "bukhari|5463": "jab raat ka khana samne rakh diya gaya ho aur namaz bhi khadi ho gayi ho to pehle khana khao. aur Ayyub se riwayat hai, un se Nafi ne, un se Ibn Umar razi Allah anhuma ne aur un se Nabi kareem sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne isi ke mutabiq.",
  "bukhari|5465": "jab namaz khadi ho chakay aur raat ka khana bhi samne ho to khana khao. wahib aur Yahya bin Saeed ne bayan kiya, un se Hisham ne ke jab raat ka khana rakha ja chakay.",
  "bukhari|549": "Asr ki aur isi waqt hum Rasool Allah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ke saath bhi ye namaz parhte the.",
  "bukhari|55": "jab aadmi sawaab ki niyyat se apne ahl wa yal par kharch kare pas wo bhi us ke liye sadaqah hai.",
  "bukhari|550": "hum se Abu al-Yaman hukm bin Nafi ne bayan kiya ke kaha humein Shuaib bin Abi hamza ne Zuhri se khabar di, unhon ne kaha ke mujh se Anas bin Malik razi Allah anhu ne bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya ke Rasool Allah sallallahu alaihi wasallam jab Asr ki namaz parhte to sooraj buland aur tez roshan hota tha. phir ek shakhs madinah ke balayi elaqah ki taraf jata wahan pahunchane ke baad bhi sooraj buland rehta tha ( Zuhri ne kaha ke ) madinah ke balayi elaqah ke baaz maqamat taqriban chaar mail par ya kuchh aise hi waqa hain.",
  "bukhari|551": "hum Asr ki namaz parhte ( Nabi kareem sallallahu alaihi wasallam ke saath ) us ke baad koi shakhs qabah jata aur jab wahan pahunch jata to sooraj abhi buland hota tha.",
  "bukhari|552": "jis ki namaz Asr chhot gayi goya us ka ghar aur maal sab lat gaya. Imam Bukhari rahimahu Allah ne farmaya ke surat Muhammad mein jo «yatarkam» ka lafz aaya hai wo «Witr» se nikala gaya hai. «Witr» kehte hain kisi shakhs ka koi aadmi mar daalna ya us ka maal cheen lena.",
  "bukhari|556": "agar Asr ki namaz ki ek rakaat bhi koi shakhs sooraj ghuroob hone se pehle pa saka to poori namaz padhe ( us ki namaz ada hui na qaza ) isi tarah agar sooraj tulu hone se pehle Fajr ki namaz ki ek rakaat bhi pa sakay to poori namaz padhe.",
  "bukhari|5575": "jis ne duniya mein sharaab pi aur phir us ne taubah nahin ki to aakhirat mein wo us se mahroom rahe ga.",
  "bukhari|5576": "hum se Abu al-Yaman ne bayan kiya, kaha hum ko Shuaib ne khabar di, unhein Zuhri ne, kaha mujh ko Saeed bin masib ne khabar di aur unhon ne Abu Hurairah razi Allah anhu se suna ke jis raat Rasool Allah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ko meraj karayi gayi to aap sallallahu alaihi wasallam ko ( bit almaqdas ke shehar ) eliya mein sharaab aur doodh ke do pyale pesh ke gaye. Nabi kareem sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne unhein dekha phir aap sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne doodh ka pyalah lay liya. us par Jibreel alaihi assalam ne kaha us Allah ke liye tamam tarifein hain jis ne aap ko deen fitrat ki taraf chalne ki hidayat farmayi. agar aap ne sharaab ka pyalah lay liya hota to aap ki ummat gumrah ho jati. Shuaib ke saath us hadees ko mamar, Ibn alhad, Usman bin Umar aur zubaidi ne Zuhri se naqal kiya hai.",
  "bukhari|5581": "hum se masdad ne bayan kiya, kaha hum se Yahya ne bayan kiya, kaha un se abuhayan ne, kaha hum se amir ne bayan kiya aur un se Ibn Umar razi Allah anhuma ne ke Umar razi Allah anhu member par khare hue aur kaha amabad! jab sharaab ki harmat ka hukm nazil hua to wo paanch chizon se banti thi angoor, khajoor, shahad, gehoon aur jo aur sharaab ( khamar ) wo hai jo aqal ko zail kar de.",
  "bukhari|5582": "hum se Ismail bin Abdullah ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha ke mujh se Malik bin Anas ne bayan kiya, un se Ishaq bin Abdullah bin Abi Talhah ne aur un se Anas bin Malik razi Allah anhu ne bayan kiya ke mein Abu Ubaidah, abutlha aur Abi bin kaab razi Allah anhum ko kachi aur paki khajoor se tayar ki hui sharaab pala raha tha ke ek aanay wale ne aao kar bataya ke sharaab haraam kar di gayi hai. us waqt abutlha razi Allah anhu ne kaha ke Anas athu aur sharaab ko baha do chunaanchah mein ne use baha diya.",
  "bukhari|5583": "hum se masdad ne bayan kiya, kaha hum se mamar ne bayan kiya, un se un ke walid ne ke mein ne Anas razi Allah anhu se suna, unhon ne bayan kiya ke ek qabeelah mein khara mein apne chachaon ko khajoor ki sharaab pala raha tha mein un mein sab se kam Umar tha. kisi ne kaha ke sharaab haraam kar di gayi. un hazrat ne kaha ke ab use phenk do. chunaanchah hum ne sharaab phenk di. mein ne Anas razi Allah anhu se puchha ke wo kis cheez ki sharaab banti thi? farmaya ke tazah paki hui aur kachi khajooron ki. Abu Bakr bin Anas ne kaha ke un ki sharaab ( khajoor ki ) hoti thi to Anas razi Allah anhu ne us ka inkaar nahin kiya aur mujh se mere baaz ashaab ne bayan kiya ke unhon ne Anas razi Allah anhu se suna, unhon ne bayan kiya ke us zamanah mein un ki sharaab aksar kachi aur paki khajoor se tayar ki jati thi.",
  "bukhari|5584": "hum se Muhammad bin Abi bakr maqadmi ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha hum se Yusuf abumashr bara ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha ke mein ne Saeed bin Abdullah se suna, unhon ne kaha ke mujh se bakr bin Abdullah ne bayan kiya aur unhon ne kaha ke mujh se Anas bin Malik razi Allah anhu ne bayan kiya ke jab sharaab haraam ki gayi to wo kachi aur pukhtah khajooron se tayar ki jati thi.",
  "bukhari|5585": "jo bhi peene wali cheez nasha lawe wo haraam hai.",
  "bukhari|5586": "jo cheez bhi nasha lane wali ho wo haraam hai.",
  "bukhari|5587": "daba“ aur ”mazafat“ mein nabeez na banaya karo aur Abu Hurairah razi Allah anhu us ke saath ”hantam“ aur ”naqir“ ka bhi izafah kiya karte the.",
  "bukhari|559": "hum Maghrib ki namaz Nabi kareem sallallahu alaihi wasallam ke saath parh kar jab wapas hote aur teer andazi karte ( to itna ujaalaa baqi rehta tha ke ) ek shakhs apne teer girne ki jagah ko dekhta tha.",
  "bukhari|5591": "hum se qatibah bin Saeed ne bayan kiya, kaha hum se yaqub bin Abdur Rahman ne bayan kiya, un se abuhazam Salamah bin dinar ne bayan kiya ke mein ne sahal bin Saad saadi se suna, unhon ne kaha ke aboasid Malik bin rabi aaye aur Nabi kareem sallallahu alaihi wasallam ko apne walima ki dawat di, un ki biwi hi sab kaam kar rahi thin halanka wo nayi dulhan thin. sahal razi Allah anhu ne bayan kiya tumhein maloom hai ke mein ne Nabi kareem sallallahu alaihi wasallam ko kiya pilaya tha. Nabi kareem sallallahu alaihi wasallam ke liye unhon ne patthar ke konde mein raat ke waqt khajoor bhigo di thi.",
  "bukhari|5592": "hum se Yusuf bin Musa ne bayan kiya, kaha hum se Muhammad bin Abdullah aboahmd zabiri ne, kaha hum se Sufyan Sauri ne bayan kiya, un se mansoor bin matamar ne, un se salim bin Abi aljad ne aur un se Jabir razi Allah anhu ne bayan kiya ke Rasool Allah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne chand bartanon mein nabeez bhagone ki ( jin mein sharaab banti thi ) mamanat kar di thi phir Ansaar ne arz kiya ke hamare pass to doosre bartan nahin hain. Nabi kareem sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne farmaya ke to khair phir ijazat hai. Imam Bukhari rahimahu Allah kehte hain mujh se khalifa bin khiyat ne bayan kiya, kaha hum se Yahya bin Saeed Qattan ne bayan kiya, kaha hum se Sufyan Sauri ne bayan kiya, un se mansoor bin matamar ne aur un se salim bin Abi aljad ne phir yahi hadees riwayat ki thi.",
  "bukhari|5593": "hum se Ali bin Abdullah madini ne bayan kiya, kaha hum se Sufyan bin Uyainah ne, wo sulaiman bin Abi Muslim ahul se, wo mujahid se, wo aboyaz amru bin aswad se aur unhon ne Abdullah bin amru bin aas se riwayat kiya ke jab Nabi kareem sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne mashkon ke siwa aur bartanon mein nabeez bhagone se mana farmaya to logon ne aap sallallahu alaihi wasallam se arz kiya: ya Rasool Allah! har kisi ko mashak kahan se mil sakti hai? us waqt aap sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne bin lakh lage ghade ( roghan zift lage bartan ) mein nabeez bhagone ki ijazat de di. hum se Abdullah bin Muhammad masndi ne bayan kiya, kaha hum se Sufyan Sauri ne yahi bayan kiya aur us mein yun hai ke jab Nabi kareem sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne chand bartanon mein nabeez bhagone se mana farmaya.",
  "bukhari|5594": "hum se masdad ne bayan kiya, kaha hum se Yahya ne, ke un se Sufyan bin Uyainah ne, un se Sufyan Sauri ne, un se Ibrahim timi ne, un se Haris bin soed ne aur un se Ali razi Allah anhu ne ke Nabi kareem sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne daba aur mazafat ( khas qasam ke bartan jin mein sharaab banti thi ) ke istemaal ki bhi mamanat kar di thi. hum se Usman ne bayan kiya, kaha hum se Jarir ne bayan kiya, kaha un se Aamash ne yahi hadees bayan ki.",
  "bukhari|5596": "tha, mein ne puchha kiya hum safed ghadon mein pi liya karein kaha ke nahin.",
  "bukhari|5598": "bazaq» ( angoor ka sherah halki aanch diya hua ) ke mutalliq puchha to unhon ne kaha ke Muhammad sallallahu alaihi wasallam «bazaq» ke wajood se pehle hi duniya se rukhsat ho gaye the jo cheez bhi nasha laye wo haraam hai. aboaljoeriah ne kaha ke «bazaq» to halaal wa taib hai. Ibn abbas razi Allah anhuma ne kaha ke angoor halaal wa taib tha jab us ki sharaab bin gayi to wo haraam khabis hai ( na ke halaal wa taib ).",
  "bukhari|5599": "hum se Abdullah bin Abi shibah ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha hum se aboasama ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha hum se Hisham bin Urwah ne bayan kiya, un se un ke baap (Urwah bin Zubair) ne bayan kiya aur un se Aishah razi Allah anha ne bayan kiya ke Nabi kareem sallallahu alaihi wasallam halwa aur shahad ko dost rakhte the.",
  "bukhari|56": "beshak to jo kuchh kharch kare aur us se teri niyyat Allah ki raza hasil karni ho to tajah ko us ka sawaab mile ga. yahan tak ke us par bhi jo to apni biwi ke munh mein dalay.",
  "bukhari|5600": "hum se Muslim bin Ibrahim ne bayan kiya, kaha hum se Hisham dastoai ne bayan kiya, kaha hum se Qatadah ne bayan kiya aur un se Anas razi Allah anhu ne bayan ne kiya ke mein ne abutlha, abudajanah aur saheel bin beza razi Allah anhum ko kachi khajoor ki mali hui nabeez pala raha tha ke sharaab haraam kar di gayi aur mein ne mojuda sharaab phenk di. mein hi unhein pala raha tha mein sab se kam Umar tha. hum us nabeez ko us waqt sharaab hi samjhate the aur amru bin Haris raawi ne bayan kiya ke hum se Qatadah ne bayan kiya, unhon ne Anas razi Allah anhu se suna.",
  "bukhari|5601": "hum se aboasm ne bayan kiya, un se Ibn jarij ne, kaha mujh ko Ata bin Abi rabah ne khabar di, unhon ne Jabir razi Allah anhu se suna, unhon ne bayan kiya ke Nabi kareem sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne kishmish aur khajoor ( ke sherah ) ko aur tazah ( pukhtah, paki hui ) khajoor aur neem pukhtah ( kachi, gadri hui ) khajoor ko mila kar bhagone se mana farmaya tha, us taur us mein nasha jaldi paida ho jata hai.",
  "bukhari|5605": "use dhak kar kyun nahin laye ek lakdi hi us par rakh lete.",
  "bukhari|5606": "use dhak kar kyun nahin laye, us par lakdi hi rakh dete. aur Aamash ne kaha ke mujh se abusafiyan ne bayan kiya, un se Jabir razi Allah anhu ne aur un se Nabi kareem sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne yahi hadees bayan ki.",
  "bukhari|5609": "hum se aboasm ne bayan kiya, un se Imam ozai ne bayan kiya, un se Ibn Shihab ne bayan kiya, un se Ubaidullah bin Abdullah ne aur un se Abdullah bin abbas razi Allah anhuma ne bayan kiya ke Rasool Allah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne doodh piya phir kuli ki aur farmaya ke us mein chaknaht hoti hai.",
  "bukhari|561": "hum se makki bin Ibrahim ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha hum se yazid bin Abi abeed ne bayan kiya Salamah bin akwa razi Allah anhu se, farmaya ke hum namaz Maghrib Nabi kareem sallallahu alaihi wasallam ke saath us waqt parhte the jab sooraj parde mein chhap jata.",
  "bukhari|5612": "pehle dayein taraf se, haan dayein taraf wale ka haq hai.",
  "bukhari|5615": "hum se abunim ne bayan kiya, kaha hum se masar ne bayan kiya, un se Abdul Malik bin misra ne, un se nazal ne bayan kiya ke wo Ali razi Allah anhu ki khidmat mein masjid kofah ke sahan mein hazir hue phir Ali razi Allah anhu ne khare ho kar piya aur kaha ke kuchh log khare ho kar paani peene ko makruh samjhate hain halanka mein ne Rasool Allah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ko us tarah karte dekha hai jis tarah tum ne mujhe us waqt khare ho kar paani peete dekha hai.",
  "bukhari|5619": "dayein taraf se, pas dayein taraf se.",
  "bukhari|5622": "hum se masdad ne bayan kiya, kaha hum se matamar ne, un se un ke walid ne, ke mein ne Anas razi Allah anhu se suna, unhon ne bayan kiya ke mein khara hua apne qabeelah mein apne chachaon ko khajoor ki sharaab pala raha tha. mein un mein se sab se chhota tha, itne mein kisi ne kaha ke sharaab haraam kar di gayi ( abutlha razi Allah anhu ne ) kaha ke sharaab phenk do. chunaanchah hum ne phenk di. sulaiman ne kaha ke mein ne Anas razi Allah anhu se puchha us waqt log kis cheez ki sharaab peete the kaha ke paki aur kachi khajoor ki. Abu Bakr bin Anas ne kaha ke yahi un ki sharaab hoti thi Anas razi Allah anhu ne us ka inkaar nahin kiya, bakr bin Abdullah mazni ya Qatadah ne kaha aur mujh se baaz logon ne bayan kiya ke unhon ne Anas razi Allah anhu se suna, unhon ne bayan kiya ke ”un ki un dinon yahi ( fazeh ) un ki sharaab thi.“",
  "bukhari|5624": "tum jab sone lago to charag bujha do. darwaze band kar do, mashkon ke munh bandh do aur khane peene ke bartanon ko dhanp do. Jabir razi Allah anhu ne kaha ke mera khayal hai ke ye bhi kaha khwah lakdi hi ke zariya se dhak sako jo us ki chorai mein Bism Allah keh kar rakh di jaye.",
  "bukhari|5625": "mashak ka munh khol kar us mein munh laga kar paani peene se roka.",
  "bukhari|5627": "tha ke ) koi shakhs apne pados ko apni deewar mein khonti wagairah garne se roke.",
  "bukhari|5628": "hum se masdad ne bayan kiya, kaha hum se Ismail ne bayan kiya, kaha hum ko Ayyub ne khabar di, unhein akramah ne aur unhein Abu Hurairah razi Allah anhu ne ke Nabi kareem sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne mashak ke munh se paani peene ki mamanat farma di thi.",
  "bukhari|5629": "hum se masdad ne bayan kiya, kaha hum se yazid bin zariya ne bayan kiya, kaha hum se Khalid haza ne bayan kiya, un se akramah ne aur un se Ibn abbas razi Allah anhuma ne bayan kiya ke Nabi kareem sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne mashak ke munh se paani peene ko mana farmaya tha.",
  "bukhari|563": "isa na ho ke ”Maghrib“ ki namaz ke naam ke liye aerab ( yaani dehati logon ) ka mahavarah tumhari zabanon par chadh jaye. Abdullah bin magfal razi Allah anhu ne kaha ya khud Nabi kareem sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne farmaya ke badwi Maghrib ko Isha kehte the.",
  "bukhari|5631": "hum se aboasm aur abunim ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha ke hum se Urwah bin Sabit ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha ke mujhe shamama bin Abdullah ne khabar di, bayan kiya ke Anas razi Allah anhu do ya teen sanson mein paani peete the.",
  "bukhari|5633": "tha ke sone aur chandi ke pyalah mein na piya karo aur na resham wa diba pahna karo kyunki ye cheezain un ke liye dena mein hain aur tumhare liye aakhirat mein hain.",
  "bukhari|5634": "jo shakhs chandi ke bartan mein koi cheez pita hai to wo shakhs apne pait mein dozakh ki aag bhadka raha hai.",
  "bukhari|564": "tum us raat ko yaad rakhna. aaj jo log zindah hain ek sau saal ke guzarne tak roye zamin par un mein se koi bhi baqi nahin rahe ga.",
  "bukhari|5640": "jo museebat bhi kisi musalman ko pahunchti hai Allah ta'ala use us ke gunah ka kafarah kar deta hai ( kisi musalman ke ) ek kanta bhi agar jism ke kisi hissah mein chabh jaye.",
  "bukhari|5643": "momin ki misal pode ki sab se pehli nakli hui hari shakh jaisi hai ke hua use kabhi jhuka deti hai aur kabhi barabar kar deti hai aur munafiq ki misal sanobar ke darakht jaisi hai ke wo sidha hi khara rehta hai aur aaqar ek jhoke mein kabhi akhad hi jata hai. aur zakriya ne bayan kiya ke hum se Saad ne bayan kiya, un se Ibn kaab ne bayan kiya, un se un ke walid majid mohataram almaqam kaab razi Allah anhu ne Nabi kareem sallallahu alaihi wasallam se yahi bayan kiya.",
  "bukhari|5645": "Allah ta'ala jis ke saath khair wa bhalai karna chahta hai use bimari ki taqalif aur digar musibaton mein mabatla kar deta hai.",
  "bukhari|5649": "bhooke ko khana khilao aur mariz ki ayaadat yaani mizaj percy karo aur qaidi ko chahadao.",
  "bukhari|565": "aap namaz Zuhr dopahar mein parhte the. aur jab namaz Asr parhte to sooraj saaf roshan hota. Maghrib ki namaz wajib hote hi ada farmate, aur ”Isha“ mein agar log jaldi jama ho jate to jaldi parh lete aur agar aanay walon ki tadaad kam hoti to der karte. aur subah ki namaz munh andhere mein parha karte the.",
  "bukhari|5656": "koi fikr ki baat nahin. un shaallah ye marz gunahon se paak karne waala hai“ lekin us dehati ne aap ke un mubarak kalimaat ke jawaab mein kaha ke aap kehte hain ke ye paak karne waala hai hargaz nahin balkeh ye bakhar ek boodhay par ghalb aao gaya hai aur use qabar tak pahuncha ke rahe ga. aap sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne farmaya ke phir isa hi ho ga.",
  "bukhari|5657": "Islam qubool kar lay chunaanchah us ne Islam qubool kar liya aur Saeed bin masib ne bayan kiya apne walid se ke jab abutalb ki wafat ka waqt qareeb hua to Nabi kareem sallallahu alaihi wasallam un ke pass mizaj percy ke liye tashreef lay gaye.",
  "bukhari|5662": "la baas tahor inshallah» ke ”koi fikr nahin agar Allah ne chaha ( ye marz ) gunahon se paak karne waala ho ga“ lekin us ne ye jawaab diya ke hargaz nahin ye to isa bakhar hai jo ek boodhay par ghalb aao chuka hai aur use qabar tak pahuncha kar hi rahe ga, us par Nabi kareem sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne farmaya ke phir isa hi ho ga.",
  "bukhari|5665": "kiya tumhare sir ki jooen tumhein takleef pahunchati hain. mein ne arz kiya: ji haan! phir aap sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne hajam bulwaya aur us ne mera sir mond diya us ke baad Nabi kareem sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne mujhe fadyah ada kar dene ka hukm farmaya.",
  "bukhari|5667": "haan tum mein ke do aadmiyon ke barabar hai. Ibn Masood razi Allah anhu ne arz kiya ke Nabi kareem sallallahu alaihi wasallam ka ajr bhi do ganna hai. kaha haan phir aap ne farmaya ke kisi musalman ko bhi jab kisi marz ki takleef ya aur koi takleef pahunchti hai to Allah us ke gunah ko us tarah jhaad deta hai jis tarah darakht apne patto ko jahadta hai.",
  "bukhari|5670": "hum se Ibrahim bin hamza ne bayan kiya, kaha hum se hatim bin Ismail ne bayan kiya, un se jaid bin Abdur Rahman ne bayan kiya ke mein ne saib bin yazid razi Allah anhu se suna, unhon ne bayan kiya ke mujhe meri khala Rasool Allah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ki khidmat mein bachpan mein lay gin aur arz kiya: ya Rasool Allah! mere bhaanje ko dard hai. Nabi kareem sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne mere sir par haath phira aur mere liye barkat ki dua ki phir aap sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne wuzu kiya aur mein ne aap ke wuzu ka paani piya aur mein ne aap ki peeth ke peeche khare ho kar nabuwat ki mahr aap ke donon shanon ke darmiyan dekhi. ye mahr nabuwat hajlah urus ki ghandi jaisi thi.",
  "bukhari|5671": "kisi takleef mein agar koi shakhs mabatla ho to use maut ki tamna nahin karni chahiye aur agar koi maut ki tamna karne hi lage to ye kehna chahiye «Allahumma ahini ma kant alhiyaat khaira li, watofni aza kant alofaat khaira li» ”ay Allah! jab tak zindagi mere liye behtar hai mujhe zindah rakh aur jab maut mere liye behtar ho to mujh ko utha lay.“",
  "bukhari|5674": "ay Allah! meri maghfirat farma mujh par raham kar aur mujh ko achhe rafiqon ( farishton aur pighambaron ) ke saath mila de.“",
  "bukhari|5675": "ay parwardigar logon ke! bimari door kar de, ay ansanon ke palne wale! shafau ata farma, to hi shafau dene waala hai. teri shafau ke siwa aur koi shafau nahin, aisi shafau de jis mein marz bilkul baqi na rahe.“ aur amru bin Abi Qais aur Ibrahim bin tahman ne mansoor se bayan kiya, unhon ne Ibrahim aur aboalzhi se ke ”jab koi mariz Nabi kareem sallallahu alaihi wasallam ke pass laya jata.“",
  "bukhari|5676": "hum se Muhammad bin bashar ne bayan kiya, kaha hum se ghandar (Muhammad bin jafar) ne bayan kiya, kaha hum se Shubah ne bayan kiya, un se Muhammad bin manakadar ne, kaha ke mein ne Jabir bin Abdullah razi Allah anhuma se suna, unhon ne bayan kiya ke Nabi kareem sallallahu alaihi wasallam mere yahan tashreef laye mein bimar tha Nabi kareem sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne wuzu kiya aur wuzu ka paani mujh par dala ya farmaya ke us par ye paani daal do us se mujhe hosh aao gaya. mein ne arz kiya ke mein to kalala hoon ( jis ke walid aur aulad na ho ) mere tarkah mein taqsim kaise ho gi us par miraas ki aayat nazil hui.",
  "bukhari|572": "doosre log namaz parh kar sau gaye hoon ge. ( yaani doosri masajid mein parhne wale musalman ) aur tum log jab tak namaz ka intizaar karte rahe ( goya sare waqt ) namaz hi parhte rahe. Ibn maryam ne us mein ye zyada kiya ke humein Yahya bin Ayyub ne khabar di. kaha mujh se Humaid tavil ne bayan kiya, unhon ne Anas razi Allah anhu se ye suna, goya us raat aap ki anguthi ki chamak ka naqshah us waqt bhi meri nazaron ke samne chamak raha hai.",
  "bukhari|574": "jis ne thanday waqt ki do namazein ( waqt par ) padhen ( Fajr aur Asr ) to wo jannat mein dakhil ho ga. Ibn raja ne kaha ke hum se Hammam ne abujamrah se bayan kiya ke Abu Bakr bin Abdullah bin Qais razi Allah anhu ne unhein us hadees ki khabar di. hum se Ishaq ne bayan kiya, kaha hum se haban ne, unhon ne kaha ke hum se Hammam ne bayan kiya, kaha hum se abujamrah ne bayan kiya Abu Bakr bin Abdullah razi Allah anhu se, unhon ne apne walid se, unhon ne Nabi kareem sallallahu alaihi wasallam se, pehli hadees ki tarah.",
  "bukhari|575": "jitna pachas ya saath aayat parhne mein sirf hota hai itna faaslah tha.",
  "bukhari|576": "itna ke ek shakhs pachas aaiteyn parh sakay.",
  "bukhari|577": "mein apne ghar sehri khata, phir Nabi kareem sallallahu alaihi wasallam ke saath namaz Fajr pane ke liye mujhe jaldi karni parti thi.",
  "bukhari|578": "hum se Yahya bin bakir ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha humein lais ne khabar di, unhon ne aqeel bin Khalid se, unhon ne Ibn Shihab se, unhon ne kaha ke mujhe Urwah bin Zubair razi Allah anhu ne khabar di ke Umm almominin Aishah razi Allah anha ne unhein khabar di ke musalman auratein Rasool Allah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ke saath namaz Fajr parhne chadron mein lapt kar aati thin. phir namaz se farigh ho kar jab apne gharon ko wapas hotin to unhein andhere ki wajah se koi shakhs pehchaan nahin sakta tha.",
  "bukhari|5783": "Allah ta'ala us ki taraf qiyamat ke din nazar rahmat nahin kare ga jo apna kapda takabbur wa ghuroor se zamin par ghaseet kar chalta hai.“",
  "bukhari|5784": "jo shakhs takabbur ki wajah se tahbnd ghasitta hua chale ga to Allah paak us ki taraf qiyamat ke din nazar bhi nahin kare ga.“ Abu Bakr razi Allah anhu ne arz kiya: ya Rasool Allah! mere tahmd ka ek hissah kabhi latak jata hai magar ye ke khas taur se us ka khayal rakha karun. aap sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne farmaya ”tum un logon mein se nahin ho jo isa takabbur se karte hain.“",
  "bukhari|5787": "tahbnd ka jo hissah takhnon se neeche latka ho wo jahannam mein ho ga.“",
  "bukhari|579": "jis ne Fajr ki ek rakaat ( jamaat ke saath ) sooraj nikalnay se pehle pa li us ne Fajr ki namaz ( bajmaat ka sawaab ) pa liya. aur jis ne Asr ki ek rakaat ( jamaat ke saath ) sooraj dubne se pehle pa li, us ne Asr ki namaz ( bajmaat ka sawaab ) pa liya.",
  "bukhari|5793": "hum se abdan ne bayan kiya, kaha hum ko Abdullah ne khabar di, kaha hum ko yunis ne, unhein Zuhri ne, unhein Ali bin Husain ne khabar di, unhein Husain bin Ali razi Allah anhuma ne khabar di ke Ali razi Allah anhu ne bayan kiya ( ke hamza razi Allah anhu ne harmat sharaab se pehle sharaab ke nasha mein jab un ki oontni zabah kar di aur unhon ne Nabi kareem sallallahu alaihi wasallam se aao kar us ki shikayat ki to ) Nabi kareem sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne apni chadar mangwai aur use audh kar tashreef lay chalne lage. mein aur Zaid bin harsa razi Allah anhu aap ke peeche peeche the. aaqar aap us ghar mein pahunche jis mein hamza razi Allah anhu the, aap ne andar aanay ki ijazat mangi aur unhon ne aap hazrat ko ijazat di.",
  "bukhari|5794": "mahram qamis, pajama, barns ( topi ya sir par pahanne ki koi cheez ) aur moze nahin pahne ga albatah agar use chapal na malin to mozon hi ko takhnon tak kat kar pahan lay wo hi joti ki tarah ho jayein ge.",
  "bukhari|5795": "hum se Abdullah bin Muhammad masndi ne bayan kiya, kaha hum ko Ibn Uyainah ne khabar di, unhein amru ne aur unhon ne Jabir bin Abdullah razi Allah anhuma se suna, unhon ne bayan kiya ke Nabi kareem sallallahu alaihi wasallam Abdullah bin Abi ( munafiq ) ke pass jab use qabar mein dakhil kiya ja chuka tha tashreef laye phir aap ke hukm se us ki lash nikali gayi aur Nabi kareem sallallahu alaihi wasallam ke ghutnon par use rakha gaya Nabi kareem sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne us par dam karte hue apni qamis pahnai aur Allah hi khub janane waala hai.",
  "bukhari|580": "jis ne ek rakaat namaz ( bajmaat ) pa li us ne namaz ( bajmaat ka sawaab ) pa liya.",
  "bukhari|5801": "hum se qatibah bin Saeed ne bayan kiya, kaha hum se lais bin Saad ne bayan kiya, un se yazid bin Abi Habib ne, un se abulkhair ne aur un se aqbah bin amir razi Allah anhu ne ke Rasool Allah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ko resham ki faroj ( qabah ) hadyah mein di gayi. Nabi kareem sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne use pahna ( resham ka mardon ke liye harmat ke hukm se pehle ) aur isi ko pahne hue namaz parhi. phir aap sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne use bari tezi ke saath utaar dala jaise aap us se nagoari mahsus karte hoon phir farmaya ke ye matqion ke liye munasib nahin hai. us riwayat ki matabat Abdullah bin Yusuf ne ki un se lais ne aur Abdullah bin Yusuf ke alawah doosron ne kaha ke «faroj harir.».",
  "bukhari|5802": "aur kaha mujh se masdad ne aur kaha hum se matamar ne ke mein ne apne baap se suna, kaha unhon ne ke mein ne Anas razi Allah anhu par reshmi zard topi ko dekha.",
  "bukhari|5804": "jise tahmd na mile wo pajama pahne aur jise chapal na malin wo moze pahnen.“",
  "bukhari|5812": "hum se amru bin asm ne bayan kiya, kaha hum se Hammam bin Yahya ne bayan kiya, un se Qatadah ne aur un se Anas bin Malik razi Allah anhu ne bayan kiya, Qatadah ne bayan kiya ke mein ne Anas razi Allah anhu se puchha ke Rasool Allah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ko kis tarah ka kapda zyada pasand tha bayan kiya ke habrat ki sabz yamni chadar.",
  "bukhari|5817": "meri ye chadar abujham ko wapas de do. us ne abhi mujhe meri namaz se ghafal kar diya tha aur abujham ki sadi chadar lete aao. ye abujham bin Huzaifah bin ghanm bani adi bin kaab qabeele mein se the.",
  "bukhari|5818": "kasa» ) aur ek moti azar nikal kar dikhai aur kaha ke Rasool Allah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ki rooh un hi do kapdon mein qabz hui thi.",
  "bukhari|5821": "hum se Ismail ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha ke mujh se Imam Malik ne bayan kiya, un se Abu az-Zinad ne bayan kiya, un se Aaraj ne aur un se Abu Hurairah razi Allah anhu ne bayan kiya ke Nabi kareem sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne do tarah ke pehnawe se mana farmaya ye ke koi shakhs ek hi kapde se apni kamar aur pandli ko mila kar bandh lay aur sharmagaa par koi doosra kapda na ho aur ye ke koi shakhs ek kapde ko us tarah jism par lapaitay ke ek taraf kapde ka koi hissah na ho aur aap ne malamsah aur manabzah se mana farmaya.",
  "bukhari|5822": "aur us se bhi ke koi shakhs ek kapde se pandli aur kamar ko mila lay aur sharmagaa par koi doosra kapda na ho.",
  "bukhari|5828": "hum se Adam ne bayan kiya, kaha hum se Shubah ne, kaha hum se Qatadah ne, kaha ke mein ne aboasman nahdi se suna ke hamare pass Umar razi Allah anhu ka maktub ( khat ) aaya hum us waqt atba bin farqad razi Allah anhu ke saath aazar baijaan mein the ( us mein likha tha ) ke Rasool Allah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne resham ke istemaal se ( mardon ko ) mana kiya hai siwa itne ke aur Nabi kareem sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne angothay ke qareeb ki apni donon ungliyon ke isharay se us ki miqdar bathayi. aboasman nahdi ne bayan kiya ke hamari samajh mein Nabi kareem sallallahu alaihi wasallam ki murad us se ( kapde wagairah resham ke ) phool bote banane se thi.",
  "bukhari|5829": "tha siwa itne ke aur us ki wazahat Nabi kareem sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne do ungliyon ke isharay se ki thi. Zuhair ( raawi hadees ) ne beach ki aur shahadat ki anglian utha kar bataya.",
  "bukhari|5832": "jo mard reshmi libaas duniya mein pahne ga wo aakhirat mein use hargaz nahin pahan sakay ga.",
  "bukhari|5833": "hum se sulaiman bin harab ne bayan kiya, kaha hum se Hammad bin Zaid ne bayan kiya, un se Sabit ne bayan kiya ke mein ne Ibn Zubair razi Allah anhu se suna, unhon ne khatba dete hue kaha ke Muhammad sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne farmaya hai ke jis mard ne duniya mein resham pahna wo aakhirat mein use nahin pahan sakay ga.",
  "bukhari|5835": "duniya mein resham to wahi mard pahne ga jis ka aakhirat mein koi hissah na ho. mein ne us par kaha ke sach kaha aur abuhafs Rasool Allah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ki taraf koi jhuti baat nasbat nahin kar sakte aur Abdullah bin raja ne bayan kiya ke hum se Jarir ne bayan kiya, un se Yahya ne aur un se Imran ne aur poori hadees bayan ki.",
  "bukhari|5836": "kiya tumhein us par hairat hai. hum ne arz kiya ji haan farmaya, jannat mein Saad bin Muadh ke rumal us se bhi achhe hain.",
  "bukhari|5837": "tha aur resham aur dibaaj pahanne aur us par bethne se mana farmaya tha.",
  "bukhari|5844": "hum se Abdullah bin Muhammad masndi ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha hum se Hisham bin Yusuf sanaani ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha hum ko mamar bin rashid ne khabar di, unhein Zuhri ne khabar di, unhein hindah bint Haris ne khabar di aur un se Umm Salamah razi Allah anha ne bayan kiya ke Nabi kareem sallallahu alaihi wasallam raat ke waqt bedar hue aur kaha Allah ke siwa koi maabud nahin, kaisi kaisi bulain us raat mein nazil ho rahi hain aur kiya kiya rahmaten us ke khazanon se utar rahi hain. koi hai jo un hajrah waliyon ko bedar kar de. dekho bahut see duniya mein pahanne odhane walian aakhirat mein nangi hoon gi. Zuhri ne bayan kiya ke hindah apni astinon mein ungliyon ke darmiyan ghandiyan lagati thin, takeh sirf anglian khalin us se aage na khale.",
  "bukhari|585": "koi tum mein se intizaar mein na baitha rahe ke sooraj tulu hote hi namaz ke liye khara ho jaye, isi tarah sooraj ke dubne ke intizaar mein bhi na rehna chahiye.",
  "bukhari|5850": "hum se sulaiman bin harab ne bayan kiya, kaha hum se Hammad ne bayan kiya, un se Saeed bin Abi muslma ne, unhon ne kaha mein ne Anas razi Allah anhu se puchha kiya Nabi kareem sallallahu alaihi wasallam jutay pahne hue namaz parhte the? to unhon ne kaha ke haan.",
  "bukhari|5853": "jis ke pass ahraam bandhanay ke liye tahbnd na ho wo pajama pahan lay ( us ka katna zaroori nahin hai ) aur jis ke pass jutay na hoon wo moze hi pahan lay lekin takhnon ke neeche tak un ko kat dalay ( jaisa ke pichli hadees mein hai ).",
  "bukhari|5855": "jab tum mein se koi shakhs juta pahne to dayein taraf se sharwa kare aur jab ataray to bayein taraf se ataray takeh dahni janib pahanne mein awal ho aur utarne mein aaqar ho.",
  "bukhari|5856": "tum mein koi shakhs sirf ek paaon mein juta pahan kar na chale ya donon paaon nanga rakhe ya donon mein juta pahne.",
  "bukhari|5858": "mujh se Muhammad bin muqatil ne bayan kiya, kaha hum ko Abdullah bin mubarak ne khabar di, unhein aesi bin tahman ne khabar di, bayan kiya ke Anas bin Malik razi Allah anhu do jutay lay kar hamare pass bahar aaye jis mein do tasme lage hue the. Sabit banani ne kaha ke ye Nabi kareem sallallahu alaihi wasallam ke jutay hain.",
  "bukhari|5859": "hum se Muhammad bin ararah ne bayan kiya, kaha ke mujh se Umar bin Abi zaida ne bayan kiya, un se aon bin Abi jahifa ne aur un se un ke walid wahab bin Abdullah sawayee razi Allah anhu ne bayan kiya ke mein ( hajat aludaa ke mauqa par ) khidmat nabwi mein hazir hua to aap sallallahu alaihi wasallam chamde ke ek surkh khimah mein tashreef rakhe hue the aur mein ne Bilal razi Allah anhu ko dekha ke Nabi kareem sallallahu alaihi wasallam ke wuzu ka paani liye hue hain aur sahabah karam razi Allah anhum Nabi kareem sallallahu alaihi wasallam ke wuzu ke paani ko lay lene mein ek doosre ke aage badhne ki koshish kar rahe hain. agar kisi ko kuchh paani mil jata hai to wo use apne badan par laga leta hai aur jise kuchh nahin milta wo apne saathi ke haath ki tari hi ko lagane ki koshish karta hai.",
  "bukhari|586": "hum se Abdul Aziz bin Abdullah ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha hum se Ibrahim bin Saad ne bayan kiya, unhon ne Salih se ye hadees bayan ki, unhon ne Ibn Shihab se, unhon ne kaha mujh se Ata bin yazid jandi lisi ne bayan kiya ke unhon ne Abu Saeed khadri razi Allah anhu se suna. unhon ne farmaya ke mein ne Nabi kareem sallallahu alaihi wasallam se suna, aap sallallahu alaihi wasallam farma rahe the ke Fajr ki namaz ke baad koi namaz sooraj ke buland hone tak na parhi jaye, isi tarah Asr ki namaz ke baad sooraj dubne tak koi namaz na parhi jaye.",
  "bukhari|5869": "bahut se log namaz parh kar sau chakay hoon ge lekin tum us waqt bhi namaz mein ho jab tak tum namaz ka intizaar karte rahe ho.",
  "bukhari|587": "tha. Muawiyah razi Allah anhu ki murad Asr ke baad do rakaaton se thi ( jise aap ke zamanah mein baaz log parhte the ).",
  "bukhari|5872": "Muhammad Rasool Allah». goya us waqt Nabi kareem sallallahu alaihi wasallam ki ungli ya aap ki hatheli mein us ki chamak dekh raha hoon.",
  "bukhari|5874": "hum ne ek anguthi banoai hai us par lafz ( «Muhammad Rasool Allah» ) kandah karaya hai us liye anguthi par koi shakhs ye naqsh na kandah karae. Anas ne bayan kiya ke jaise us anguthi ki chamak Nabi kareem sallallahu alaihi wasallam ki changlian mein ab bhi mein dekh raha hoon.",
  "bukhari|5875": "Muhammad Rasool Allah» kandah karaya. jaise Nabi kareem sallallahu alaihi wasallam ke haath mein us ki safedi ab bhi mein dekh raha hoon.",
  "bukhari|5877": "Muhammad Rasool Allah» aur logon se keh diya ke mein ne chandi ki ek anguthi banwa kar us par «Muhammad Rasool Allah» naqsh karwaya hai. us liye ab koi shakhs ye naqsh apni anguthi par na khadoae.",
  "bukhari|588": "namaz Fajr ke baad sooraj nikalnay tak aur namaz Asr ke baad sooraj ghuroob hone tak.",
  "bukhari|5880": "hum se aboasm nabeel ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha hum ko Ibn jarij ne khabar di, unhon ne kaha hum ko Hasan bin Muslim ne khabar di, unhein taus ne aur unhein Ibn abbas razi Allah anhuma ne ke mein idalftar ki namaz mein Rasool Allah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ke saath mojod tha. Nabi kareem sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne khatba se pehle namaz padhai aur Ibn wahab ne jarij se ye lafz badhaye ke phir Nabi kareem sallallahu alaihi wasallam auraton ke majma ki taraf gaye ( aur sadaqah ki targhib dalai ) to auratein Bilal razi Allah anhu ke kapde mein chhale dar angothian dalne lagin.",
  "bukhari|5881": ". chunaanchah auratein apni baliyan aur khushboo aur mashak ke haar sadaqah mein dene lagin.",
  "bukhari|5883": "hum se hajjaj bin minhaal ne bayan kiya, kaha hum se Shubah ne bayan kiya, kaha ke mujhe adi bin Sabit ne khabar di, kaha ke mein ne Saeed bin jabeer se suna aur unhon ne Ibn abbas razi Allah anhuma se ke Nabi kareem sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne Eid ke din do rakaatein padhayen na us ke pehle koi namaz parhi aur na us ke baad phir aap auraton ki taraf tashreef laye, aap ke saath Bilal razi Allah anhu the. aap ne auraton ko sadaqah ka hukm farmaya to wo apni baliyan Bilal razi Allah anhu ki jholi mein dalne lagin.",
  "bukhari|5886": "hum se Muadh bin fazalah ne bayan kiya, kaha hum se Hisham dastoai ne, un se Yahya bin Abi kaseer ne, un se akramah ne aur un se Ibn abbas razi Allah anhuma ne bayan kiya ke Rasool Allah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne makhns mardon par aur mardon ki chal chalan ikhtiyar karne wali auraton par lanat bheji aur farmaya ke un zananah bannay wale mardon ko apne gharon se bahar nikal do. Ibn abbas razi Allah anhuma ne bayan kiya ke Nabi kareem sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne falan hijde ko nikala tha aur Umar razi Allah anhu ne falan hijde ko nikala tha.",
  "bukhari|5888": "munch ke bal katarwana paidaishi sunnat hai.“",
  "bukhari|5890": "moye zer naf mondna, nakhun tarshoana aur munch katrana paidaishi suntein hain.“",
  "bukhari|5892": "tum musharkene ke khilaf karo, dadhi chhor do aur munchin katroo.“ Abdullah bin Umar razi Allah anhuma jab haj ya amrah karte to apni dadhi ( haath se ) pakad lete aur ( muthi ) se jo bal zyada hote unhein katarwa dete.",
  "bukhari|5893": "munchin khub katarwaya liya karo aur dadhi ko badhao.“",
  "bukhari|5895": "hum se sulaiman bin harab ne bayan kiya, kaha hum se Hammad bin Zaid ne bayan kiya, un se Sabit ne bayan kiya ke Anas razi Allah anhu se Nabi kareem sallallahu alaihi wasallam ke khazab ke mutalliq sawaal kiya gaya to ahul ne kaha ke Nabi kareem sallallahu alaihi wasallam ko khazab ki nobat hi nahin aayi thi agar mein aap ki dadhi ke safed bal gunna chahta to gun sakta tha.",
  "bukhari|5899": "hum se Abdullah bin Zubair hamidi ne bayan kiya, kaha hum se Sufyan Sauri ne bayan kiya, kaha hum se Zuhri ne bayan kiya un se Abu Salamah aur sulaiman bin yasar ne aur un se Abu Hurairah razi Allah anhu ne bayan kiya ke yahud wa nasara khazab nahin lagate tum un ke khilaf karo yaani khazab lagaya karo.",
  "bukhari|591": "hum se masdad bin masrhad ne bayan kiya, kaha hum se Yahya Qattan ne bayan kiya, kaha hum se Hisham bin Urwah ne bayan kiya, kaha ke mujhe mere baap Urwah ne khabar di, kaha ke Aishah razi Allah anha ne farmaya mere bhaanje! Nabi kareem sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne Asr ke baad ki do rakaat mere yahan kabhi tark nahin kein.",
  "bukhari|5921": "hum se Muslim bin Ibrahim ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha hum se Abdullah bin Musanna bin Abdullah bin Anas bin Malik ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha hum se Abdullah bin dinar ne bayan kiya aur un se Abdullah bin Umar razi Allah anhuma ne bayan kiya ke Rasool Allah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne «qaza.» se mana farmaya tha.",
  "bukhari|5923": "hum se Ishaq bin nasr ne bayan kiya, kaha hum se Yahya bin Adam ne bayan kiya, kaha hum se israel ne bayan kiya, un se aboashaq ne, unhein Abdur Rahman bin aswad ne, unhein un ke walid ne aur un se Aishah razi Allah anha ne bayan kiya ke mein Nabi kareem sallallahu alaihi wasallam ko sab se umdah khushboo lagaya karti thi, yahan tak ke khushboo ki chamak mein aap ke sir aur aap ki dadhi mein dekhti thi.",
  "bukhari|5924": "agar mujhe maloom hota ke tum jhank rahe ho to mein tumhari aankh phod deta are azan ( ijazat ) lena to us ke liye hai ke aadmi ki nazar ( kisi ke ) sattar par na pade.",
  "bukhari|5926": "hum se aboalolid ne bayan kiya, kaha hum se Shubah ne bayan kiya, un se ashas bin Sulaim ne, un se un ke walid ne, un se masrooq ne aur un se Aishah razi Allah anha ne ke Nabi kareem sallallahu alaihi wasallam har kaam mein jahan tak mumkin hota dahni taraf se sharwa karne ko pasand farmate the, kangha karne aur wuzu karne mein bhi.",
  "bukhari|5927": "( ke Allah ta'ala ne farmaya ) Ibn Adam ka har amal us ka hai siwa roza ke ke ye mera hai aur mein khud us ka badlah doon ga aur roza dar ke munh ke khushboo Allah ke nazdeek mashak ki khushboo se bhi badh kar hai.“",
  "bukhari|5928": "hum se Musa bin Ismail ne bayan kiya, kaha hum se wahib ne bayan kiya, un se Hisham bin Urwah ne bayan kiya, un se Usman bin Urwah ne, un se un ke walid ne aur un se Aishah razi Allah anha ne bayan kiya ke mein ne Rasool Allah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ko aap ke ahraam ke waqt umdah se umdah khushboo jo mil sakti thi, wo lagati.",
  "bukhari|5929": "hum se abunim ne bayan kiya, kaha hum se Urwah bin Sabit Ansari ne bayan kiya, kaha ke mujh se samama bin Abdullah ne bayan kiya aur un se Anas razi Allah anhu ne ke ( jab un ko ) khushboo ( hadyah ki jati to ) aap wo wapas nahin kiya karte the aur kehte ke Nabi kareem sallallahu alaihi wasallam bhi khushboo ko wapas nahin farmaya karte the.",
  "bukhari|5932": "hum se Ismail bin Abi shibah ne bayan kiya, kaha ke mujh se Imam Malik ne bayan kiya, un se Ibn Shihab ne, un se Humaid bin Abdur Rahman bin auf aur unhon ne Muawiyah bin Abi Sufyan razi Allah anhuma se haj ke saal mein suna wo madinah manoorah mein manbar par ye farma rahe the unhon ne balon ki ek choti jo un ke chokidar ke haath mein thi lay kar kaha kahan hain tumhare ulama mein ne Rasool Allah sallallahu alaihi wasallam se suna hai aap us tarah bal banane se mana farma rahe the aur farma rahe the ke bani israel us waqt tabah ho gaye jab un ki auraton ne us tarah apne bal sanwarne sharwa kar diye.",
  "bukhari|5938": "yaani jo balon mein jod lagaye to isa aadmi mard ho ya aurat wo makar hai jo apne makar wa fareb par us taur par pardah daalta hai.",
  "bukhari|594": "jis ne Asr ki namaz chhodi us ka amal akarat ho gaya.",
  "bukhari|5941": "Allah ne masnooi bal lagane wali aur jis ke lagaya jaye, donon par lanat bheji hai.",
  "bukhari|5942": "godne wali, gadoane wali, masnooi bal jodnay wali aur jadoane wali“ yaani Nabi kareem sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne un sab par lanat bheji hai.",
  "bukhari|5945": "aur sood lene wale aur dene wale, godne wali aur godane wali ( par lanat bheji ).",
  "bukhari|5949": "rahmat ke farishte us ghar mein dakhil nahin hote jis mein kutta ya mortin hoon. aur lais bin Saad ne bayan kiya, un se yunis bin yazid ne, un se Ibn Shihab ne kaha ke mujh ko Ubaidullah bin Abdullah bin atba ne khabar di, unhon ne Ibn abbas razi Allah anhuma se suna, wo kehte the ke mein ne abutlha razi Allah anhu se suna, phir unhon ne Nabi kareem sallallahu alaihi wasallam se yahi hadees naqal ki hai.",
  "bukhari|5950": "Allah ke pass qiyamat ke din tasveer banane walon ko sakhat se sakhat tar azaab ho ga.“",
  "bukhari|5951": "jo log ye mortin banatay hain unhein qiyamat ke din azaab kiya jaye ga aur un se kaha jaye ga ke jis ko tum ne banaya hai ab us mein jaan bhi dalo.“",
  "bukhari|5952": "hum se Muadh bin fazalah ne bayan kiya, un se Hisham dastoai ne bayan kiya, un se Yahya bin Abi kaseer ne, un se Imran bin hatan ne aur un se Aishah razi Allah anha ne bayan kiya ke Rasool Allah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ko apne ghar mein jab bhi koi cheez aisi milti jis par salib ki murat bani ho ( jaise nasara rakhte hain ) to us ko tod daalte.",
  "bukhari|5955": "hum se masdad ne bayan kiya, kaha hum se Abdullah bin daud ne bayan kiya, un se Hisham bin Urwah ne, un se un ke walid ne aur un se Aishah razi Allah anha ne bayan kiya ke Rasool Allah sallallahu alaihi wasallam safar se aaye aur mein ne pardah latka rakha tha jis mein tasveerein thin, Nabi kareem sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne mujhe us ke utaar lene ka hukm diya to mein ne use utaar liya.",
  "bukhari|5959": "hum se Imran bin misra ne bayan kiya, kaha hum se abdalwars ne bayan kiya, kaha hum se Abdul Aziz bin sahib ne aur un se Anas razi Allah anhu ne bayan kiya ke Aishah razi Allah anha ke pass ek pardah tha. use unhon ne ghar ke ek kinare par latka diya tha to Nabi kareem sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne farmaya ke ye pardah nikal daal, us ki murat us namaz mein mere samne aati hain aur dil achat hota hai.",
  "bukhari|5960": "hum se Yahya bin sulaiman ne bayan kiya, kaha ke mujh se Abdullah bin wahab ne, kaha ke mujh se Umar bin Muhammad ne bayan kiya, un se salim ne aur un se un ke walid (Ibn Umar razi Allah anhuma) ne bayan kiya ke ek waqt par Jibreel alaihi assalam ne Nabi kareem sallallahu alaihi wasallam ke yahan aanay ka waada kiya lekin aanay mein der hui. us waqt par nahin aaye to Nabi kareem sallallahu alaihi wasallam sakhat preshan hue phir aap bahar niklay to Jibreel alaihi assalam se mulaqat hui. Nabi kareem sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne un se shikayat ki to unhon ne kaha ke hum ( farishte ) kisi aise ghar mein nahin jate jis mein murat ya kutta ho.",
  "bukhari|5963": "jo shakhs duniya mein murat banae ga qiyamat ke din us par zor dala jaye ga ke use wo zindah bhi kare halanka wo use zindah nahin kar sakta.",
  "bukhari|5966": "mujh se Muhammad bin bashar ne bayan kiya, kaha hum se abdalohab ne, kaha hum se Ayyub sakhtiyani ne ke akramah ke samne ye zikr aaya ke teen aadmi jo ek janwar par chadhin us mein kaun bahut bura hai. unhon ne bayan kiya ke Ibn abbas razi Allah anhuma ne kaha ke Rasool Allah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ( makkah makrmah ) tashreef laye to aap qasm bin abbas ko apni soari par aage aur fazal bin abbas ko peeche bathaey hue the. ya qasm peeche the aur fazal aage the ( razi Allah anhum ) ab tum un mein se kise bura kaho ge aur kise achha.",
  "bukhari|597": "agar koi namaz parhna bhool jaye to jab bhi yaad aao jaye us ko parh lay. us qaza ke siwa aur koi kafarah us ki wajah se nahin hota. aur ( Allah ta'ala ne farmaya ke ) namaz mere yaad aanay par qaim kar. Musa ne kaha ke hum se Hammam ne hadees bayan ki ke mein ne Qatadah razi Allah anhu se suna wo yun parhte the namaz parh meri yaad ke liye. haban bin halal ne kaha, hum se Hammam ne bayan kiya, kaha hum se Qatadah ne, kaha hum se Anas razi Allah anhu ne, unhon ne Nabi kareem sallallahu alaihi wasallam se, phir aisi hi hadees bayan ki.",
  "bukhari|5972": "tumhare maa baap mojod hain unhon ne kaha ke ji haan mojod hain. Nabi kareem sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne farmaya ke phir unhein mein jihad karo.",
  "bukhari|5973": "yaqeenan sab se bare gunahon mein se ye hai ke koi shakhs apne walidain par lanat bheje. puchha gaya: ya Rasool Allah! koi shakhs apne hi walidain par kaise lanat bheje ga? Nabi kareem sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne farmaya ke wo shakhs doosre ke baap ko bura bhala kahe ga to doosra bhi us ke baap ko aur us ki maa ko bura bhala kahe ga.",
  "bukhari|5975": "Allah ne tum par maa ki nafarmani haraam qarar di hai aur ( walidain ke huqooq ) na dena aur nahaq un se mutalbat karna bhi haraam qarar diya hai, larkiyon ko zindah dafn karna ( bhi haraam qarar diya hai ) aur «qil waqal» ( fazul baatein ) kasrat sawaal aur maal ki barbadi ko bhi napasand kiya hai.",
  "bukhari|5980": "hum se Yahya ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha hum se lais ne bayan kiya, un se aqeel ne bayan kiya, un se Ibn Shihab ne bayan kiya, un se Ubaidullah bin Abdullah ne aur unhein Abdullah bin abbas razi Allah anhuma ne khabar di aur unhein abusafiyan razi Allah anhu ne khabar di ke harqal ne unhein bula bheja to unhon ne use bataya ke wo yaani Nabi kareem sallallahu alaihi wasallam humein namaz, sadaqah, paak damni aur silah rahmi ka hukm farmate hain.",
  "bukhari|5984": "qataa rahmi karne waala jannat mein nahin jaye ga.",
  "bukhari|5985": "jise pasand hai ke us ki rozi mein farakhi ho aur us ki amrdaraz ki jaye to wo silah rahmi kiya kare.",
  "bukhari|5986": "jo chahta ho ke us ke rizq mein farakhi ho aur us ki amrdaraz ho to wo silah rahmi kiya kare.",
  "bukhari|5988": "raham ka taluq rahman se juda hua hai pas jo koi us se apne aap ko jodta hai Allah paak ne farmaya ke mein bhi us ko apne se jod leta hoon aur jo koi use todta hai mein bhi apne aap ko us se tod leta hoon.",
  "bukhari|5989": "raham ( rishta dari rahman se mali hui ) shakh hai jo shakhs us se mile mein us se milta hoon aur jo us se qataa taluq kare mein us se qataa taluq karta hoon.",
  "bukhari|5991": "kisi kaam ka badlah dena silah rahmi nahin hai balkeh silah rahmi karne waala wo hai ke jab us ke saath silah rahmi ka muamalah na kiya ja raha ho tab bhi wo silah rahmi kare.",
  "bukhari|5997": "jo Allah ki makhlooq par raham nahin karta us par bhi raham nahin kiya jata.",
  "bukhari|5998": "agar Allah ne tumhare dil se raham nikal diya hai to mein kiya kar sakta hoon.",
  "bukhari|60": "hum se aboalnaman ne bayan kiya, kaha hum se abooanah ne abubshar se bayan kiya, unhon ne Yusuf bin mahak se, unhon ne Abdullah bin amru se, unhon ne kaha ek safar mein jo hum ne kiya tha Nabi kareem sallallahu alaihi wasallam hum se peeche rah gaye aur aap sallallahu alaihi wasallam hum se us waqt mile jab ( Asr ki ) namaz ka waqt aan pahuncha tha hum ( jaldi jaldi ) wuzu kar rahe the. pas paaon ko khub dhone ke badal hum yun hi sa dho rahe the. ( ye hal dekh kar ) aap sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne buland aawaz se pukara dekho ediyon ki kharabi dozakh se hone wali hai do ya teen baar aap sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne ( yun hi buland aawaz se ) farmaya.",
  "bukhari|6000": "Allah ne rahmat ke sau hissay banae aur apne pass un mein se nananwe hissay rakhe sirf ek hissah zamin par utara aur isi ki wajah se tum dekhte ho ke makhlooq ek doosre par raham karti hai, yahan tak ke ghodi bhi apne bacha ko apne sam nahin lagnay deti balkeh samon ko utha leti hai ke kahin us se us ke bacha ko takleef na pahunche.",
  "bukhari|6003": "hum se Abdullah bin Muhammad masndi ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha hum se arm Muhammad bin fazal ne bayan kiya, kaha hum se matamar bin sulaiman ne bayan kiya, kaha ke un se un ke walid ne bayan kiya, kaha ke mein ne Abu tamima se suna, wo aboasman nahdi se bayan karte the aur aboasman nahdi ne kaha ke un se asama bin Zaid razi Allah anhuma ne bayan kiya ke Rasool Allah sallallahu alaihi wasallam mujhe apni ek ran par bathate the aur Hasan razi Allah anhu ko doosri ran par bathalate the. phir donon ko malate aur farmate, ay Allah! un donon par raham kar ke mein bhi un par raham karta hoon. aur Ali bin Abdullah madini ne bayan kiya ke hum se Yahya ne bayan kiya, kaha hum se sulaiman timi ne bayan kiya, un se aboasman nahdi ne isi hadees ko bayan kiya. sulaiman timi ne kaha jab Abu tamima ne ye hadees mujh se bayan ki aboasman nahdi se to mere dil mein shak paida hua. mein ne aboasman se bahut see ahadees sunni hain par ye hadees kyun nahin sunni phir mein ne apni ahadees ki kitaab dekhi to us mein ye hadees aboasman nahdi se likhi hui thi.",
  "bukhari|6007": "bewaon aur miskeenon ke liye koshish karne waala Allah ke raaste mein jihad karne wale ki tarah hai. Abdullah qanbi ko us mein shak hai. Imam Malik ne us hadees mein ye bhi kaha tha us shakhs ke barabar sawaab milta hai jo namaz mein khara rehta hai tahakta hi nahin aur us shakhs ke barabar jo roze barabar rakhe chala jata hai iftaar hi nahin karta hai.",
  "bukhari|6010": "tum ne ek wasi cheez ko tang kar diya aap ki murad Allah ki rahmat se thi.",
  "bukhari|6011": "tum mominon ko aapas mein ek doosre ke saath rahmat wa mohabbat ka muamalah karne aur ek doosre ke saath lutf wa narm khoi mein ek jism jaisa pao ge ke jab us ka koi tukda bhi takleef mein hota hai, to sara jism takleef mein hota hai isa ke neend ud jati hai aur jism bakhar mein mabatla ho jata hai.“",
  "bukhari|6012": "agar koi musalman kisi darakht ka pauda lagata hai aur us darakht se koi insaan ya janwar khata hai to lagane wale ke liye wo sadaqah hota hai.“",
  "bukhari|6013": "jo raham nahin karta us par raham nahin kiya jata.“",
  "bukhari|6014": "Jibreel alaihi assalam mujhe padosi ke baare mein barbar us tarah wasiyat karte rahe ke mujhe khayal guzra ke shayad padosi ko warasat mein sharik na kar dein.“",
  "bukhari|6015": "Jibreel alaihi assalam mujhe us tarah barbar padosi ke haq mein wasiyat karte rahe ke mujhe khayal guzra ke shayad padosi ko warasat mein sharik na kar dein.“",
  "bukhari|6016": "wallah! wo imaan waala nahin. wallah! wo imaan waala nahin. wallah! wo imaan waala nahin. arz kiya gaya kaun: ya Rasool Allah? farmaya wo jis ke shar se us ka padosi mehfooz na ho. us hadees ko shababa aur asd bin Musa ne bhi riwayat kiya hai aur Humaid bin aswad aur Usman bin Umar aur Abu Bakr bin yash aur Shuaib bin Ishaq ne us hadees ko Ibn Abi zib se yun riwayat kiya hai, unhon ne maqbri se, unhon ne Abu Hurairah razi Allah anhu se.",
  "bukhari|6017": "karte the ”ay musalman orto! tum mein se koi aurat apni kisi padosan ke liye kisi bhi cheez ko ( hadyah mein ) dene ke liye haqeer na samjhe khwah bakri ka paia hi kyun na ho.“",
  "bukhari|6018": "jo koi Allah aur aakhirat ke din par imaan rakhta ho wo apne padosi ko takleef na pahunchaye aur jo koi Allah aur aakhirat ke din par imaan rakhta ho wo apne mehman ki izzat kare aur jo koi Allah aur aakhirat ke din par imaan rakhta ho wo achhi baat zabaan se nikaley warna khamosh rahe.“",
  "bukhari|6020": "jis ka darwazah tum se ( tumhare darwaze se ) zyada qareeb ho.“",
  "bukhari|6021": "hum se Ali bin yash ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha hum se aboghsan ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha mujh se Muhammad bin manakadar ne bayan kiya, un se Jabir bin Abdullah razi Allah anhuma ne ke Nabi kareem sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne farmaya ”har nek kaam sadaqah hai.“",
  "bukhari|6028": "hum se Muhammad bin alala ne bayan kiya, kaha hum se aboasama ne bayan kiya, un se barid ne, un se abubardah ne aur un se Abu Musa ashari razi Allah anhu ne ke Nabi kareem sallallahu alaihi wasallam ke pass jab koi mangne waala ya zaroorat mand aata to aap sallallahu alaihi wasallam farmate ke logo! tum safarsh karo takeh tumhein bhi sawaab mile aur Allah apne Nabi ki zabaan par jo chahe ga faislah karae ga.",
  "bukhari|6029": "tum mein sab se behtar wo aadmi hai, jis ke akhlaq sab se achhe hoon.",
  "bukhari|6031": "hum se asbagh bin farj ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha ke mujhe Abdullah bin wahab ne khabar di unhon ne kaha hum ko aboihii faleh bin sulaiman ne khabar di, unhein halal bin asama ne bayan kiya aur un se Anas bin Malik razi Allah anhu ne bayan kiya ke Rasool Allah sallallahu alaihi wasallam na gaali dete the na badgu the na badkho the aur na lanat malamat karte the. agar hum mein se kisi par naaraz hote itna farmate use kiya ho gaya hai, us ki peshani mein khak lage.",
  "bukhari|6034": "hum se Muhammad bin kaseer ne bayan kiya, kaha hum ko Sufyan ne khabar di, un se Ibn manakadar ne bayan kiya, unhon ne Jabir razi Allah anhu se suna, unhon ne bayan kiya ke kabhi isa nahin hua ke Rasool Allah sallallahu alaihi wasallam se kisi ne koi cheez mangi ho aur aap ne us ke dene se inkaar kiya ho.",
  "bukhari|6035": "karte the ke tum mein sab se zyada behtar wo hai jis ke akhlaq sab se achhe hoon.",
  "bukhari|6038": "hum se Musa bin Ismail ne bayan kiya, unhon ne salaam bin miskeen se suna, kaha ke mein ne Sabit se suna, kaha ke hum se Anas razi Allah anhu ne bayan kiya ke mein ne Rasool Allah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ki das saal tak khidmat ki lekin aap ne kabhi mujhe uf tak nahin kaha aur na kabhi ye kaha ke falan kaam kyun kiya aur falan kaam kyun nahin kiya.",
  "bukhari|6039": "Nabi kareem sallallahu alaihi wasallam apne ghar ke kaam kaj karte aur jab namaz ka waqt ho jata to namaz ke liye masjid tashreef lay jate the.",
  "bukhari|6041": "koi shakhs imaan ki halaut ( mathas ) us waqt tak nahin pa sakta jab tak wo kisi shakhs se mohabbat karay to sirf Allah ke liye kare aur us ko aag mein dala jana achha lage lekin imaan ke baad kafar mein jana use pasand na ho, aur jab tak Allah aur us ke Rasool se use un ke siwa doosri tamam chizon ke maqable mein zyada mohabbat na ho.",
  "bukhari|6045": "agar koi shakhs kisi shakhs ko kafir ya fasiq kahe aur wo darhaqiqat kafir ya fasiq na ho to khud kehne waala fasiq aur kafir ho jaye ga.",
  "bukhari|6046": "hum se Muhammad bin sanan ne bayan kiya, kaha hum se faleh bin sulaiman ne bayan kiya kaha hum se halal bin Ali ne bayan kiya aur un se Anas razi Allah anhu ne bayan kiya ke Rasool Allah sallallahu alaihi wasallam fahash go nahin the, na aap lanat malamat karne wale the aur na gaali dete the, aap ko bahut ghussa aata to sirf itna keh dete, use kiya ho gaya hai, us ki peshani pah khak lage.",
  "bukhari|605": "qad qamat alslota» ke takbeer ke kalimaat ek ek dafah kahin.",
  "bukhari|6053": "qabeelah Ansaar mein sab se behtar gharana bano najaar ka gharana hai.“",
  "bukhari|6057": "jo shakhs ( roza ki halat mein ) jhoot baat karna aur fareb karna aur jahalat ki baton ko na chhode to Allah ko us ki koi zaroorat nahin ke wo apna khana peena chhode. ahmd bin yunis ne kaha ye hadees mein ne sunni to thi magar mein us ki sanad bhool gaya tha jo mujh ko ek shakhs ( Ibn Abi zib ) ne batlaa di.",
  "bukhari|6059": "Allah Musa alaihi assalam par raham kare, unhein us se bhi zyada iza di gayi, lekin unhon ne sabr kiya.",
  "bukhari|606": "hum se Muhammad bin salaam ne bayan kiya, kaha hum se abdalohab saqfi ne bayan kiya, kaha hum se Khalid bin mahran haza ne abuqlaba Abdur Rahman bin Zaid harmi se bayan kiya, unhon ne Anas bin Malik razi Allah anhu se ke jab musalman zyada ho gaye to mashwara hua ke kisi aisi cheez ke zariya namaz ke waqt ka ailan ho jise sab log samajh lein. kuchh logon ne zikr kiya ke aag roshan ki jaye. ya narsanga ke zariya ailan karein. lekin aaqar mein Bilal ko hukm diya gaya ke azaan ke kalimaat do do dafah kahin aur takbeer ke ek ek dafah.",
  "bukhari|6060": "tum ne use halak kar diya ya ( ye farmaya ke ) tum ne us shakhs ki kamar ko tod diya.",
  "bukhari|6064": "badagmani se bachte raho kyunki badagmani ki baatein aksar jhuti hoti hain, logon ke ayub talash karne ke peeche na pado, aapas mein hasad na karo, kisi ki peeth peeche burai na karo, bughz na rakho, balkeh sab Allah ke bande aapas mein bhai bhai bin kar raho.“",
  "bukhari|6065": "aapas mein bughz na rakho, hasad na karo, peeth peeche kisi ki burai na karo, balkeh Allah ke bande aapas mein bhai bhai bin kar raho aur kisi musalman ke liye jaiz nahin ke ek bhai kisi bhai se teen din se zyada salaam kalam chhor kar rahe.“",
  "bukhari|607": "qad qamat alslota» do hi dafah kaha jaye ga.",
  "bukhari|6071": "kiya mein tumhein jannat walon ki khabar na doon. har kamzor wa toaza karne waala agar wo ( Allah ka naam lay kar ) qasam kha lay to Allah us ki qasam poori kar de. kiya mein tumhein dozakh walon ki khabar na doon har tand khu, akad kar chalne waala aur matakbar.",
  "bukhari|6076": "aapas mein bughz na rakho aur ek doosre se hasad na karo, peeth peeche kisi ki burai na karo, balkeh Allah ke bande aur aapas mein bhai bhai bin kar raho aur kisi musalman ke liye jaiz nahin ke kisi bhai se teen din se zyada tak baat cheet band kare.“",
  "bukhari|6077": "kisi shakhs ke liye jaiz nahin ke apne kisi bhai se teen din se zyada ke liye mulaqat chhode, us tarah ke jab donon ka samna ho jaye to ye bhi munh pher lay aur wo bhi munh pher lay aur un donon mein behtar wo hai jo salaam mein pahal kare.“",
  "bukhari|6078": "mein tumhari narazgi aur khushi ko khub pahchanta hoon. Umm almominin ne bayan kiya ke mein ne arz kiya: ya Rasool Allah! aap kis tarah se pahchante hain? farmaya ke jab tum khush hoti ho kehti ho, haan Muhammad ke Rabb ki qasam! aur jab naaraz hoti ho to kehti ho nahin, Ibrahim ke Rabb ki qasam! bayan kiya ke mein ne arz kiya: ji haan, aap kafarmana bilkul sahih hai mein sirf aap ka naam lena chhodti hoon.",
  "bukhari|6080": "hum se Muhammad bin salaam ne bayan kiya, kaha hum ko abdalohab saqfi ne khabar di, unhein Khalid haza ne, unhein Anas bin siren ne aur unhein Anas bin Malik razi Allah anhu ne ke Rasool Allah sallallahu alaihi wasallam qabeelah Ansaar ke gharana mein mulaqat ke liye tashreef lay gaye aur unhein ke yahan khana khaya, jab aap wapas tashreef lane lage to aap ke hukm se ek chatayi par paani chahadka gaya aur Nabi kareem sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne us par namaz parhi aur ghar walon ke liye dua ki.",
  "bukhari|6082": "ab walima kar khwah ek bakri ka ho.",
  "bukhari|6083": "hum se Muhammad bin sabaah ne bayan kiya, kaha hum se Ismail bin zakriya ne bayan kiya, kaha hum se asm bin sulaiman ahul ne bayan kiya, kaha ke mein ne Anas bin Malik razi Allah anhu se puchha, kiya tum ko ye baat maloom hai ke hum se Muhammad bin sabaah ne bayan kiya, kaha hum se Ismail bin zakriya ne bayan kiya, kaha hum se asm bin sulaiman ahul ne bayan kiya, kaha ke mein ne Anas bin Malik razi Allah anhu se puchha, kiya tum ko ye baat maloom hai ke",
  "bukhari|6092": "hum se Yahya bin sulaiman ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha ke mujh se Ibn wahab ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha hum ko amru ne khabar di, un se aboalanzar ne bayan kiya, un se sulaiman bin yasar ne aur un se Aishah razi Allah anha ne bayan kiya ke Nabi kareem sallallahu alaihi wasallam ko us tarah khal kar kabhi hanstay nahin dekha ke aap ke halaq ka kawa nazar aanay lagta ho, aap sallallahu alaihi wasallam sirf maskrate the.",
  "bukhari|6094": "blashbah sach aadmi ko neki ki taraf bulata hai aur neki jannat ki taraf lay jati hai aur ek shakhs sach bolta rehta hai yahan tak ke wo sadeeq ka laqab aur martabah hasil kar leta hai aur blashbah jhoot burai ki taraf lay jata hai aur burai jahannam ki taraf aur ek shakhs jhoot bolta rehta hai, yahan tak ke wo Allah ke yahan bahut jhoota likh diya jata hai.“",
  "bukhari|6095": "munafiq ki teen nishaniyan hain, jab bolta hai jhoot bolta hai, jab waada karta hai khilaf karta hai aur jab use amin banaya jata hai to khyanat karta hai.“",
  "bukhari|6098": "hum se aboalolid ne bayan kiya, kaha hum se Shubah ne bayan kiya, un se makharq ne, unhon ne kaha mein ne tariq se suna, kaha ke Abdullah bin Masood razi Allah anhu ne kaha blashbah sab se achha kalam Allah ki kitaab hai aur sab se achha tareeqa ( chal chalan ) Muhammad sallallahu alaihi wasallam ka tareeqa hai.",
  "bukhari|6099": "koi shakhs bhi ya koi cheez bhi takleef bardasht karne wali, jo use kisi cheez ko sun kar hui ho, Allah se zyada ( sabr karne waala ) nahin hai. log us ke liye aulad thahrate hain aur wo unhein tandrusti deta hai balkeh unhein rozi bhi deta hai.“",
  "bukhari|6103": "jab koi shakhs apne kisi bhai ko kehta hai ke ay kafir! to un donon mein se ek kafir ho gaya. aur akramah bin amar ne Yahya se bayan kiya ke un se Abdullah bin yazid ne kaha, unhon ne Abu Salamah se suna aur unhon ne Abu Hurairah razi Allah anhu se suna unhon ne Nabi kareem sallallahu alaihi wasallam se.",
  "bukhari|6104": "jis shakhs ne bhi apne kisi bhai ko kaha ke ay kafir! to un donon mein se ek kafir ho gaya.“",
  "bukhari|6108": "hum se qatibah bin Saeed ne bayan kiya, kaha hum se lais bin Saad ne bayan kiya, un se Nafi ne, un se Ibn Umar razi Allah anhuma ne ke wo Umar bin khatab razi Allah anhu ke pass pahunche jo chand soaron ke saath the, us waqt Umar razi Allah anhu apne walid ki qasam kha rahe the. us par Rasool Allah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne unhein pukaar kar kaha, khabardar! yaqeenan Allah paak tumhein mana karta hai ke tum apne baap dadon ki qasam khao, pas agar kisi ko qasam hi khani hai to Allah ki qasam khaye, warna chip rahe.",
  "bukhari|6109": "qiyamat ke din un logon par sab se zyada azaab ho ga, jo ye sorten banatay hain.“",
  "bukhari|611": "hum se Abdullah bin Yusuf tanisi ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha ke humein Imam Malik ne Ibn Shihab Zuhri se khabar di, unhon ne Ata bin yazid lisi se, unhon ne Abu Saeed khadri razi Allah anhu se, unhon ne Rasool Allah sallallahu alaihi wasallam se ke jab tum azaan suno to jis tarah mozan kehta hai isi tarah tum bhi kaho.",
  "bukhari|6114": "pahalwaan wo nahin hai jo kashti ladnay mein ghalb ho jaye balkeh asli pahalwaan to wo hai jo ghussa ki halat mein apne aap par qabu paye be qabu na ho jaye.“",
  "bukhari|6116": "ghussa na hua kar. unhon ne kayi martabah ye sawaal kiya aur Nabi kareem sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne farmaya ke ghussa na hua kar.",
  "bukhari|6118": "use chhor do ke hea imaan mein se hai.",
  "bukhari|6120": "uglay pighambaron ka kalam jo logon ko mila us mein ye bhi hai ke jab sharm hi na rahi to phir jo ji chahe wo kare.“",
  "bukhari|6123": "hum se masdad ne bayan kiya, kaha hum se marhum bin Abdul Aziz ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha ke mein ne kaha ke mein ne Sabit se suna aur unhon ne Anas razi Allah anhu se suna, unhon ne bayan kiya ke ek khatoon Nabi kareem sallallahu alaihi wasallam ki khidmat mein hazir huin aur apne aap ko Nabi kareem sallallahu alaihi wasallam ke nikah ke liye pesh kiya aur arz kiya: kiya Nabi kareem sallallahu alaihi wasallam ko mujh se nikah ki zaroorat hai? us par Anas razi Allah anhu ki sahbazadi bolein, wo kitni behiya thi. Anas razi Allah anhu ne kaha ke wo tum se to achhi thin unhon ne apne aap ko Nabi kareem sallallahu alaihi wasallam ke nikah ke liye pesh kiya.",
  "bukhari|6125": "aasani paida karo, tangi na paida karo, logon ko tasli aur tashfi do nafrat na dalao.“",
  "bukhari|6129": "ay Abu amir! teri naghir nami chadya to bakhair hai?“",
  "bukhari|6136": "jo shakhs Allah aur aakhirat ke din par imaan rakhta ho, us par lazim hai ke apne padosi ko takleef na de, jo shakhs Allah aur aakhirat ke din par imaan rakhta ho, us par lazim hai ke apne mehman ki izzat kare aur jo shakhs Allah aur aakhirat ke din par imaan rakhta ho, us par lazim hai ke bhali baat kahe warna chip rahe.“",
  "bukhari|6137": "jab tum aise logon ke pass ja kar atro aur wo jaisa dastur hai mahmani ke taur par tum ko kuchh dein to use manzoor kar low agar na dein to mahmani ka haq qaiday ke muafaq un se wasool kar low.",
  "bukhari|6138": "jo shakhs Allah par aur aakhirat ke din par imaan rakhta ho use apne mehman ki izzat karni chahiye aur jo shakhs Allah aur aakhirat ke din par imaan rakhta ho use chahiye ke wo silah rahmi kare, jo shakhs Allah aur aakhirat ke din par imaan rakhta ho, use chahiye ke achhi baat zabaan se nikaley warna chip rahe.“",
  "bukhari|6145": "baaz sharon mein danaee hoti hai.“",
  "bukhari|6146": "hum se abunim ne bayan kiya, kaha hum se Sufyan bin Uyainah ne bayan kiya, un se aswad bin Qais ne, unhon ne kaha ke mein ne jandab bin Abdullah bijlee se suna, unhon ne kaha ke Nabi kareem sallallahu alaihi wasallam chal rahe the ke aap ko patthar se thukar lagi aur aap gar pade, us se aap ki ungli se khun bahne laga, aap sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne ye shar parha ”to to ek ungli hai aur kiya hai jo zakhmi ho gayi… kiya hua agar rah maula mein to zakhmi ho gayi.“",
  "bukhari|6147": "ki shera ke kalam mein se sachcha kalimah labeed ka masraa hai jo ye hai ke Allah ke siwa jo kuchh hai sab madoom wa fana hone waala hai. amia bin Abi alslat shayar to qareeb tha ke musalman ho jaye.",
  "bukhari|6152": "ay hasan! Allah ke Rasool ki taraf se mashrkon ko jawaab do, ay Allah! rooh alquds ke zariya un ki madad kar. Abu Hurairah razi Allah anhu ne kaha ke haan.",
  "bukhari|6153": "hajham» ke alfaaz farmaye ) Jibreel alaihi assalam tere saath hain.",
  "bukhari|6154": "agar tum mein se koi shakhs apna pait peep se bhare to ye us se behtar hai ke wo use shar se bhare.“",
  "bukhari|6155": "agar tum mein se koi shakhs apna pait peep se bhar lay to ye us se behtar hai ke wo sharon se bhar jaye.“",
  "bukhari|6166": "afsos ( «wilkam» ya «vihkam» ) Shubah ne bayan kiya ke shak un ke shaikh ( waqad bin Muhammad ko ) tha. mere baad tum kafir na ho jana ke ek doosre ki gardan marne lago. aur nazar ne Shubah se bayan kiya «vihkam» aur Umar bin Muhammad ne apne walid se «wilkam» ya «vihkam» ke lafz naqal ke hain.",
  "bukhari|6168": "insaan us ke saath hai jis se wo mohabbat rakhta hai.“",
  "bukhari|6169": "insaan us ke saath hai jis se wo mohabbat rakhta hai. us riwayat ki matabat Jarir bin Hazim, sulaiman bin qaram aur abooanah ne Aamash se ki, un se abooail ne, un se Abdullah bin Masood ne aur un se Nabi kareem sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne.",
  "bukhari|617": "Bilal to raat rahe azaan dete hain. us liye tum log khate peete raho. yahan tak ke Ibn Umm maktum azaan dein. raawi ne kaha ke wo nabeena the aur us waqt tak azaan nahin dete the jab tak un se kaha na jata ke subah ho gayi. subah ho gayi.",
  "bukhari|6170": "insaan us ke saath hai jis se wo mohabbat rakhta hai. Sufyan ke saath us riwayat ki matabat abumaaoia aur Muhammad bin abeed ne ki hai.",
  "bukhari|6177": "ahd todne wale ke liye qiyamat mein ek jhanda uthaya jaye ga aur pukaar diya jaye ga ke ye falan bin falan ki daga bazi ka nishan hai.“",
  "bukhari|6178": "ahd todne wale ke liye qiyamat mein ek jhanda uthaya jaye ga aur pukara jaye ga ke ye falan bin falan ki daga bazi ka nishan hai.“",
  "bukhari|6179": "tum mein koi shakhs ye na kahe ke mera nafs palid ho gaya hai balkeh ye kahe ke mera dil kharaab ya preshan ho gaya.“",
  "bukhari|618": "hum se Abdullah bin Yusuf tanisi ne bayan kiya, kaha ke humein Imam Malik ne Nafi se khabar di, unhon ne Abdullah bin Umar razi Allah anhuma se, unhon ne kaha mujhe Umm almominin hafsa razi Allah anha ne khabar di ke Rasool Allah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ki adat thi ke jab mozan subah ki azaan subah sadiq ke tulu hone ke baad de chuka hota to aap sallallahu alaihi wasallam azaan aur takbeer ke beach namaz qaim hone se pehle do halki see rakaatein parhte.",
  "bukhari|6180": "tum mein se koi hargaz yun na kahe ke mera nafs palid ho gaya lekin yun keh sakta hai ke mera dil kharaab ya preshan ho gaya.“ us hadees ko aqeel ne bhi Ibn Shihab se riwayat kiya hai.",
  "bukhari|6181": "Allah ta'ala farmata hai ke insaan zamanah ko gaali deta hai halanka mein hi zamanah hoon, mere hi haath mein raat aur din hain.“",
  "bukhari|6182": "angoor «anb» ko «karam» na kaho aur ye na kaho ke haye zamanah ki namaradi. kyunki zamanah to Allah hi ke ikhtiyar mein hai.“",
  "bukhari|6183": "log ( angoor ko ) «karam» kehte hain, «karam» to momin ka dil hai.“",
  "bukhari|6186": "apne bete ka naam Abdur Rahman rakh lay.",
  "bukhari|6187": "mere naam par naam rakho lekin meri kanit na ikhtiyar karo.",
  "bukhari|6188": "mere naam par naam rakho lekin meri kanit na rakho.“",
  "bukhari|6189": "apne larkay ka naam Abdur Rahman rakh low.",
  "bukhari|619": "hum se abunim fazal bin dakin ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha ke hum se shiban ne Yahya bin Abi kaseer se bayan kiya, unhon ne Abu Salamah bin Abdur Rahman bin auf se, unhon ne Aishah sadiqah razi Allah anha se ke Nabi kareem sallallahu alaihi wasallam Fajr ki azaan aur iqamat ke darmiyan do halki see rakaatein parhte the.",
  "bukhari|6192": "hum se sadaqah bin fazal ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha hum ko Muhammad bin jafar ne khabar di, unhein Shubah ne, unhein Ata bin Abi Maimunah ne, unhein aburafa ne aur unhein Abu Hurairah razi Allah anhu ne ke Umm almominin zainab razi Allah anha ka naam brah tha, kaha jane laga ke wo apni paki zahr karti hain. chunaanchah Nabi kareem sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne un ka naam zainab rakha.",
  "bukhari|6193": "tumhara naam kiya hai? unhon ne kaha ke mera naam hazan hai. Nabi kareem sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne farmaya ke tum sahal ho, unhon ne kaha ke mein to apne baap ka rakha hua naam nahin badlon ga. Saeed bin masib ne kaha us ke baad se ab tak hamare khandan mein sakhti aur museebat hi rahi. «hazonat» se sobat murad hai.",
  "bukhari|6194": "hum se Muhammad bin Abdullah bin Numair ne bayan kiya, kaha hum se Muhammad bin bashr ne, un se Ismail bin Abi Khalid bijlee ne, ke mein ne Ibn Abi Awfa se puchha. tum ne Nabi kareem sallallahu alaihi wasallam ke sahbazade Ibrahim ko dekha tha? bayan kiya ke un ki wafat bachpan hi mein ho gayi thi aur agar Nabi kareem sallallahu alaihi wasallam ke baad kisi Nabi ki aamad hoti to Nabi kareem sallallahu alaihi wasallam ke sahbazade zindah rehte lekin Nabi kareem sallallahu alaihi wasallam ke baad koi Nabi nahin aaye ga.",
  "bukhari|6195": "hum se sulaiman bin harab ne bayan kiya, kaha hum ko Shubah ne khabar di, unhein adi bin Sabit ne kaha ke mein ne bara razi Allah anhu se suna, bayan kiya ke jab aap ke farzand Ibrahim alaihi assalam ka inteqal hua to Rasool Allah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne farmaya ”us ke liye jannat mein ek doodh plane wali dayah maqrar ho gayi hai.“",
  "bukhari|6196": "mere naam par naam rakho, lekin meri kanit na ikhtiyar karo kyunki mein Qasim ( taqsim karne waala ) hoon aur tumhare darmiyan ( uloom deen ko ) taqsim karta hoon.“ aur us riwayat ko Anas razi Allah anhu ne bhi Nabi kareem sallallahu alaihi wasallam se naqal kiya.",
  "bukhari|62": "darakhton mein se ek darakht isa hai ke us ke pate nahin jhadte aur musalman ki bhi yahi misal hai batlao wo kaun sa darakht hai? ye sun kar logon ke khayalat jungle ke darakhton mein chale gaye. Abdullah ne kaha ke mere dil mein aaya ke batlaa doon ke wo khajoor ka darakht hai lekin ( wahan bahut se buzurg mojod the us liye ) mujh ko sharm aayi. aaqar sahabah ne arz kiya ya Rasool Allah! aap hi bayan farma dijiye. aap sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne batlaia ke wo khajoor ka darakht hai.",
  "bukhari|620": "dekho Bilal razi Allah anhu raat rahe mein azaan dete hain, us liye tum log ( sehri ) kha pi sakte ho. jab tak Ibn Umm maktum azaan na dein.",
  "bukhari|6200": "ay Allah! waled bin waled, Salamah bin Hisham, yash bin Abi rabiyah aur makkah mein digar mojod kamzor musalmanon ko najaat deday.“ «Allahumma ashdad watatak Ali mazar, Allahumma ajalha alaihum sanin kasni Yusuf» ”ay Allah! qabeelah mazar ke kafaron ko sakhat pakad, ay Allah! un par Yusuf alaihi assalam ke zamanah jaisa qahat nazil farma.“",
  "bukhari|6205": "qiyamat ke din Allah ke nazdeek sab se badtareen naam us ka ho ga jo apna naam mulk alamlak ( shahanshaa ) rakhe.“",
  "bukhari|6206": "mulk alamlak“ apna naam rakhe ga. Sufyan ne bayan kiya ke Abu az-Zinad ke ghair ne kaha ke us ka mafhoom hai ”shahan shah“.",
  "bukhari|6208": "haan wo dozakh mein us jagah par hain jahan takhnon tak aag hai agar mein na hota to wo dozakh ke neeche ke tabqe mein rehte.",
  "bukhari|6212": "humein to koi ( khauf ki ) cheez nazar na aayi, albatah ye ghoda to goya darya tha.“",
  "bukhari|6214": "phir mere pass wahi aanay ka silsilah band ho gaya. ek din mein chal raha tha ke mein ne aasmaan ki taraf se ek aawaz sunni, mein ne aasmaan ki taraf nazar athayi to mein ne phir us farshta ko dekha jo mere pass ghar hira mein aaya tha, wo aasmaan wa zamin ke darmiyan kursi par baitha hua tha.",
  "bukhari|6221": "hum se Muhammad bin kaseer ne bayan kiya, kaha hum se Sufyan Sauri ne bayan kiya, kaha hum se Sufyan ne bayan kiya aur un se Anas bin Malik razi Allah anhu ne bayan kiya ke Nabi kareem sallallahu alaihi wasallam ke pass do ashaab chahinke. Nabi kareem sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne ek ka jawaab yarhamk Allah ( Allah tum par raham kare ) se diya aur doosre ka nahin. Nabi kareem sallallahu alaihi wasallam se us ki wajah pochhi gayi to farmaya ke us ne alhamdulillah kaha tha ( us liye us ka jawaab diya ) aur doosre ne alhamdulillah nahin kaha tha. chahenkne wale ko alhamdulillah zaroor kehna chahiye aur sunne walon ko yarhamk Allah.",
  "bukhari|6224": "jab tum mein se koi chahinke to «Alhamd Allah» kahe aur us ka bhai ya us ka saathi ( raawi ko shabah tha ) «yarhamk Allah» kahe. jab saathi «yarhamk Allah» kahe to us ke jawaab mein chahenkne waala «yahadikm Allah wislah balkam».“",
  "bukhari|6225": ". lekin meri chahink par nahin farmaya? Nabi kareem sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne farmaya ke unhon ne alhamdulillah kaha tha aur tum ne nahin kaha tha.",
  "bukhari|6226": "Allah ta'ala chahink ko pasand karta hai kyunki wo baaz dafah sehat ki alamat hai aur jamai ko napasand karta hai. us liye jab tum mein se koi shakhs chahinke to wo alhamdulillah kahe lekin jamai lena shaitan ki taraf se hota hai. us liye jab tum mein se kisi ko jamai aaye to wo apni quwwat wa taqat ke mutabiq use roke. us liye ke jab tum mein se koi jamai leta hai to shaitan hansta hai.",
  "bukhari|6231": "chhota bare ko salaam kare, guzarne waala bethne wale ko salaam kare aur chhoti jamaat bari jamaat ko pehle salaam kare.“",
  "bukhari|6232": "soar paidal chalne wale ko salaam kare, paidal chalne waala baithe hue ko aur kam tadaad wale bari tadaad walon ko.“",
  "bukhari|6234": "chhota bare ko salaam kare, guzarne waala bethne wale ko aur kam tadaad wale bari tadaad walon ko.“",
  "bukhari|6236": "hum se Abdullah bin Yusuf ne bayan kiya, kaha hum se lais bin Saad ne bayan kiya, kaha ke mujh se yazid ne bayan kiya, un se abulkhair ne, un se Abdullah bin Umar wa razi Allah anhu ne ke ek saheb ne Nabi kareem sallallahu alaihi wasallam se puchha: Islam ki kaun see halat afzal hai? Nabi kareem sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne farmaya ye ke ( Allah ki makhlooq ko ) khana khilao aur salaam karo, use bhi jise tum pahchante ho aur use bhi jise nahin pahchante.",
  "bukhari|6237": "kisi musalman ke liye jaiz nahin ke wo apne kisi ( musalman ) bhai se teen din se zyada taluq katay ke jab wo malin to ye ek taraf munh pher lay aur doosra doosri taraf aur donon mein achha wo hai jo salaam pehle kare.“ aur Sufyan ne kaha ke unhon ne ye hadees Zuhri se teen martabah sunni hai.",
  "bukhari|624": "har do azanon ( azaan wa iqamat ) ke darmiyan ek namaz ( ka fasal ) doosri namaz se hona chahiye ( teesri martabah farmaya ke ) jo shakhs isa karna chahe.",
  "bukhari|6244": "hum se ishaq ne bayan kiya kaha hum ko abdalsamd ne khabar di, unhein Abdullah bin Musanna ne khabar di un se samama bin Abdullah ne bayan kiya aur un se Anas razi Allah anhu ne ke Rasool Allah sallallahu alaihi wasallam jab kisi ko salaam karte ( aur jawaab na milta ) to teen martabah salaam karte the aur jab aap sallallahu alaihi wasallam koi baat farmate to ( zyada se zyada ) teen martabah use dehrate.",
  "bukhari|6246": "Abu Hurairah! ahl safah ke pass ja aur unhein mere pass bula la. mein un ke pass aaya aur unhein bula laya. wo aaye aur ( andar aanay ki ) ijazat chahi phir jab ijazat di gayi to dakhil hue.“",
  "bukhari|6247": "Nabi kareem sallallahu alaihi wasallam bhi isa hi karte the.",
  "bukhari|6249": "ay Aishah! ye Jibreel hain tumhein salaam kehte hain bayan kiya ke mein ne arz kiya «walia assalam warhmat Allah» aap dekhte hain jo hum nahin dekh sakte Umm almominin ka isharah Nabi kareem sallallahu alaihi wasallam ki taraf tha. mamar ke saath us hadees ko Shuaib aur yunis aur Numan ne bhi Zuhri se riwayat kiya hai yunis aur Numan ki rawaiyton mein «wabarkath.» ka lafz zyada hai.",
  "bukhari|6250": "kaun hain? mein ne kaha ”mein“ Nabi kareem sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne farmaya ”mein, mein“ jaise aap ne us jawaab ko napasand farmaya.",
  "bukhari|6253": "Jibreel alaihi assalam tumhein salaam kehte hain. Aishah razi Allah anha ne kaha ke walia assalam warhmat Allah un par bhi Allah ki taraf se salamati aur us ki rahmat nazil ho.",
  "bukhari|6257": "jab tumhein yahudi salaam karein aur agar un mein se koi «alsam alik.» kahe to tum us ke jawaab mein sirf «walik» ( aur tumhein bhi ) keh diya karo.“",
  "bukhari|6258": "jab ahl kitaab tumhein salaam karein to tum us ke jawaab mein sirf «walaikum» kaho.“",
  "bukhari|626": "hum se Abu al-Yaman ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha ke humein Shuaib ne khabar di, unhon ne Zuhri se, unhon ne kaha ke mujhe Urwah bin Zubair ne khabar di ke Umm almominin Aishah razi Allah anha ne farmaya ke jab mozan subah ki doosri azaan de kar chip hota to Rasool Allah sallallahu alaihi wasallam khare hote aur farz se pehle do rakaat ( sunnat Fajr ) halki phalki ada karte subah sadiq roshan ho jane ke baad phir dahni karwat par let rehte. yahan tak ke mozan takbeer kehne ki itlaa dene ke liye aap sallallahu alaihi wasallam ke pass aata.",
  "bukhari|6263": "hum se amru bin asm ne bayan kiya, kaha hum se Hammam ne bayan kiya un se Qatadah ne ke mein ne Anas razi Allah anhu se puchha, kiya musafha ka dastur Nabi kareem sallallahu alaihi wasallam ke sahabah mein tha? unhon ne kaha ke ji haan zaroor tha.",
  "bukhari|6269": "koi shakhs kisi doosre shakhs ko us ke bethne ki jagah se na athae ke khud wahan baitth jaye.“",
  "bukhari|627": "har do azanon ( azaan wa takbeer ) ke beach mein namaz hai. har do azanon ke darmiyan namaz hai. phir teesri martabah aap sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne farmaya ke agar koi parhna chahe.",
  "bukhari|6270": "tha ke kisi shakhs ko us ki jagah se uthaya jaye takeh doosra us ki jagah par baithe, albatah ( aanay wale ko majlis mein ) jagah de diya karo aur farakhi kar diya karo aur Ibn Umar razi Allah anhuma napasand karte the ke koi shakhs majlis mein se kisi ko utha kar khud us ki jagah baitth jaye.",
  "bukhari|6273": "kiya mein tumhein sab se bare gunah ki khabar na doon.“ sahabah razi Allah anhum ne arz kiya kyun nahin ya Rasool Allah! Nabi kareem sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne farmaya ke Allah ke saath shark karna aur walidain ki nafarmani karna.",
  "bukhari|6276": "hum se qatibah bin Saeed ne bayan kiya, kaha hum se Jarir ne bayan kiya, un se Aamash ne, un se aboalzhi ne, un se masrooq ne aur un se Aishah razi Allah anha ne bayan kiya ke Rasool Allah sallallahu alaihi wasallam takhat ke wasti mein namaz parhte the aur mein Nabi kareem sallallahu alaihi wasallam aur qiblah ke darmiyan leti rehti thi mujhe koi zaroorat hoti lekin mujh ko khare ho kar aap ke samne ana bura maloom hota. albatah aap ki taraf rukh kar ke mein aahista se khasak jati thi.",
  "bukhari|6279": "hum se Muhammad bin kaseer ne bayan kiya, kaha hum se Sufyan Sauri ne bayan kiya, un se abuhazam ne aur un se sahal bin Saad saadi razi Allah anhu ne bayan kiya ke hum khana aur qilola namaz Jumuah ke baad kiya karte the.",
  "bukhari|6284": "tha. ashtamal sama aur ek kapde mein us tarah ahtaba karne se ke insaan ki sharmagaa par koi cheez na ho aur malamst aur manabzat se. us riwayat ki matabat mamar, Muhammad bin Abi hafsa aur Abdullah bin badil ne Zuhri se ki hai.",
  "bukhari|6288": "jab teen aadmi saath hoon to teesaray saathi ko chhor kar do aapas mein kana phosi ( sargoshi ) na karein.“",
  "bukhari|6289": "hum se Abdullah bin sabaah ne bayan kiya, kaha hum se matamar bin sulaiman ne bayan kiya, kaha ke mein ne apne walid se suna ke mein ne Anas bin Malik razi Allah anhu se suna ke Rasool Allah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne mujh se ek raz ki baat kahi thi aur mein ne wo raz kisi ko nahin bataya ( un ki walida ) Umm Sulaim razi Allah anha ne bhi mujh se us ke mutalliq puchha lekin mein ne unhein bhi nahin bataya.",
  "bukhari|6290": "jab teen aadmi hoon to teesaray saathi ko chhor kar tum aapas mein kana phosi ( sargoshi ) na kiya karo. us liye ke logon ko ranj ho ga albatah agar doosre aadmi bhi hoon to mazaiqah nahin.“",
  "bukhari|6293": "jab sone lago to ghar mein aag na chhoro.“",
  "bukhari|6294": "aag tumhari dushman hai us liye jab sone lago to use bujha diya karo.",
  "bukhari|6295": "( sote waqt ) bartan dhak liya karo warna darwaze band kar liya karo aur charag bujha liya karo kyunki ye chuha baaz auqaat charag ki bati khinch leta hai aur ghar walon ko jala deta hai.“",
  "bukhari|6296": "jab raat mein sone lago to charag bujha diya karo aur darwaze band kar liya karo aur mashkizon ka munh bandh diya karo aur khane peene ki cheezain dhak diya karo.“ Hammad ne kaha ke mera khayal hai ke ye bhi farmaya ke ”agarchah ek lakdi se hi ho.“",
  "bukhari|630": "dekho jab tum safar mein niklo to ( namaz ke waqt raaste mein ) azaan dena phir iqamat kehna, phir jo shakhs tum mein Umar mein bara ho namaz padhaye.",
  "bukhari|6304": "har Nabi ko ek dua hasil hoti hai ( jo qubool ki jati hai ) aur mein chahta hoon ke mein apni dua ko aakhirat mein apni ummat ki shafaat ke liye mehfooz rakhun.“",
  "bukhari|6305": "har Nabi ne kuchh cheezain mangin ya farmaya ke har Nabi ko ek dua di gayi jis cheez ki us ne dua mangi phir use qubool kiya gaya lekin mein ne apni dua qiyamat ke din apni ummat ki shafaat ke liye mehfooz rakhi hui hai.",
  "bukhari|6307": "Allah ki qasam mein din mein sattar martabah se zyada Allah se istighfar aur us se taubah karta hoon.",
  "bukhari|6310": "hum se Abdullah bin Muhammad masndi ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha hum se Hisham bin Yusuf ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha hum ko mamar ne khabar di, unhein Zuhri ne, unhein Urwah ne aur unhein Aishah razi Allah anha ne ke Nabi kareem sallallahu alaihi wasallam raat mein ( Tahajjud ki ) gayarah rakaat parhte the phir jab Fajr tulu ho jati to do halki rakaat ( sunnat Fajr ) parhte. us ke baad aap dayein pehlu let jate aaqar mozan aata aur Nabi kareem sallallahu alaihi wasallam ko itlaa deta to aap Fajr ki namaz padhate.",
  "bukhari|6312": "tere hi naam ke saath mein murdah aur zindah rehta hoon“ aur jab bedar hote to kehte «alhamdulillah alzi ahyana baad ma amatna walia alnshor» ”isi Allah ke liye tamam tarifein hain jis ne humein zindah kiya. us ke baad ke us ne maut tari kar di thi aur isi ki taraf lotna hai.“ Quran sharif mein jo lafz «nansharha» hai us ka bhi yahi mani hai ke hum us ko nikal kar athate hain.",
  "bukhari|6314": "ay Allah! tere naam ke saath marta hoon aur zindah hota hoon.“ aur jab aap bedar hote to kehte «alhamdulillah alzi ahyana baad ma amatna walia alnshor.» ”tamam tarifein us Allah ke liye hain jis ne humein zindah kiya us ke baad ke humein maut ( murad neend hai ) de di thi aur teri hi taraf jana hai.“",
  "bukhari|6319": "hum se Abdullah bin Yusuf ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha hum se lais bin Saad ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha ke mujh se aqeel ne bayan kiya, un se Ibn Shihab ne bayan kiya, unhein Urwah ne khabar di aur unhein Umm almominin Aishah razi Allah anha ne ke jab Rasool Allah sallallahu alaihi wasallam lettey to apne haathon par phonkte aur muzat parhte aur donon haath apne jism par pherte.",
  "bukhari|6322": "ay Allah! mein khabis janon aur janiyon ki burai se teri panah mangta hoon.“",
  "bukhari|6324": "tere naam ke saath, ay Allah! mein marta aur tere hi naam se jeeta hoon.“ aur jab bedar hote to ye dua parhte «alhamdulillah alzi ahyana baad ma amatna, walia alnshor» ”tamam tarifein us Allah ke liye hain jis ne humein maut ke baad zindagi bakhshi aur isi ki taraf hum ko lotna hai.“",
  "bukhari|6325": "ay Allah! mein tere hi naam se marta hoon aur tere hi naam se zindah hota hoon.“ aur jab bedar hote to farmate «alhamdulillah alzi ahyana baad ma amatna walia alnshor.» ”tamam tarifein us Allah ke liye hain jis ne humein maut ke baad zindagi bakhshi aur isi ki taraf hum ko jana hai.“",
  "bukhari|6326": "ay Allah! mein ne apni jaan par bahut zulm kiya hai aur gunahon ko tere siwa koi maaf nahin karta pas meri maghfirat kar, aisi maghfirat jo tere pass se ho aur mujh par raham kar blashbah to bara maghfirat karne wala, bara raham karne waala hai.“ aur amru bin Haris ne bhi us hadees ko yazid se, unhon ne abulkhair se, unhon ne Abdullah bin amru razi Allah anhuma se suna ke Abu Bakr sadeeq razi Allah anhu ne Nabi kareem sallallahu alaihi wasallam se arz kiya aaqar tak.",
  "bukhari|6327": "wala tajhar baslatak wala takhafat bha» dua ke baare mein nazil hui ( ke na bahut zor zor se aur na bilkul aahista aahista ) balkeh darmiyani raasta ikhtiyar karo.",
  "bukhari|633": "hum se Ishaq bin mansoor ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha ke humein jafar bin aon ne khabar di, unhon ne kaha ke hum se aboalamis ne bayan kiya, unhon ne aon bin Abi hajifa se abuhajifa ke wastah se bayan kiya, kaha ke mein ne Rasool Allah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ko abth mein dekha ke Bilal hazir hue aur aap sallallahu alaihi wasallam ko namaz ki khabar di phir Bilal razi Allah anhu barchi lay kar aage badhe aur use aap sallallahu alaihi wasallam ke samne ( bataur satrah ) maqam abth mein gad diya aur aap sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne ( us ko satrah bina kar ) namaz padhai.",
  "bukhari|6332": "ay Allah! Abi Awfa ki aal aulad par rahmaten nazil farma.",
  "bukhari|6334": "ya Allah! us ke maal wa aulad ko zyada kar aur jo kuchh to ne use diya hai, us mein use barkat ata farmayo.“",
  "bukhari|6335": "Allah us par raham farmaye us ne mujhe falan falan aaiteyn yaad dila dein jo mein falan falan surton se bhool gaya tha.",
  "bukhari|634": "hum se Muhammad bin Yusuf fariyabi ne bayan kiya, kaha ke hum se Sufyan Sauri ne aon bin Abi hajifa se bayan kiya, unhon ne apne baap se ke unhon ne Bilal razi Allah anhu ko azaan dete hue dekha. wo kehte hain mein bhi un ke munh ke saath idhar idhar munh phirne laga.",
  "bukhari|6340": "bandah ki dua qubool hoti hai jab tak ke wo jaldi na kare ke kehne lage ke mein ne dua ki thi aur meri dua qubool nahin hui.“",
  "bukhari|6344": "hum se Abdullah bin Abi alsud ne bayan kiya, kaha hum se harmi bin amarah ne bayan kiya, kaha hum se Shubah ne bayan kiya, un se Qatadah ne aur un se Anas razi Allah anhu ne ke meri walida ( Umm Sulaim razi Allah anhu ) ne kaha: ya Rasool Allah! Anas razi Allah anhu aap ka khaadim hai us ke liye dua farma dein. Nabi kareem sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne dua ki ke ay Allah! us ke maal wa aulad ko zyada kar aur jo kuchh to ne use diya hai us mein barkat ata farma.",
  "bukhari|6345": "Allah ke siwa koi maabud nahin jo bahut azmath waala hai aur burd baar hai, Allah ke siwa koi maabud nahin jo aasmanon aur zamin ka Rabb aur bare bhari arsh ka Rabb hai.“",
  "bukhari|6346": "Allah saheb azmath aur bardbar ke siwa koi maabud nahin, Allah ke siwa koi maabud nahin jo arsh azeem ka Rabb hai, Allah ke siwa koi maabud nahin jo aasmanon aur zaminon ka Rabb hai aur arsh azeem ka Rabb hai.“ aur wahab ne bayan kiya ke hum se Shubah ne bayan kiya, un se Qatadah ne us tarah bayan kiya.",
  "bukhari|6347": "hum se Ali bin Abdullah madini ne bayan kiya, kaha hum se Sufyan bin Uyainah ne bayan kiya, kaha mujh se sami ne bayan kiya, un se abusaleh ne aur un se Abu Hurairah razi Allah anhu ne ke Nabi kareem sallallahu alaihi wasallam museebat ki sakhti, tabahi tak pahunch jane, qaza wa qadr ki burai aur dushmanon ke khush hone se panah mangte the aur Sufyan ne kaha ke hadees mein teen safat ka bayan tha. ek mein ne bhala di thi aur mujhe yaad nahin ke wo ek kaun see sifat hai.",
  "bukhari|6349": "hum se masdad bin masrhad ne bayan kiya, kaha hum se Yahya bin Saeed Qattan ne bayan kiya, un se Ismail bin Abi Khalid ne bayan kiya, un se Qais bin Abi Hazim ne bayan kiya, kaha ke mein Khabbab bin Aratt razi Allah anhu ki khidmat mein hazir hua unhon ne saat dag ( kisi bimari ke ilaj ke liye ) lagoae the. unhon ne kaha ke Rasool Allah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne agar humein maut ki dua karne se mana na kiya hota to mein zaroor us ki dua karta.",
  "bukhari|6350": "hum se Muhammad bin Musanna ne bayan kiya, kaha hum se Yahya Qattan ne bayan kiya, un se Ismail bin Abi Khalid ne bayan kiya, un se Qais bin Abi Hazim ne bayan kiya, kaha ke mein Khabbab bin Aratt razi Allah anhu ki khidmat mein hazir hua unhon ne apne pait par saat dag lagoa rakhe the, mein ne suna ke wo keh rahe the ke agar Nabi kareem sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne humein maut ki dua karne se mana na kiya hota to mein us ki zaroor dua kar leta.",
  "bukhari|6351": "tum mein se koi shakhs kisi takleef ki wajah se jo use hone lagi ho, maut ki tamna na kare. agar maut ki tamna zaroori hi ho jaye to ye kahe ke ay Allah! jab tak mere liye zindagi behtar hai mujhe zindah rakhiyo aur jab mere liye maut behtar ho to mujhe utha lijio.“",
  "bukhari|6358": "ay Allah! apni rahmat nazil kar Muhammad ( sallallahu alaihi wasallam ) par jo tere bande hain aur tere Rasool hain jis tarah to ne rahmat nazil ki Ibrahim par aur barkat bhej Muhammad ( sallallahu alaihi wasallam ) par aur un ki aal par jis tarah barkat bheji to ne abrahm par aur aal Ibrahim par.“",
  "bukhari|6359": "Allahumma sal Ali aal Abi Awfa » ”ay Allah! aal Abi Awfa par apni rahmat nazil farma.“",
  "bukhari|636": "tum log takbeer ki aawaz sun low to namaz ke liye ( mamuli chal se ) chal pado. sukoon aur waqar ko ( baharhaal ) pakade rakho aur dod ke mat aao. phir namaz ka jo hissah mile use parh low, aur jo na mil sakay use baad mein poora kar low.",
  "bukhari|6360": "ay Allah! Muhammad aur aap ki azwaj aur aap ki aulad par apni rahmat nazil kar jaisa ke to ne Ibrahim aur aal Ibrahim par rahmat nazil ki aur Muhammad aur un ki azwaj aur un ki aulad par barkat nazil kar, jaisa ke to ne Ibrahim aur aal Ibrahim par barkat nazil ki. blashbah to tareef kiya gaya shan wa azmath waala hai.“",
  "bukhari|6361": "ay Allah! mein ne jis momin ko bhi bura bhala kaha ho to us ke liye use qiyamat ke din apni qurbat ka zariya bina de.",
  "bukhari|637": "jab namaz ke liye takbeer kahi jaye to us waqt tak na khare ho jab tak mujhe nikaltay hue na dekh low.",
  "bukhari|6372": "Allahumma habb alina almadinat, kama habbat alina makat au ashad, wanqal hamaha ali aljhafat, Allahumma barak lana fi madna wasaana» ”ay Allah! hamare dil mein madinah ki aisi hi mohabbat paida kar de jaisi to ne makkah ki mohabbat hamare dil mein paida ki hai balkeh us se bhi zyada aur us ke bakhar ko jahafah mein muntaqil kar de, ay Allah! hamare liye hamare mudd aur saa mein barkat ata farma.“",
  "bukhari|6381": "Allahumma aksar malah woldh, wabark lahu feema ateth» ”ay Allah! us ke maal wa aulad mein ziadati kar aur jo kuchh to de us mein barkat ata farma.“",
  "bukhari|6383": "ay Allah! abeed aboamr ki maghfirat farma.“ mein ne us waqt Nabi kareem sallallahu alaihi wasallam ki baghal ki safedi dekhi. phir aap sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne dua ki ”ay Allah! qiyamat ke din use apni bahut see insani makhlooq se buland martabah ata farmayo.“",
  "bukhari|6385": "Allah ke siwa koi maabud nahin, wo tanha hai us ka koi sharik nahin, us ke liye badshahi hai aur isi ke liye tamam tarifein hain aur wo har cheez par qadrat rakhne waala hai. lautte hain hum taubah karte hue apne Rabb ki ibadat karte hue aur hamd bayan karte hue. Allah ne apna waada sach kar dikhaya, apne bandah ki madad ki aur tanha tamam lashkar ko shikast di.“",
  "bukhari|6386": "Allah tumhein barkat ata farmaye, walima kar, chahe ek bakri ka hi ho.",
  "bukhari|6390": "ay Allah! mein teri panah mangta hoon bakhal se aur teri panah mangta hoon duniya ki azmaish se aur qabar ke azaab se.",
  "bukhari|6392": "ay Allah! kitaab ke nazil karne wale! hisaab jaldi lene wale! ahzab ko ( musharkene ki jamaaton ko, gazwah ahzab mein ) shikast de, unhein shikast deday aur unhein jhanjod de.“",
  "bukhari|6397": "ay Allah! qabeelah dos ko hidayat de aur unhein ( mere pass ) bhej de.“",
  "bukhari|6399": "ay Allah! meri maghfirat farma meri khataon mein, meri nadani mein aur meri kisi muamalah mein ziadati mein, un baton mein jin ka to mujh se zyada janane waala hai. ay Allah! meri maghfirat kar mere hansi mazah aur sanjidgi mein aur mere irada mein aur ye sab kuchh meri hi taraf se hain.“",
  "bukhari|640": "tum log apni apni jagah thahre raho. phir aap sallallahu alaihi wasallam wapas tashreef laye to aap sallallahu alaihi wasallam ghusl ke hue the aur sir mubarak se paani tapak raha tha. phir aap sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne logon ko namaz padhai.",
  "bukhari|6402": "jab parhne waala Aameen kahe to tum bhi Aameen kaho kyunki us waqt malaika bhi Aameen kehte hain aur jis ki Aameen malaika ki Aameen ke saath hoti hai us ke pichhle gunah maaf kar diye jate hain.“",
  "bukhari|6405": "jis ne «subhanallah wabhamdh.» din mein sau martabah kaha, us ke gunah maaf kar diye jate hain, khwah samandar ki jhag ke barabar hi kyun na hoon.“",
  "bukhari|6406": "do kalme jo zabaan par halke hain taraazoo mein bahut bhari aur Rahman ko aziz hain «subhanallah alazeem, subhanallah wabhamdh».“",
  "bukhari|6407": "hum se Muhammad bin ala ne bayan kiya, kaha hum se aboasama ne bayan kiya, un se yazid bin Abdullah ne, un se abubardah ne aur un se Abu Musa razi Allah anhu ne bayan kiya ke Nabi kareem sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne farmaya ”us shakhs ki misal jo apne Rabb ko yaad karta hai aur us ki misal jo apne Rabb ko yaad nahin karta zindah aur murdah jaisi hai.“",
  "bukhari|6412": "do nematen aisi hain ke aksar log un ki qadr nahin karte, sehat aur faraghat.“ abbas anbari ne bayan kiya ke hum se safwaan bin aesi ne bayan kiya, un se Abdullah bin Abi hind ne, un se un ke walid ne ke mein ne Abdullah bin abbas razi Allah anhuma se suna, unhon ne Nabi kareem sallallahu alaihi wasallam se isi hadees ki tarah.",
  "bukhari|6413": "Allahumma la aish illa aish alakhra, faslh alansar walmahajra» ”ay Allah! aakhirat ki zindagi ke siwa aur koi zindagi nahin. pas to Ansaar wa muhajirin mein salah ko baqi rakh.“",
  "bukhari|6415": "alduniya wama feha» se behtar hai.",
  "bukhari|6418": "hum se Muslim bin Ibrahim farahidi ne bayan kiya, kaha hum se Hammam bin Yahya ne bayan kiya, un se Ishaq bin Abdullah bin Abi Talhah ne aur un se Anas razi Allah anhu ne bayan kiya ke Nabi kareem sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne chand khatot khinche aur farmaya ke ye umeed hai aur ye maut hai, insaan isi halat ( amidon tak pahunchane ki ) mein rehta hai ke qareeb waala khat ( maut ) us tak pahunch jata hai.",
  "bukhari|6419": "Allah ta'ala ne us aadmi ke azar ke silsile mein hujat tamam kar di jis ki maut ko mokhar kiya yahan tak ke wo saath saal ki Umar ko pahunch gaya.“ us riwayat ki matabat abuhazam aur Ibn ajlan ne maqbri se ki.",
  "bukhari|6421": "insaan ki Umar badhti jati hai aur us ke saath do cheezain us ke andar badhti jati hain, maal ki mohabbat aur Umar ki darazi.“ us ki riwayat Shubah ne Qatadah se ki hai.",
  "bukhari|6423": "koi bandah jab qiyamat ke din us halat mein pesh ho ga ke us ne kalimah «la ilah illa Allah» ka iqraar kiya ho ga aur us se us ka maqsood Allah ki khushnudi hasil karna ho gi to Allah ta'ala dozakh ki aag ko us par harm kar de ga.“",
  "bukhari|6429": "sab se behtar mera zamanah hai, us ke baad un logon ka jo us ke baad hoon ge phir jo un ke baad hoon ge aur us ke baad aise log paida hoon ge jo qasam se pehle goahi dein ge kabhi goahi se pehle qasam khain ge.“",
  "bukhari|6431": "hum se Muhammad bin Musanna ne bayan kiya, kaha hum se Yahya Qattan ne bayan kiya, un se Ismail bin Abi Khalid ne, un se Qais bin Abi Hazim ne kaha ke mein Khabbab bin Aratt razi Allah anhu ki khidmat mein hazir hua, wo apne makaan ki deewar banwa rahe the, unhon ne kaha ke hamare saathi jo guzar gaye duniya ne un ke nek aamaal mein se kuchh kami nahin ki lekin un ke baad hum ko itna paisa mila ke hum us ko kahan kharch karein bas us mitti aur paani yaani imarat mein hum ko use kharch ka mauqa mila hai.",
  "bukhari|6434": "nek log yake baad digre guzar jayein ge us ke baad jo ke bhose ya khajoor ke kachre ki tarah kuchh log duniya mein rah jayein ge jin ki Allah paak ko kuchh zara bhi parwa na ho gi.“ Imam Bukhari rahimahu Allah ne kaha «hafalat» aur «hasalat.» donon ke ek mani hain.",
  "bukhari|6436": "agar insaan ke pass maal ki do waadiyan hoon to teesri ka khwahshmand ho ga aur insaan ka pait mitti ke siwa aur koi cheez nahin bhar sakti aur Allah us shakhs ki taubah qubool karta hai jo ( dil se ) sachi taubah karta hai.“",
  "bukhari|6439": "agar insaan ke pass sone ki ek wadi ho to wo chahe ga ke do ho jayein aur us ka munh qabar ki mitti ke siwa aur koi cheez nahin bhar sakti aur Allah us ki taubah qubool karta hai jo taubah kare.“",
  "bukhari|6445": "agar mere pass ahad pahad ke barabar bhi sona ho to mujhe us mein khushi ho gi ke teen din bhi mujh par us hal mein na guzarne payen ke us mein se mere pass kuchh bhi baqi bachche. albatah agar kisi ka qarz door karne ke liye kuchh rakh chhodon to ye aur baat hai.",
  "bukhari|6446": "tongri ye nahin hai ke saman zyada ho, balkeh amiri ye hai ke dil gani ho.“",
  "bukhari|645": "jamaat ke saath namaz akile namaz parhne se satais darjah zyada fazilat rakhti hai.",
  "bukhari|6457": "hum se hadba bin Khalid ne bayan kiya, kaha hum se Hammam bin Yahya ne bayan kiya, kaha hum se Qatadah ne bayan kiya kaha ke hum Anas bin Malik razi Allah anhu ki khidmat mein hazir hote, un ka nan bye waheen mojod hota ( jo rotian paka paka kar deta jata ) Anas razi Allah anhu logon se kehte ke khao, mein ne kabhi Nabi kareem sallallahu alaihi wasallam ko patli roti khate nahin dekha aur na Nabi kareem sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne kabhi apni aankh se samochi bahani hui bakri dekhi. yahan tak ke aap ka inteqal ho gaya.",
  "bukhari|646": "hum se Abdullah bin Yusuf ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha ke mujh se lais ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha ke mujh se yazid bin had ne bayan kiya, unhon ne Abdullah bin Khabbab se, unhon ne Abu Saeed khadri razi Allah anhu se ke unhon ne Nabi kareem sallallahu alaihi wasallam se suna aap sallallahu alaihi wasallam farmate the ke jamaat se namaz tanha namaz parhne se pachis darjah zyada fazilat rakhti hai.",
  "bukhari|6460": "hum se Abdullah bin Muhammad ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha hum se Muhammad bin fazeel ne bayan kiya, un se un ke walid ne, un se amarah ne, un se abuzraa ne aur un se Abu Hurairah razi Allah anhu ne bayan kiya ke hum se Abdullah bin Muhammad ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha hum se Muhammad bin fazeel ne bayan kiya, un se un ke walid ne, un se amarah ne, un se abuzraa ne aur un se Abu Hurairah razi Allah anhu ne bayan kiya ke",
  "bukhari|6461": "jis par hamishgi ho sakay, kaha ke mein ne puchha aap raat ko Tahajjud ke liye kab uthte the? batlaia ke jab marg ki aawaz sun lete.",
  "bukhari|6464": "darmiyani chal ikhtiyar karo aur buland parwazi na karo aur amal karte raho, tum mein se kisi ka amal use jannat mein nahin dakhil kar sakay ga, mere nazdeek sab se pasandeedah amal wo hai jis par hamishgi ki jaye khwah kam hi kyun na ho.“",
  "bukhari|6465": "jis par hamishgi ki jaye, khwah wo thori hi ho aur farmaya nek kaam karne mein itni hi takleef uthao jitni taqat hai ( jo hamesha nabh sakay ).",
  "bukhari|6466": "mujh se Usman bin Abi shibah ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha hum se Jarir ne bayan kiya, un se mansoor ne bayan kiya, un se Ibrahim nakhi ne aur un se alqmah ne bayan kiya ke mein ne Umm almominin Aishah razi Allah anha se puchha: Umm almominin! Nabi kareem sallallahu alaihi wasallam keunkr ibadat kiya karte the kiya aap ne kuchh khas din khas kar rakhe the? batlaia ke nahin Nabi kareem sallallahu alaihi wasallam ke amal mein hamishgi hoti thi aur tum mein kaun hai jo un amlon ki taqat rakhta ho jin ki Nabi kareem sallallahu alaihi wasallam taqat rakhte the.",
  "bukhari|6467": "dekho jo nek kaam karo theek taur se karo aur had se na badh jao balkeh us ke qareeb raho ( miana ravi ikhtiyar karo ) aur khush raho aur yaad rakho ke koi bhi apne amal ki wajah se jannat mein nahin jaye ga. sahabah ne arz kiya: aur aap bhi nahin ya Rasool Allah! farmaya aur mein bhi nahin. siwa us ke ke Allah apni maghfirat wa rahmat ke saaya mein mujhe dhank lay. madini ne bayan kiya ke mera khayal hai ke Musa bin aqbah ne ye hadees Abu Salamah se aboalnsar ke waste se sunni hai, Abu Salamah ne Aishah razi Allah anha se. aur afaan bin Muslim ne bayan kiya ke hum se wahib ne bayan kiya, un se Musa bin aqbah ne bayan kiya, kaha ke mein ne Abu Salamah razi Allah anhu se suna aur unhon ne Aishah razi Allah anha se aur unhon ne Nabi kareem sallallahu alaihi wasallam se ke aap sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne farmaya ”darsati ke saath amal karo aur khush raho.“ aur mujahid ne bayan kiya ke «sadada sadida» har do ke mani sidq ke hain.",
  "bukhari|6472": "meri ummat ke sattar hazaar log be hisaab jannat mein jayein ge. ye wo log hoon ge jo jhaad phoonk nahin karate na shagun lete hain aur apne Rabb hi par baharosa rakhte hain.“",
  "bukhari|6474": "mere liye jo shakhs donon jabdon ke darmiyan ki cheez ( zabaan ) aur donon taangon ke darmiyan ki cheez ( sharmagaa ) ki zamah dari deday mein us ke liye jannat ki zamah dari deta hoon.“",
  "bukhari|6475": "jo koi Allah aur aakhirat ke din par imaan rakhta hai use chahiye ke achhi baat kahe warna khamosh rahe aur jo koi Allah aur aakhirat ke din par imaan rakhta hai wo apne padosi ko takleef na pahunchaye aur jo koi Allah aur aakhirat ke din par imaan rakhta ho wo apne mehman ki izzat kare.“",
  "bukhari|6479": "saat tarah ke log wo hain janhein Allah ta'ala apne saaya mein panah de ga. ( un mein ) ek wo shakhs bhi hai jis ne tanhayi mein Allah ko yaad kiya to us ki aankhon se aansu jari ho gaye.“",
  "bukhari|6486": "agar tumhein wo maloom hota jo mein janta hoon to tum hanstay kam aur rote zyada.“",
  "bukhari|6487": "dozakh khwahishaat nafsani se dhak di gayi hai aur jannat mushkilaat aur dushwariyon se dhaki hui hai.“",
  "bukhari|6488": "jannat tumhare jutay ke tasme se bhi zyada tumhare qareeb hai aur isi tarah dozakh bhi.“",
  "bukhari|6489": "sab se sachcha shar jise shayar ne kaha hai ye hai ”haan Allah ke siwa tamam cheezain bebaniyad hain.“",
  "bukhari|6490": "jab tum mein ne koi shakhs kisi aise aadmi ko dekhay jo maal aur shakal wa soorat mein us se badh kar hai to use aise shakhs ka dhyaan karna chahiye jo us se kam darjah ka hai.“",
  "bukhari|6494": "hum se Abu al-Yaman ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha hum ko Shuaib ne khabar di, un se Zuhri ne bayan kiya ke mujh se Ata bin yazid ne bayan kiya aur un se Abu Saeed khadri razi Allah anhu ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha ke sawaal kiya gaya: ay Allah ke Rasool! Muhammad bin Yusuf ne bayan kiya, un se ozai ne bayan kiya, un se Zuhri ne bayan kiya, un se Ata bin yazid lisi ne bayan kiya aur un se Abu Saeed khadri razi Allah anhu ne bayan kiya ke ek arabi Nabi kareem sallallahu alaihi wasallam ki khidmat mein hazir hua aur puchha: ya Rasool Allah! kaun shakhs sab se achha hai? farmaya ke wo shakhs jis ne apni jaan aur maal ke zariya jihad kiya aur wo shakhs jo kisi pahad ki khoh mein thahra hua apne Rabb ki ibadat karta hai aur logon ko apni burai se mehfooz rakhta hai. us riwayat ki matabat zubaidi, sulaiman bin kaseer aur Numan ne Zuhri se ki. aur mamar ne Zuhri se bayan kiya, un se Ata ya Ubaidullah ne, un se Abu Saeed khadri razi Allah anhu ne bayan kiya aur un se Nabi kareem sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne aur yunis wa Ibn musafir aur Yahya bin Saeed ne Ibn Shihab ( Zuhri ) se bayan kiya, un se Ata ne aur un se Nabi kareem sallallahu alaihi wasallam ke kisi sahabi ne aur un se Nabi kareem sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne.",
  "bukhari|6495": "logon par ek isa door aaye ga jab ek musalman ka sab se behtar maal bhedin hoon gi wo unhein lay kar pahad ki chotiyon aur baarish ki jaghon par chala jaye ga, us din wo apne deen ko lay kar fasadon se dar kar wahan se bhag jaye ga.",
  "bukhari|6499": "aur mein ne aap ke siwa kisi ko ye kehte nahin suna ke Nabi kareem sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne farmaya, chunaanchah mein un ke qareeb pahuncha to mein ne suna ke wo keh rahe the ke Nabi kareem sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne farmaya ke ( kisi nek kaam ke natijah mein ) jo shohrat ka talib ho Allah ta'ala us ki badniyati qiyamat ke din sab ko suna de ga. isi tarah jo koi logon ko dikhane ke liye nek kaam kare ga Allah bhi qiyamat ke din us ko sab logon ko dikhla de ga.",
  "bukhari|65": "Muhammad Rasool Allah» kandah tha. goya mein ( aaj bhi ) aap sallallahu alaihi wasallam ke haath mein us ki safedi dekh raha hoon. ( Shubah raawi hadees kehte hain ke ) mein ne Qatadah se puchha ke ye kis ne kaha ( ke ) us par «Muhammad Rasool Allah» kandah tha? unhon ne jawaab diya, Anas razi Allah anhu ne.",
  "bukhari|6508": "jo shakhs Allah se milne ko pasand karta hai Allah bhi us se milne ko pasand karta hai aur jo shakhs Allah se milne ko napasand karta hai Allah bhi us se milne ko napasand karta hai.“",
  "bukhari|6513": "masdad ne bayan kiya, kaha hum se Yahya ne bayan kiya, un se abdarba bin Saeed ne, un se Muhammad bin Umar ne bayan kiya, un se Talhah bin kaab ne bayan kiya, un se aboqtadah ne aur un se Nabi kareem sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne farmaya ke ye marnay waala ya to aaraam pane waala hai ya doosre bandon ko aaraam dene waala hai.",
  "bukhari|6514": "mit ke saath teen cheezain chalti hain do to wapas aao jati hain sirf ek kaam us ke saath rah jata hai, us ke saath us ke ghar wale us ka maal aur us ka amal chalta hai us ke ghar wale aur maal to wapas aao jata hai aur us ka amal us ke saath baqi rah jata hai.“",
  "bukhari|6515": "jab tum mein se koi marta hai to subah wa shaam ( jab tak wo barzakh mein hai ) us ke rahne ki jagah use har roz dikhai jati hai ya dozakh ho ya jannat aur kaha jata hai ke ye tere rahne ki jagah hai yahan tak ke to uthaya jaye ( yaani qiyamat ke din tak ).“",
  "bukhari|6516": "jo log mar gaye un ko bura na kaho kyunki jo kuchh unhon ne aage bheja tha us ke pass wo khud pahunch chakay hain, unhon ne bure bhale jo bhi amal ke the wisa badlah pa liya.“",
  "bukhari|6518": "be hoshi ke waqt tamam log behosh ho jayein ge aur sab se pehle uthne waala mein hoon ga. us waqt Musa alaihi assalam arsh ilahi ka kona thame hoon ge. ab mein nahin janta ke wo behosh bhi hoon ge ya nahin. us hadees ko Abu Saeed khadri razi Allah anhu ne bhi Nabi kareem sallallahu alaihi wasallam se riwayat kiya hai.",
  "bukhari|6519": "Allah ta'ala zamin ko apni muthi mein lay lay ga aur aasmanon ko apne dayein haath mein lapait lay ga, phir farmaye ga ke ab mein hoon badshah, aaj zamin ke badshah kahan gaye?“",
  "bukhari|6521": "qiyamat ke din logon ka hashar safed wa surkhi aamez zamin par ho ga jaise midah ki roti saaf wa safed hoti hai. us zamin par kisi ( cheez ) ka koi nishan na ho ga.“",
  "bukhari|6523": "hum se Abdullah bin Muhammad ne bayan kiya, kaha hum se yunis bin Muhammad baghdadi ne bayan kiya, kaha hum se shiban nahoi ne bayan kiya, kaha un se Qatadah ne, kaha hum se Anas bin Malik razi Allah anhu ne bayan kiya ke ek sahabi ne kaha, ay Allah ke Nabi! qiyamat mein kafiron ko un ke chehre ke bill kis tarah hashar kiya jaye ga. Nabi kareem sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne farmaya ke wo zaat jis ne unhein duniya mein do paaon par chalaya use us par qadrat nahin hai ke qiyamat ke din unhein chehre ke bill chala de. Qatadah razi Allah anhu ne kaha ke zaroor hai, hamare Rabb ki izzat ki qasam, beshak wo munh ke bill chala sakta hai.",
  "bukhari|6531": "tum mein se har koi sare jahanon ke parwardigar ke aage khara ho ga us hal mein ke us ka paseenah kanon ki low tak pahuncha hua ho ga.",
  "bukhari|6532": "qiyamat ke din log pasine mein sharabor ho jayein ge aur halat ye ho jaye gi ke tum mein se har kisi ka paseenah zamin par sattar haath tak phel jaye ga aur munh tak pahunch kar kanon ko chhone lage ga.“",
  "bukhari|6533": "sab se pehle jis cheez ka faislah logon ke darmiyan ho ga wo nahaq khun ke badlah ka ho ga.“",
  "bukhari|6544": "jab ahl jannat jannat mein aur ahl jahannam jahannam mein dakhil ho jayein ge to ek aawaz dene waala un ke darmiyan khara ho kar pukaray ga ke ay jahannam walo! ab tumhein maut nahin aaye gi aur ay jannat walo! tumhein bhi maut nahin aaye gi balkeh hamesha yahein rehna ho ga.“",
  "bukhari|6545": "ahl jannat se kaha jaye ga ke ay ahl jannat! hamesha ( tumhein yahein ) rehna hai, tumhein maut nahin aaye gi aur ahl dozakh se kaha jaye ga ke ay dozakh walo! hamesha ( tum ko yahein ) rehna hai, tum ko maut nahin aaye gi.“",
  "bukhari|6546": "hum se Usman bin hasim ne bayan kiya, kaha hum se auf bin Abi jamila ne bayan kiya, un se aburja Imran atardi ne, un se Imran bin haseen razi Allah anhuma ne ke Nabi kareem sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne bayan kiya ke mein ne jannat mein jhank kar dekha to wahan rahne wale aksar ghareeb log the aur mein ne jahannam mein jhank kar dekha ( shab meraj mein ) to wahan auratein thin.",
  "bukhari|6551": "kafir ke donon shanon ke darmiyan tez chalne wale ke liye teen din ki musafat ka faaslah ho ga.“",
  "bukhari|6552": "jannat mein ek darakht hai jis ke saaya mein soar sau saal tak chalne ke baad bhi use tay nahin kar sakay ga.“",
  "bukhari|6553": "jannat mein ek darakht ho ga jis ke saaya mein umdah aur tez raftar ghode par soar shakhs sau saal tak chalta rahe ga aur phir bhi use tay na kar sakay ga.“",
  "bukhari|6554": "meri ummat mein sattar hazaar ya saat lakh aadmi jannat mein jayein ge.“ raawi ko shak hua ke sahal se kaun see tadaad bayan hui thi, ” ( wo jannat mein us tarah dakhil hoon ge ke ) wo ek doosre ko thame hue hoon ge. un ka pahla abhi andar dakhil na hone paye ga ke jab tak aakhri bhi dakhil na ho jaye. un ke chehre chodhwen raat ke chaand ki tarah roshan hoon ge.“",
  "bukhari|6555": "jannat wale ( apne oopar ke darjon ke ) balakhanon ko us tarah dekhen ge jaise tum aasmaan mein sataron ko dekhte ho.“",
  "bukhari|6561": "qiyamat ke din azaab ke aitebar se sab se kam wo shakhs ho ga jis ke donon qadmon ke neeche aage ka angarah rakha jaye ga aur us ki wajah se us ka dimagh khol raha ho ga.",
  "bukhari|6564": "mumkin hai qiyamat ke din meri shafaat un ke kaam aao jaye aur unhein jahannam mein takhnon tak rakha jaye jis se un ka bheja kholta rahe ga.",
  "bukhari|6566": "ek jamaat jahannam se Muhammad ( sallallahu alaihi wasallam ) ki shafaat ki wajah se niklay gi aur jannat mein dakhil ho gi jin ko «jahanmeen.» ke naam se pukara jaye ga.“",
  "bukhari|6569": "jannat mein jo bhi dakhil ho ga use us ka jahannam ka thikana bhi dikhaya jaye ga ke agar nafarmani ki hoti ( to wahan use jagah milti ) takeh wo aur zyada shukr kare aur jo bhi jahannam mein dakhil ho ga use us ka jannat ka thikana bhi dikhaya jaye ga ke agar achhe amal ke hote ( to wahan jagah milti ) takeh us ke liye hasrat wa afsos ka baais ho.",
  "bukhari|6572": "hum se masdad ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha hum se abooanah ne bayan kiya, un se Abdul Malik ne bayan kiya, un se Abdullah bin Haris bin nufl ne bayan kiya aur un se abbas razi Allah anhu ne bayan kiya ke unhon ne Nabi kareem sallallahu alaihi wasallam se puchha: kiya aap ne abutalb ko koi nafa pahunchaya?",
  "bukhari|6578": "mujh se amru bin Muhammad ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha hum se hashim ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha hum ko abubshar aur Ata bin saib ne khabar di, unhein Saeed bin jabeer ne aur un se Abdullah bin abbas razi Allah anhuma ne bayan kiya ke kausar se murad bahut zyada bhalai ( khair kaseer ) hai jo Allah ta'ala ne Nabi kareem sallallahu alaihi wasallam ko di hai. abubshar ne bayan kiya ke mein ne Saeed bin jabeer se kaha ke baaz logon ka khayal hai ke kausar jannat mein ek nahar hai to unhon ne kaha ke jo nahar jannat mein hai wo bhi us khair ( bhalai ) ka ek hissah hai jo Allah ta'ala ne Nabi kareem sallallahu alaihi wasallam ko di hai.",
  "bukhari|658": "jab namaz ka waqt aao jaye to tum donon azaan do aur iqamat kaho, phir jo tum mein bara hai wo Imam banay.",
  "bukhari|6581": "hum se aboalolid ne bayan kiya, kaha hum se Hammam ne bayan kiya, un se Qatadah ne, un se Anas razi Allah anhu ne aur un se Nabi kareem sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne (doosri sanad) aur hum se hadba bin Khalid ne bayan kiya, kaha hum se Hammam ne bayan kiya, kaha hum se Qatadah ne bayan kiya, kaha hum se Anas bin Malik ne bayan kiya aur un se Nabi kareem sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne bayan kiya ke mein jannat mein chal raha tha ke mein ek nahar par pahuncha us ke donon kanaron par kholdar motiyon ke gumbad banay hue the. mein ne puchha: Jibreel! ye kiya hai? unhon ne kaha ye kausar hai jo aap ke Rabb ne aap ko diya hai. mein ne dekha ke us ki khushboo ya mitti tez mashak jaisi thi. raawi hadba ko shak tha.",
  "bukhari|661": "haan! ek raat Isha ki namaz mein aap sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne adhi raat tak der ki. namaz ke baad hamari taraf mutujah hue aur farmaya, log namaz parh kar sau chakay hoon ge. aur tum log us waqt tak namaz hi ki halat mein the jab tak tum namaz ka intizaar karte rahe. Anas razi Allah anhu ne farmaya jaise us waqt mein aap sallallahu alaihi wasallam ki anguthi ki chamak dekh raha hoon ( yaani aap sallallahu alaihi wasallam ki anguthi ki chamak ka saman meri aankhon mein hai ).",
  "bukhari|662": "jo shakhs masjid mein subah shaam baar baar hazri deta hai. Allah ta'ala jannat mein us ki mahmani ka saman kare ga. wo subah shaam jab bhi masjid mein jaye.",
  "bukhari|663": "kiya subah ki chaar rakaatein parhta hai? kiya subah ki chaar rakaatein ho gin? us hadees ki matabat ghandar aur Muadh ne Shubah se ki hai jo Malik se riwayat karte hain. Ibn Ishaq ne Saad se, unhon ne hifas se, wo Abdullah bin bahina se aur Hammad ne kaha ke humein Saad ne hifas ke wastah se khabar di aur wo Malik ke wastah se.",
  "bukhari|666": "illa saloa fi alrhal» ke logo! apni qiyam gahon par hi namaz parh low. phir farmaya ke Nabi kareem sallallahu alaihi wasallam sardi wa baarish ki raton mein mozan ko hukm dete the ke wo ailan kar de ke logo apni qiyam gahon par hi namaz parh low.",
  "bukhari|669": "badal ka ek tukda aaya aur barsa yahan tak ke ( masjid ki chhat ) tapkane lagi jo khajoor ki shakhon se banayi gayi thi. phir namaz ke liye takbeer hui. mein ne dekha ke Nabi kareem sallallahu alaihi wasallam keechad aur paani mein sajdah kar rahe the. keechad ka nishan aap ki peshani par bhi mein ne dekha.",
  "bukhari|671": "agar shaam ka khana samne rakha jaye aur idhar namaz ke liye takbeer bhi hone lage to pehle khana kha low.",
  "bukhari|672": "jab shaam ka khana hazir kiya jaye to Maghrib ki namaz se pehle khana kha low aur khane mein be mazah bhi na hona chahiye aur apna khana chhor kar namaz mein jaldi mat karo.",
  "bukhari|674": "agar tum mein se koi khana kha raha ho to jaldi na kare, balkeh poori tarah kha lay go ( agarchah ) namaz khadi kyun na ho gayi ho. abwabdallah ( Imam Bukhari rahimahu Allah ) ne kaha aur mujh se Ibrahim bin almanzar ne wahab bin Usman se ye hadees bayan ki aur wahab madni hain.",
  "bukhari|675": "hum se Abdul Aziz bin Abdullah ne bayan kiya, kaha ke hum se Ibrahim bin Saad ne Salih bin kisan se bayan kiya, unhon ne Ibn Shihab se, unhon ne kaha ke mujh ko jafar bin amru bin amia ne khabar di ke un ke baap amru bin amia ne bayan kiya ke mein ne Rasool Allah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ko dekha ke aap sallallahu alaihi wasallam bakri ki ran ka gosht kat kat kar kha rahe the. itne mein aap sallallahu alaihi wasallam namaz ke liye balae gaye aap sallallahu alaihi wasallam khare hue aur chari daal di, phir aap sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne namaz padhai aur wuzu nahin kiya.",
  "bukhari|676": "hum se Adam bin Abi yas ne bayan kiya, kaha ke hum se Shubah ne bayan kiya, kaha ke hum se hukm bin atba ne Ibrahim nakhi se bayan kiya, unhon ne aswad bin yazid se, unhon ne kaha ke mein ne Aishah razi Allah anha se puchha ke Rasool Allah sallallahu alaihi wasallam apne ghar mein kiya kiya karte the aap ne batlaia ke Nabi kareem sallallahu alaihi wasallam apne ghar ke kaam kaj yaani apne ghar waliyon ki khidmat kiya karte the aur jab namaz ka waqt hota to fora ( kaam kaj chhor kar ) namaz ke liye chale jate the.",
  "bukhari|68": "hum se Muhammad bin Yusuf ne bayan kiya, unhein Sufyan ne Aamash se khabar di, wo abooail se riwayat karte hain, wo Abdullah bin Masood razi Allah anhu se ke Rasool Allah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne humein naseehat farmanay ke liye kuchh din maqrar kar diye the us dar se ke kahin hum kabidah khatir na ho jayein.",
  "bukhari|686": "tum log apne ghar mein jis jagah pasand karo mein namaz parh doon mein jahan chahta tha us ki taraf mein ne isharah kiya. phir aap khare ho gaye aur hum ne aap ke peeche saf bandh li. phir aap ne jab salaam phira to hum ne bhi salaam phira.",
  "bukhari|69": "aasani karo aur sakhti na karo aur khush karo aur nafrat na dalao.",
  "bukhari|691": "kiya tum mein wo shakhs jo ( ruku ya sajdah mein ) Imam se pehle apna sir utha leta hai us baat se nahin darta ke kahin Allah paak us ka sir gadhe ke sir ki tarah bina de ya us ki soorat ko gadhe ki see soorat bina de.",
  "bukhari|693": "( apne hakim ki ) suno aur itaat karo, khwah ek isa habshi ( ghulam tum par ) kyun na hakim bina diya jaye jis ka sir sokhe hue angoor ke barabar ho.",
  "bukhari|694": "Imam logon ko namaz padhate hain. pas agar Imam ne theek namaz padhai to us ka sawaab tumhein mile ga aur agar ghalti ki to bhi ( tumhari namaz ka ) sawaab tum ko mile ga aur ghalti ka wabaal un par rahe ga.",
  "bukhari|696": "( hakim ki ) sun aur itaat kar. khwah wo ek isa habshi ghulam hi kyun na ho jis ka sir manqe ke barabar ho.",
  "bukhari|700": "hum se Muslim bin Ibrahim ne bayan kiya, kaha ke hum se Shubah ne amru bin dinar se bayan kiya, unhon ne Jabir bin Abdullah se ke Muadh bin jabal razi Allah anhu, Nabi kareem sallallahu alaihi wasallam ke saath namaz parhte phir wapas aao kar apni qaum ki imamat kiya karte the.",
  "bukhari|703": "jab koi tum mein se logon ko namaz padhaye to takhfif kare kyunki jamaat mein zaeef bimar aur boodhay ( sab hi ) hote hain, lekin akela padhe to jis qadr ji chahe tool de sakta hai.",
  "bukhari|706": "hum se abumamar Abdullah bin amru ne bayan kiya, kaha ke hum se abdalwars bin Saeed ne bayan kiya, kaha ke hum se Abdul Aziz bin sahib ne Anas bin Malik razi Allah anhu se bayan kiya ke Nabi kareem sallallahu alaihi wasallam namaz ko mukhtasar aur poori parhte the.",
  "bukhari|707": "mein namaz der tak parhne ke irada se khara hota hoon. lekin kisi bachche ke roney ki aawaz sun kar namaz ko halki kar deta hoon, kyunki us ki maa ko ( jo namaz mein sharik ho gi ) takleef mein daalna bura samajhta hoon. waled bin Muslim ke saath us riwayat ki matabat bashr bin bakr, baqiah bin waled aur Ibn mubarak ne ozai ke wastah se ki hai.",
  "bukhari|708": "hum se Khalid bin mukhlid ne bayan kiya, kaha ke hum se sulaiman bin Bilal ne bayan kiya, kaha ke hum se sharik bin Abdullah bin Abi namar qureshi ne bayan kiya, kaha ke mein ne Anas bin Malik razi Allah anhu se suna, unhon ne batlaia ke Nabi kareem sallallahu alaihi wasallam se zyada halki lekin kamil namaz mein ne kisi Imam ke peeche kabhi nahin parhi. aap sallallahu alaihi wasallam ka ye hal tha ke agar aap sallallahu alaihi wasallam bachche ke roney ki aawaz sun lete to us khayal se ke us ki maa kahin preshani mein na mabatla ho jaye namaz mukhtasar kar dete.",
  "bukhari|709": "mein namaz sharwa kar deta hoon. irada ye hota hai ke namaz tavil karun, lekin bachche ke roney ki aawaz sun kar mukhtasar kar deta hoon kyunki mujhe maloom hai ke maa ke dil par bachche ke roney se kaisi chut parti hai.",
  "bukhari|71": "hum se Saeed bin afir ne bayan kiya, un se wahab ne yunis ke waste se naqal kiya, wo Ibn Shihab se naqal karte hain, un se Humaid bin Abdur Rahman ne kaha ke mein ne Muawiyah se suna. wo khatba mein farma rahe the ke mein ne Rasool Allah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ko ye farmate hue suna ke jis shakhs ke saath Allah ta'ala bhalai ka irada kare use deen ki samajh inayat farma deta hai aur mein to mehaz taqsim karne waala hoon, dene waala to Allah hi hai aur ye ummat hamesha Allah ke hukm par qaim rahe gi aur jo shakhs un ki mukhalfat kare ga, unhein nuqsaan nahin pahuncha sakay ga, yahan tak ke Allah ka hukm ( qiyamat ) aao jaye ( aur ye alam fana ho jaye ).",
  "bukhari|711": "hum se sulaiman bin harab aur aboalnaman Muhammad bin fazal ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha ke hum se Hammad bin Zaid ne bayan kiya, unhon ne Ayyub sakhtiyani se, unhon ne amru bin dinar se, unhon ne Jabir razi Allah anhu se farmaya ke Muadh razi Allah anhu, Nabi kareem sallallahu alaihi wasallam ke saath namaz parhte phir wapas aao kar apni qaum ko namaz padhate the.",
  "bukhari|717": ". namaz mein apni safon ko barabar kar low, nahin to Allah ta'ala tumhara munh ulat de ga.",
  "bukhari|72": "darakhton mein ek darakht isa hai us ki misal musalman ki tarah hai. ( Ibn Umar razi Allah anhuma kehte hain ke ye sun kar ) mein ne irada kiya ke arz karun ke wo ( darakht ) khajoor ka hai magar choonkeh mein sab mein chhota tha us liye khamosh raha. ( phir ) Rasool Allah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne khud hi farmaya ke wo khajoor hai.",
  "bukhari|723": "safin barabar rakho kyunki safon ka barabar rakhna namaz ke qaim karne mein dakhil hai.",
  "bukhari|724": "aur to koi baat nahin sirf log safin barabar nahin karte. aur aqbah bin abeed ne bashir bin yasar se yun riwayat kiya ke Anas razi Allah anhu hamare pass madinah tashreef laye. phir yahi hadees bayan ki.",
  "bukhari|7270": "ay Allah! use Quran ka ilm sikha.“",
  "bukhari|7271": "hum se Abdullah bin sabaah ne bayan kiya, kaha hum se matamar bin sulaiman ne bayan kiya, kaha ke mein ne auf arabi se suna ‘ un se aboalmanhal ne bayan kiya, unhon ne abubarzah razi Allah anhu se suna, unhon ne kaha ke Allah ta'ala ne tumhein Islam aur Muhammad sallallahu alaihi wasallam ke zariya gani kar diya hai ya buland darjah kar diya hai.",
  "bukhari|7274": "anbia mein se koi Nabi isa nahin jin ko kuchh nishaniyan ( yaani majzaat ) na diye gaye hoon jin ke mutabiq un par imaan laya gaya ( aap sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne farmaya ke ) insaan imaan laye aur mujhe jo bara majazah diya gaya wo Quran majid hai jo Allah ne meri taraf bheja, pas mein umeed karta hoon ke qiyamat ke din shumar mein tamam anbia se zyada perwi karne wale mere hoon ge.“",
  "bukhari|7276": "amanat dari aasmaan se baaz logon ke dilon ki jadon mein utari, ( yaani un ki fitrat mein dakhil hai ) aur Quran majid nazil hua to unhon ne Quran majid ka matlab samjha aur sunnat ka ilm hasil kiya to Quran wa hadees donon se us imandari ko jo fatarti thi poori quwwat mil gayi.",
  "bukhari|7280": "sari ummat jannat mein jaye gi sawaey un ke janhon ne inkaar kiya.“ sahabah ne arz kiya: ya Rasool Allah! inkaar kaun kare ga? farmaya ”jo meri itaat kare ga wo jannat mein dakhil ho ga aur jo meri nafarmani kare ga us ne inkaar kiya.“",
  "bukhari|7282": "hum se abunim fazal bin dakin ne bayan kiya, kaha hum se Sufyan Sauri ne bayan kiya, un se Aamash ne, un se ibrahimi ne, un se Hammam ne aur un se Huzaifah razi Allah anhu ne kaha ke ay Quran wa hadees parhne walo! tum agar Quran wa hadees par na jamo ge, idhar idhar dayein bayein raasta low ge to bhi gumrah ho ge bahut hi bare gumrah.",
  "bukhari|7293": "humein taklif ikhtiyar karne se mana kiya gaya hai.",
  "bukhari|7295": "tumhare walid falan hain. aur ye aayat nazil hui «ya aiha alzain aamnoa la tasaloa an ashya» ”ay logo! aisi cheezain na poocho.“ alaia.",
  "bukhari|7296": "insaan barabar sawaal karta rahe ga, yahan tak ke sawaal kare ga ke ye to Allah hai, har cheez ka paida karne waala lekin Allah ko kis ne paida kiya.“",
  "bukhari|73": "hum se hamidi ne bayan kiya, un se Sufyan ne, un se Ismail bin Abi Khalid ne doosre lafzon mein bayan kiya, un lafzon ke alawah jo Zuhri ne hum se bayan ke, wo kehte hain mein ne Qais bin Abi Hazim se suna, unhon ne Abdullah bin Masood razi Allah anhu se suna, wo kehte hain ke Rasool Allah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ka irshad hai ke hasad sirf do baton mein jaiz hai. ek to us shakhs ke baare mein jise Allah ne daulat di ho aur wo us daulat ko rah haq mein kharch karne par bhi qadrat rakhta ho aur ek us shakhs ke baare mein jise Allah ne hikmat ( ki daulat ) se nawaza ho aur wo us ke zariya se faislah karta ho aur ( logon ko ) us hikmat ki taleem deta ho.",
  "bukhari|7316": "rushk do hi aadmiyon par ho sakta hai, ek wo jaise Allah ne maal diya aur use ( maal ko ) rah haq mein latanay ki poori tarah tufiq mali hoti hai aur doosra wo jise Allah ne hikmat di hai aur us ke zariya faislah karta hai aur us ki taleem deta hai.“",
  "bukhari|7320": "tum apne se pehli ummaton ki ek ek balshat aur ek ek gaz mein atbaa karo ge, yahan tak ke agar wo kisi goa ke surakh mein dakhil hue hoon ge to tum us mein bhi un ki atbaa karo ge.“ hum ne puchha: ya Rasool Allah! kiya yahud wa nasara murad hain? farmaya phir aur kaun.",
  "bukhari|7326": "hum se abunim ne bayan kiya, kaha hum se Sufyan bin Uyainah ne bayan kiya, un se Abdullah bin dinar ne aur un se Ibn Umar razi Allah anhuma ne ke Nabi kareem sallallahu alaihi wasallam qabah mein tashreef late the, kabhi paidal aur kabhi soari par.",
  "bukhari|7329": "hum se Ayyub bin salman ne bayan kiya, kaha hum se Abu Bakr bin awais ne bayan kiya, un se sulaiman bin Bilal ne, un se Salih bin kisan ne, un se Ibn Shihab ne bayan kiya ke mujhe Anas bin Malik razi Allah anhu ne khabar di ke Rasool Allah sallallahu alaihi wasallam Asr ki namaz parh kar un gaon mein jate jo madinah ki bulandi par waqa hain wahan pahunch jate aur sooraj buland rehta. wali madinah ka bhi yahi hukm hai aur lais ne bhi us hadees ko yunis se riwayat kiya, us mein itna zyada hai ke ye gaon madinah se teen chaar mail par waqa hain.",
  "bukhari|733": "Imam us liye hai ke us ki perwi ki jaye. us liye jab wo takbeer kahe to tum bhi takbeer kaho. jab wo ruku kare to tum bhi ruku karo. jab wo sir athae to tum bhi uthao aur jab wo «sama Allah lemon hamdh» kahe to tum «Rabbana luck Alhamd» aur jab wo sajdah kare to tum bhi karo.",
  "bukhari|7331": "ay Allah! un madinah walon ke pimana mein unhein barkat de aur un ke saa aur mudd mein unhein barkat de.“ aap sallallahu alaihi wasallam ki murad ahl madinah ( ke saa wa mudd ) se thi ( madni saa aur mudd ko bhi tarikhi azmath hasil hai ).",
  "bukhari|7333": "hum se Ismail ne bayan kiya, kaha mujh se Imam Malik ne bayan kiya, un se matlab ke maula amru ne aur un se Anas bin Malik razi Allah anhu ne ke ahad pahad Rasool Allah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ko ( raaste mein ) dikhai diya to aap sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne farmaya ke ye wo pahad hai jo hum se mohabbat rakhta hai aur hum us se mohabbat rakhte hain. ay Allah! Ibrahim alaihi assalam ne makkah ko harmat waala qarar diya tha aur mein tere hukm se us ke donon pathrilay kanaron ke darmiyani elaqah ko harmat waala qarar deta hoon. us riwayat ki matabat sahal razi Allah anhu ne Nabi kareem sallallahu alaihi wasallam se ahad ke mutalliq ki hai.",
  "bukhari|7335": "mere hajrah aur mere manbar ke darmiyan ki zamin jannat ke baghon mein se ek bagh hai aur mera ye manbar mere hoz par ho ga.“",
  "bukhari|7336": "hum se Musa bin Ismail ne bayan kiya, kaha hum se jaweria ne bayan kiya, un se Nafi ne aur un se Abdullah razi Allah anhu ne bayan kiya ke Rasool Allah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne ghodon ki dod karayi aur wo ghode chhode gaye jo ghor dod keliye tayar ke gaye the to un ke dodne ka maidan maqam hafia se saniat aludaa tak tha aur jo tayar nahin ke gaye the un ke dodne ka maidan saniat aludaa se masjid bani zariq tak tha aur Abdullah razi Allah anhu bhi un logon mein the janhon ne maqable mein hissah liya tha.",
  "bukhari|7339": "hum se Muhammad bin bashar ne bayan kiya, kaha hum se abdalaali ne bayan kiya, kaha hum se Hisham bin hasan ne bayan kiya, un se Hisham bin Urwah ne bayan kiya, un se un ke walid ne ke Aishah razi Allah anha ne bayan kiya ke mere aur Rasool Allah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ke liye ye lagan rakhi jati thi aur hum donon us se ek saath nahate the.",
  "bukhari|734": "Imam us liye hai ke us ki perwi ki jaye, us liye jab wo takbeer kahe to tum bhi takbeer kaho. jab wo ruku kare to tum bhi ruku karo aur jab wo «sama Allah lemon hamdh» kahe to tum «Rabbana walk Alhamd» aur jab wo sajdah kare to tum bhi sajdah karo aur jab wo baitth kar namaz padhe to tum sab bhi baitth kar namaz parho.",
  "bukhari|7342": "hum se abukrib ne bayan kiya, kaha hum se aboasama ne bayan kiya, kaha hum se barid ne bayan kiya, kaha ke mein madinah manoorah aaya aur Abdullah bin salaam razi Allah anhu se meri mulaqat hui to unhon ne kaha ke mere saath ghar chalo to mein tumhein us pyalah mein plaon ga jis mein Rasool Allah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne piya tha aur phir hum us namaz parhne ki jagah namaz padhen ge jahan Nabi kareem sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne namaz parhi thi. chunaanchah mein un ke saath gaya aur unhon ne mujhe sato pilaya aur khajoor khalai aur mein ne un ke namaz parhne ki jagah namaz parhi.",
  "bukhari|7345": "hum se Abdur Rahman bin mubarak ne bayan kiya, kaha hum se fazeel ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha hum se Musa bin aqbah ne bayan kiya, un se salim bin Abdullah ne, un se un ke walid Abdullah bin Umar razi Allah anhuma ne ke Nabi kareem sallallahu alaihi wasallam ko jab ke aap maqam zulhalifa mein parao ke hue the, khawab dikhaya gaya aur kaha gaya ke aap ek mubarak wadi mein hain.",
  "bukhari|735": "Allah akbar» kehte aur jab apna sir ruku se athate to donon haath bhi athate ( rafa yadin karte ) aur ruku se sir mubarak athate hue «sama Allah lemon hamdh, Rabbana walk Alhamd» kehte the. sajdah mein jate waqt rafa yadin nahin karte the.",
  "bukhari|7355": "hum se Hammad bin Humaid ne bayan kiya, kaha hum se Ubaidullah bin Muadh ne, kaha hum se hamare walid Muadh bin hasan ne bayan kiya, un se Shubah bin hajjaj ne bayan kiya, un se Saad bin Ibrahim ne, un se Muhammad bin almankdar ne bayan kiya, un se Saad bin Ibrahim ne, un se Muhammad bin almankdar ne bayan kiya ke mein ne Jabir bin Abdullah razi Allah anhuma ko dekha ke wo Ibn siyad ke waqia par Allah ki qasam khate the. mein ne un se kaha ke aap Allah ki qasam khate hain? unhon ne kaha ke mein ne Umar razi Allah anhu ko Nabi kareem sallallahu alaihi wasallam ke samne Allah ki qasam khate dekha aur Nabi kareem sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne us par koi inkaar nahin farmaya.",
  "bukhari|736": "sama Allah lemon hamdh» albatah sajdah mein aap rafa yadin nahin karte the.",
  "bukhari|7361": "Abu al-Yaman Imam Bukhari rahimahu Allah ke shaikh ne bayan kiya ke hum ko Shuaib ne khabar di, unhein Zuhri ne, unhein Humaid bin Abdur Rahman ne khabar di, unhon ne Muawiyah razi Allah anhu se suna wo madine mein quraish ki ek jamaat se hadees bayan kar rahe the. Muawiyah razi Allah anhu ne kaab ahbar ka zikr kiya aur farmaya jitne log ahl kitaab se ahadees naqal karte hain un sab mein kaab ahbar bahut sachche the aur bawajood us ke kabhi kabhi un ki baat jhoot nikalti thi, ye matlab nahin hai ke kaab ahbar jhoot boltay the.",
  "bukhari|7362": "ahl kitaab ki na tasdiq karo aur na un ki takzeeb karo kyunki hum imaan laye Allah par aur us par jo hum par nazil hua aur jo hum se pehle tum par nazil hua aaqar aayat tak jo surat albaqrah mein hai.",
  "bukhari|7364": "jab tumhare dil mile rahein Quran parho aur jab tum mein ikhtelaaf ho jaye to us se door ho jao.“",
  "bukhari|7365": "jab tak tumhare dilon mein atahaad wa ittefaq ho Quran parho aur jab ikhtelaaf ho jaye to us se door ho jao.“ aur yazid bin harun wasti ne harun aur se bayan kiya, un se aboamran ne bayan kiya, un se jandab razi Allah anhu ne Nabi kareem sallallahu alaihi wasallam se bayan kiya.",
  "bukhari|7368": "Maghrib ki namaz se pehle bhi namaz parho aur teesri martabah mein farmaya ke jis ka ji chahe kyunki aap sallallahu alaihi wasallam pasand nahin karte the ke use log lazmi sunnat bina lein.",
  "bukhari|737": "hum se Ishaq bin shahin wasti ne bayan kiya, kaha ke hum se Khalid bin Abdullah tahan ne bayan kiya Khalid haza se, unhon ne abuqlaba se ke unhon ne Malik bin hoers sahabi ko dekha ke jab wo namaz sharwa karte to takbeer tahrima ke saath rafa yadin karte, phir jab ruku mein jate us waqt bhi rafa yadin karte aur jab ruku se sir athate tab bhi karte aur unhon ne bayan kiya ke Rasool Allah sallallahu alaihi wasallam bhi isi tarah kiya karte the.",
  "bukhari|739": "sama Allah lemon hamdh» kehte tab bhi ( rafa yadin karte ) donon haathon ko athate aur jab qaadah auli se uthte tab bhi rafa yadin karte. aap ne us faal ko Nabi kareem sallallahu alaihi wasallam tak pahunchaya. ( ke Nabi kareem sallallahu alaihi wasallam isi tarah namaz parha karte the.)",
  "bukhari|740": "hum se Abdullah bin muslma qanbi ne bayan kiya Imam Malik rahimahu Allah se, unhon ne abuhazam bin dinar se, unhon ne sahal bin Saad razi Allah anhu se ke logon ko hukm diya jata tha ke namaz mein dayan haath bayein klai par rakhen, abuhazam bin dinar ne bayan kiya ke mujhe achhi tarah yaad hai ke aap use Rasool Allah sallallahu alaihi wasallam tak pahunchate the. Ismail bin Abi awais ne kaha ke ye baat Nabi kareem sallallahu alaihi wasallam tak pahunchayi jati thi yun nahin kaha ke pahunchate the.",
  "bukhari|743": "alhamdulillah Rabb alaalameen» se sharwa karte the.",
  "bukhari|747": "hum se hajjaj bin minhaal ne bayan kiya, kaha ke hum se Shubah ne bayan kiya, kaha ke humein aboashaq amru bin Abdullah sabii ne khabar di, kaha ke mein ne Abdullah bin yazid razi Allah anhu se suna ke aap khatba de rahe the. aap ne bayan kiya ke hum se bara bin azb razi Allah anhu ne bayan kiya aur wo jhute nahin the ke jab wo ( sahabah ) Nabi kareem sallallahu alaihi wasallam ke saath namaz parhte to Nabi kareem sallallahu alaihi wasallam ke ruku se sir athane ke baad us waqt tak khare rehte jab tak dekhte ke aap sallallahu alaihi wasallam sajdah mein chale gaye hain ( us waqt wo bhi sajde mein jate ).",
  "bukhari|749": "abhi jab mein namaz parha raha tha to jannat aur dozakh ko us deewar par dekha. us ki tasveerein us deewar mein qiblah ki taraf namudaar huin to mein ne aaj ki tarah khair aur shar kabhi nahin dekhi. aap sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne qol mazkor teen baar farmaya.",
  "bukhari|75": "ay Allah use ilm kitaab ( Quran ) ata farmayo“.",
  "bukhari|751": "hum se masdad bin masrhad ne bayan kiya, kaha ke hum se aboalahus salaam bin Sulaim ne bayan kiya, kaha ke hum se ashas bin Sulaim ne bayan kiya apne walid ke waste se, unhon ne masrooq bin ajda se, unhon ne Aishah razi Allah anha se aap ne batlaia ke mein ne Rasool Allah sallallahu alaihi wasallam se namaz mein idhar idhar dekhne ke baare mein puchha. aap sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne farmaya ke ye to daka hai jo shaitan bande ki namaz par daalta hai.",
  "bukhari|752": "hum se qatibah bin Saeed ne bayan kiya, kaha ke hum se Sufyan bin Uyainah ne Zuhri se bayan kiya, unhon ne Urwah se, unhon ne Aishah razi Allah anha se ke Nabi kareem sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne ek dhari dar chadar mein namaz parhi. phir farmaya ke us ke naqsh wa nigar ne mujhe ghafal kar diya. use lay ja kar abujham ko wapas kar do aur un se ( bajaye us ke ) sadi chadar mang lau.",
  "bukhari|753": "jab koi namaz mein hota hai to Allah ta'ala us ke munh ke samne hota hai. us liye koi shakhs samne ki taraf namaz mein na thooke. us hadees ki riwayat Musa bin aqbah aur Abdul Aziz Ibn Abi road ne Nafi se ki.",
  "bukhari|756": "jis shakhs ne surat fathaa na parhi us ki namaz nahin hui.",
  "bukhari|760": "aap sallallahu alaihi wasallam ki dadhi mubarak ke halne se.",
  "bukhari|762": "hum se makki bin Ibrahim ne bayan kiya, unhon ne Hisham dastoai se, unhon ne Yahya bin Abi kaseer se, unhon ne Abdullah bin Abi Qatadah se, unhon ne apne baap aboqtadah razi Allah anhu se ke Nabi kareem sallallahu alaihi wasallam Zuhr aur Asr ki do rakaat mein surat fathaa aur ek ek surat parhte the. aur aap sallallahu alaihi wasallam kabhi kabhi koi aayat humein suna bhi diya karte.",
  "bukhari|763": "walmarslat arfa» parhte hue suna. phir kaha ke ay bete! tum ne us surat ki telawat kar ke mujhe yaad dalaya. mein aaqar Umar mein Nabi kareem sallallahu alaihi wasallam ko Maghrib mein yahi surat parhte hue santi thi.",
  "bukhari|764": "hum se aboasm nabeel ne bayan kiya, unhon ne Abdul Malik Ibn jarij se, unhon ne Ibn Abi malika (Zuhair bin Abdullah) se, unhon ne Urwah bin Zubair se, unhon ne maroan bin hukm se, us ne kaha Zaid bin Sabit ne mujhe toka ke tumhein kiya ho gaya hai ke tum Maghrib mein chhoti chhoti sorten parhte ho. mein ne Nabi kareem sallallahu alaihi wasallam ko do lambi surton mein se ek surat parhte hue suna.",
  "bukhari|765": "hum se Abdullah bin Yusuf tanisi ne bayan kiya, kaha ke humein Imam Malik ne Ibn Shihab se khabar di, unhon ne Muhammad bin jabeer bin matam se, unhon ne apne baap (jabeer bin matam) se, unhon ne bayan kiya ke mein ne Rasool Allah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ko Maghrib mein surat altoor parhte hue suna tha.",
  "bukhari|766": "aza alsma anshqat» parhi aur sajdah ( telawat ) kiya. mein ne un se us ke mutalliq maloom kiya to batlaia ke mein ne aboalqasm sallallahu alaihi wasallam ke peeche bhi ( us aayat mein telawat ka ) sajdah kiya hai aur zindagi bhar mein us mein sajdah karun ga, yahan tak ke mein aap sallallahu alaihi wasallam se mil jaon.",
  "bukhari|770": "sach kehte ho. tum se umeed bhi isi ki hai.",
  "bukhari|776": "hum se Musa bin Ismail ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha ke hum se Hammam bin Yahya ne bayan kiya, unhon ne Yahya bin Abi kaseer ke waste se bayan kiya, unhon ne Abdullah bin Abi Qatadah se, unhon ne apne baap aboqtadah razi Allah anhu se ke Nabi kareem sallallahu alaihi wasallam Zuhr ki do pehli rakaaton mein surat fathaa aur do sorten parhte the aur aakhri do rakaat mein sirf surat fathaa parhte. kabhi kabhi humein ek aayat suna bhi diya karte the aur pehli rakaat mein qaraat doosri rakaat se zyada karte the. Asr aur subah ki namaz mein bhi aap ka yahi maamool tha.",
  "bukhari|777": "hum se qatibah bin Saeed ne bayan kiya, kaha ke hum se Jarir bin abdalhamid ne Aamash se bayan kiya, wo amarah bin amir se, wo abumamar Abdullah bin maqbrah se, unhon ne bayan kiya ke hum ne Khabbab bin Aratt razi Allah anhu se kaha ke kiya Rasool Allah sallallahu alaihi wasallam Zuhr aur Asr mein Quran majid parhte the? unhon ne jawaab diya ke haan! hum ne puchha ke aap ko maloom kis tarah hota tha. unhon ne bataya ke aap sallallahu alaihi wasallam ki resh mubarak ke halne se.",
  "bukhari|779": "hum se abunim fazal bin dakin ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha ke hum se Hisham dastoai ne bayan kiya, unhon ne Yahya bin Abi kaseer se bayan kiya, unhon ne Abdullah bin Abi Qatadah se, unhon ne apne walid aboqtadah razi Allah anhu se ke Nabi kareem sallallahu alaihi wasallam Zuhr ki pehli rakaat mein ( qaraat ) tavil karte the aur doosri rakaat mein mukhtasar. subah ki namaz mein bhi aap sallallahu alaihi wasallam isi tarah karte the.",
  "bukhari|780": "jab Imam «Aameen» kahe to tum bhi «Aameen» kaho. kyunki jis ki «Aameen» malaika ke Aameen ke saath ho gayi us ke pichhle tamam gunah maaf kar diye jayein ge. Ibn Shihab ne bayan kiya ke Rasool Allah sallallahu alaihi wasallam «Aameen» kehte the.",
  "bukhari|781": "jab koi tum mein se «Aameen» kahe aur farishton ne bhi isi waqt aasmaan par «Aameen» kahi. us tarah ek ki «Aameen» doosre ke «Aameen» ke saath mil gayi to us ke pichhle tamam gunah maaf ho jate hain.",
  "bukhari|782": "jab «ghair almaghzob alaihum wala alzalin» kahe to tum bhi «Aameen» kaho kyunki jis ne farishton ke saath «Aameen» kahi us ke pichhle tamam gunah maaf kar diye jate hain. sami ke saath us hadees ko Muhammad bin amru ne Abu Salamah se, unhon ne Abu Hurairah razi Allah anhu se, unhon ne Nabi kareem sallallahu alaihi wasallam se riwayat kiya. aur naeem majmar ne bhi Abu Hurairah razi Allah anhu se, unhon ne Nabi kareem sallallahu alaihi wasallam se.",
  "bukhari|784": "hum se Ishaq bin shahin wasti ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha ke hum se Khalid bin Abdullah tahan ne Saeed bin yas jariri se bayan kiya, unhon ne aboalala yazid bin Abdullah se, unhon ne matraf bin Abdullah se, unhon ne Imran bin haseen se ke unhon ne Ali razi Allah anhu ke saath basra mein ek martabah namaz parhi. phir kaha ke humein unhon ne wo namaz yaad dila di jo ke hum Nabi kareem sallallahu alaihi wasallam ke saath parha karte the. phir kaha ke Ali razi Allah anhu jab sir athate aur jab sir jahakate us waqt takbeer kehte.",
  "bukhari|787": "are teri maa maray! kiya ye Rasool Allah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ki see namaz nahin hai.",
  "bukhari|790": "hum se aboalolid Hisham bin Abdul Malik ne bayan kiya, kaha ke hum se Shubah ne bayan kiya, aboyafur akbar se, unhon ne bayan kiya ke mein ne masab bin Saad se suna, unhon ne kaha ke mein ne apne walid ke pehlu mein namaz parhi aur apni donon hathilion ko mila kar ranon ke darmiyan rakh liya. us par mere baap ne mujhe toka aur farmaya ke hum bhi pehle isi tarah karte the. lekin baad mein us se rok diye gaye aur hukm hua ke hum apne haathon ko ghutnon par rakhen.",
  "bukhari|791": "hum se hifas bin Umar ne bayan kiya, kaha hum se Shubah ne bayan kiya, sulaiman bin Aamash ke wastah se kaha mein ne Zaid bin wahab se suna, unhon ne bayan kiya ke Huzaifah bin yaman razi Allah anhu ne ek shakhs ko dekha ke na ruku poori tarah karta hai na sajdah. us liye aap ne us se kaha ke tum ne namaz hi nahin parhi aur agar tum mar gaye to tumhari maut us sunnat par nahin ho gi jis par Allah ta'ala ne Muhammad sallallahu alaihi wasallam ko paida kiya tha.",
  "bukhari|792": "hum se badal bin mahbar ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha ke hum se Shubah ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha ke mujhe hukm ne Ibn Abi laili se khabar di, unhon ne bara bin azb razi Allah anhu se, unhon ne batlaia ke Nabi kareem sallallahu alaihi wasallam ke ruku wa sajod, donon sajdon ke darmiyan ka waqfah aur jab ruku se sir athate to taqriban sab barabar the. siwa qiyam aur tashahad ke qud ke.",
  "bukhari|794": "subhanak Allahumma Rabbana wabhamdak, Allahumma aghfar li» parha karte the.",
  "bukhari|795": "sama Allah lemon hamdh» kehte to us ke baad «Allahumma Rabbana walk Alhamd» bhi kehte. isi tarah jab aap sallallahu alaihi wasallam ruku karte aur sir athate to takbeer kehte. donon sajdon se khare hote waqt bhi aap sallallahu alaihi wasallam «Allah akbar» kaha karte the.",
  "bukhari|796": "jab Imam «sama Allah lemon hamdh» kahe to tum «Allahumma Rabbana walk Alhamd» kaho. kyunki jis ka ye kehna farishton ke kehne ke saath ho ga, us ke pichhle tamam gunah bakhsh diye jayein ge",
  "bukhari|800": "hum se aboalolid ne bayan kiya, kaha ke hum se Shubah ne Sabit banani se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha ke Anas razi Allah anhu humein Nabi kareem sallallahu alaihi wasallam ki namaz ka tareeqa batlate the. chunaanchah aap sallallahu alaihi wasallam namaz parhte aur jab apna sir ruku se athate to itni der tak khare rehte ke hum sochne lagte ke aap sallallahu alaihi wasallam bhool gaye hain.",
  "bukhari|801": "hum se aboalolid Hisham bin Abdul Malik ne bayan kiya, kaha ke hum se Shubah ne hukm se bayan kiya, unhon ne Ibn Abi laili se, unhon ne bara bin azb razi Allah anhu se, unhon ne kaha ke Nabi kareem sallallahu alaihi wasallam ke ruku, sajdah, ruku se sir athate waqt aur donon sajdon ke darmiyan ka bethna taqriban barabar hota tha.",
  "bukhari|807": "hum se Yahya bin bakir ne bayan kiya, kaha ke mujh se bakr bin mazar ne jafar bin rabiyah se bayan kiya, unhon ne Abdur Rahman bin harmaz se, unhon ne Abdullah bin Malik bin bahina se ke Nabi kareem sallallahu alaihi wasallam jab namaz parhte sajde mein apne donon bazoon ko us qadr phela dete ke baghal ki safedi zahr ho jati thi. lais bin Saad ne bayan kiya ke mujh se bhi jafar bin rabiyah ne isi tarah hadees bayan ki.",
  "bukhari|808": "hum se salat bin Muhammad basri ne bayan kiya, kaha hum se mehdi bin maimun ne waasil se bayan kiya, unhon ne abooail se, unhon ne Huzaifah razi Allah anhu se ke unhon ne ek shakhs ko dekha jo ruku aur sajdah poori tarah nahin karta tha. jab wo namaz parh chuka to unhon ne us se farmaya ke to ne namaz hi nahin parhi. abooail ne kaha ke mujhe yaad aata hai ke Huzaifah ne ye farmaya ke agar tum mar gaye to tumhari maut Muhammad sallallahu alaihi wasallam ke tareeq par nahin ho gi.",
  "bukhari|809": "hum se qabisa bin aqbah ne bayan kiya, kaha ke hum se Sufyan Sauri ne amru bin dinar se bayan kiya, unhon ne taus se, unhon ne Ibn abbas razi Allah anhuma se, aap ne batlaia ke Nabi kareem sallallahu alaihi wasallam ko saat aaza par sajdah ka hukm diya gaya, us tarah ke na balon ko apne samitte na kapde ko ( wo saat aaza ye hain ) peshani ( maa naak ) donon haath, donon ghatne aur donon paaon.",
  "bukhari|810": "humein saat aaza par us tarah sajdah ka hukm hua hai ke hum na bal samitin na kapde.",
  "bukhari|811": "hum Nabi kareem sallallahu alaihi wasallam ki iqtadaa mein namaz parhte the. jab aap «sama Allah lemon hamdh» kehte ( yaani ruku se sir athate ) to hum mein se koi us waqt tak apni peeth na jahakata jab tak aap sallallahu alaihi wasallam apni peshani zamin par na rakh dete.",
  "bukhari|812": "mujhe saat aaza par sajdah karne ka hukm hua hai. peshani par aur apne haath se naak ki taraf isharah kiya aur donon haath aur donon ghatne aur donon paaon ki ungliyon par. us tarah ke hum na kapde samitin na bal.",
  "bukhari|814": "hum se Muhammad bin kaseer ne bayan kiya, kaha ke humein Sufyan ne abuhazam Salamah bin dinar ke waste se khabar di, unhon ne sahal bin Saad se, unhon ne kaha ke kuchh log Nabi kareem sallallahu alaihi wasallam ke saath tahbnd chhote hone ki wajah se unhein gardanon se bandh kar namaz parhte the aur auraton se keh diya gaya tha ke jab tak mard achhi tarah baitth na jayein tum apne saron ko ( sajdah se ) na uthao.",
  "bukhari|815": "Nabi kareem sallallahu alaihi wasallam ko hukm tha ke saat hadiyoon par sajdah karein aur bal aur kapde na samitin.",
  "bukhari|816": "mujhe saat hadiyoon par us tarah sajdah ka hukm hua hai ke na bal sameton aur na kapde.",
  "bukhari|817": "subhanak Allahumma Rabbana wabhamdak, Allahumma aghfar li» ( us dua ko parh kar ) aap Quran ke hukm par amal karte the.",
  "bukhari|82": "hum se Saeed bin afir ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha mujh se lais ne, un se aqeel ne Ibn Shihab ke waste se naqal kiya, wo hamza bin Abdullah bin Umar se naqal karte hain ke Abdullah bin Umar razi Allah anhuma ne farmaya mein ne Rasool Allah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ko ye farmate hue suna hai ke mein sau raha tha ( isi halat mein ) mujhe doodh ka ek pyalah diya gaya. mein ne ( khub achhi tarah ) pi liya. hatta ke mein ne dekha ke tazgi mere nakhunon se nikal rahi hai. phir mein ne apna bacha hua ( doodh ) Umar bin alkhitab ko de diya. sahabah razi Allah anhum ne puchha aap ne us ki kiya tabeer li? aap sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne farmaya ilm.",
  "bukhari|822": "sajdah mein aetadaal ko malhuz rakho aur apne bazu katon ki tarah na phelaya karo.",
  "bukhari|823": "hum se Muhammad bin sabaah ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha ke humein hashim ne khabar di, unhon ne kaha humein Khalid haza ne khabar di, abuqlaba se, unhon ne bayan kiya ke mujhe Malik bin hoers lisi razi Allah anhu ne khabar di ke aap ne Nabi kareem sallallahu alaihi wasallam ko namaz parhte dekha. aap sallallahu alaihi wasallam jab taaq rakaat mein hote to us waqt tak na uthte jab tak thori der baitth na lete.",
  "bukhari|825": "mein ne Nabi kareem sallallahu alaihi wasallam ko isi tarah karte dekha.",
  "bukhari|826": "hum se sulaiman bin harab ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha ke hum se Hammad bin Zaid ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha ke hum se ghilan bin Jarir ne bayan kiya, unhon ne matraf bin Abdullah se, unhon ne kaha ke mein ne aur Imran bin haseen razi Allah anhuma ne Ali bin Abi talib razi Allah anhu ki iqtadaa mein namaz parhi. aap ne jab sajdah kiya, sajdah se sir uthaya do rakaaton ke baad khare hue to har martabah takbeer kahi. jab aap ne salaam pher diya to Imran bin haseen ne mera haath pakad kar kaha ke unhon ne waqi humein Muhammad sallallahu alaihi wasallam ki tarah namaz padhai hai ya ye kaha ke mujhe unhon ne Muhammad sallallahu alaihi wasallam ki namaz yaad dila di.",
  "bukhari|827": "namaz mein sunnat ye hai ke ( tashahad mein ) dayan paaon khara rakhe aur bayan philade mein ne kaha ke aap to isi ( meri ) tarah karte hain aap bole ke ( kamzori ki wajah se ) mere paaon mera bojh nahin utha pate.",
  "bukhari|837": "hum se Musa bin Ismail ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha ke hum se abrahim bin Saad ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha ke hum se Ibn Shihab Zuhri ne hind bint Haris se hadees bayan ki ke (Umm almominin) Umm Salamah razi Allah anha ne farmaya ke Rasool Allah sallallahu alaihi wasallam jab ( namaz se ) salaam pherte to salaam ke khatm hote hi auratein khadi ho jatin ( bahar aanay ke liye ) aur aap sallallahu alaihi wasallam khare hone se pehle thori der thahre rehte the. Ibn Shihab rahimahu Allah ne kaha mein samajhta hoon aur poora ilm to Allah hi ko hai aap sallallahu alaihi wasallam us liye thahr jate the ke auratein jaldi chali jayein aur mard namaz se farigh ho kar un ko na payen.",
  "bukhari|838": "hum ne Rasool Allah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ke saath namaz parhi. phir jab aap sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne salaam phira to hum ne bhi salaam phira.",
  "bukhari|842": "mein Nabi kareem sallallahu alaihi wasallam ki namaz khatm hone ko takbeer ( «Allah akbar» ) ki wajah se samajh jata tha. Ali bin madini ne kaha ke hum se Sufyan ne amru ke hawale se bayan kiya ke abomabd Ibn abbas ke galamon mein sab se zyada qabil aitmad the. Ali bin madini ne bataya ke un ka naam nafiz tha.",
  "bukhari|845": "hum se Musa bin Ismail ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha ke hum se Jarir bin Hazim ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha ke hum se aburja Imran bin tamim ne samrah bin jandab razi Allah anhu se naqal kiya, unhon ne batlaia ke Nabi kareem sallallahu alaihi wasallam jab namaz ( farz ) parha chakte to hamari taraf munh karte.",
  "bukhari|847": "hum se Abdullah bin munir ne bayan kiya, unhon ne yazid bin harun se suna, unhein Humaid zili ne khabar di, aur unhein Anas bin Malik razi Allah anhu ne ke Rasool Allah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne ek raat ( Isha ki ) namaz mein der farmayi taqriban adhi raat tak. phir aaqar hajrah se bahar tashreef laye aur namaz ke baad hamari taraf munh kiya aur farmaya ke doosre log namaz parh kar sau chakay lekin tum log jab tak namaz ka intizaar karte rahe goya ke namaz mein rahe ( yaani tum ko namaz ka sawaab milta raha ).",
  "bukhari|848": "aur hum se Adam bin Abi yas ne kaha ke un se Shubah ne bayan kiya un se Ayyub sakhtiyani ne un se Nafi ne, farmaya ke Abdullah bin Umar razi Allah anhuma ( nafil ) isi jagah par parhte the aur jis jagah farz parhte aur Qasim bin Muhammad bin Abi bakr ne bhi isi tarah kiya hai aur Abu Hurairah razi Allah anhu se marfua riwayat hai ke Imam apni ( farz parhne ki ) jagah par nafil na padhe aur ye sahih nahin.",
  "bukhari|854": "jo shakhs ye darakht khaye ( aap ki murad lehsun se thi ) to wo hamari masjid mein na aaye Ata ne kaha mein ne Jabir se puchha ke aap ki murad us se kiya thi. unhon ne jawaab diya ke aap ki murad sirf kache lehsun se thi. mukhlid bin yazid ne Ibn jarij ke wastah se ( alania ke bajaye ) alantanah naqal kiya hai ( yaani aap sallallahu alaihi wasallam ki murad sirf lehsun ki badbu se thi ).",
  "bukhari|856": "jo shakhs us darakht ko khaye wo hamare qareeb na aaye hamare saath namaz na padhe.",
  "bukhari|857": "hum se Muhammad bin Musanna ne bayan kiya, kaha ke hum se ghandar ne bayan kiya, un se Shubah ne bayan kiya, unhon ne sulaiman sheebani se suna, unhon ne shabi se, unhon ne bayan kiya ke mujhe ek aise shakhs ne khabar di jo ( ek martabah ) Nabi kareem sallallahu alaihi wasallam ke saath ek akili alag thalag toti hui qabar par se guzar rahe the wahan Nabi kareem sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne namaz padhai aur log aap sallallahu alaihi wasallam ke peeche saf bandhay hue the. sulaiman ne kaha ke mein ne shabi se puchha ke abuamru aap se ye kis ne bayan kiya to unhon ne kaha ke Ibn abbas razi Allah anhuma ne.",
  "bukhari|858": "Jumuah ke din har balig ke liye ghusl zaroori hai.",
  "bukhari|862": "phir Nabi kareem sallallahu alaihi wasallam bahar aaye aur farmaya ke ( us waqt ) roye zamin par tumhare siwa aur koi us namaz ko nahin parhta, us zamanah mein madinah walon ke siwa aur koi namaz nahin parhta tha.",
  "bukhari|865": "agar tumhari biwiyan tum se raat mein masjid aanay ki ijazat mangin to tum log unhein us ki ijazat de diya karo. Ubaidullah ke saath us hadees ko Shubah ne bhi Aamash se riwayat kiya, unhon ne mujahid se, unhon ne Ibn Umar razi Allah anhuma se aur unhon ne Nabi kareem sallallahu alaihi wasallam se.",
  "bukhari|866": "hum se Abdullah bin Muhammad masndi ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha ke hum se Usman bin Umar ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha humein yunis bin yazid ne Zuhri se khabar di, unhon ne kaha ke mujhe hind bint Haris ne khabar di ke Nabi kareem sallallahu alaihi wasallam ki zujah mataharah Umm Salamah razi Allah anha ne unhein khabar di ke Rasool Allah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ke zamanah mein auratein farz namaz se salaam phirne ke fora baad ( bahar aanay ke liye ) uth jati thin. Rasool Allah sallallahu alaihi wasallam aur mard namaz ke baad apni jagah baithe rehte. jab tak Allah ko manzoor hota. phir jab Rasool Allah sallallahu alaihi wasallam uthte to doosre mard bhi khare ho jate.",
  "bukhari|867": "hum se Abdullah bin muslma qanbi ne bayan kiya, unhon ne Imam Malik rahimahu Allah se bayan kiya, (doosri sanad) aur hum se Abdullah bin Yusuf tanisi ne bayan kiya, unhein Imam Malik rahimahu Allah ne Yahya bin Saeed Ansari se khabar di, unhein amrah bint Abdur Rahman ne, un se Aishah razi Allah anha ne farmaya ke Rasool Allah sallallahu alaihi wasallam subah ki namaz parh lete phir auratein chaadarein lapait kar ( apne gharon ko ) wapas ho jati thin. andhere se un ki pehchaan na ho sakti.",
  "bukhari|868": "mein namaz ke liye khara hota hoon, mera irada ye hota hai ke namaz lambi karun lekin kisi bachche ke roney ki aawaz sun kar namaz ko mukhtasar kar deta hoon ke mujhe us ki maa ko takleef dena bura maloom hota hai.",
  "bukhari|869": "hum se Abdullah bin Yusuf tanisi ne bayan kiya, kaha ke humein Imam Malik rahimahu Allah ne Yahya bin Saeed se khabar di, un se amrah bint Abdur Rahman ne, un se Aishah razi Allah anha ne, unhon ne farmaya ke aaj auraton mein jo nayi baatein paida ho gayi hain agar Rasool Allah sallallahu alaihi wasallam unhein dekh lete to un ko masjid mein aanay se rok dete jis tarah bani israel ki auraton ko rok diya gaya tha. mein ne puchha ke kiya bani israel ki auraton ko rok diya gaya tha? aap ne farmaya ke haan.",
  "bukhari|872": "hum se Yahya bin Musa ne bayan kiya, kaha ke hum se Saeed bin mansoor ne bayan kiya, kaha ke hum se faleh bin sulaiman ne Abdur Rahman bin Qasim se bayan kiya, un se us ke baap (Qasim bin Muhammad bin Abi bakr) ne un se Aishah razi Allah anha ne ke Rasool Allah sallallahu alaihi wasallam subah ki namaz munh andhere parhte the. musalmanon ki auratein jab ( namaz parh kar ) wapas hotin to andhere ki wajah se un ki pehchaan na hoti ya wo ek doosri ko na pehchaan saktin.",
  "bukhari|873": "jab tum mein se kisi ki biwi ( namaz parhne ke liye masjid mein aanay ki ) us se ijazat mange to shohar ko chahiye ke us ko na roke.",
  "bukhari|875": "hum se Yahya bin qazaa ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha ke hum se Ibrahim bin Saad ne bayan kiya, unhon ne Zuhri se bayan kiya, un se hind bint Haris ne bayan kiya, un se Umm Salamah razi Allah anha ne, unhon ne farmaya ke Rasool Allah sallallahu alaihi wasallam jab salaam pherte to aap sallallahu alaihi wasallam ke salaam pherte hi auratein jane ke liye uth jati thin aur Nabi kareem sallallahu alaihi wasallam thori der thahre rehte khare na hote. Zuhri ne kaha ke hum ye samjhate hain, aage Allah jane, ye us liye tha takeh auratein mardon se pehle nikal jayein.",
  "bukhari|877": "tum mein se jab koi shakhs Jumuah ki namaz ke liye ana cha hai to use ghusl kar lena chahiye.",
  "bukhari|882": "der sirf itni hui ke azaan sunte hi mein ne wuzu kiya ( aur phir hazir hua ) aap ne farmaya ke kiya aap logon ne Nabi kareem sallallahu alaihi wasallam se ye hadees nahin sunni hai ke jab koi Jumuah ke liye jaye to ghusl kar lena chahiye.",
  "bukhari|884": "hai ke Jumuah ke din agarchah janabat na ho lekin ghusl karo aur apne sir dhoya karo aur khushboo lagaya karo. Ibn abbas razi Allah anhuma ne kaha ke ghusl ka hukm to theek hai lekin khushboo ke mutalliq mujhe ilm nahin.",
  "bukhari|887": "agar mujhe apni ummat ya logon ki takleef ka khayal na hota to mein har namaz ke liye un ko masoak ka hukm de deta.",
  "bukhari|888": "mein tum se masoak ke baare mein bahut kuchh keh chuka hoon.",
  "bukhari|889": "hum se Muhammad bin kaseer ne bayan kiya, ke humein Sufyan Sauri ne mansoor bin mamar aur haseen bin Abdur Rahman se khabar di, unhein abooail ne, unhein Huzaifah bin yaman razi Allah anhu ne ke Nabi kareem sallallahu alaihi wasallam jab raat ko uthte to munh ko masoak se khub saaf karte.",
  "bukhari|891": "alam tanzil» aur «hil ati Ali alansan» parha karte the.",
  "bukhari|894": "hum se Abu al-Yaman ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha ke humein Shuaib ne Zuhri se khabar di, unhon ne kaha ke mujh se salim bin Abdullah ne bayan kiya, unhon ne (apne walid) Abdullah bin Umar razi Allah anhuma se suna wo farmate the ke mein ne Rasool Allah sallallahu alaihi wasallam se suna ke tum mein se jo shakhs Jumuah parhne aaye to ghusl kare.",
  "bukhari|895": "har balig ke oopar Jumuah ke din ghusl wajib hai.",
  "bukhari|898": "Allah ta'ala ka har musalman par haq hai ke har saat din mein ek din ( Jumuah ) ghusl kare.",
  "bukhari|899": "auraton ko raat ke waqt masajdon mein aanay ki ijazat de diya karo.",
  "bukhari|9": "imaan ki saath se kuchh oopar shakhen hain. aur hea ( sharm ) bhi imaan ki ek shakh hai.",
  "bukhari|903": "hum se abdan Abdullah bin Usman ne bayan kiya, kaha ke humein Abdullah bin mubarak ne khabar di, kaha ke humein Yahya bin Saeed ne khabar di ke unhon ne amrah bint Abdur Rahman se Jumuah ke din ghusl ke baare mein puchha. unhon ne bayan kiya ke Aishah razi Allah anha farmati thin ke log apne kaamon mein mashghul rehte aur Jumuah ke liye isi halat ( mail kachil ) mein chale aate, us liye un se kaha gaya ke kash tum log ( kabhi ) ghusl kar liya karte.",
  "bukhari|904": "hum se sarij bin Numan ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha ke hum se faleh bin sulaiman ne bayan kiya, un se Usman bin Abdur Rahman bin Usman timi ne bayan kiya, un se Anas bin Malik razi Allah anhu ne ke Rasool Allah sallallahu alaihi wasallam Jumuah ki namaz us waqt parhte jab sooraj dhal jata.",
  "bukhari|906": "agar sardi zyada parti to Nabi kareem sallallahu alaihi wasallam namaz sawere parh lete. lekin jab garmi zyada hoti to thanday waqt namaz parhte. aap ki murad Jumuah ki namaz se thi. yunis bin bakir ne kaha ke humein abukhaldah ne khabar di. unhon ne sirf namaz kaha. Jumuah ka zikr nahin kiya aur bashr bin Sabit ne kaha ke hum se abukhaldah ne bayan kiya ke amer ne humein Jumuah ki namaz padhai. phir Anas razi Allah anhu se puchha ke Nabi kareem sallallahu alaihi wasallam Zuhr ki namaz kis waqt parhte the?",
  "bukhari|907": "hum se Ali bin Abdullah madini ne bayan kiya, kaha ke hum se waled bin Muslim ne bayan kiya, kaha ke hum se yazid bin Abi maryam ne bayan kiya, kaha ke hum se abaya bin rafaa bin rafa bin khadij ne bayan kiya, unhon ne bayan kiya ke mein Jumuah ke liye ja raha tha. raaste mein abwabs razi Allah anhu se meri mulaqat hui, unhon ne kaha ke mein ne Rasool Allah sallallahu alaihi wasallam se suna hai ke jis ke qadam Allah ki rah mein ghubar aalud ho gaye Allah ta'ala use dozakh par haraam kar de ga.",
  "bukhari|908": "hum se Adam bin Abi yas ne bayan kiya, kaha ke hum se Ibn Abi zib ne bayan kiya, kaha ke hum se Zuhri ne Saeed aur Abu Salamah se bayan kiya, un se Abu Hurairah razi Allah anhu ne aur un se Nabi kareem sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne (doosri sanad se bayan kiya) Imam Bukhari rahimahu Allah ne kaha aur hum se Abu al-Yaman ne bayan kiya, kaha ke humein Shuaib ne khabar di, unhein Zuhri ne aur unhein Abu Salamah bin Abdur Rahman ne khabar di, wo Abu Hurairah razi Allah anhu se riwayat karte the ke aap ne Rasool Allah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ko ye kehte hue suna ke jab namaz ke liye takbeer kahi jaye to dodte hue mat aao balkeh ( apni mamuli raftar se ) aao poore itminaan ke saath phir namaz ka jo hissah ( Imam ke saath ) palo use parh low aur jo rah jaye to use baad mein poora karo.",
  "bukhari|909": "jab tak mujhe dekh na low saf bandi ke liye khare na hua karo aur aahistagi se chalna lazim kar low.",
  "bukhari|911": "hai ke koi shakhs apne musalman bhai ko utha kar us ki jagah khud baitth jaye. mein ne Nafi se puchha ke kiya ye Jumuah ke liye hai to unhon ne jawaab diya ke Jumuah aur ghair Jumuah sab ke liye yahi hukm hai.",
  "bukhari|913": "hum se abunim fazal bin dakin ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha ke hum se Abd alazeez bin Abu Salamah majshon ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha hum se Zuhri ne bayan kiya, un se saib bin yazid ne ke Jumuah mein teesri azaan Usman bin afaan razi Allah anhu ne badhai jabka madinah mein log zyada ho gaye the jab ke Nabi kareem sallallahu alaihi wasallam ke ek hi mozan the. ( aap sallallahu alaihi wasallam ke door mein ) Jumuah ki azaan us waqt di jati jab Imam manbar par bethta.",
  "bukhari|915": "hum se Yahya bin bakir ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha ke hum se lais bin Saad ne aqeel ke waste se bayan kiya, un se Ibn Shihab ne ke saib bin yazid ne unhein khabar di ke Jumuah ki doosri azaan ka hukm Usman bin afaan razi Allah anhu ne us waqt diya jab namazi bahut zyada ho gaye the aur Jumuah ke din azaan us waqt hoti jab Imam manbar par baitha karta tha.",
  "bukhari|919": "jo Jumuah ke liye aaye wo pehle ghusl kar liya kare.",
  "bukhari|920": "hum se Ubaidullah bin Umar qoariri ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha ke hum se Khalid bin Haris ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha ke hum se Ubaidullah bin Umar ne Nafi se bayan kiya, un se Abdullah bin Umar razi Allah anhuma ne ke Nabi kareem sallallahu alaihi wasallam khare ho kar khatba dete the. phir baitth jate aur phir khare hote jaise tum log bhi aaj kal karte ho.",
  "bukhari|925": "amabad»! Zuhri ke saath us riwayat ki matabat abumaaoia aur aboasama ne Hisham se ki, unhon ne apne walid Urwah se us ki riwayat ki, unhon ne abuhmid se aur unhon ne Nabi kareem sallallahu alaihi wasallam se ke aap sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne farmaya «amabad»! aur Abu al-Yaman ke saath us hadees ko Muhammad bin Yahya ne bhi Sufyan se riwayat kiya. us mein sirf «amabad» hai.",
  "bukhari|926": "amabad»! Shuaib ke saath us riwayat ki matabat Muhammad bin waled zubaidi ne Zuhri se ki hai.",
  "bukhari|928": "hum se masdad bin masrhad ne bayan kiya, kaha ke hum se bashr bin mafzal ne bayan kiya, kaha ke hum se Ubaidullah umri ne Nafi se bayan kiya, un se Abdullah bin Umar razi Allah anhuma ne ke Nabi kareem sallallahu alaihi wasallam ( Jumuah mein ) do khatbe dete aur donon ke beach mein bethte the. ( khatba Jumuah ke beach mein ye bethna bhi masnoon tareeqa hai ).",
  "bukhari|930": "achha uth aur do rakaat namaz parh lay.",
  "bukhari|931": "athu aur do rakaat namaz ( tahiat almsajd ) parh low.",
  "bukhari|932": "hum se masdad bin masrhad ne bayan kiya, kaha ke hum se Hammad bin Zaid ne bayan kiya, un se Abd alazeez bin Anas ne bayan kiya, un se Anas bin Malik razi Allah anhu ne (doosri sanad) aur Hammad bin yunis se bhi riwayat ki Abdul Aziz aur yunis donon ne Sabit se, unhon ne Anas razi Allah anhu se ke Nabi kareem sallallahu alaihi wasallam Jumuah ka khatba de rahe the ke ek shakhs khara ho gaya aur arz kiya ya Rasool Allah sallallahu alaihi wasallam maveshi aur bakrian halak ho gin ( baarish na hone ki wajah se ) aap dua farmayen ke Allah ta'ala baarish barsae. chunaanchah aap sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne donon haath philaye aur dua ki.",
  "bukhari|934": "jab Imam Jumuah ka khatba de raha ho aur to apne pass baithe hue aadmi se kahe ke ”chip rah“ to to ne khud ek lago harkat ki.",
  "bukhari|937": "hum se Abdullah bin Yusuf tanisi ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha ke humein Imam Malik rahimahu Allah ne Nafi se khabar di, un se Abdullah bin Umar razi Allah anhuma ne bayan kiya ke Rasool Allah sallallahu alaihi wasallam Zuhr se pehle do rakaat, us ke baad do rakaat aur Maghrib ke baad do rakaat apne ghar mein parhte aur Isha ke baad do rakaatein parhte aur Jumuah ke baad do rakaatein jab ghar wapas hote tab parha karte the.",
  "bukhari|94": "hum se abdah ne bayan kiya, un se abdalsamd ne, un se Abdullah bin Musanna ne, un se samama bin Abdullah bin Anas ne, un se Anas razi Allah anhu ne bayan kiya, wo Nabi akram sallallahu alaihi wasallam se riwayat karte hain ke jab aap sallallahu alaihi wasallam salaam karte to teen baar salaam karte aur jab koi kalimah irshad farmate to use teen baar dehrate yahan tak ke khub samajh liya jata.",
  "bukhari|940": "hum se Muhammad bin aqbah sheebani ne bayan kiya, kaha ke hum se aboashaq fazari Ibrahim bin Muhammad ne bayan kiya, un se Humaid tavil ne, unhon ne Anas razi Allah anhu se suna. aap farmate the ke hum Jumuah sawere parhte, us ke baad dopahar ki neend lete the.",
  "bukhari|941": "hum se Saeed bin Abi maryam ne bayan kiya, kaha ke hum se aboghsan ne bayan kiya, kaha ke mujh se abuhazam ne sahal bin Saad razi Allah anhu se bayan kiya, unhon ne batlaia ke hum Nabi kareem sallallahu alaihi wasallam ke saath Jumuah parhte, phir dopahar ki neend liya karte the.",
  "bukhari|95": "hum se abdah ne bayan kiya, un se abdalsamd ne, un se Abdullah bin Musanna ne, un se samama bin Abdullah bin Anas ne, unhon ne Anas bin Malik razi Allah anhu se bayan kiya, wo Rasool Allah sallallahu alaihi wasallam se riwayat karte hain ke jab aap sallallahu alaihi wasallam koi kalimah irshad farmate to use teen baar lotate yahan tak ke khub samajh liya jata. aur jab kuchh logon ke pass aap sallallahu alaihi wasallam tashreef late aur unhein salaam karte to teen baar salaam karte.",
  "bukhari|98": "hum se sulaiman bin harab ne bayan kiya, un se Shubah ne Ayyub ke waste se bayan kiya, unhon ne Ata bin Abi rabah se suna, unhon ne Ibn abbas razi Allah anhuma se suna ke mein Rasool Allah sallallahu alaihi wasallam par goahi deta hoon, ya Ata ne kaha ke mein Ibn abbas par goahi deta hoon ke Nabi kareem sallallahu alaihi wasallam ( ek martabah Eid ke mauqa par mardon ki safon mein se ) niklay aur aap sallallahu alaihi wasallam ke saath Bilal razi Allah anhu the. aap ko khayal hua ke auraton ko ( khatba achhi tarah ) nahin sunayi diya. to aap sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne unhein alehdah naseehat farmayi aur sadqe ka hukm diya ( ye waaz sun kar ) koi aurat bali ( aur koi aurat ) anguthi dalne lagi aur Bilal razi Allah anhu apne kapde ke daman mein ( ye cheezain ) lene lage. us hadees ko Ismail bin alaihi ne Ayyub se riwayat kiya, unhon ne Ata se ke Ibn abbas razi Allah anhuma ne yun kaha ke mein Nabi kareem sallallahu alaihi wasallam par goahi deta hoon ( us mein shak nahin hai ). Imam Bukhari rahimahu Allah ki gharaz ye hai ke agla bab aam logon se mutalliq tha aur ye hakim aur Imam se mutalliq hai ke wo bhi auraton ko waaz sanaey.",
  "bukhari|990": "raat ki namaz do do rakaat hai phir jab koi subah ho jane se daray to ek rakaat parh lay, wo us ki sari namaz ko taaq bina de gi.",
  "bukhari|993": "raat ki namaz do, do rakaatein hai aur jab to khatm karna chahe to ek rakaat Witr parh lay jo sari namaz ko taaq bina de gi. Qasim bin Muhammad ne bayan kiya ke hum ne bahut son ko teen rakaat Witr parhte bhi paia hai aur teen ya ek ( rakaat Witr ) sab jaiz aur mujh ko umeed hai ke kisi mein qabahat na ho gi.",
  "bukhari|994": "hum se Abu al-Yaman ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha ke humein Shuaib ne Zuhri se khabar di, unhon ne kaha ke mujh se Urwah bin Zubair ne bayan kiya ke Aishah razi Allah anha ne unhein khabar di ke Rasool Allah sallallahu alaihi wasallam gayarah rakaatein ( Witr aur Tahajjud ki ) parhte the, aap sallallahu alaihi wasallam ki yahi namaz thi. murad un ki raat ki namaz thi. aap sallallahu alaihi wasallam ka sajdah un rakaaton mein itna lamba hota tha ke sir athane se pehle tum mein se koi shakhs bhi pachas aaiteyn parh sakta aur Fajr ki namaz farz se pehle aap sallallahu alaihi wasallam sunnat do rakaatein parhte the us ke baad ( zara der ) dahne pehlu par let rehte yahan tak ke mozan balaane ke liye aap sallallahu alaihi wasallam ke pass aata.",
  "bukhari|998": "Witr raat ki tamam namazon ke baad parha karo.",
  "ibnmajah|1978": "sab se behtar wo log hain jo apni auraton ke liye behtar hoon.",
  "ibnmajah|3682": "raaste mein ek darakht ki shakh ( tahni ) padi hui thi jis se logon ko takleef hoti thi, ek shakhs ne use hata diya ( takeh musaafiron aur guzarne walon ko takleef na ho ) isi wajah se wo jannat mein dakhil kar diya gaya.",
  "ibnmajah|3686": "haan! har kalija wale janwar ke jis ko pyaas lagti hai, paani plane mein sawaab hai.",
  "ibnmajah|3700": "Anas razi Allah anhu kehte hain ke Rasool Allah sallallahu alaihi wasallam hamare pass tashreef laye, ( us waqt ) hum bachche the to aap ne humein salaam kiya.",
  "ibnmajah|3792": "Allah ta'ala irshad farmata hai ke mein apne bande ke saath hota hoon, jab wo mera zikr karta hai, aur us ke hont mere zikr ki wajah se harkat mein hote hain.",
  "ibnmajah|3812": "jo shakhs sau baar «subhanallah wabhamdh» kahe to us ke gunah maaf kar diye jayein ge, agarchah samandar ke jhag ke barabar hi kyun na hoon.",
  "ibnmajah|3825": "kiya mein tumhein wo kalimah na bataon jo jannat ke khazanon mein se ek khazanah hai? mein ne arz kiya: kyun nahin, zaroor bataiye, ay Allah ke Rasool! aap sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne farmaya: wo kalimah «la hol wala quat illa ballah» hai.",
  "ibnmajah|3842": "tum Allah se faqiri, maal ki kami, zillat, zulm karne aur zulm ke jane se panah mango.",
  "ibnmajah|3983": "momin ek surakh se do baar nahin dasa jata 1؎.",
  "ibnmajah|4032": "Abdullah bin Umar razi Allah anhuma kehte hain ke Rasool Allah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne farmaya: wo momin jo logon se mil jal kar rehta hai, aur un ki iza par sabr karta hai, to us ka sawaab us momin se zyada hai jo logon se alag thalag rehta hai, aur un ki iza rasani par sabr nahin karta hai 1؎.",
  "ibnmajah|4177": "Anas bin Malik razi Allah anhu kehte hain ke agar ahl madinah mein se koi ek bandi Rasool Allah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ka haath pakadti to aap sallallahu alaihi wasallam us se apna haath na chahadate, yahan tak ke wo aap ko apni zaroorat ke liye jahan chahti lay jati 1؎.",
  "ibnmajah|4184": "hea imaan se hai, aur imaan ka badlah jannat hai, aur fahash goyi «jafa» ( zulm wa ziadati ) hai aur «jafa» ( zulm ziadati ) ka badlah jahannam hai.",
  "ibnmajah|4213": "shar se aadmi ke liye yahi kaafi hai ke wo apne Muslim bhai ki tehqeer kare.",
  "ibnmajah|4237": "Umm almominin Umm Salamah razi Allah anha kehti hain ke qasam hai us ( Allah ) ki jo aap sallallahu alaihi wasallam ko ( duniya se ) lay gaya! aap jab fot hue to aap zyada namaz ( Tahajjud ) baitth kar ada farmate the. aur aap ke nazdeek zyada pasandeedah amal wo nek amal tha jis par bandah hamishgi kare agarchah thora ho.",
  "muslim|1010": "(shabi ke bajaye ) Ibrahim ( nakhi ) ne alqmah se aur unhon ne Abd Allah se riwayat ki, kaha: mein liltah aljan ko Rasool allhasli Allah alaihi wasallam ke saath na tha aur meri khwahish thi ke mein aap ke saath hota",
  "muslim|1011": "muan ( bin Abd ar-Rahman bin Abd Allah bin Masood hazli ) se riwayat hai, kaha: mein ne apne walid se suna, kaha: mein ne masrooq se puchha: jis raat janon ne kaan laga kar ( Quran ) suna, us ki itlaa nabisli Allah alaihi wasallam ko kis ne di? unhon ne kaha: mujhe tumhare walid ( Ibn Masood razi Allah anhu ) ne bataya ke aap ko un janon ki itlaa ek darakht ne di thi. ( ye aapsli Allah alaihi wasallam ka majazah tha.)",
  "muslim|1015": ". Abu wanah ne mansoor se baqi mandah sabiqah sanad se Hazrat Abu Saeed khadri razi Allah anhu se riwayat ki ke Nabi akrmasli Allah alaihi wasallam Zuhr ki namaz mein pehli do rakaaton mein se har rakaat mein tees aayat ke baqdari qiraat farmate the aur aakhri do mein pandrah ayiton ke baqdari ya ye kaha: us ( pehli do ) se nisf. aur Asr ki pehli do rakaaton mein se har rakaat mein pandrah ayiton ke barabar aur aakhri do mein us se nisf.",
  "muslim|1018": "Shubah ne aboon se riwayat ki, unhon ne kaha ke mein ne Hazrat Jabir bin samrah razi Allah anhu se suna ke Hazrat Umar razi Allah anhu ne Hazrat Saad razi Allah anhu se kaha: logon ne aap ki har cheez hatta ke namaz ki bhi shikayat ki hai. Hazrat Saad razi Allah anhu ne kaha: mein ( ye kehta hoon ke mein ) pehli do rakaaton mein ( qiyam ko ) tool deta hoon aur aakhri do rakaaton mein takhfif karta hoon, mein ne jis tarah Rasool allhasli Allah alaihi wasallam ki aqtada mein namaz parhi thi, us mein koi kotahi nahin karta. to Umar razi Allah anhu ne kaha: aap ke baare mein yahi guman hai ya aap ke baare mein mera guman yahi hai.",
  "muslim|1020": ". atiyah bin Qais ne qazaa se, unhon ne Hazrat Abu Saeed khadri razi Allah anhu se riwayat ki, unhon ne kaha: Zuhr ki namaz iqamat kahi jati aur koi jane waala baqea jata, apni zaroorat se farigh ho kar wuzu karta, phir ( masjid mein ) aata aur Rasool allhasli Allah alaihi wasallam use lamba karne ki wajah se abhi pehli rakaat mein hote.",
  "muslim|1024": "Abu wanah ne ziyad bin elaqah se aur unhon ne Hazrat qatbah ne Malik razi Allah anhu se riwayat ki, unhon ne kaha: mein ne namaz parhi aur humein Rasool allhasli Allah alaihi wasallam ne namaz padhai, aap ﴿qa walqaran almajeed﴾ parhi hatta ke aap ne ﴿walankhal basqat﴾ ( aur kajhur ke buland wabala darakht ) parha to mein us aayat ko baar baar ( zahan mein ) dahrane laga aur aap ne jo kaha mujhe us ( ke mafhoom ) ka pata na chala.",
  "muslim|1027": "zaida ne kaha: humein samak bin harab ne Hazrat Jabir bin samrah razi Allah anhuma se hadees bayan ki ke Nabi akrmasli Allah alaihi wasallam Fajr ki namaz mein ﴿qa walqaran almajeed﴾ parha karte the, us ke bawajood aap ki namaz halki thi",
  "muslim|1030": "Abu daud tealsi ne Shubah se, unhon ne samak se aur unhon ne Hazrat Jabir bin samrah razi Allah anhuma se riwayat ki ke Nabi akrmasli Allah alaihi wasallam Zuhr ki namaz mein ﴿sabh ism rabak alaala﴾ ( aur apne parwardigar ke unche naam ki tasbeeh kar ) parhte aur subah ki namaz mein us se lambi qiraat karte the.",
  "muslim|1031": "(sulaiman ) timi ne Abu minhaal se aur unhon ne Hazrat Abu barzah razi Allah anhu se riwayat ki ke Rasool allhasli Allah alaihi wasallam subah ki namaz mein saath se sau aayat tak parha karte the.",
  "muslim|1037": ". Shubah ne adi se riwayat ki, unhon ne kaha: mein ne Hazrat bara razi Allah anhu ko Nabi akrmasli Allah alaihi wasallam se hadees bayan karte hue suna ke aapsli Allah alaihi wasallam safar mein the, aap ne Isha ki padhai to us ki ek rakaat mein ﴿waltin walziton﴾ parhi.",
  "muslim|1038": "(Shubah ke bajaye ) Yahya bin Saeed ne adi bin Sabit se aur unhon ne Hazrat bara bin azb razi Allah anhu se riwayat ki, unhon ne kaha: mein ne Rasool allhasli Allah alaihi wasallam ke saath Isha ki namaz parhi to aap ne ﴿waltin walziton﴾ ki qiraat ki.",
  "muslim|1042": "mansoor ne amru bin dinar se aur unhon ne Hazrat jabarban Abd Allah razi Allah anhuma se riwayat ki ke Muadh bin jabal razi Allah anhu Rasool allhasli Allah alaihi wasallam ke saath Isha ki namaz parha karte the, phir apni qaum mein aao kar yahi namaz un ko padhate the.",
  "muslim|1043": "(mansoor ke bajaye ) Ayyub ne amru bin dinar se aur unhon ne Hazrat Jabir bin Abd Allah razi Allah anhuma se riwayat ki ke Muadh razi Allah anhu Rasool allhasli Allah alaihi wasallam ke saath Isha ki namaz parha karte the, phir apni qaum ki masjid mein aao kar un ko namaz padhate the.",
  "muslim|1046": "jab tum mein se koi fard logon ki imamat karae to wo halki namaz padhaye kyunki un ( namazion ) mein bachche, boodhay, kamzor aur bimar bhi hote hain aur jab akela padhe to jaise chahe padhe. ‘ ‘",
  "muslim|1048": "jab tum mein se koi shakhs logon ko namaz padhaye to wo takhfif kare kyunki logon mein kamzor, bimar aur zaroorat mand bhi hote hain. ‘ ‘",
  "muslim|1049": ".... isi ke maanind, albatah us mein saqim ( bimar ) ki jagah kabir ( boodha ) kaha hai.",
  "muslim|1052": "Abd alazeez bin sahib ne Hazrat Anas razi Allah anhu se riwayat ki ke Nabi akrmasli Allah alaihi wasallam namaz mein takhfif karte aur makmal ada karte the.",
  "muslim|1055": ". Sabit banani ne Hazrat Anas razi Allah anhu se riwayat ki, unhon ne kaha: Rasool allhasli Allah alaihi wasallam maa ke saath ( aaye hue ) bachche ka rona sunte aur aap namaz mein hote to halki surat ya ( kaha ) chhoti surat parh lete.",
  "muslim|1056": "mein namaz sharwa karta hoon, mera irada lambi namaz ( parhne ) ka hota hai, phir bachche ka rona santa hoon to bachche par maa ke gham ki shiddat ki wajah se ( namaz mein ) takhfif kar deta hoon. ‘ ‘",
  "muslim|1062": "Zuhair aur Abu khisma ne apni apni sanad ke saath Abu Ishaq se aur unhon ne Abd Allah bin yazid se riwayat ki, unhon ne kaha: mujhe Hazrat bara razi Allah anhu ne hadees bayan ki aur wo jhoot nahin boltay the ke wo log ( sahabah karam ) Rasool allhasli Allah alaihi wasallam ke peeche namaz parhte the. jab aap ruku se apna sir utha lete to mein kisi ko na dekhta ke wo apni pusht jahakata ho yahan tak ke Rasool allhasli Allah alaihi wasallam apni peshani zamin par rakh dete, us ke baad aap ke peeche wale sajde mein girte.",
  "muslim|1063": "Sufyan ne Abu Ishaq se, unhon ne Abd Allah bin yazid se aur unhon ne Hazrat bara razi Allah anhu se hadees bayan ki aur wo jhoot bolnay wale na the, unhon ne kaha: Rasool Allah sallallahu alaihi wasallam jab sama Allah lemon hamdah kehte to hum mein se koi ek bhi us waqt tak apni pusht na jahakata jab tak Rasool allhasli Allah alaihi wasallam sajde mein na chale jate, phir hum aap ke baad sajde mein jate",
  "muslim|1064": "maharb bin dasar ne kaha ke mein ne Abd Allah bin yazid ko manbar par bayan karte hue suna, wo keh rahe the: bara razi Allah anhu ne humein bataya ke wo log ( sahabah karam ) Rasool allhasli Allah alaihi wasallam ke saath namaz parhte the, jab aap ruku mein chale jate to wo ruku karte aur jab aap apna sir ruku se athate to aap sama Allah lemon hamdh kehte, hum khare rehte yahan tak ke hum aap ko dekhte ke aap ne apna chehra mubarak zamin par rakh diya hai, phir hum aap ki perwi karte ( sajde mein jate.)",
  "muslim|1066": "mein qasam khata hoon peeche hatnay wale, sidhe chalne, dabak jane wale ( sataron ) ki ‘ ‘ parhte hue suna aur hum mein se koi aadmi apni pusht nahin jahakata tha hatta ke aap poori tarah sajde mein chale jate the.",
  "muslim|1067": "Allah ne sun li jis ne us ki hamd ki, ay Allah hamare Rabb! tere hi liye tareef watosif hai aasmaan bhar, zamin bhar aur un ke siwa jo to chahe us ki wasaat bhar. ‘ ‘",
  "muslim|1068": "ay Allah hamare Rabb teer ee hi tareef haasman aur zamin tak aur us alawah jahan tak to chahe us cheez ki wasaat tak.",
  "muslim|1069": "karte the: ’’ay Allah! tere liye hai hamd aasmaan bhar, zamin bhar aur un ke siwa jo cheez to chahe us ki wasaat bhar. ay Allah! mujhe paak kar de baraf ke saath, aulon ke saath aur thanday paani ke saath. ay Allah! mujhe gunahon aur khataon se us tarah saaf kar de jis tarah safed kapda mail kachil se saaf kiya jata hai. ‘ ‘",
  "muslim|1073": "aur un ke baad jo to chahe us ki wasat bhar. ‘ unhon ( hifas ) ne aage ka hissah bayan nahin kiya.",
  "muslim|1076": ". Ibn Shihab Zuhri ne kaha: mujhe Ibrahim bin Abd Allah bin hanin ne hadees sunayi ke un ke walid ne un se bayan kiya, unhon ne Hazrat Ali bin Abi talib razi Allah anhu se suna, unhon ne kaha ke mujhe Rasool allhasli Allah alaihi wasallam ne ruku aur sajde mein Quran parhne se mana farmaya.",
  "muslim|1077": "waled bin kaseer se riwayat hai ke mujhe Ibrahim bin Abd Allah bin hanin ne apne walid se bayan kiya, unhon ne Hazrat Ali bin Abi talib razi Allah anhu se suna, keh rahe the: mujhe Rasool allhasli Allah alaihi wasallam ne, jab mein ruku ya sajde mein hoon, Quran parhne se roka.",
  "muslim|1078": "Zaid bin aslam ne Ibrahim bin Abd Allah bin hanin se, unhon ne apne walid se aur unhon ne Hazrat Ali bin Abi talib razi Allah anhu se riwayat ki, unhon ne kaha: mujhe Rasool allhasli Allah alaihi wasallam ne ruku aur sajde mein ( Quran ki ) qiraat karne se mana kiya. mein ( ye ) nahin kehta: tumhein mana kiya. ( Hazrat Ali ne apne hoalaa se jo suna wahi bataya. pichli ahadees se wazeh hota hai ke hukm sab ke liye hai.)",
  "muslim|1079": "daud bin Qais ne kaha: mujhe Ibrahim bin Abd Allah bin hanin ne apne walid, unhon ne Hazrat Ibn abbas razi Allah anhu se aur unhon ne Hazrat Ali razi Allah anhu se riwayat ki, unhon ne kaha ke mere habibsli Allah alaihi wasallam ne mujhe us baat se mana farmaya tha ke mein ruku ya sajde mein Quran padhon.",
  "muslim|108": "abumaaoia ne Aamash se hadees sunayi, unhon ne Abu Sufyan se aur unhon ne Hazrat Jabir razi Allah anhu se riwayat ki ke Rasool Allah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ke pass Numan bin qoqal razi Allah anhu aaye aur kaha: ay Allah ke Rasool! aap kiya farmate hain ke jab mein farz namaz ada karun, haraam ko haraam aur halaal ko halaal samjhon to kiya mein jannat mein dakhil ho jaon ga? Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne farmaya: ’’haan! ‘ ‘",
  "muslim|1083": "bandah apne Rabb ke sab se zyada qareeb us halat mein hota hai jab wo sajde mein hota hai, lehza us mein kasrat se dua karo. ‘ ‘",
  "muslim|1084": "Allah! mere sare gunah bakhsh de, chhote bhi aur bare bhi, pehle bhi aur pichhle bhi, khale bhi aur chhapay bhi. ‘ ‘",
  "muslim|1085": "teri pakeezgi bayan karta hoon ay mere Allah! hamare Rabb! teri hamd ke saath, ay mere Allah! mujhe bakhsh de. ‘ ‘ aap ( ye kalimaat ) Quran majid ki tawil ( hukm ki tamil ) ke taur par farmaya karte the.",
  "muslim|1087": "ay mere Rabb! mein teri pakeezgi bayan karta hoon teri hamd ke saath, ay mere Allah! mujhe bakhsh de. ‘ ‘",
  "muslim|1091": "nahaayat paak hai, muqadas hai farishton aur rooh ( jabrel alaihi assalam ) ka parwardigar. ‘ ‘",
  "muslim|1094": "( kuchh ) mango. ‘ ‘ to mein ne arz ki: mein aap se ye chahta hoon ke jannat mein bhi aap ki rafaqat naseeb ho. aap ne farmaya: ’’ya us ke siwa kuchh aur? ‘ ‘ mein ne arz ki: bas yahi. to aap ne farmaya: ’’tum apne maamle mein sajdon ki kasrat se meri madad karo. ‘ ‘",
  "muslim|1096": "mujhe hukm diya gaya ke mein saat hadiyoon ( wale aaza ) par sajdah karun aur ye ke mein ( namaz mein ) na kapda adson aur na bal. ‘ ‘",
  "muslim|1097": "Sufyan bin Uyainah ne ( Abd Allah ) bin taus se aur unhon ne apne walid ke hawale se Hazrat Ibn abbas razi Allah anhuma se riwayat ki ke Nabi akrmasli Allah alaihi wasallam ko hukm diya gaya ke saat ( aaza ) par sajdah karein aur balon ko aur kapdon ko adsne se roka gaya hai.",
  "muslim|1098": "mujhe saat hadiyoon: peshani, aur ( saath hi ) aap ne apne haath se apni naak ki taraf isharah kiya, donon haathon, donon taangon ( ghutnon ) aur donon paaon ke kanaron par sajdah karne ka hukm diya gaya hai aur ye ke hum ( namaz parhte hue ) kapdon aur balon ko na adsin. ‘ ‘",
  "muslim|1099": "mujhe hukm diya gaya hai ke mein saat ( aaza ) par sajdah karun, balon aur kapdon ko aktha na karun, ( sajdah ) peshani aur naak, donon haathon, donon ghutnon aur donon paaon par ( karun. ) ‘ ‘",
  "muslim|1100": "jab bandah sajdah karta hai to us ke saath saat atraf ( kinare ya aaza ) us ka chehra, us ki donon hathilian, us ke donon ghatne aur us ke donon qadam sajdah karte hain. ‘ ‘",
  "muslim|1102": "sajde mein aetadaal ikhtiyar karo aur koi shakhs us tarah apne bazur ( zamin par ) na bachhaye jis tarah kutta bachhata hai. ‘ ‘",
  "muslim|1104": "jab tum sajdah karo to apni hathilian ( zamin par ) rakho aur apni kahnian oopar uthao",
  "muslim|1109": "wakia ne kaha: humein jafar bin barqan ne yazid bin asm se hadees sunayi, unhon ne Hazrat Maimunah bint Haris razi Allah anha se riwayat ki, unhon ne kaha: Rasool allhasli Allah alaihi wasallam jab sajdah karte to ( donon haathon ko pahluon se ) door rakhte yahan tak ke jo aap ke peeche hota wo aap ki baghlon ki safedi dekh sakta tha. wakia ne kaha: ( wazah se ) murad baghlon ki safedi hai.",
  "muslim|1113": "palan ki pichli lakdi ke masl ho. ‘ ‘",
  "muslim|1115": "Abd Allah bin Numair ne abeed Allah se, unhon ne Nafi se aur unhon ne Hazrat Ibn Umar razi Allah anhuma se riwayat ki ke jab Rasool allhasli Allah alaihi wasallam Eid ke din nikaltay to neze ka hukm dete, wo aap ke aage gad diya jata, aap us ki taraf rukh kar ke namaz parhte aur log aap ke peeche hote, safar mein bhi aap isa hi karte, us bina par hakam ne us ( nezah garne ) ko apna liya hai.",
  "muslim|1128": "jab tum mein se koi namaz parh raha ho to kisi ko aage se na guzarne de aur jahan tak mumkin ho us ko hatae agar wo na mane to us se laday kyunki wo shaitan hai. ‘ ‘ ( maqsood ye tha ke logon ko us gunah se har qimat par bachaya jaye aur namaz ki harmat ka ahtemam kiya jaye.)",
  "muslim|113": "Islam ki bunyad paanch ( raknon ) par rakhi gayi hai: us haqeeqat ki ( dil, zabaan aur baad mein zikr kiye gaye bunyadi aamaal ke zariye se ) goahi dena ke Allah ta'ala keswa koi maabud nahin aur Hazrat Muhammad sallallahu alaihi wasallam us ke bande aur us ke Rasool hain, namaz qaim karna, zakaat ada karna, bit Allah ka haj karna aur Ramazan ke roze rakhna. ‘ ‘",
  "muslim|1130": "jab tum mein se koi namaz parh raha ho to kisi ko apne aage se na guzarne de, agar wo na mane to us se laday kyunki us ki mait mein ( us ka ) hamrahi ( shaitan ) hai.",
  "muslim|1140": "Zuhri ne Urwah se aur unhon ne Hazrat Aishah razi Allah anha se riwayat ki ke Nabi akrmasli Allah alaihi wasallam raat ko namaz parhte the, mein janaze ki tarah aap ke aur qable ke darmiyan chorai mein leti hoti thi",
  "muslim|1142": "Abu bakr bin hifas ne Urwah se riwayat ki, unhon ne kaha: Hazrat Aishah razi Allah anha ne puchha: kaun see cheez namaz qataa kar deti hai? to hum ne kaha: aurat aur gadha. us par unhon ne kaha: aurat bura chopaia hai! mein ne apne aap ko dekha hai ke mein Rasool Allah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ke samne chorai rukh janaze ki tarah leti hoti thi jabka aap namaz parh rahe the.",
  "muslim|1144": "mansoor ne Ibrahim ( nakhi ) se, unhon ne aswad se aur unhon ne Hazrat Aishah razi Allah anha se riwayat ki, unhon ne farmaya: tum ne humein katon orgadhon ke barabar kar diya hai, halanka mein ne apne aap ko ( us tarah ) dekha hai ke mein chaar pai par leti hoti thi, Rasool allhasli Allah alaihi wasallam tashreef late aur charpai ke wasti mein khare ho kar namaz parhte, mein aap ke samne hona pasand na karti, us liye mein chaar pai ke paion ki taraf se khaskati yahan tak ke apne lahaf se nikal jati.",
  "muslim|1145": "Abu Salamah bin Abd ar-Rahman ne Hazrat Aishah razi Allah anha se riwayat ki, unhon ne kaha: mein Rasool allhasli Allah alaihi wasallam ke samne sau jati aur mere paaon aap ke qable ( wale hissay ) mein hote, jab aap sajdah karte to ( paaon par haath laga kar ) mujhe isharah kar dete to mein apne donon paaon sakitar leti aur jab aap khare ho jate to mein un ko phela leti. unhon ( Aishah razi Allah anha ) ne kaha: ghar un dinon aise the ke un mein charag nahin hote the.",
  "muslim|1147": "Hazrat Aishah razi Allah anha se riwayat hai ke Rasool Allah sallallahu alaihi wasallam raat ko namaz parhte aur mein haiz ki halat mein aap ke pehlu ki janib hoti. mujh par chadar hoti aur us chadar ka kuchh hissah aap ke pehlu ( ki taraf ) se aap par ( bhi ) hota.",
  "muslim|1148": "kiya tum mein se har ek ke pass do kapde hain? ‘ ‘",
  "muslim|1150": "kiya tum mein se har ek ke pass do kapde hain? ‘ ‘",
  "muslim|1151": "tum mein se koi shakhs ek kapde mein namaz us tarah na padhe ke us ke kandhon par us ka koi hissah na ho. ‘ ‘",
  "muslim|1154": "Hammad bin Zaid ne Hisham bin Urwah se, unhon ne apne walid se aur unhon ne Hazrat Umar bin Abi Salamah razi Allah anhu se riwayat ki, kaha: mein ne Rasool allhasli Allah alaihi wasallam ko Umm Salamah razi Allah anha ke ghar mein ek kapde mein namaz parhte dekha, aap ne us ke donon kanaron ko adl badal kar rakha tha, yaani dayein kinare ko bayein taraf aur bayein kinare ko dayein taraf lay gaye the",
  "muslim|1165": "hum logon ko aur logon par fazilat mali teen baton ki wajah se hamari safin farishton ki safon ki tarah ki gayi aur hamare liye sari zamin namaz ki jagah hai aur zamin ki khak hum ko paak karne wali hai jab paani na mile aur ek baat aur bayan ki.",
  "muslim|1171": "dushman par raab tari kar ke mere madad ki gayi, mujhe jame kalimaat se nawaza gaya aur mein neend ke alam mein tha ke zamin ke khazanon ki kanjian mere pass lai gin aur unhein mere haathon mein de diya gaya. ‘ ‘",
  "muslim|1172": "raab ke zariye meri madad ki gayi hai aur mujhe jame kalimaat inayat kiye gaye hain",
  "muslim|1174": "Muadh anbari ne kaha: humein Shubah ne hadees sunayi, unhon ne kaha: mujhe abotiyah ne Hazrat Anas razi Allah anhu se hadees sunayi ke Rasool allhasli Allah alaihi wasallam masjid banane se pehle bakrion ke bade mein namaz parh liya karte the.",
  "muslim|1177": "Sufyan ( Sauri ) se riwayat hai, kaha: mujhe Abu Ishaq ne hadees sunayi, kaha: mein ne Hazrat bara razi Allah anhu se suna, wo keh rahe the: hum ne Rasool Allah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ke saath sola ya satrah mah bit almaqdas ki taraf rukh kar ke namaz parhi, phir hamara rukh kaaba ki taraf pher diya gaya.",
  "muslim|1185": "Allah yahud ko halak kare! unhon ne apne anbia ki qabron ko sajdah gah bina liya. ‘ ‘",
  "muslim|1186": "Allah yahud wansari par lanat kare! unhon ne apne anbia ki qabron ko masajdin bina liya. ‘ ‘",
  "muslim|1187": "yahud wansari par Allah ki lanat ho! unhon ne apne anbia ki qabron ko masajid bina liya. ‘ ‘ aap un jaisa amal karne se draw rahe the.",
  "muslim|1190": "jis shakhs ne Allah ki khatir koi masjid banayi, Allah us ke liye jannat mein us jaisa ( ghar ) tamir kar ay ga. ‘ ‘",
  "muslim|1194": "mein ghalban ibrahim nakhi se neeche kisi raawi ko waham hua hai. isi liye Imam Muslim razi Allah anhu mufsil aur sahih riwayat ko pehle laye hain. baaz sharhin ne use mutadad waaqeaat par bhi mahmool kiya hai. wallah alam balsoab",
  "muslim|1197": "wakia ne Ismail bin Abi Khalid se ‘ unhon ne Zubair bin adi se aur unhon ne masab bin Saad se riwayat ki ‘ kaha: mein ne ruku kiya aur apne haathon ko us tarah kar liya ‘ yaani un ko jodkar apni ranon ke darmiyan rakh liya to mere walid ne mujh se kaha: hum isi tarah kiya karte the ‘ phir humein ghanton ( parhath rakhne ) ka hukm diya gaya.",
  "muslim|1198": "Hazrat taus bayan karte hain ke hum ne Ibn abbas razi Allah anhamasedonon pairon parbithane ke baare mein po chha to unhon ne jawaab diya: ye sunnat hai. hum ne un se arz ki: hamara to khayal hai ke ye insaan ( ya agar ra ki zirke saath rajal parha jaye to paaon ) parziyati hai. Ibn abassali Allah alaihi waslmane kaha: ( nahin ) balkeh ye tumhare bani sallallahu Allah alaihi waslamki sunnat hai.",
  "muslim|1201": "namaz mein ( us ki apni ) mashgholit hoti hai. ‘ ‘",
  "muslim|1203": "Allah ke hazur intehai khushu wa khazua ke alam mein khatre ho’’ to humein khamosh rahne kahakam diya gaya humein gaftagokrne se rok diya gaya.",
  "muslim|1207": "‘ ‘ tumhare salaam ka jawaab dene se mujhe sirf us baat ne roka ke mein namaz parh raha tha. ’’",
  "muslim|1212": "Abdullah bin muslma bin muslma bin qanab aur qatibah bin Saeed ne kaha: humein Imam Malik ne hadees sunayi. doosri sanad mein Yahya bin Yahya ne kaha: mein ne Imam Malik se kaha: kaha aap ko amir bin Abdullah bin Zubair ne Umar wa bin Sulaim zarqi se aur unhon ne Hazrat Abu Qatadah razi Allah ta'ala anhu se riwayat karte hue ye hadees sunayi thi ke Rasool Allah sallallahu alaihi wasallam apni sahbazadi zainab aur Abu alaas bin rabi razi Allah ta'ala anhuma ki beti amama razi Allah ta'ala anha ko utha kar namaz parh lete the, jab aap khare hote to use utha lete aur jab sajdah karte to use ( zamin par ) bitha dete the? Yahya ne kaha: Imam Malik ne jawaab diya: haan ( ye riwayat mujhe sunayi thi.)",
  "muslim|1218": "koi aadmi pehlu par haath rakhe hue namaz padhe. Imam Muslim ke ustad Abu bakr ki riwayat mein ( Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam ke bajaye ) ‘ ‘ Rasool Allah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne mana farmaya ’’ ke alfaaz hain.",
  "muslim|1219": "‘ ‘ agar tumhare liye use kiye bina charah na ho to ek baar ( kar low. ) ’’",
  "muslim|1223": "‘ ‘ jab tum mein se koi namaz mein ho to apne samne na thooke kyunki jab wo wo namaz parhta hai to Allah us ke samne hota hai. ’’",
  "muslim|1225": "koi shakhs apne dayein ya samne thooke, albatah wo ( agar kachi zamin ya rit par namaz par ha raha hai to ) apni bayein janib ya bayein paaon ke neeche thook sakta hai.",
  "muslim|1230": "jab tum mein se koi namaz mein hota hai to wo apne Rabb se raz wa niyaz karta hai, us liye wo na apne samne thooke na hi dayein taraf, albatah bayein taraf paaon ke neeche ( thook lay. ) ‘ ‘",
  "muslim|1231": "masjid mein thookna ek ganna ha hai aur us ka kafarah ye hai ke ( agar farsh kacha heto ) use dafn kar diya jaye. ‘ ‘",
  "muslim|1232": "masjid mein thookna ek ganna ha hai aur us ka kafarah use dafn karna hai. ‘ ‘",
  "muslim|1234": "khams ne yazid bin Abdullah bin shakhir se, unhon ne apne walid serwait ki, unhon nekha: mein ne Rasool Allah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ke saath ( aap ki aqtada mein ) namaz ada ki, mein ne aap ko dekha ke aap ne ( gale se ) balgham nikala aur ( choonkeh paaon ke neeche rit thi us liye ) use apne jutay se masal diya.",
  "muslim|1235": "jariri ne Abu ala yazid bin Abdullah bin shakhir se aur unhon ne apne walid se riwayat ki ke unhon ne Rasool Allah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ki mait mein namaz parhi. kaha: aap ne gale se balgham nikala aur use apne bayein jutay se masal dala.",
  "muslim|1236": "bashr bin mafzal ne humein Abu muslma Saeed bin yazid se khabar di, unhon ne kaha: mein ne Anas bin Malik razi Allah anhu se puchha: kiya Rasool Allah sallallahu alaihi wasallam jutay pahan kar namaz parhte the? unhon ne jawaab diya: haan.",
  "muslim|1238": "us ke bail buton ne mujhe mashghul kar diya tha, use Abu jaham ke pass lay jao aur ( us ke badle ) mujhe anbajani chadar la do. ‘ ‘",
  "muslim|1239": "ye manqsh chadar Abu jaham bin Huzaifah ke pass lay jao aur mujhe us ki ( sadah ) anbajani chadar lado kyunki us ne abhi meer namaz se meri tawajjah hata di thi. ‘ ‘",
  "muslim|1241": "jab raat ka kha na aao jaye aur namaz ke liye takbeer ( bhi ) keh di jaye to pehle khana kha low",
  "muslim|1242": "jab raat ka khana pesh kar diya jaye aur namaz ka ( bhi ) waqt ho jaye to Maghrib ki namaz parhne se pehle khane ki ibtada karo aur ( namaz ke liye ) apna raat ka khana chhor ne mein ajlat na karo. ‘ ‘ ( us zamane mein raat ka khana Maghrib ke qareeb hi kha ya jata tha.)",
  "muslim|1244": "jab tum mein se kisi ke samne shaam ka khana rakha jaye idhar namaz khadi ho to pehle khana kha lay aur namaz ke liye jaldi na kare jab tak khane se farigh na ho. “",
  "muslim|1249": "jis ne us tarkari mein se kuchh khaya ho wo hamari masajdon ke qareeb na aaye yahan tak ke us ki buchli jaye. ‘ ‘ aap ki murad lehsun se thi.",
  "muslim|125": "mujhe hukm diya gaya hai ke mein logon se jung karun yahan tak ke wo laalah alaallhake qail ho jayein, chunaanchah jo laalah illa allhaka qail ho gaya, us ne meri taraf se apna maal aur apni jaan mehfooz kar li, illa ye ke us ( iqraar ) ka haq ho, aur us shakhs ka hisaab Allah ke sapard hai. ‘ ‘",
  "muslim|1250": "jis ne us pode mein se kuchh khaya ho wo hargaz hamare qareeb na aaye aur na hamare saath namaz padhe. ‘ ‘",
  "muslim|1252": ". sau ( ek martabah ) hum zaroorat se majbur ho gaye aur unhein kha liya to aap ne farmaya: ’’jis ne us badbudar sabzi mein se kuchh khaya ho wo hargaz hamari masjid ke qareeb na aaye, farishte bhi yaqeenan us cheez se takleef mahsus karte hain jis se insaan takleef mahsus karte hain. ‘ ‘",
  "muslim|1253": "jis ne lehsun ya pyaz khaya wo hum se door rahe ya hamari masajdon se door rahe aur apne ghar baithe. ‘ ‘ aur isa ho a ke ( ek dafah ) aap ke pass ek handi lai gayi jis mein kuchh sabz tarkarian thin, aap ne un se kuchh bu mahsus ki to un ke mutalliq puchha. aap ko un tarkarion ke baare mein bataya gaya jo us mein ( dali gayi ) thin to aap ne use, apne sathiyon mein se ek ke pass lay jane ko kaha. jab us ne bhi use dekh kar ( aap ki naapasandidgi ki bina par ) us ko napasand kiya to aap ne farmaya: ’’tum kha low kyunki mein un se sargoshi karta hoon jin se tum sargoshi nahin karteho. ‘ ‘ ( us se farishte murad hain. sahih Ibn khazima aur sahih Ibn haban ki riwayat mein us baat ki sarahat mojod hai.)",
  "muslim|1265": "bula shabah tum mein se koi jab namaz parhne ke liye khara hota hai to shaitan aakar use altabas ( shabah ) mein daalta hai hatta ke wo nahin janta ke us ne kitni ( rakaatein ) parhi hain. tum mein se koi jab ye ( kefiat ) paye tooah ( aakhri tashahad mein ) baithe hue do sajde kar lay. ‘ ‘",
  "muslim|1269": "Malik ne Ibn Shihab se, unhon ne Abdur Rahman Aaraj se aur unhon ne Hazrat Abdullah bin bahsina razi Allah anhu se riwayat ki, kaha: Rasool Allah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne humein kisi ek namaz ki do rakaatein padhayen, phir ( teesri ke liye ) khare ho gaye aur ( darmiyan ke tashahad ke liye ) na baithe to log bhi aap ke saath khare ho gaye, jab aap ne namaz poori kar li aur hum aap ke salaam ke intizaar main the toap ne takbeer kahi aur baithe baithe salaam se pehle do sajde kiye, phir salaam pher diya.",
  "muslim|1294": "abdalohab taqfi ne Khalid haza se baqi mandah isi sanad ke saath Hazrat Imran bin haseen razi Allah anhu se riwayat ki, unhon ne kaha ke Rasool Allah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne Asr ki teesri rakaat mein salaam pher diya, phir uth kar apne hujre mein dakhil ho gaye, ek ( lambe ) chooday haathon waala aadmi khara hua aur arz ki: ay Allah ke Rasool! kiya namaz kam kar di gayi hai? phir aap gusse ke alam mein niklay aur chhodi hui rakaat padhai, phir salaam pher diya, phir saho ke do sajde kiye, phir salaam phira.",
  "muslim|1296": "Muhammad bin bashr ne hadees bayan ki, kaha: humein Ubaidullah nenafa se hadees bayan ki aur unhon ne Hazrat Ibn Umar razi Allah anhu se riwayat ki, anho n ne kaha: basa auqaat Rasool Allah sallallahu alaihi wasallam Quran parhte hue sajde ( wali aayat ) se guzarte to hamare saath sajdah karte, aap ke pass hamari bahitr lag jati hatta ke hum mein se baaz ko sajdah karne kelee jagah na maliti ( ye sajdah ) namaz ke alawah hota tha.",
  "muslim|1298": "Ata bin yasar ne ( apne shagird Ibn qasit ko ) bataya ke unhon ne Imam ke saath ( Quran ki kisi surat ki ) qiraat karne ke baare mein Hazrat Zaid bin Sabit razi Allah anhu se sawaal kiya? unhon ne kaha: Imam ke saath ( fathaa ke siwa ) kuchh na padhe aur kaha: unhon ( Zaid razi Allah anhu ) ne Rasool Allah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ke samne ( walnjam aza hoi ) parhi to aap ne sajdah na kiya.",
  "muslim|130": "jis ne la ilah illa Allah kaha aur Allah ke siwa jin ki bandagi ki jati hai, un ( sab ) ka inkaar kiya to us ka maal wa jaan mehfooz ho gaya aur us ka hisaab Allah par hai. ‘ ‘",
  "muslim|1306": "Shubah ne Ata bin Abi Maimunah se unhon ne Abu rafa se riwayat ki ‘ kaha: mein ne Hazrat Abu Hurairah razi Allah anhu ko dekha ‘ wo ( aza alsma anshqat ) mein sajdah karte the. mein ne puchha: aap us mein sajdah karte hain? unhon ne kaha: haan! mein ne apne khalilsli Allah alaihi waslmako us sajdah karte dekha ‘ us liye mein hamesha us mein sajdah karta raho n ga hatta ke un se ja malon. Shubah ne kaha: mein ne ( Ata se ) puchha: ( khalil se murad ) Nabi akram sallallahu Allah alaihi waslmahin? unhon ne kaha: haan.",
  "muslim|1310": "Ayyub ne Nafi se aur unhon ne Hazrat Ibn Umar razi Allah anhu se riwayat ki ke Rasool allhasli Allah alaihi waslmajb tashahad mein bithteto apna bayan haath apne bayein gathane prrkhataaurapna dayan haath apne dayein gathane par rakhte aur ungliyon se taripan ( 53 ) ki gira banatay aur angashat shahadat se isharah karte.",
  "muslim|1314": "ahmd bin hanbal ne kaha: humein Yahya bin Saeed ne Shubah se hadees sunayi ‘ unhon ne mujahid se ‘ unhon ne Abu mamar se aur unhon ne Hazrat Abd Allah razi Allah anhu se riwayat ki. Shubah ne kaha. hukm ne ek baar ye riwayat marfua bayan ki. ke ek hakim ya ek aadmi ne do taraf salaam phirato Abdullah ( bin Masood razi Allah anhu ) ne kaha: us ne ye ( sunnat ) kaha se apna li hai? goya us door ke hakmon ne aisi suntein bhi tark ki hui thin. jis ne ahtemam kiya sahabah ne use saraha. mohadasen ki kawishon se ye sab suntein zindah huin.",
  "muslim|1316": "Zuhair bin harab ne kaha: humein Sufyan bin Uyainah ne amru ( bin dinar ) se hadees sunayi ‘ unhon ne kaha: mujhe Abu maabad ne Ibn abbas razi Allah anhama se us baat ki khabar di ‘ baad mein ( bhool jane ki wajah se ) us se inkaar kar diya ‘ unhon ( Ibn abbas razi Allah anhu ) ne kaha ke humein Rasool Allah ki namaz khatm hone ka pata takbeer se chalta hai.",
  "muslim|1328": "ay Allah! mein qabar ke azaab se teri panah mein aata hoon aur aag ke azaab se aur zindagi aur maut ki azmaish se aur maseeh dajal ke shar se. ‘ ‘",
  "muslim|1331": "Aaraj ne Hazrat Abu Hurairah razi Allah anhu se aur unhon ne Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam se isi ki maanind riwayat ki",
  "muslim|1334": "ay Allah! to hi salaam hai aur salamati teri hi taraf se hai, to saheb rifat wa barkat hai, ay jalal wale aur izzat bakhshane wale! ‘ ‘ waled ne kaha: mein ne ozai se puchha: istighfar kaise kiya jaye? unhon ne kaha: astagfar Allah, astagfar Allah kahe.",
  "muslim|1335": "ay Allah! to hi salaam hai aur salamati teri hi taraf se hai, to saheb rifat wabarkat hai, ay jalal wale aur izzat bakhshane wale! ‘ ‘ Ibn Numair ki riwayat mein: ya zaljalal walakram ( ya ke azafe ke saath ) hai",
  "muslim|1349": "( namaz ke ya ) ek doosre ke peeche kahe jane wale aise kalimaat hain ke harfrz namaz ke baad unhein kehne waala.. ya un ko ada karne waala. kabhi namrad wa nakam nahin rehta, taintis baar subhanallah, taintis baar Alhamd Allah orchontis ba ra Allah akbar. ‘ ‘",
  "muslim|1359": "jab namazkhadi ho jaye to us ke liye dodte hue na aao, ( balkeh us tarah ) chalte hue aao ke tum par sukoon tari ho. ( namaz ka ) jo hissah palo use parh low aur jo rah jaye use poora kar low. ‘ ‘",
  "muslim|136": "jo shakhs mar gaya aur wo ( yaqeen ke saath ) janta tha ke Allah ta'ala ke siwa koi ibadat ke laeq nahin, wo jannat mein dakhil ho ga. ‘ ‘",
  "muslim|1360": "jab namaz ki takbeer keh di jaye to tum us kelee bhagtay hue mat aao, us tarah aao ke tum par sukoon ho, ( namaz ka ) jitna hissah palo, parh low aur jo rah jaye use poora kar low kyunki jab koi shakhs namaz ka irada karke aata heto wo namaz ( hi ) mein hota hai. ‘ ‘",
  "muslim|1361": "jab namaz ke liye bulawa diya jaye to us ke liye chalte hue aao, aur tum par sukoon ( tari ) ho, jo ( namaz ka hissah ) mil jaye, wo parh low aur jo rah jaye use makmal kar low. ‘ ‘",
  "muslim|1362": "jab namaz ke liye iqamat keh di jaye to tum mein se koi shakhs us ki taraf bhag kar na aaye balkeh us tarah chal kar aaye ke us par sukoon waqar tar ee ho, jitni ( namaz ) pa low, parh low aur jo tumhare ( pahunchane ) se pehle guzar chaki use purkar low. ‘ ‘",
  "muslim|1368": "apni jagah par raho. ‘ ‘ aur khud ( masjid se ) bahar nikal gaye, phir ( aaye to ) aap ghusl farma chakay the aur aap ke sir se paani tapak raha tha, phir aap ne unhein namaz padhai.",
  "muslim|1371": "jis ne namaz ki ek rakaat pali, yaqeenan us ne namaz pali. ‘ ‘",
  "muslim|1372": "jis ne Imam ke saath namaz ki ek rakaat pali, us ne namaz pali. ‘ ‘",
  "muslim|1374": "jis ne sooraj nikalnay se pehle subah ki ek rakaat pali to yaqeenan us ne subah ( ki namaz ) pali urjas ne sooraj ke ghuroob hone pehle Asr ki ek rakaat pali to yaqeenan us ne Asr ( ki namaz ) pali. ‘ ‘",
  "muslim|1376": "mamar ne Zuhri se, unhon ne Abu Salamah se, aur unhon ne Hazrat Abu Hurairah razi Allah anhu se isi tarah riwayat ki jis tarah Imam Malik ne Zaid bin aslam se riwayat ki.",
  "muslim|1377": "jis ne sooraj ke ghuroob hone se pehle Asr ki namaz mein se ek rakaat pali to yaqeenan us ne ( namaz ) pali aur jis ne sooraj nikalnay se pehle Fajr ki ek rakaat pali to yaqeenan us ne ( namaz ) pali. ‘ ‘",
  "muslim|1381": "zahar ee se Imam Malik ki sabiqah sanad hi se riwayat hai ke Urwah ne khae: mujhe Nabi akram sallallahu alaihi wasallam ki zujah Hazrat Aishah razi Allah ta'ala anha ne bataya ke Rasool Allah sallallahu alaihi wasallam Asr ki namaz ( us waqt ) parhte ke dhoop un ke hujre mein hoti, ( hujre mein se ) dhoop bahar nikalnay se pehle. ( magharbi deewar ka saaya hujre ke darwaze tak na pahuncha hota.)",
  "muslim|1382": "Abu Bakr bin Abi shabia aur amru naqd ne hadees sunayi, amru ne kaha: Sufyan ne humein Zuhri se hadees sunayi, unhon ne Urwah se aur unhon ne Hazrat Aishah razi Allah ta'ala anha se riwayat ki ke Nabi akram sallallahu alaihi wasallam Asr ki namaz parhte the aur sooraj mirehjre mein chamak raha hota tha, abhi ( sahan ke mashriq hissay mein ) saaya na philahota tha. Abu bakr ne ( mani ke wazahat karte hue ) kaha: abhi ( mashriq ki taraf ) saaya zahr na hua hota tha.",
  "muslim|1383": "yunis Ibn Shihab se riwayat ki, kaha mujhe Urwah bin Zubair ne bataya ke mujhe Nabi akram sallallahu alaihi wasallam ki zujah Hazrat Aishah ne khabar di ke Rasool Allah sallallahu alaihi wasallam Asr ki namaz us waqt parhte the jabka dhoop un kehjre mein hoti ( mashriq ki taraf phelta ) saaya un ke hujre mein na phela hota.",
  "muslim|1384": "Hisham ne apne walid Urwah se aur unhon ne Hazrat Aishah razi Allah ta'ala anha se riwayat ki ke Rasool Allah sallallahu alaihi wasallam Asr ki namaz parhte aur dhoop mere hujre mein par rahi hoti thi",
  "muslim|1385": "jab tum Fajr ki namaz parho to sooraj kaphla kinarah namudaar hone tak us ka waqt hai, phir jab tum Zuhr parho to Asr hone tak us ka waqt hai aur jab tum Asr parho to sooraj ke zard hone tak us ka waqt hai aur jab tum Maghrib parho to shafaq ( surkhi ) ke khatm hone tak us ka waqt hai aur jab tum Isha parho to adhi raat hone tak us ka waqt hai. ‘ ‘",
  "muslim|1395": "jab garmi shadid ho jaye to namaz thanday waqt mein padhokunka garmi ki shiddat dozakh ki lapton ( garmi ke phelao ) mein se hai. ‘ ‘",
  "muslim|1398": "ye garmi aatish dozakh ki lapton mein se hai, us liye namaz thanday waqt mein parho",
  "muslim|1401": "aag naapne Rabb ke hazur shikayat ki aur kaha: ay mere Rabb! mera ek hissah doosre ko kharha hai. to Allah ne use do sans lene ki ijazat ata kardi: ek sans sardi mein aur ek sans garmi, garmi aur sardi ke musam mein jo tum shadid tarsin garmi aur shadid tarsin sardi mahsus karte ho to ye wahi ( cheez ) hai. ‘ ‘",
  "muslim|1404": "Hazrat Jabir bin samrah razi Allah anhu se riwayat hai ke Nabi akram sallallahu alaihi wasallam Zuhr ki namaz us waqt parhte the jab sooraj dhalta tha",
  "muslim|1405": "Abu ahus salaam bin Sulaim ne humein hadees sunayi, unhon ne Abu Ishaq se, unhon ne Saeed bin wahab se aur unhon Hazrat Khabbab razi Allah anhu se riwayat ki, kaha: hum ne Rasool Allah sallallahu alaihi wasallam se shadid garam rit par namaz ada karne ki shikayat ki to aap ne hamari shikayat ka azalah na farmaya.",
  "muslim|1410": "Imam Malik ne Ibn Shihab se, unhon ne Hazrat Anas razi Allah anhu se riwayat ki ke hum Asr ki namaz parhte the, phir jane waala qabah jata, un logon ke pass pahunchta aur sooraj abhi uncha hota. ( qabah madinah se do mail ki musafat par hai.)",
  "muslim|1411": "Ishaq bin Abdullah bin Abi Talhah ne Hazrat asan bin Malik razi Allah anhu se riwayat ki ke, kaha hum Asr ki namaz parhte, phir ek insaan bano amru bin auf ke mahle ( qabah mein ) jata to unhein Asr ki namaz parhte hue pata.",
  "muslim|1413": "Hazrat Abu amama bin sahal razi Allah anhu bayan karte hain: hum ne Umar bin Abdul Aziz rahmat Allah alaihi ke saath Zuhr ki namaz parhi, phir hum bahar niklay aur Anas bin Malik razi Allah anhu ki khidmat mein hazir hue to hum ne unhein hasr ki namaz parhte hue paia, mein ne puchha: chicha jaan! ye kaun see namaz hejo aap ne parhi hai? unhon ne jawaab diya: Asr ki hai, aur yahi Rasool Allah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ki namaz hai jo hum aap ke saath parha karte the.",
  "muslim|1417": "jis shakhs ki namaz Asr rah gayi to gaya us ke ahl wayal aur us ka maal tabah wabarbad ho gaye. ‘ ‘",
  "muslim|1438": "jis ne do thanday waqton ki namazein ada kein, wo jannat mein dakhil ho ga. ‘ ‘ ( din ka thanda waqt Asr ka aur raat ka sab se thanda waqt Fajr ka hota hai.)",
  "muslim|1440": "Hazrat Salamah bin akwa razi Allah anhu se riwayat hai ke Rasool allhasli Allah alaihi wasallam Maghrib ki namaz us waqt parhte jab sooraj ghuroob hota aur parde ki aut mein chala jata",
  "muslim|1441": "waled bin Muslim ne kaha: hum se ozai ne hadees bayan ki, kaha: hum se Abu najaashee ne hadees bayan ki, kaha: mein ne Hazrat rafa bin khadij razi Allah anhu se suna, keh rahe the: hum Rasool Allah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ke saath Maghrib ki namaz parhte to hum mein se koi shakhs lotta aur wo apne teer ke girne ki jaghin dekh sakta tha.",
  "muslim|1447": "aaj raat tumhare siwa ahl zamin mein se koi nahin jo namaz ka intizaar kar raha ho. ‘ ‘",
  "muslim|1454": "yakhff ke alfaaz hain. ( mafhoom ek hi hai.)",
  "muslim|1457": "Sufyan bin Uyainah ne Zuhri se, unhon ne Urwah saor unhon ne Hazrat Aishah razi Allah ta'ala anha se riwayat ki ke momin auratein subah ki namaz Nabi akram sallallahu alaihi wasallam ke saath parhti thin, phir apni chaadarein orhe hue wapas aatein aur ( andhere ki wajah se ) koi unhein pehchaan nahin sakta tha.",
  "muslim|1463": "Muadh anbari ne Shubah se hadees bayan ki aur unhon ne siyar bin salama se riwayat ki ke mein ne Abu barzah ko kehte hue suna, Rasool Allah Isha ki namaz mein kuchh ( yaani ) adhi raat tak ta khair ki parwaana karte the aur us se pehle sone aur us ke baad guftagu karne ko pasand nahin farmate the. Shubah ne kaha: phir mein unhein dubarah malato unhon ne kaha: ya tihai raat tak.",
  "muslim|1464": "(Shubah ke bajaye ) Hammad bin Salamah ne Abu minhaal ( siyar bin salama ) se riwayat ki, kaha: mein ne Abu barzah aslami razi Allah anhu sesna, kehte taheka Rasool Allah sallallahu alaihi wasallam Isha ko tihai raat tak mokhar kar dete the aur us se pehle sone aur baad mein guftagu karne ko napasand farmate the aur subah ki namaz mein sau se lay kar saath tak aaiteyn telawat farmate aur aise waqt mein salaam pherte the jab hum ek doosre ke chehre ko pehchaan sakte the",
  "muslim|1466": "Abu zar! mere baad aise hakamran aayin ge jo namaz ko mardin ge ( un ka waqt khatm karden ge ) to tum namaz ko us ke waqt par parh lena, agar tum ne namaz waqt parpadh li to ( un ke saath ada ki gayi doosri namaz ) tumhare liye nafil ho jaye gi warna tum ne apni namaz to bacha hi li hai",
  "muslim|1473": "sab ke saath mil kar namaz parhna akile insaan ki namaz se pachis darje afzal hai. ’’aap ne farmaya: ’’raat ke farishte aur din ke farishte Fajr ki namaz mein jama hote hain. ‘ ‘ Abu Hurairah razi Allah anhu ne kaha: tum chahu to ye aayat parh low ( jo us baat ki tasdiq karti hai ): ’’ aur Fajr ke waqt Quran parhna blashbah Fajr ki qiraat mein hazri di jati hai",
  "muslim|1475": "bajmaat namaz akile ki pachis namazon ke barabar hai",
  "muslim|1476": "Imam ke saath ( parhi gayi ) namaz aisi pachis namazon se afzal hai jo insaan akile parhta hai. ‘ ‘",
  "muslim|1477": "ba jamaat namaz parhna akile ki namaz se satais darje afzal hai. ‘ ‘",
  "muslim|1478": "aadmi ki jamaat ke saath namaz iski akile parhi gayi satais namazon se badh kar hai",
  "muslim|1485": "mein ne irada kiya ke kisi aadmi ko hukm do n wo logon ko namaz padhaye, phir un logon ke gharon ko un par ( us samit ) jaladon jo Jumuah se peeche rehte hain",
  "muslim|1489": "Ibrahim bin muhajir ne Abu shasa se riwayat ki, kaha: hum masjid mein Hazrat Abu Hurairah razi Allah anhu ke saath baithe hue the ke mozan ne azaan kahi, ek aadmi masajdse uth kar chal para, Hazrat Abu Hurairah razi Allah anhu nemslsal us par nazar rakhi hatta ke wo masjid se nikal gaya, Hazrat Abu Hurairah razi Allah anhu nekha: ye shakhs, yaqeenan us ne Abu alqasim sallallahu alaihi wasallam ki nafarmani ki hai.",
  "muslim|1491": "jis ne Isha ki namaz bajmaat ada ki to goya us ne adhi raat ka qiyam kiya aur jis nesbah ki namaz ( bhi ) jamaat ke saath parhi to goya us ne sari raat namaz parhi. ‘ ‘",
  "muslim|1493": "jis shakhs ne subah ki namaz parhi wa ha Allah ta'ala ki zamah dari ( aman ) mein hai. to esanah ho ke ( aise shakhs ko kisi tarah nuqsaan pahunchane ki banapar ) Allah ta'ala tum ( mein se kisi shakhs ) se apne zami ke baare mein kisi cheez ka mutalbah kare, phir wo use pakad lay, phir use undhe munh jahannam mein daal de. ‘ ‘",
  "muslim|1500": "Abu altiah nehzrt Anas bin Malik razi Allah anhu se riwayat ki, kaha: Rasool Allah sallallahu alaihi wasallam tamam ansanon mein sab se zyada khubsurat akhlaq ke Malik the. basa auqaat aap hamare ghar mein hote aur namaz ka waqt ho jata, phir aap us chatayi ke baare mein hukm dete jo aap ke neeche hoti, use jahada jata, phir us par paani chahadka jata, phir aap imamat farmate aur hum aap ke peeche khare hote aur aap humein namaz padhate. kaha: un ki chatayi kajhur ke patto ki hoti thi.",
  "muslim|1504": "Rasool Allah sallallahu alaihi wasallam namaz parhte aur mein aap ke samne hoti aur aksar isa hota ke jab aap sajdah karte to aap ka kapda mujhe lagta aur aap ( khajoor ke patto aur dhagon se bani hui ) ek jaye namaz par namaz parhte the.",
  "muslim|1508": "‘ ‘ tum mein se koi shakhs jab tak apni ( namaz parhne ki ) jagah par baitha rehta hai, farishte us ke haq mein dua karte rehte hain, kehte hain: ay Allah! use bakhsh de! ay Allah us par raham farma! jab tak wo be wuzu nahin hota, neez jab tak tum mein se kisi shaqz ko namaz roke rakhti hai, wo namaz hi mein hota hai. ’’",
  "muslim|151": "Hazrat abbas bin abdalmtalb razi Allah anhu bayan karte hain ke unhon ne Rasool Allah sallallahu alaihi wasallam se suna, aap farma rahe the: ’’us shakhs ne imaan ka mazah chakh liya jo Allah ke Rabb, Islam ko deen aur mahmdsli Allah alaihi wasallam ke Rasool hone par ( dil se ) razi ho gaya. ‘ ‘",
  "muslim|1510": "‘ ‘ jab tak tum mein se kisi ko namaz roke rakhti hai wo musalsal namaz mein hota hai, use ghar ki taraf lotne se namaz ke alawah aur kisi cheez ne nahin roka hota. ’’",
  "muslim|1511": "‘ ‘ tum mein se koi shakhs jitni der namaz ke intizaar mein baitha hai namaz hi mein rehta hai jab tak be wuzu na ho jaye. farishte us ke liye dua karte rehte: ay Allah! use maaf farma! ay Allah! us pera raham farma. ’’",
  "muslim|1518": "‘ ‘ tumhare liye har qadam ke badle mein ek darjah hai. ’’",
  "muslim|152": "imaan ki sattar se zyada shakhen hain aur haya bhi imaan ki ek shakh hai. ‘ ‘",
  "muslim|1521": "‘ ‘ jis ne apne ghar mein wuzu kiya, phir Allah ke gharon mein se us ke kisi ghar ki taraf chal kar gaya takeh Allah ke farzon mein se ek fareeze ko ada kare to us ke donon qadam ( ye karte hain ke ) un mein se ek gunah natata hai aur doosra darjah buland karta hai",
  "muslim|1523": "‘ ‘ paanch namazon ki misal tum mein se kisi ek ke darwaze par chalti hoyi bahut bari nahar ki see hai, wo us mein se rozanah paanch dafah ghusl karta ho. ’’ ( Aamash ne abusafiyan ki bajaye Hasan ke hawale se riwayat karte hue ) kaha: Hasan ne kaha: ye ghusl us ke jism par koi mail kachil nahin chhode ga.",
  "muslim|1524": "Hazrat Abu Hurairah razi Allah anhu ne Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam se riwayat ki: ‘ ‘ jo shakhs din ke pehle hissay mein ya din ke doosre hissay mein masjid ki taraf gaya Allah ta'ala ( har dafah aanay par ) us ke liye jannat mein mezbani ka intazam farmata hai, jab bhi wo ( aaye ) subah ko aaye ya shaam ko aaye. ’’",
  "muslim|1528": "‘shahron mein pyari jagah Allah ke nazdeek masajdin hain aur ‘ Allah ke nazdeek ( insani ) aabadion ka sab se naapsandedah hissah un ke bazar hain. ’’",
  "muslim|1529": "‘ ‘ jab ( namaz parhne wale ) teen hoon to un mein se ek un ki imamat karae aur un mein se imamat ka zyada haqdaar wo hai jo un mein se zyada ( Quran ) parha ho. ’’",
  "muslim|153": "imaan ke sattar se oopar ( ya saath se oopar ) shobe ( ajza ) hain. sab se afzal juz laalah illa Allah ka iqraar hai aur sab se chhota kisi aziat ( dene wali cheez ) ko raaste se hatana hai aur heabhi imaan ki shakhon mein se ek hai. ‘ ‘",
  "muslim|1538": "‘ ‘ jab namaz ( ka waqt ) aaye to azaan kaho, phir iqamat kaho aur tum donon mein jo bara ho wo tumhari imamat kar lay. ’’",
  "muslim|1557": "ay Allah! bano lahian: ral, zakoan aur asia par lanat bhej janhon ne Allah aur us ke Rasool sallallahu alaihi wasallam ki nafarmani ki. gafar ki Allah maghfirat kar ay aur aslam ko Allah salamati ata farmaye. ‘ ‘",
  "muslim|1565": "Hazrat Abu Qatadah razi Allah anhu se riwayat hai ‘ kaha: Rasool Allah sallallahu Allah alaihi waslmajb safar mein hote aur raat ( ke aakhri hissay ) mein aaraam ke liye lete to dayein pehlu par lettey aur jab subah se zara pehlu par lettey to apni kahni khadi kar lete aur sir hatheli par taka lete. ( takeh zyada gehri neend na aaye. us hadees ke alfaaz bhi us baat ki tayid karte hain ke oopar bayan kiye gaye do alag algoaqe hain.)",
  "muslim|1566": "jo shakhs koi namaz bhool jaye to jaise hi wo use yaad aaye ‘ wo namaz parh lay ‘ us namaz ka us ke alawah aur koi kafarah nahin. ‘ ‘",
  "muslim|1568": "‘ ‘ jo shakhs koi namaz bhool gaya ya use ada karte waqt sota rah gaya to us ( namaz ) ka kafarah yahi hai ke jab use yaad aaye wo us namaz ko parh lay. ‘ ‘",
  "muslim|1571": "yunis ne Ibn Shihab se riwayat ki, unhon ne kaha, mujhe Urwah bin Zubair ne hadees bayan ki, ke Nabi akram sallallahu alaihi wasallam ki ahlia Hazrat Aishah sadiqah razi Allah ta'ala anha ne kaha: jab Allah ta'ala nenmaz farz ki to wo do rakaat farz ki, phir hazr ki soorat mein use makmal kardia aur safar ki namaz ko pehle fareeze par qaim rakhagia.",
  "muslim|1577": "Shubah ne kaha: mein ne Qatadah se suna, wo Musa bin Salamah hazli ( basri ) se hadees bayan karrhe the. kaha: mein ne Hazrat Ibn abbas razi Allah ta'ala anhu se puchha: jab mein makkah mein hoon aur Imam ke saath namaz na padhon to phir kaise namaz padhon? to unhon ne jawaab diya: do rakaatein, ( yahi ) Abu alqasim sallallahu alaihi wasallam ki sunnat hai.",
  "muslim|1581": "Abu qalaba ne Hazrat Anas bin Malik razi Allah ta'ala anhu se riwayat ki ke Rasool Allah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne madinah mein Zuhr ki chaar rakaat padhen aur zulhalifa mein Asr ki do rakaatein padhen.",
  "muslim|1582": "Muhammad bin manakadar aur Ibrahim bin misra donon ne Hazrat Anas bin Malik razi Allah ta'ala anhu se suna keh rahe the: mein ne Rasool Allah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ke saath madinah mein Zuhr ki chaar rakaat padhen aur aao pe ke saath zulhalifa mein Asr ki do rakaatein padhen.",
  "muslim|1583": "Shubah ne Yahya bin yazid hanai se riwayat ki, kaha: kaha mein ne Hazrat Anas bin Malik razi Allah ta'ala anhu se namaz qasar karne ke baare mein puchha toanhon ne kaha: Rasool Allah sallallahu alaihi wasallam jab teen mail ya teen farsakh ki musafat par nikaltay. musafat ke baare mein shak karne wale Shubah hain. to do rakaat namaz parhte.",
  "muslim|1586": "hashim ne Yahya bin Abi Ishaq se, unhon ne Hazrat Anas bin Malik razi Allah ta'ala anhu se riwayat ki, kaha: hum Rasool Allah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ke saath madinah se makkah jane ke liye niklay to aap do rakaat namaz parhte rahe yahan tak ke madinah wapas pahunch gaye. raawi ne Hazrat Anas razi Allah ta'ala anhu se puchha: aap makkah kitna arsa tharay? unhon ne jawaab diya: das din ( aap sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne hajat aludaa ke mauqa par makkah aakar khud makkah, mani, arfat aur mazdalfat mukhtalif maqamat pards din guzare.)",
  "muslim|1588": "Shubah ne kaha: mujhe Yahya bin Abi Ishaq ne hadees sunayi, kaha: mein nehzrt Anas bin Malik razi Allah ta'ala anhu se suna, wo bayan karte the ke hum haj ke liye madinah se chale... phir mazkorah bala riwayat bayan ki.",
  "muslim|159": "kaho: aamnat ballah ( mein Allah par imaan laya ), phir us par pakay ho jao. ‘ ‘",
  "muslim|1592": "Abu asama ne kaha: humein Ubaidullah bin Umar ne Nafi se hadees sunayi, unhon ne Hazrat Ibn Umar razi Allah ta'ala anhu se riwayat ki, kaha: Rasool Allah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne mani mein do rakaatein padhen, aap ke baad Hazrat Abu bakr razi Allah ta'ala anhu ne aur Hazrat Abu bakr razi Allah ta'ala anhu ke baad Hazrat Umar razi Allah ta'ala anhu ne aur Hazrat Usman razi Allah ta'ala anhu ne apni khilafat ke ibtadai saloon mein ( durkaten padhen ) phir Usman razi Allah ta'ala anhu ne us ke baad chaar rakaatein padhen. us liye Hazrat Ibn Umar razi Allah ta'ala anhu jab Imam ke saath namaz parhte to chaar rakaat parhte aur jab akile parhte to wo rakaatein parhte.",
  "muslim|1599": "Zuhair ne hadees bayan ki, kaha: humein Abu Ishaq ne hadees sunayi, kaha, mujh se harsa bin wahab khazaee razi Allah ta'ala anhu ne hadees bayan ki kaha: mein ne mani mein Rasool Allah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ki iqtadaa mein namaz parhi jabka log ( tadaad mein ) jitne zyada hosakte the ( mojod the ) aap ne hajat aludaa ke mauqa par do rakaat namaz padhai. Imam Muslim ne kaha: harsa bin wahab khazaee razi Allah ta'ala anhu maa ( malika bint jarul alkhzaia ) ki taraf se Ubaidullah bin Umar bin khatab razi Allah ta'ala anhu ke bhai the.",
  "muslim|160": "tum logon ko khana khilao aur har kisi ko, khwah tum use jante ho ya nahin jante, salaam kaho. ‘ ‘",
  "muslim|1600": "phir kaha ke jab raat sard aur baarish wali hoti to Rasool Allah sallallahu alaihi wasallam mozan ko hukm dete ke wo kahe ( illa saloa fi alrhal ) suno! ( apne ) thakanon par namaz parh low.",
  "muslim|1601": "suno! apne thakanon mein namaz parh low, suno! thakanon mein namaz parho, \" phir kaha: jab safar mein raat sard ya baarish wali hoti to Rasool Allah sallallahu alaihi wasallam mozan ko ye kehne ka hukm dete \" illa saloa fi alrhalkam ) \" suno! apni qiyam gahon mein namaz parh low.",
  "muslim|1603": "tum mein se jo chahe apni qiyam gah mein namaz parh lay.",
  "muslim|161": "jis ki zabaan aur haath se digar musalman aman mein hoon",
  "muslim|1617": "Ibn had ne Abdullah bin dena ra se aur unhon ne Hazrat Abdullah bin Umar razi Allah ta'ala anhu se riwayat ki ke unhon ne kaha: Rasool Allah sallallahu alaihi wasallam apni soari par Witr ada karte the.",
  "muslim|1618": "salim bin Abdullah ne apne walid ( Abdullah bin Umar razi Allah ta'ala anhu ) se riwayat ki, kaha: Rasool Allah sallallahu alaihi wasallam apni soari par nafil parhte jidhar bhi aap ka rukh hojata aur isi par Witr bhi parhte, albatah aap farz namaz us par nahin parhte the.",
  "muslim|162": "musalman wo hai jis ki zabaan aur haath se doosre musalman mehfooz rahein",
  "muslim|1622": "Ubaidullah se riwayat hekha: mujhe Nafi ne khabrdi ke Hazrat Umar razi Allah ta'ala anhu ko jab ( safar ke liye ) jaldi chalna hota to shafaq ( sooraj ki surkhi ) ghaeb hone ke baad ( yaani Isha kauqat sharwa hone ke baad ) Maghrib aur Isha ko jama karke parhte the aur batatey the ke Rasool Allah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ko jab jild chalna hota to aap sallallahu alaihi wasallam Maghrib aur Isha ko jama karlete the.",
  "muslim|1623": "Sufyan ne ( Ibn Shihab ) Zuhri se, unhon ne salim se aur unhon ne apne walid ( Ibn Umar razi Allah ta'ala anhu razi Allah ta'ala anhu se ra wait ki ke mein ne Rasool Allah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ko dekha, jab aap ko chalne ki jaldi hoti to aap Maghrib aur Isha ko jama karlete the.)",
  "muslim|1624": "yunis ne Ibn Shihab se riwayat ki, kaha: majhesalam bin Abdullah ne khabar di ke un ke walid ne kaha: mein ne Rasool Allah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ko dekha jab aap ne safar mein jild chalna hota to Maghrib ki namaz ko mokhar kardite hatta ke use aur Isha ki namaz ko jama karkarte.",
  "muslim|1627": "Jabir bin Ismail ne bhi aqeel bin Khalid se baqi mandah isi sanad ke saath riwayat ki ke Nabi akram sallallahu alaihi wasallam ko jab safar mein jaldi hoti to Zuhr ko Asr ke awal waqt tak mokhar kardite, phir donon ko jama karlete aur Maghrib ko mokhar karte aur Isha ke saath aktha karke parhte jab shafaq ghaeb hojati.",
  "muslim|1629": "Zuhair ne kaha: humein Abu Zubair ne Saeed bin jabeer se hadees sunayi, unhon ne Hazrat Ibn abbas razi Allah ta'ala anhu se riwayat ki, unhon ne kaha: Rasool Allah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne Zuhr aur Asr ko madinah mein kisi khauf aur safar ke bina jama karke parha. abuzber ne kaha: mein ne ( Ibn abbas razi Allah ta'ala anhu ke shagird ) Saeed se puchha: aap sallallahu alaihi wasallam wo ne isa kyun kiyatha? unhon nejoab diya: mein bhi Hazrat Ibn abbas razi Allah ta'ala anhu se siwa la kiyatha jaise tum ne mujh se sawaal kiya hai to unhon ne kaha: aap ne chaha ke apni ummat keksi fard ko tangi aur dushwaree mein na dalin.",
  "muslim|163": "( us ka Islam ) jis ki zabaan se aur haath se musalman mehfooz rahein",
  "muslim|1634": "Sufyan bin ainia ne amru bin dinar se unhon ne ( abushasha ) Jabir bin Zaid se aur unhon ne Hazrat Ibn abbas razi Allah ta'ala anhu se riwayat ki, unhon ne kaha: mein ne Nabi akram sallallahu alaihi wasallam ke saath aath rakaat ( Zuhr orasar ) akhati aur saat rakaat ( Maghrib aur Isha ) akhati padhen. ( amru ne kaha ) mein ne Abu shasha ( Jabir bin Zaid ) se kaha ke mera khayal hai aap ne Zuhr ko mokhar kiya aur Asr jaldi parhi aur Maghrib ko mokhar kiya aur Isha mein jaldi ki. unhon ne kaha: mera bhi yahi khayal hai.",
  "muslim|1640": "Abu wanah ne ( Ismail bin Abdur Rahman ) sadi se riwayat ke, unhon ne kaha: mein ne Hazrat Anas razi Allah ta'ala anhu se puchha: jab mein namaz parh lon to apnarkh kaise modon, apni dayein taraf ya apni bayein taraf se? unhon ne kaha: mein ne to Rasool Allah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ko zyada tardain taraf se rukh pherte dekha hai.",
  "muslim|1641": "Sufyan bin ainia ne sadi se aur unhon ne Hazrat Anas razi Allah ta'ala anhu se riwayat ki ke Nabi kareem sallallahu alaihi wasallam apni dayein taraf se rukh phirakrte the.",
  "muslim|1642": "ay mirerb! to jab apne bandon ko athae ga ya jama kare ga us din mujhe apne azaab se bachana.",
  "muslim|1645": "(Shubah ki bajaye ) shababa ne warqa se yahi riwayat isi sanad ke saath bayan ki hai.",
  "muslim|1650": "kiya tum subah ki chaar rakaatein parho ge?",
  "muslim|1654": "jab tum mein se koi shakhs masjid mein dakhil hoto bethne se pehle do rakaat namaz padhe.",
  "muslim|1660": "Saeed jaziri ne Abdullah bin shaqiq se riwayat ki, unhon nekha: mein ne Hazrat Aishah razi Allah ta'ala anha se puchha: kiya Nabi akram sallallahu alaihi wasallam chaasht ki namaz parhte the? unhon ne kaha: nahin, illa ye ke bahar ( safar ) se wapas aaye hoon.",
  "muslim|1661": "kems bin Hasan qisi ne Abdullah bin shaqiq se riwayat ki, unhon ne kaha: mein ne Hazrat Aishah razi Allah ta'ala anha se puchha: kiyanbi akram sallallahu alaihi wasallam chaasht ki namaz parha karte the? unhon ne jawaab diya: nahin illa ye ke safar se wapas aaye hoon.",
  "muslim|1662": "Hazrat Aishah razi Allah ta'ala anha se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: mein ne kabhi Rasool Allah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ko ( ghar mein qiyam ke dauran mein ) chaasht ke nafil parhte nahin dekha, jabka mein chaasht ki namaz parhti hoon. ye baat yaqini hai ke Rasool Allah sallallahu alaihi wasallam kisi kaam ko karna pasand farmate the. lekin us dar se ke log ( bhi aap ko dekh kar ) wo kaam karein gaaor ( un ki da lachaspi ki bana par ) wo kaam un par farz kardia jaye ga, aap sallallahu alaihi wasallam us kaam ko chhor dete the.",
  "muslim|1663": "abdalwars ne kaha: humein yazid rushk ne hadees sunayi, unhon ne kaha, mujhe mazah ne hadees sunayi, unhon ne Hazrat Aishah razi Allah ta'ala anha se sawaal kiya ke Rasool Allah sallallahu alaihi wasallam chaasht ki namaz kitni ( rakaatein ) parhte the? unhon ne jawaab diya chaar rakaatein aur jis qadr zyada parhna chahte ( parh lete ).",
  "muslim|1665": "Saeed ne kaha: Qatadah ne humein hadees bayan ki ke mazah adwiah ne un ( hadees sunne walon ) ko Hazrat Aishah razi Allah ta'ala anha se hadees sunayi, unhon ne kaha: Rasool Allah sallallahu alaihi wasallam chaasht ki namaz chaar rakaatein parhte the. aur Allah ta'ala jis qadr chahta zyada ( bhi ) parh lete.",
  "muslim|168": "koi bandah ( aur Abd alvaris ki hadees mein hai koi aadmi ) us waqt tak momin nahin ho sakta jab tak mein use us ke ahl wa yal, maal ursab logon se zyada mahbub na hoon. ‘ ‘",
  "muslim|1681": "abdah bin sulaiman ne kaha: humein Hisham bin Urwah ne apne walid ke hawale se Hazrat Aishah razi Allah ta'ala anha se hadees bayan ki, kaha: Rasool Allah sallallahu alaihi wasallam azaan sunte to Fajr ki do rakaatein parhte aur un mein takhfif karte the.",
  "muslim|1683": "Abu Salamah ne Hazrat Aishah razi Allah ta'ala anha se riwayat ki ke Nabi akram sallallahu alaihi wasallam subah ki namaz ki azaan aur iqamat ke darmiyan do rakaatein parhte the.",
  "muslim|1684": "Yahya bin Saeed ne kaha: mujhe Muhammad bin Abdur Rahman ne bataya ke unhon ne amrah kohzrt Aishah razi Allah ta'ala anha se hadees bayan karte hue suna wo kaha karti thin ke Rasool Allah sallallahu alaihi wasallam subah ki ( sunnat ) durkaten parhte aur un ko itna halka parhte ke mein ( dil mein ) kehti thi: kiya aap ne un mein fathaa bhi parhi hai ya nahin? ( aap sallallahu alaihi wasallam amuma fathaa bhi bahut tahar tahar kar parhte the.)",
  "muslim|1685": "Shubah ne Muhammad bin Abdur Rahman Ansari se riwayat ki. unhon ne amrah bint Abdur Rahman se suna, unhon ne Hazrat Aishah razi Allah ta'ala anha se riwayat ki, kaha jab Fajr tulu hojati to Rasool Allah sallallahu alaihi wasallam do rakaatein ada karte. ( dil mein ) kehti kiya aao pe sallallahu alaihi wasallam un mein fathaa parhte hain?",
  "muslim|1688": "Fajr ki do rakaatein duniya aur jo kuchh duniya mein hai, us se behtar hain.",
  "muslim|1689": "wo do ( rakaatein ) mujhe sari duniya se zyada pasand hain.",
  "muslim|169": "tum mein se koi shakhs ( us waqt tak ) momin nahin ho sakta jab tak mein us ke liye us ki aulad, us ke walid aur tamam ansanon se badh kar mahbub na hoon. ‘ ‘",
  "muslim|1690": "Hazrat Abu Hurairah razi Allah ta'ala anhu se riwayat hai ke Rasool Allah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne Fajr ki do rakaaton mein ( qal ya aiha alkafirone ) aur ( qal ho Allah ahad ) telawat kein.",
  "muslim|1691": "maroan bin Muawiyah fazari ne Usman bin hakeem Ansari se hadees bayan ki, unhon ne kaha: mujhe Saeed bin yasar ne bataya ke unhein Hazrat Ibn abbas razi Allah ta'ala anhu ne khabrdi ke Rasool Allah sallallahu alaihi wasallam Fajr ki do rakaaton mein se pehli mein ( Quran majid se aayat ) ( qoloa aamna ballah wama anzal alina ) ( walahsah ) parhte jo surah baqrah ki aayat hai aur doosri mein ( aal Imran ki aayat ) ( aamna ballah washhad bana muslmon ) ( waala hissah ) parhte.",
  "muslim|1692": "Abu Khalid ahmar ne Usman bin hakeem se, unhon ne Saeed bin yasar se aur unhon ne Hazrat Ibn abbas razi Allah ta'ala anhu se riwayat ki, unhon ne kaha: Rasool Allah sallallahu alaihi wasallam Fajr ki do rakaaton mein ( Quran majid mein se ) ( qoloa aamna ballah wama anzal alina ) ( waala hissah ) aur jo surah aal Imran mein hai ( talwa ali kalmah sawa benna wabenkam ) ( walahsah ) parha karte the.",
  "muslim|170": "tum mein se koi shakhs momin nahin ho sakta yahan tak ke wo apne bhai ke liye ( ya farmaya: apne padosi ke liye bhi ) wahi pasand kare jo wo apne liye pasand karta hai. ‘ ‘",
  "muslim|1700": "Hammad ne badil orayub se riwayat ki, unhon ne Abdullah bin shaqiq se aur unhon ne Hazrat Aishah razi Allah ta'ala anha se riwayat ki, unhon ne kaha: Rasool Allah sallallahu alaihi wasallam raat ko lamba waqt namaz parhte rehte, pas jab aap khare hokar namaz parhte to khare khare ruku karte aur jab baitth kar namaz parhte to baithe hue ruku karte.",
  "muslim|1701": "Shubah ne badil se hadees sunayi unhon ne Abdullah bin shaqiq se riwayat ki, unhon ne kaha: mein faras ( iran ) mein bimar tha, us liye baitth kar namaz parhta tha. mein ne us ke baare mein Hazrat Aishah razi Allah ta'ala anha razi Allah ta'ala anhu se puchha to unhon ne jawaab diya: Rasool Allah sallallahu alaihi wasallam raat ko lamboqt khare hokar namaz parhte the... us ke baad ( isi tarah ) hadees bayan ki.",
  "muslim|1703": "Muhammad bin siren ne Abdullah bin shaqiq aqili se riwayat ki, unhon ne kaha: hum logon ne Hazrat Aishah razi Allah ta'ala anha sa Rasool Allah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ki namaz ke baare mein puchha to unhon ne kaha aap kasrat se khad ay hukraor baitth kar namaz parhte the. jab aap khare hokar namaz ka aaghazfrmate to khare khare ruku karte aur jab aap baithe hue namaz ka aaghaz karte to baithe hue ruku karte.",
  "muslim|1704": "Hisham bin Urwah se riwayat hai, kaha: mujhe mere walid ne Hazrat Aishah razi Allah ta'ala anha se khabar di, unhon ne kaha: mein ne Rasool Allah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ko nahin dekha tha ke aap ne raat ki namaz ke kisi hissay mein baitth kar qiraat ki ho yahan tak ke jab aap ki Umar zyada hogayi to aap baitth kar qiraat karte aur jab surat ki tees ya chalis aaiteyn ra ha jatin to khare hokar unhein parhte phir ruku karte.",
  "muslim|1705": "Abu Salamah bin Abdur Rahman ne Hazrat Aishah razi Allah ta'ala anha se riwayat ki ke Rasool Allah sallallahu alaihi wasallam baitth kar ( bhi ) namaz parhte the, aap baithe hue qiraat farmate jab aap ki qiraat se itna hissah bach jata jitni tees ya chalis aaiteyn hoti hain to aap khad ay hojate aur khare hue un ki qiraat farmate phir ruku karte phir sajdah karte, phir doosri rakaat mein isa hi karte.",
  "muslim|1706": "amrah ne Hazrat Aishah razi Allah ta'ala anha se riwayat ki, unhon ne kaha: Rasool Allah sallallahu alaihi wasallam baithe hue qiraat farmate, pas jab ruku karnachahte to itni der ke liye khare hojate jitni der mein ek insaan chalis aaiteyn parh leta hai.",
  "muslim|1707": "alqmah bin waqaas se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: mein ne Hazrat Aishah razi Allah ta'ala anha se puchha: jab Rasool Allah sallallahu alaihi wasallam baitth kar do rakaatein parhte to kiya karte the? unhon ne jawaab diya: aap un mein qiraat karte rehte, jab ruku karne ka irada karte to khare hojate phir ra koa karte.",
  "muslim|1708": "Saeed bin jariri ne Abdullah bin shaqiq se riwayat ki, unhon ne kaha: mein ne Hazrat Aishah razi Allah ta'ala anha se kaha: kiya Rasool Allah sallallahu alaihi wasallam baitth kar namaz parh lete the? unhon ne kaha: haan, jab logon ( ke muamalaat ki dekh bhaal orfkar mandi ) ne aap ko boodha kardia.",
  "muslim|171": "us zaat ki qasam jis ke haath mein meri jaan hai! koi bandah us waqt tak momin nahin ho sakta jab tak apne padosi ke liye ( ya farmaya: apne bhai ke liye ) wahi pasand na kare jo wo apne liye pasand karta hai. ‘ ‘",
  "muslim|1711": "Abdullah bin Urwah ke walid Urwah bin Zubair ne Hazrat Aishah razi Allah ta'ala anha se riwayat ki unhon ne kaha: jab Rasool Allah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ka badan zara badh gaya aur aap bhari hogaye to aap ki namaz ka zyada tar hissah baithe hue ( ada ) hota tha.",
  "muslim|1717": "Malik ne Ibn Shihab se, unhon ne Urwah se, aur unhon ne Hazrat Aishah razi Allah ta'ala anha se riwayat ki ke Rasool Allah sallallahu alaihi wasallam raat kogyarah rakaat parhte the, un mein se ek ke zariye Witr ada farmate, jab aap us ( ek rakaat ) se farigh hojate to aap apne dayein pehlu ke bill let jate yahan tak ke aap ke pass mozan ajata to aap do ( nisbatan ) halki rakaatein parhte.",
  "muslim|1720": "Abdullah bin Numair ne humein hadees bayan ki aur kaha: humein apne Hisham ne apne walid ( Urwah ) se hadees sunayi aur unhon ne Hazrat Aishah razi Allah ta'ala anha se riwayat ki, unhon ne kaha: Rasool Allah sallallahu alaihi wasallam raat ko terah rakaatein parhte the, un mein se paanch rakaaton ke zariye Witr ( ada ) karte the, un mein aakhri rakaat ke alawah kisi mein bhi tashahad ke liye na bethte the. ( baaz raton mein aap sallallahu alaihi wasallam ka ye maamool hota)",
  "muslim|1724": "Hisham ne Yahya se aur unhon ne Abu Salamah se ra wait ki, unhon ne kaha: mein ne Hazrat Aishah razi Allah ta'ala anha se Rasool Allah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ke baare mein siwa la kiya to unhon ne kaha aap terah rakaatein parhte the, aath rakaatein parhte phir ( ek rakaat se ) Witr ada farmate, phir baithe hue do rakaatein parhte, phir jab ruku karna chahte to uth khare hote aur ruku karte, phir subah ki namaz ki azaan aur iqamat ke darmiyan do rakaatein parhte. ( kabhi aap sallallahu alaihi wasallam ki Tahajjud aur Witr ki tarteeb ye bin jati thi)",
  "muslim|1729": "amar bin zariq ne Abu Ishaq se, unhon ne aswad se aur unhon ne Hazrat Aishah razi Allah ta'ala anha se riwayat ki, kaha: Rasool Allah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ra at ko namaz parhte hatta ke un ki namaz ka aakhri hissah Witr hota. ( aksar aap sallallahu alaihi wasallam ka maamool yahi tha)",
  "muslim|1730": "masrooq ne kaha: mein ne Hazrat Aishah razi Allah ta'ala anha se Rasool Allah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ke amal ke baare mein puchha to unhon ne kaha: aap ko hamesha kiya jane waala amal pasand tha. mein ne kaha: aap kis wa qat namaz parhte the? to anho n ne kaha: jab aap marg ki aawaz sunte to khare hojate aur namaz parhte.",
  "muslim|1732": "Abu nazar ne Abu Salamah se aur unhon ne Hazrat Aishah razi Allah ta'ala anha se riwayat ki, kaha: Nabi akram sallallahu alaihi wasallam jab Fajr ki suntein parh lete to agar mein jaagti hoti mere saath guftagu farmate, warna let jate.",
  "muslim|1734": "Aishah! athu aur Witr parh low.",
  "muslim|1735": "Qasim bin Muhammad ne Hazrat Aishah razi Allah ta'ala anha se riwayat ki ke Rasool Allah sallallahu alaihi wasallam raat ko apni namaz parhte aur wo ( Aishah razi Allah ta'ala anha ) aap ke samne leti hoti thin, jab aap ke Witr baqi rah jate to aap unhein jaga dete aur wo Witr parh litin.",
  "muslim|1737": "Yahya bin wasab ne masrooq se aur unhon ne Hazrat Aishah razi Allah ta'ala anha se riwayat ki, unhon ne kaha: Rasool Allah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne raat ke har hissay mein Witr ( raat ) ki namaz parhi, raat ke ibtadai hissay mein bhi, darmiyan mein bhi aur aaqar mein bhi, aap ke Witr ( ke auqaat ) sehri tak jate the.",
  "muslim|1738": "Abu zoha ne masrooq se aur unhon ne Hazrat Aishah razi Allah ta'ala anha se riwayat ki, unhon ne kaha: Rasool Allah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne raat keharhse mein Witr padhe hain, ( lekin amuma ) aap ke Witr raat ke aakhri hissay tak chalte.",
  "muslim|1749": "do do rakaatein. aur jab tumhein subah hone ka andeshah ho to ek rakaat watarpadh low.",
  "muslim|1750": "raat ki namaz do do rakaat hai aur jab tumhein subah hone ka khatrah hoto ek ek rakaat ( parh kar unhein ) Witr karlo.",
  "muslim|1753": "Witr parhne mein subah se sabqat karo. \" ( subah hone se pehle pehle Witr parh low.)",
  "muslim|1754": "lais ne Nafi se riwayat ki ke Hazrat Ibn Umar razi Allah ta'ala anha razi Allah ta'ala anhu ne kaha: joshkhs ra at ko namaz padhe, wo Witr ko apni namaz ka aakhri hissah banae kyunki Rasool Allah sallallahu alaihi wasallam isi ka hukm dete the.",
  "muslim|1755": "raat ke waqt Witr ko apni namaz ka aakhri hissah banao.",
  "muslim|1756": "Ibn jarij ne kaha: mujhe Nafi ne bataya ke Hazrat Ibn Umar razi Allah ta'ala anhu kahakrte the: jo shakhs ra at ko namaz padhe wo subah se pehle namaz ka aakhri hissah Witr kubnae, Rasool Allah sallallahu alaihi wasallam un ( apne sathiyon ) ko yahi hukm deakrte the.",
  "muslim|1757": "Witr raat ke aakhri hissay ki ek rakaat hai.",
  "muslim|1759": "( Witr ) raat ke aakhri hissay ki ek rakaat hai. \" aur mein ne Hazrat Ibn Umar razi Allah ta'ala anhu se puchha to unhon ne kaha: mein ne Rasool Allah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ko ye farmate hue suna: \" ( Witr ) raat ke aaqar ki ek rakaat hai.",
  "muslim|1763": "raat ki namaz do rakaat hai aur jab tum dekho ke subah aaya chahti hai to ek rakaat se ( apni namaz ko ) Witr karo. \" Ibn Umar razi Allah ta'ala anhu se arz ki gayi: Musanna, Musanna, ka kiya mafhoom hai? unhon ne kaha: ye ke tum har do rakaaton ( ke aaqar ) mein salaam phero.",
  "muslim|1764": "subah se pehle pehle Witr parh low.",
  "muslim|1765": "subah hone se pehle Witr parh low.",
  "muslim|1766": "jise dar ho ke wo raat ke aakhri hissay mein nahin uth sakay ga, wo raat ke sharwa mein Witr parh lay. aur jise umeed ho ke wo raat ke aaqar mein uth jaye ga, wo raat ke aaqar mein Witr padhe kyunki raat ke aakhri hissay ki namaz ka mashahidah kiya jata hai aur ye afzal hai. \"\" abumaaoia ne ( mashhodh ki bajaye ) mahzurat ( us mein hazri di jati hai ) kaha. ( mafhoom ek hi hai)",
  "muslim|1768": "qiyam ka lamba hona behtareen namaz hai.",
  "muslim|1772": "Ibn Shihab ne Abu Abdullah aghz aur Abu Salamah bin Abdur Rahman se, unhon ne Hazrat Abu Hurairah razi Allah ta'ala anhu se riwayat ki ke Rasool Allah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne farmaya: barkat aur rifat ka Malik hamara Rabb, har raat ko jab raat ka aakhri tihai hissah baqi rah jata hai, ( to ) duniya ke aasmaan par nuzool farmata hai aur kehta hai: kaun mujhe pukarta hai ke mein us ki pukaar ko sunoon? kaun mujh se mangta hai ke mein us ko doon, aur kaun mujh se bakhshish talab karta hai ke mein use bakhsh doon?",
  "muslim|1774": "jab raat ka adha ya do tihai hissah guzar jata hai toa allah tabarak wata li aasmaan duniya par nuzool farmata hai aur kehta hai: kiya koi mangne waala hai ke use diyajae? kiya koi da aa karne waala hai ke us ki dua qubool kijaye? kiakoi bakhshish ka talbgar hai ke use bakhsha jaye hatta ke subah phot parti hai.",
  "muslim|1776": "pharallah ta'ala apne donon haath philata hai aur farmata hai.: kaun asko qarz de ga jo na muhtaj hai aur na hi zalim.",
  "muslim|1781": "jis ne Ramazan ke roze imaan ( ki halat mein ) aur sawaab ke liye rakhe, us ke guzashta sab gunah maaf kardee jayein ge aur jis ne liltah alqadr ka qiyam imaan ke saath aur sawaab ke liye kiya to us ke guzashta sare gunah maaf kardee jayein ge.",
  "muslim|1782": "jo shakhs liltah alqadr ka qiyam kare ga aur us ko pale ga. mera khayal hai aap ne farmaya. imaan ke alam mein aur ehtisaab ke liye, use bakhsh diya jaye ga.",
  "muslim|1803": "Abu bakr bin Abi shibah Ibn Musanna, aur Ibn bashar ne ghandar, Shubah aur abujamrah ki sanad se hadees bayan ki ke Hazrat Ibn abbas razi Allah ta'ala anhu farmate hain ke Rasool Allah sallallahu alaihi wasallam raat koterah rakaatein padhakrte the ( yahi raat ki rakaaton ki zyada se zyada tadaad hai jis mein do khafeef rakaatein shamil hain. aap sallallahu alaihi wasallam ka maamool gayarah katha jis tarah Hazrat Aishah razi Allah ta'ala anha ne farmaya.)",
  "muslim|1807": "jab tum mein se koi raat ko ( namaz ke liye ) uthe to wo apni namaz ka aaghaz do halki rakaaton se kare.",
  "muslim|1815": "Jarir ne Aamash se aur unhon ne abooail se riwayat ki. unhon ne kaha: Hazrat Abd Allah bin Masood razi Allah ta'ala anhu ne kaha: mein ne Rasool Allah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ke saath namazpadhi aap ne itni lambi namaz parhi ke mein ne ek naapsandedah kaam ka irada kar liya. kaha: to un se puchha gaya aap ne kis baat ka irada kiya tha? unhon ne kaha: mein ne irada kiya ke baitth jaon aur aap ko ( akile hi qiyam ki halat mein ) chhoddon.",
  "muslim|1820": "kuchh namazein ghar mein parha karo aur un ( gharon ) ko qabren na banao.",
  "muslim|1821": "Ayyub ne Nafi se unhon ne Hazrat Ibn Umar razi Allah ta'ala anhu se aur unhon ne Nabi akram sallallahu alaihi wasallam se riwayat ki, aap ne far ma ya: gharon mein ( nafil ) namazein padhon aur unhein qabren na banao.",
  "muslim|1822": "jab tum mein se koi apni masjid mein namaz ( bajmaat ) ada kar lay to apni namaz mein se apne ghar ke liye bhi kuchh hissah rakhe kyunki Allah us ke ghar mein us ke namaz parhne ki wajah se khirobhala yi rakhe ga.",
  "muslim|1823": "Hazrat Abu Musa razi Allah ta'ala anhu ne Nabi akram sallallahu alaihi wasallam se riwayat ki ke aap sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne far ma ya: \" us ghar ki misal jis mein Allah ka zikr kiya ja ta hai aur us ghar ki misal jis mein Allah ko yaad nahin kiya ja ta zindah aur murdah jaisi hai.",
  "muslim|1824": "apne gharon ko qabristan na bina wo shaitan us ghar se bha gata hai jis mein surah baqrah parhi jati hai.",
  "muslim|1828": "jise hamesha kiya ja ye agar che kam ho.",
  "muslim|1829": "alqmah se riwayat hai kaha mein ne Umm almomnin! Aishah razi Allah ta'ala anha se sawaal kiya aur kaha Umm almomnin! Rasool Allah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ke amal ki kefiat kiya thi? kiya aap ( kisi khas amal ke liye ) kuchh ayam makhsoos far ma lete the? unhon ne far ma ya: nahin aap ka amal daimi ho ta tha aur tum mein se ko nun us qadr istataat rakhta hai jitni istataat Rasool Allah sallallahu alaihi wasallam mein thi?",
  "muslim|1830": "Allah taa li ke haan mahbub tarin ka mim wo hai jis par hamesha amal kiya ja ye agarchah wo qalil ho. ( Qasim bin Muhammad ne ) kaha: Hazrat Aishah razi Allah ta'ala anha jab koi amal kartin to us ko lazim kar leti.",
  "muslim|1835": "jab tum mein se koi shakhs namaz mein unghane lage to wo sojae hatta ke neend jati rahe kyunki jab tum mein se koi shakhs ungh ki halat mein namaz padhatahe to wo mumkin hai wo istighfar karne chale lekin ( us ki bajaye ) apne aap ko bura bhala kehne lage,",
  "muslim|1836": "jab tum mein se koi shakhs raat ko qiyam kare aur us ki zabaan par qiraat mushkil hujaye aur use pata na chale ke wo kiya keh raha hai to use let jana chahiye.",
  "muslim|1838": "Allah us par raham far ma ye! us ne mujhe ek aayat yaad dila di hai jo mujhe bhala di gayi thi.",
  "muslim|1847": "Abd alazeez bin Muhammad ne kaha: yazid bin had ne humein Muhammad bin abra haim se hadees bayan ki unhon ne Abu Salamah se aur unhon ne Hazrat Abu Hurairah razi Allah ta'ala anhu se riwayat ki ke unhon ne Rasool Allah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ko far ma tay hue suna: Allah taa li ne ( kabhi ) kisi cheez par us tarah kaan nahin dhara jis tarah kisi khush aawaz Nabi ( ki qiraat ) par jab wo buland aawaz ke saath khush alhani se qiraat kare.",
  "muslim|1849": "hayi bin Abi kaseer ne Abu Salamah se aur unhon ne Hazrat Abu Hurairah razi Allah ta'ala anhu se riwayat ki unhon ne kaha: Rasool Allah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne far maya: Allah taa li ne ( kabhi ) kisi cheez par us tarah ka nun nahin dhara jaise wo Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam ( ki aawaz ) par ka nun dharta hai jo buland aawaz ke saath khush alhani se qiraat karta hai.",
  "muslim|1851": "Abd Allah bin Qais.. ya ashari... ko aal daodki bansriyon ( khubsurat aawazon ) mein se ek bansri ( khubsurat aawaz ) ataki gayi hai",
  "muslim|1856": "Abu khasima ne Abu Ishaq se aur unhon ne Hazrat bar a razi Allah ta'ala anhu se riwayat ki, unhon ne kaha: ek aadmi surah kahaf ki telawat karrhatha aur us ke pass hi do rasion mein bandha hoaghoda ( mojod ) tha. to use ek badli ne dhanp liya.",
  "muslim|1862": "Quran majid ka mahr Quran likhne wale intehai mazaz aur Allah ta'ala ke farmanbardar farishton ke saath hoga aur jo insaan Quran majidpadhatahe aur haklata hai. aur wo ( parhna ) us ke liye mashaqat ka baais hai, us ke liye do ajr hain.",
  "muslim|1865": "Allah ta'ala ne hukm diya hai ke mein tumhare samnelm yakan alzain kafarwa ki qiraat karun. \" unhon ne kaha: aur ( Allah ta'ala ne ) aap ke samne mera naam liya hai? aap ne farmaya: \" haan. \" ( Anas razi Allah ta'ala anhu ne ) kaha: to wo rodiye.",
  "muslim|1866": "Khalid bin Haris ne kaha: Shubah ne humein Qatadah ke hawale se hadees bayan ki, unhon ne kaha: mein ne Hazrat Anas razi Allah ta'ala anhu se suna, wo keh rahe the ke Rasool Allah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne Abi razi Allah ta'ala anhu se kaha... ( aage sabiqah hadees ) ke maanind hai.",
  "muslim|1878": "tha: \" surah baqrah ki aakhri do aaiteyn, jo shakhs raat mein unhein padhe ga wo us ke liye kaafi hoon gi.",
  "muslim|1880": "jis ne raat ke waqt surah baqrah ki ye aakhri do aayat padhen, wo us ke liye kaafi hoon gi. \"\" Abdur Rahman ne kaha: mein khud abumsaud razi Allah ta'ala anhu ko mila, wo bit Allah ka tawaaf karrhe the, mein ne un se puchha to unhon ne mujhe ye riwayat ( baraah rast ) Nabi akram sallallahu alaihi wasallam se sunayi.",
  "muslim|1883": "jis ( musalman ) ne surah kahaf ki pehli das aayat hafiz karlin, use dajal ke fatne se mehfooz karlia gaya.",
  "muslim|1886": "kiya tum mein se koi shakhs itna bhi nahin karsakta ke ek raat mein tihai Quran ki telawat karle? \" unhon ( sahabah karam rizwan Allah anham ajmayin ) ne arz ki: ( koi shakhs ) tihai Quran ki telawat kaise karsaktahe? aap sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne farmaya: qal ho Allah ahad ek tihai Quran ke barabar hai.",
  "muslim|1889": "mein tumhare samne tihai Quran ki qiraat karta hoon. \" phir aap sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne qal ho Allah ahad ﴿ Allah alsamad parha yahan tak ke use ( surat ) ko khatm kardia.",
  "muslim|1892": "mujh par aisi aaiteyn atari gayi hain ke un jaisi ( aaiteyn ) kabhi dekhi tak nahin gin. ( yaani ) moz teen.",
  "muslim|1896": "do baton ke siwa kisi cheez mein hasad ( rushk ) nahin kiya jasakta: ek wo aadmi jise Allah ta'ala ne maal diya phir use us par maslat kardia ke wo us maal ko haq ki rah mein be darigh latae. doosra wo insaan jise Allah ta'ala ne hikmat ( danaee ) ata ki aur wo us ke mutabiq ( apne aur doosron ke ) muamalaat tay kar ta hai aur us ki taleem detahe.",
  "muslim|1902": "jabrail alaihi assalam ne mujhe ek harf par ( Quran ) padhaya, mein ne un se marajat ki, phir mein zyada ka taqaza karta raha aur wo mere liye harof mein izafah karte gaye yahan tak ke saat harfon tak pahunch gaye. \"\" Ibn Shihab ne kaha: mujhe khabar pahunchi ke parhne ki ye saat sorten ( saat harof ) aise maamle mein hotin jo ( haqiqata aur mana ) ek hi rehta, ( un ki wajah se ) halaal wahram ke aitebar se koi ikhtelaaf na hota.",
  "muslim|1912": "mansoor ne ( abooail ) shaqiq se riwayat ki, unhon ne kaha: bano bajila mein se ek aadmi jise nahik bin sanan kaha jatatha. Hazrat Abdullah razi Allah ta'ala anhu ke pass aaya aur kehne laga: mein ( tamam ) mufsil sorten ek rakaat mein parhta hoon. Hazrat Abdullah razi Allah ta'ala anhu ne farmaya: tezi se jaise shar tezi se padhe jate hain? mujhe wo baham milti jalti sorten maloom hain janhin Rasool Allah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ek ek rakaat mein do do karke parhte the.",
  "muslim|1914": "Zuhair ne kaha: hum se Abu Ishaq ne hadees bayan ki, unhon ne kaha: mein ne ek aadmi ko dekha us ne aswad bin yazid ( sabii kofi ) se jabka wo masjid mein Quran ki taleem de rahe the. sawaal kiya: tum us ( aayat ) ko kaise parhte ho? dal parhte ya zal? unhon ne jawaab diya: dal parhta hoon. mein ne Abd Allah bin Masood razi Allah ta'ala anhu se suna wo bata rahe the. ke mein ne Rasool Allah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ko fahal min madkar dal ke saath parhte suna.",
  "muslim|1915": "Shubah ne Abu Ishaq se unhon ne aswad se unhon ne Hazrat Abd Allah bin Masood razi Allah ta'ala anhu se aur unhon ne Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam se rwa yat ki ke aao pe sallallahu alaihi wasallam us kalme madkar parhte the ( yaani dal ke saath)",
  "muslim|1920": "Hazrat Abu Hurairah razi Allah ta'ala anhu se rwa yat hai ke Rasool Allah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne namaz Asr ke baad sooraj ghuroob ho ne tak namaz parhne se mana far ma ya. aur subah ke baad sooraj tulu ho ne tak namaz se mana far ma ya.",
  "muslim|1923": "namaz Asr ke baad koi namaz nahin yahan tak ke sooraj ghuroob hujaye aur namaz Fajr ke baad koi namaz nahin yahan tak ke sooraj tulu hujaye.",
  "muslim|1924": "tum mein se koi shakhs ( jaan bojh kar ) tulu shams aur ghuroob shams ke waqt ka qasad karke un auqaat mein namaz na padhe.",
  "muslim|1925": "apni namaz ke liye jaan bojh kar na sooraj ke tulu hone ka qasad karo aur na us ke ghuroob hone ka kyunki sooraj shaitan ke do singon ke saath tulu hota hai.",
  "muslim|1926": "jab sooraj ka kinarah namudaar hujaye to namaz mokhar kardo hatta ke wo ( sooraj ) nikal aaye ( buland hujaye ) aur jab sooraj ka kinarah ghuroob hujaye to namaz mokhar kardo hatta ke wo ( sooraj ) poori tarah ghaeb hujaye.",
  "muslim|1927": "lais ne khair bin naeem hazarmi se riwayat ki, unhon ne Abdullah bin habirah se, unhon ne Abu tamim jishani se aur unhon ne Abu basra razi Allah ta'ala anhu gafari se riwayat ki, unhon ne kaha: Rasool Allah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne humein makhms nami jagah mein Asr ki namaz padhai aur farmaya \" ye namaz tum se pehle logon ko di gayi ( un par farz ki gayi ) to unhon ne use zaa kardia, us liye jo bhi us ki hifazat kare ga use us ka dugna ajr mile ga aur a sa ke baad koi namaz nahin yahan tak ke ( us ka ) shahid tulu hujaye. \" shahid ( se murad ) satarah hai.",
  "muslim|1929": "Hazrat aqbah bin amir jahni razi Allah ta'ala anhu kehte the ke teen a waqat hain, Rasool Allah sallallahu alaihi wasallam humein rokte the ke hum un mein namaz padhen ya un mein apne mardon ko qabron mein atarin: jab sooraj chamakta hua tulu hurha ho yahan tak ke wo buland hujaye aur jab dopahar ko thaharne waala ( saaya ) thahr jata hai hatta ke sooraj ( aage ko ) jhuk jaye aur jab sooraj ghuroob hone ke liye jahakta hai yahan tak ke wo ( poori tarah ) ghuroob hujaye.",
  "muslim|1932": "namaz ke liye tum jaan bojh kar sooraj ke tulu aur us ke ghuroob hone ka qasad na karo ke us waqt namaz parho.",
  "muslim|1937": "Abu Ishaq ne aswad aur masrooq se riwayat ki, un donon ne kaha: hum Hazrat Aishah razi Allah ta'ala anha ke baare mein goahi dete hain ke unhon ne kaha: koi din jis mein Rasool Allah sallallahu alaihi wasallam mere pass hote the isa na tha ke aap sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne ye do rakaatein na parhi hoon. un ki murad Asr ke baad ki do rakaaton se thi.",
  "muslim|1939": "Abdul Aziz bin sahib ne Hazrat Anas bin Malik razi Allah ta'ala anhu se riwayat ki, kaha: hum madine mein hote the, jab mozan Maghrib ki azaan deta wa log satunon ki tarah lapakte the aur wo do rakaatein parhte the hatta ke ek musafir masjid mein aata to un rakaaton ko parhne walon ki kasrat dekh kar ye samajhta ke Maghrib ki namaz hochuki hai.",
  "muslim|1951": "jab tum mein se koi shakhs Jumuah kele aanay kairadah kare to wo ghusl kare.",
  "muslim|1952": "tum mein se jo Jumuah ke liye aaye ghusl kare.",
  "muslim|1957": "Jumuah ke din har balig shakhs par ghusl karna wajib hai.",
  "muslim|1959": "amrah ne Hazrat Aishah razi Allah ta'ala anha se riwayat ki, unhon ne kaha: low ga ka mim ka jim wale the un ke naukar chakar na hote the wo aise the ke un se bu aati thi to un se kaha gaya: kiya hi achha ho ke tum Jumuah ke din naha liya karo.",
  "muslim|196": "Allah ki, us ki kitaab ki, us ke Rasool ki, musalmanon ke amiron ki aur aam muslmanon ki ( khairkhwahi. ) ‘ ‘",
  "muslim|1960": "Jumuah ke din ghusl karna har balg shakhs par wajib hai aur masoak karna bhi aur ( har shakhs ) apni istataat ke mata baq khushboo istemaal kare. \"\" albatah bakir ne ( sanad mein ) Abd alrahman ka zikr nahin kiya aurkhushbuke baare mein kaha: \"\" chahe wo aurat ki khushboo kyun na ho.",
  "muslim|1961": "rooh bin abua aur Abd alrazaq ne Ibn jarij se hadees bayan ki unhon ne kaha mujhe Ibrahim bin misr ha ne taus se khabar di aur unhon ne Hazrat Ibn abbas razi Allah ta'ala anhu se riwayat ki ke unhon ne Jumuah ke din ghusl karne ke baare mein Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam kafir ma nun bayan kiya. taus ne kaha: mein ne Ibn abbas razi Allah ta'ala anhu se po chha: agar us ke ghar walon ke pass mojod ho to wo khushboo tel bhi istemaal kar sakta hai? unhon ne ( jawaab mein ) kaha: mein ye baat nahin ja nata.",
  "muslim|1965": "Jumuah ke din jab Imam khatba de raha ho ( us waqt ) agar tum ne apne saathi se kaha: khamosh raho to tum ne fazul go yi ki.",
  "muslim|1969": "us mein ek ghadi hai us ( ghadi ) ki moafqat karte ho ye koi musalman bandah namaz parhte ho ye Allah taa li se jo kuchh bhi mangta hai Allah taa li use ata kar deta hai. qatibah ne apni riwayat mein izafah kiya: aap sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne apne haath se ashara far ma kar us ghadi ke qalil ho ne ko wazeh kiya.",
  "muslim|1970": "beshak Jumuah ke din mein ek ghadi hai koi musalman bhi khara namaz parhte ho ye us ki moafqat kar leta ( use palita ) hai ( aur ) Allah taa li se kisi khair ka sawaal karta hai to Allah taa li use wahi ( khair ) ata kar deta hai. aur aap sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne ha th se us ke qalil aur kam ho ne ko bayan kiya.",
  "muslim|1973": "Jumuah ke din mein ek ghadi aisi hai ke koi musalman Allah taa li se kisi khair ka sawaal karte ho ye us ki moafqat nahin karta magar Allah taa li use wahi khair ata kar deta hai \" far ma ya ye ek chhoti see ghadi hai.",
  "muslim|1976": "behtareen din jis par sooraj tulu ho ta hai Jumuah ka din hai isi din Adam paida kiye gaye aur isi din jannat mein dakhil kiye gaye aur isi din us se nika lay gaye.",
  "muslim|1977": "Salih mominon ke liye ye inaam azeem ha sal karne ka din ho ga.",
  "muslim|1978": "hum sab se aakhri hain aur qiyamat ke din sab se pehle ho n ge ye us ke bawajood hai ke har ummat ko kitaab hum se pehle di gayi aur humein ( hamari kitaab ) un ke baad di gayi phir ye din jise Allah ta'ala ne hamare liye likh diya tha Allah taa li ne us ke liye hamari rahnuma yi far ma yi low ga us maamle mein hamare baad hain yahud kal ( Jumuah se agla din yaani hafta mana ain ge ) aur nasara parso ( haftese agla din atwar ka mana ain ge.)",
  "muslim|1987": "jis ne ghusl kiya, phir Jumuah ke liye hazir hua, phir us ke maqdar mein jitni ( nafil ) namaz thi parhi, phir khamoshi se ( khatba ) santa raha hatta ke khatib apne khatbe se farigh hogaya, phir us ke saath namaz parhi, us ke us Jumuah se lay kar ek aur ( pichhle ya uglay ) Jumuah tak ke gunah bakhsh diye jate hain aur mazid teen dinon ke bhi.",
  "muslim|1988": "jis shakhs ne wuzu kiya aurachhi tarah wuzu kiya, phir Jumuah ke liye aaya, ghor ke saath khamoshi se khatba suna, us ke Jumuah se lay kar Jumuah tak gunah maaf kardee jate hain. ortin din zaid ke bhi. aur jo ( balaujah ) kankrion ko haath lagata raha ( un se khelta raha ), us ne lago orfzul kaam kiya.",
  "muslim|1992": "wakia ne yaali bin Haris maharbi se riwayat ki, unhon ne yas bin Salamah bin akwa se aur unhon ne apne walid ( Hazrat Salamah bin akwa razi Allah ta'ala anhu ) se riwayat ki, unhon ne kaha: jab sooraj dhalta hum Rasool Allah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ke saath Jumuah parhte, phir hum saaya talash karte hue lautte.",
  "muslim|1993": "Hisham bin Abdul Malik ne yaali bin Haris se baqi mandah isi sanad ke saath riwayat ki hum Rasool Allah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ke saath Jumuah parhte phir lautte to humein deewaron ka itna bhi saaya na milta ke hum ( sooraj se ) us ki aut lay skin.",
  "muslim|1994": "Hazrat Ibn Umar razi Allah ta'ala anhu se riwayat hai unhon ne kaha: Rasool Allah sallallahu alaihi wasallam Jumuah ke din khare hokar khatba irshad farmate, phir ( thori der ) baitth jate, phir khare hojate. kaha: jis tarah ajkal ( khatba dene wale ) karte hain.",
  "muslim|1995": "Abu ahus ne samak se aur unhon ne Hazrat Jabir bin samrat razi Allah ta'ala anhu se riwayat ki, unhon ne kaha: Nabi kareem sallallahu alaihi wasallam ke do khatbe hote the jin ke darmiyan aap bethte the. aap Quran parhte aur logon ko naseehat aur tazkeer farmate.",
  "muslim|1996": "Abu khasima ne samak se riwayat ki, unhon ne kaha: Hazrat Jabir bin samrat razi Allah ta'ala anhu ne mujhe khabar di ke Rasool Allah sallallahu alaihi wasallam khare hokar khatba dete the, phir baitth jate, phir khare hote aur khare hokar khatba dete, us liye jis ne tumhein ye bataya ke aap baitth kar khatba dete the, us ne jhoot bola. Allah ki qasam! mein ne aap ke saath do hazaar se zaid namazein parhi hain. ( jin mein bahut se Jumuah bhi aaye aur aap sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne tamam khatbe khare hokar diye.)",
  "muslim|200": "ziyad bin elaqah ( kofi ) se riwayat hai, unhon ne Hazrat Jarir bin Abd Allah razi Allah anhu se suna, wo keh rahe the: mein ne Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam se har musalman ke saath khair khwahi karne par beat ki.",
  "muslim|2001": "aur jab wo tijarat ya koi mashghalah dekhte hain to idhar tut padtay hain aur aap kokhada chhor jate hain.",
  "muslim|2002": "low gon ke groh har soorat Jumuah chhor dene se baz aaja ain ya Allah taa li un ke dilon par mahr laga de ga phir wo gha falon mein se ho ja ain ge.",
  "muslim|2003": "aboa hos ne sama ki bin harab se aur unhon ne Hazrat ja barban samrah razi Allah ta'ala anhu se riwayat ki unhon ne kaha: mein Rasool Allah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ke saath namaz parhta tha aap ki namaz ( tawalat mein ) mutawasit ho ti thi aur aap ka khatba bhi mutawasit ho ta tha.",
  "muslim|2004": "mujhe samak bin harab ne hadees bayan ki \" ke bajaye ) zakriya nemjhe samak se riwayat ki \" ke alfa za hain.",
  "muslim|2010": "to bura khatib hai, ( faqre ke pehle hissay ki tarah ) yun kaho, jis ne Allah ki aur us ke Rasool ki nafarmani ki ( wo gumrah hua. ) \"\" Ibn Numair ki ra wait mein ghoi ( wah ke neeche zer ) hai.",
  "muslim|2013": "Yahya bin Ayyub ne Yahya bin Saeed se, unhon ne amrah se aur unhon ne apni behen se jo Umar mein un se bari thin, riwayat ki... sulaiman bin Bilal ki hadees ke maanind.",
  "muslim|2014": "Abdullah bin Muhammad bin muan ne harsa bin Numan ki beti ( Umm Hisham ) se riwayat ki, unhon ne kaha: mein ne surah qa ( kisi aur se nahin baraah rast ) Rasool Allah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ki zabaan se sun kar yaad ki, aap har Jumuah mein asepadh kar khatab farmate the. unhon ne kaha: hamara aur Rasool Allah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ka tandur ek hi tha.",
  "muslim|2015": "Yahya bin Abdullah bin Abdur Rahman bin Saad ne zaraarah ne Umm Hisham bint harsa bin Numan razi Allah ta'ala anhu se riwayat ki, unhon ne kaha: hamara aur Rasool Allah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ka tandur do ya ek saal se kuchh zyada arsa ek hi raha aur mein ne surah qa walqaraan almajeed ( kisi aur se nahin balkeh ) Rasool Allah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ki zabaan se sun kar yaad ki, aap har Jumuah ke din jab logon ko khatba dete to use manbar par parhte the.",
  "muslim|2020": "athu aur do rakaatein parh low. \" qatibah ki hadees mein ( fasal rakaten ke bajaye ) sal rakaten ( do rakaatein parho ) hai.",
  "muslim|2021": "kiya tum ne do rakaatein parh li hain? \" us ne kaha: nahin. aap ne farmaya: \" parh low.",
  "muslim|2022": "jab tum mein se koi shakhs Jumuah ke din aaye jabka Imam ( ghar se ) nikal ( kar ) achka hai to wo do rakaat parh lay.",
  "muslim|2023": "athu aur do ra katen parho.",
  "muslim|2024": "! \" jab tum mein se koi Jumuah kedan aaye jabka Imam khatba de raha ho to wo do rakaatein padhe aur un mein akhtasaar kare.",
  "muslim|2028": "(Jarir ne Ibrahim bin Muhammad bin muntashar se, unhon ne apne walid se, unhon ne Hazrat Numan bin bashir ke aazaad kardah ghulam Habib bin salim se aur unhon ne Hazrat Numan bin bashir razi Allah ta'ala anhu serwait ki, unhon ne kaha: Rasool Allah sallallahu alaihi wasallam eiden aur Jumuah mein sabh ism rabook alaala aur ) hil atak hadees alghashiat parhte. kaha: aur agar Eid aur Jumuah ek hi din akhate hojate to aap yahi do sorten donon namazon mein parhte the.",
  "muslim|2030": "Ubaidullah bin Abdullah ne kaha: zahak bin Qais ne Hazrat Numan bin bashir razi Allah ta'ala anhu kokht likh kar puchha ke Rasool Allah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne Jumuah ke din surah Jumuah ke alawah ( aur ) kaun see surat parhi? unhon ne jawaab diya: aap sallallahu alaihi wasallam hil atak hadees alghashiat parha karte the.",
  "muslim|2031": "abdah bin sulaiman ne Sufyan se riwayat ki, unhon ne makhol bin rashid se, unhon ne Muslim albatin se, unhon ne Saeed bin jabeer se auranhon ne Hazrat Ibn abbas razi Allah ta'ala anhu se riwayat ki ke Nabi akram sallallahu alaihi wasallam Jumuah ke din Fajr ki namaz mein alam ﴿﴾ tanzil alktab alsajdah aur hil ati Ali alansan hin min aldhar parhte the. aap sallallahu alaihi wasallam Jumuah ki namaz mein surah Jumuah orsorah munafiqon parhte the.",
  "muslim|2034": "Sufyan ne Saad bin Ibrahim se, unhon ne Abdur Rahman Aaraj se, unhon ne abuhrirat razi Allah ta'ala anhu se aur unhon ne Nabi akram sallallahu alaihi wasallam se riwayat ki ke aap Jumuah ke din Fajr ki namaz mein alam ﴿﴾ tanzil alktab aur hil ati Ali alansan parhte the.",
  "muslim|2035": ". Ibrahim bin Saad ne apne walid ( Saad bin Ibrahim ) se, unhon ne Abdur Rahman Aaraj se aur unhon ne Hazrat Abu Hurairah razi Allah ta'ala anhu se riwayat ki ke Nabi akram sallallahu alaihi wasallam Jumuah ke din subah ki namaz ki pehli rakaat mein alam ﴿﴾ tanzil alktab aur doosri rakaat mein hil ati Ali alansan hin min aldharlam yakan shiya mazkora parhte the..",
  "muslim|2036": "jab tum mein se koi Jumuah parh chakay to us ke baad chaar rakaatein padhe.",
  "muslim|2039": "lais ne Nafi se auranhon ne Hazrat Abdullah bin Umar razi Allah ta'ala anhu se riwayat ki ke jab wo Jumuah parh lete to wapas jate aur apne ghar mein do ra rakaatein parhte. phir unhon ( Ibn Umar razi Allah ta'ala anhu ) ne bataya ke Rasool Allah sallallahu alaihi wasallam isa hi karte the.",
  "muslim|2040": "fesli \" parha tha ya yaqeen hai ( ke yahi padhatha)",
  "muslim|2041": "salim ne apne walid ( Hazrat Abdullah bin Umar razi Allah ta'ala anhu ) se riwayat ki ke Nabi akram sallallahu alaihi wasallam Jumuah kebaddo ra katen parhte the.",
  "muslim|211": "munafiq ki teen alamatein hain: jab baat kare to jhoot bole, jab waada kare to ( us ki ) khilaf warzi kare aur jab use ( kisi cheez ka ) amin banaya jaye to ( us mein ) khyanat kare. ‘ ‘",
  "muslim|219": "jis ne Islam ki halat mein apne haqeeqi baap ke siwa kisi aur ko baap banane kadoi kiya aur wo janta hai ke wo us ka baap nahin to us par jannat haraam hai. ‘ ‘ us par Hazrat abubakra razi Allah anhu ne kaha: khud mein ne bhi Rasool Allah razi Allah anhu seehi suna hai.",
  "muslim|220": "jis ne apne walid ke siwa kisi aur ko walid banane ka dawa kiya, halanka wo janta hai ke wo us ka walid nahin hai, to us par jannat haraam hai. ‘ ‘",
  "muslim|223": "logon ko chip karao. ‘ ‘ us ke baad aap ne farmaya: ’’ mere baad kafir na bin jana ke ek doosre ki gardnin marne lago. ‘ ‘",
  "muslim|2267": "paanch wasaq se kam khajoor aur gale mein sadaqah nahin hai.",
  "muslim|2281": "lais ne na fa se riwayat ki ke Hazrat Abd Allah bin Umar razi Allah ta'ala anhu ne kaha Rasool Allah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne khajooron ka ek saa ya jo ka ek saa sadaqah fitar ( ada ) karne ka hukm diya. Hazrat Ibn Umar razi Allah ta'ala anhu ne kaha: to low go n ne gandam ke do id us ( jo ) ke ek saa ke barabar qarar de liye.",
  "muslim|2283": "Zaid bin aslam ne aya za bin Abd Allah bin Saad bin Abi sarh se riwayat ki ke unhon ne Hazrat Abu sidkhadri razi Allah ta'ala anhu ko ye kehte ho ye suna hum zaka ta alfitr taam ( gandam ) ka ek saa ya jo ka ek saa ya khajooron ka ek saa ya paneer ka ek saa ya manqe ka ek saa nika la karte the.",
  "muslim|2286": "Haris bin Abd alar haman bin Abi zabab ne yaz bin Abd Allah bin Abi sarh se aur unhon ne Hazrat Abu Saeed khadri razi Allah ta'ala anhu se riwayat ki unhon ne kaha: hum fatra na un teen ajnas se nikala karte the paneer, khajoor aur jo. ( yahi un ki bania di khurdani ajna sa thin.)",
  "muslim|2288": "Musa bin aqbah ne Nafi se aur unhon ne Hazrat Ibn Umar razi Allah ta'ala anhu se riwayat ki ke Rasool Allah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne fatrane ke baare mein ye hukm diya ke use namaz Eid ki taraf logon ke nikalnay se pehle ada kardia jaye.",
  "muslim|2289": "zahak ne Nafi se aur unhon ne Hazrat Abdullah bin Umar razi Allah ta'ala anhu se ra wait ki ke Rasool Allah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne sadaqah fitar nikalnay ke baare mein ye hukm diya ke use logon ke aidke nikalnay se pehle ada kardia jaye.",
  "muslim|2298": "apne zakaat wasool karne walon ko razi kiakro. \"\" Hazrat Jarir razi Allah ta'ala anhu ne kaha: jab se mein ne Rasool Allah sallallahu alaihi wasallam se ye hadees sunni hai to mere pass se jo koi zakaat wasool karne waala gaya, razi gaya.",
  "muslim|2302": "mere liye ye baat khushi kabaas nahin ke mere pass ahad pahad ke barabar sona ho aur tisra din mujh par us tarah aaye ke mere pass us mein se koi dinar bacha hua mojod hosoe us dinar ke jis ko mein apna qarz chakane ke liye rakh lon.",
  "muslim|2308": "Allah taa li ne far ma ya hai ay Adam ke bete! to kharch kar mein tajah par kharch karun ga. aur aap ne far ma ya: \"\" Allah ka dayan haath ( achhi tarah ) bhara hua hai. Ibn Numair ne malai ke baja ye malan ( ka lafz ) kaha.. us ka faiz ja ri rehta hai din ho ya ra te koi cheez us mein kami nahin karti.",
  "muslim|232": "kiya tumhein maloom nahin ke tumhare Rabb az wajal ne kiya farmaya? us ne farmaya: jo nemat bhi mein bandon ko deta hoon to un mein se ek groh ( se taluq rakhne wale log ) us ( nemat ) ke sabb se kafrkarne walehu jate hain aur kehte hain: falan satare ( ne ye nemat di hai ) ya falan falan sataron ke sabb se ( mali hai. ) ‘ ‘",
  "muslim|2320": "haan, tumhare liye un mein, jo tum un par kharch karogi, ajr hai.",
  "muslim|2322": "musalman jab apne ahl wayal par kharch karta hai aur us se Allah ki raza chahta hai to wo us ke liye sadaqah hai.",
  "muslim|2324": "Abdullah bin idris ne Hisham bin Urwah se, unhon ne apne walid se, aur unhon ne Hazrat asma razi Allah ta'ala anha se riwayat ki, unhon ne kaha: mein ne puchha: ay Allah ke Rasool sallallahu alaihi wasallam! mere walida mere pass aayi hain aur ( silah rahmi ki ) khwahish mand hain. ya ( khali haath wapsi se ) khaaif hain. kiya mein un se silah rahmi karun? aap sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne farmaya: \" haan.",
  "muslim|2325": "haan, apni maa ke saath silah rahmi karo.",
  "muslim|2326": "Muhammad bin bashr ne kaha: hum se Hisham ne apne walid ke hawale se Hazrat Aishah razi Allah ta'ala anha se hadees bayan ki ke ek aadmi Rasool Allah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ki khidmat mein hazir hua aur kaha: ay Allah ke Rasool sallallahu alaihi wasallam! meri walida achanak wafat pagayi hain aur unhon ne koi wasiyat nahin ki, mera un ke baare mein guman hai ke agar bolten to wo zaroor sadaqah kartin, agar ( ab ) mein un ki taraf se sadaqah karun to kiya unhein ajr mile ga? aap sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne farmaya: \" haan",
  "muslim|2328": "aur Ibn Abi shibah ne kaha: Nabi kareem sallallahu alaihi wasallam se riwayat hai... \" har neki sadaqah hai.",
  "muslim|2336": "koi din nahin jis mein bande subah karte hain magar ( us mein aasmaan se ) do farishte utartay hain, un mein se ek kahthahay: ay Allah! kharch karne wale ko ( behtareen ) badal ata farma aur doosra kehta hai: ay Allah! rokne wale ka ( maal ) talif karde.",
  "muslim|2337": "koi din nahin jis mein bande subah karte hain magar ( us mein aasmaan se ) do farishte utartay hain, un mein se ek kahthahay: ay Allah! kharch karne wale ko ( behtareen ) badal ata farma aur doosra kehta hai: ay Allah! rokne wale ka ( maal ) talif karde.",
  "muslim|2338": "low gon par yaqeenan isa waqt aaye ga jis mein aadmi sone ka sadaqah lay kar ghome ga phir use koi isa aadmi nahin mile ga jo use us se lay lay aur mardon ki qalat aur auraton ki kasrat ki wajah se isa akela aadmi dekha ja ye ga jis ke peeche cha less auratein ho n gi jo us ki panah lay rahi ho n gi. Ibn barad ki rwa yat mein ( isa akela aadmi dekha ja ye ga. ki jagah watari rajal ( aur tum isaadmi ko dekho ge ) hai.",
  "muslim|2340": "qiyamat qaim nahin ho gi yaha n tak ke tamha rey haan maal ki farawani ho gayi wo maal ( paani ki tarah ) bahay ga yahan tak ke ma la ke Malik ko ye fikr la haq ho gi ke us se us ( maal ) ko bataur sadaqah ko nun qubool karega? ek aadmi ko use lene ke liye bula ya ja ye ga to wo kahe ga: mujhe us ki koi zaroorat nahin.",
  "muslim|2342": "koi shakhs pa kizah maal se koi sadaqah nahin karta aur Allah taa li pa kizah maal hi qubool far ma ta hai magar wo rahman use apne da ain ha th mein leta hai cha hai wo khajoor ka ek da na ho to wo us rahman ki hatheli mein phalta phoolta hai hatta ke pahad se bhi bara ho ja ta hai bilkul isi tarah jis tarah tum mein se koi apne bachhere ya oont ke bachche ko pa lata hai.",
  "muslim|2347": "tum mein se jo shakhs aag se mehfooz rahne ki astata aat rakhe cha hai khajoor ke ek tukde ke zariye se kyun na ho wo zaroor ( isa ) kare.",
  "muslim|236": "Ansaar se mohabbat karna imaan ki nishani hai aur un se bughz rakhna nifaq ki alamat hai. ‘ ‘",
  "muslim|2363": "be shak ek musalman amanat dar khazan ( khazanchi ) jo diye gaye hukm par amal karta hai. ( ya farmaya: ada karta hai ) use khush dilli ke saath poore ka poora ( balkeh ) wafar, us shakhs ko ada kardita hai jis ke baare mein use hukm diya gaya hai to wo ( khazan bhi )... do sadaqah karne walon mein se ek hai.",
  "muslim|2364": "jab aurat ajade bina apne ghar ke khane se kharch karti hai to use kharch karne ki wajah se ajr mile ga aur us ke khawind ko us ke kamaanay ki wajah se apna ajr mile ga aur khazanchi ke liye bhi isi tarah ( ajr ) hai. ye ek doosre ke ajr mein koi kami nahin karte.",
  "muslim|2375": "( maal ko ) kharch... ya har taraf phelao ya ( paani ki tarah ) bahao... aur guno nahin warna Allah bhi tumhein gun gun kar de ga.",
  "muslim|2376": "( maal ko ) har taraf kharch karo.. ya ( paani ki tarah bahao ya kharch karo... aur shumar na karo warna Allah bhi tumhein shumar kar kar ke de ga aur sanbha la kar na rakho warna Allah bhi tum se sanbha la kar rakhe ga.)",
  "muslim|238": "koi isa aadmi Ansaar se bughz nahin rakhe ga jo Allah ta'ala aur qiyamat par imaan rakhta hai. ‘ ‘",
  "muslim|2385": "oopar waala ha th neeche wale ha th se behtar hai aur oopar waala ha th kharch karne waala hai aur neeche waala mangne waala hai.",
  "muslim|2386": "sab se afzal sadaqah... ya sab se achha sadaqah.. wo hai jis ke peeche ( dil ki ) to nagri ho aur oopar waala ha th neeche wale ha th se behtar hai aur ( dene ki ) ibtada us se karo jis ki tum kafa lat karte ho.",
  "muslim|2388": "Adam ke bete! be shak to ( zaroorat se ) zaid maal kharch kar de ye tere liye behtar hai aur to use ro ki rakhe to ye tere liye bura hai aur guzar basar jitna rakhne par tumhein koi mila mat nahin ki ja ye gi aur kharch ka aaghaz un se karo jin ke ( kekharch ) tum zamah dar ho aur oopar waala ha th neeche wale ha th se behtar hai.",
  "muslim|2390": "mangne mein asrar na karo Allah ki qasam! isa nahin ho sakta ke tum mein se koi shakhs mujh se kuchh mange mein use napasand karta hoon phir bhi us ka sawaal mujh se kuchh nakloale to jo mein us ko doon us mein bar kat ho.",
  "muslim|2392": "Humaid bin Abd ar-Rahman bin auf ne kaha: mein ne Hazrat Muawiyah bin Abi Sufyan razi Allah ta'ala anhu se suna wo khatba dete ho ye keh rahe the mein ne Rasool Allah sallallahu alaihi wasallam se suna aap far ma rahe the Allah jis ke saath bhala yi ka irada far ma ta hai use deen ka gahra faham ata far ma deta hai aur mein to bas taqsim karne waala hoon aur deta Allah hai.",
  "muslim|2394": "( asal ) miskeen wo nahin jise ek do khajorin ya ek do luqmay luta dete hain, asal miskeen sawaal se bachne waala hai, chahu to ye aayat parh low: \" wo logon se chamt kar ( asrar se ) nahin mangte.",
  "muslim|2396": "tum mein se kisi shakhs ke saath sawaal chimta rehta hai yahan tak ke wo Allah se mile ga to us ke chehre pargosht ka ek tukda bhi na hoga.",
  "muslim|2398": "aadmi logon se sawaal karta rehta hai ( mangna us ki adat bin jata hai ) yahan tak ke wo qiyamat ke din us halat mein aaye ga ke us ke chehre par gosht ka ek tukda bhi na hoga.",
  "muslim|2399": "jo shakhs maal badhane ke liye logon se un ka maal mangta hai wo aag ke angare mangta hai, kam ( akhate ) karle ya zyada karle.",
  "muslim|2400": "tum mein se koi shakhs subah ko niklay apni pusht par lakdiyan akhati kar laeyor us se sadaqah kare aur logon ( ke ation ) se be niyaz hujaye, wo us se bahtarhe ke kisi aadmi se mange, wo ( chahe to ) asede ya ( chahe to ) mahroom rakhe, blashbah oopar waala haath neeche wale haath se afzal hai aur ( kharch kare ki ) ibtada un se karo jin ki tum kafalat karte ho.",
  "muslim|2402": "tum mein se koi indhan ka gatha bandhay aur apni peeth parlade, aur beach de, us ke liye us se behtar hai ke kisi aadmi se sawaal kare, ( chahe ) wo use de ya na de.",
  "muslim|2411": "do chizon ki mohabbat mein boodhay ka dil bhi joan rehta hai: zindagi lambi hone aur maal ki mohabbat mein.",
  "muslim|2412": "Adam kabeta boodha hojatahe magar us ki do cheezain joan rehti hain: daulat ki hars aur Umar ki hars.",
  "muslim|2415": "agar Adam ke bete ke pass maal ki ( bhari ho yi ) do waadiyan hoon to wo teesri hasil karna cha hai ga aadmi ka pait mitti ke siwa koi aur cheez nahin bhar sakti aur Allah isi ki taraf to jah far ma ta hai jo ( us ki taraf ) to jah karta hai.",
  "muslim|2416": "Shubah ne kaha: Qatadah se suna wo Hazrat Anas razi Allah ta'ala anhu se riwayat kar rahe the kaha: mein ne Rasool Allah sallallahu alaihi wasallam se suna far ma rahe the mujhe pata nahin hai ke ye alfa za aap par nazil ho ye the ya aap ( khudhi ) far ma rahe the. ( aage ) Abu wanah ki hadees ke maanind hai.",
  "muslim|2417": "agar Ibn Adam ke pass sone ki ( bhari ho yi ) ek wadi ho to wo cha hai ga ke us ke pass ek a war wai bhi ho, us ka munh mitti ke siwa koi aur cheez nahin bharti Allah us ki taraf to jah far ma ta hai jo Allah ki taraf to jah karta hai.",
  "muslim|2420": "ghana maal wa asbab ki kasrat se nahin balkeh haqeeqi ghana dil ki be naya zee hai.",
  "muslim|2426": "Hazrat Abd Allah bin amru bin aas razi Allah ta'ala anhu se riwayat hai ke Rasool Allah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne far ma ya: \" wo insaan ka miab wa bamurad ho gaya jo musalman ho gaya aur use guzar basar ke baqdari rozi mali aur Allah taa li ne use jo diya us par qanaat ki to feeq bakhshi.",
  "muslim|2427": "ay Allah! aal Muhammad sallallahu alaihi wasallam ki rozi kam se kam khane jitni kar de.",
  "muslim|246": "be shak aadmi orshrk wa kafar ke darmiyan ( faaslah mitanay waala amal ) namaz ka tark hai. ‘ ‘",
  "muslim|2466": "Ibn aon ne Muhammad se aur unhon ne abidah se riwayat ki, unhon ne kaha mein tumhein sirf wahi bayan karun ga jo mein ne un ( Ali razi Allah ta'ala anhu ) se suna hai phir unhon ne Hazrat Ali razi Allah ta'ala anhu se ayo ba ki hadees ki tarah marfo ain hadees bayan ki.",
  "muslim|247": "aadmi aur shark wa kafar ke darmiyan ( faaslah mitanay waala amal ) namaz chhodna hai. ‘ ‘ ( us riwayat mein un’’beshak ‘ ‘ ka lafz nahin, baqi wahi hai.)",
  "muslim|2473": "chhoro, chhoro, phenk do use kiya tum nahin ja nate ke hum sadaqah nahin kha tay?",
  "muslim|2476": "mein apne ghar lotta hoon aur apne bistar par ek khajoor gari ho yi pa ta hoon mein use kha ne ke liye utha ta hoon phir darta hoon ke ye sadaqah na ho to use phenk deta hoon.",
  "muslim|2478": "agar ye ( amka nun ) na ho ta ke ye sadqe mein se ho sakti hai to mein use kha leta.",
  "muslim|2480": "agar ye ( amka nun ) na ho ta ke ye sadaqah ho ga to mein use kha leta",
  "muslim|2483": "kiya khane ki koi cheez hai? \"\" unhon ne arz ki nahin Allah ke Rasool Allah sallallahu alaihi wasallam Allah ki qasam! hamare pass us bakri ki hazi ( wale go shat ) ke siwa kha ne ki aur koi cheez nahin jo meri aazaad kardah low nadi ko bataur sadaqah di gayi thi aap ne far ma ya: \"\" use hi lay aao wo apne maqam par pahunch chaki hai ( jis ko sadaqah ke taur par di gayi thi use mil gayi hai aur us ki malkiat mein achki hai)",
  "muslim|2485": "Hazrat Anas bin ma luck razi Allah ta'ala anhu se riwayat hai unhon ne kaha ( Hazrat Aishah razi Allah ta'ala anha ki aazaad kardah kaneez ) Hazrat barirah razi Allah ta'ala anha ne kuchh go shat jo us par sadaqah kiya gaya tha Nabi akram sallallahu alaihi wasallam ko bataur hadyah pesh kiya to aap ne far ma ya: \" wo us ke liye sadaqah aur hamare liye had ye hai.",
  "muslim|2490": "kiya aap ke pass ( kha ne ke liye ) kuchh hai? unhon ne kaha: nahin albatah nasibat ( Umm atiyah razi Allah ta'ala anha ne us ( sadqe ki ) bakri mein se kuchh hissah bheja hai jo aap ne un ke haan bheji thi aap ne far ma ya: \" wo apni jagah pahunch chaki hai.",
  "muslim|2491": "Hazrat Abu Hurairah razi Allah ta'ala anhu se riwayat hai ke Nabi akram sallallahu alaihi wasallam ko jab kha na pesh kiya ja ta aap us ke baare mein po chatay agar ye kaha ja ta ke tahfa hai to use kha lete aur agar kaha ja ta ke sadaqah hai to use na khate.",
  "muslim|2492": "ay Allah! Abu Awfa ki aal par rahmat na zal far ma.",
  "muslim|2494": "jab tamha rey pass sadaqah wasool karne waala aaye to wo tumhare haan se us hal mein low tay ke wo tum se khush ho.",
  "muslim|2495": "jab Ramazan aata hai jannat ke darwaze khol diye jate hain aur dozakh kedarwaze band kardee jate hain aur shiatin bidiyon mein jakad diye jate hain.",
  "muslim|2496": "jab Ramazan ( ka aaghaz ) hotahe, rahmat ke darwaze khol diye jate hain aur dozakh ke darwaze bandkardie jate hain aur shiatin ko zanjirin pahna di jati hain.",
  "muslim|2498": "roza na rakho hatta ke chaand dekh low aur iftaar ( rozon ka ikhtataam ) na karo hatta ke chaand dekh low auragar tum parmatla abralod kardia jaye to us ( Ramazan ) ki miqdar ( ginti ) poori karo.",
  "muslim|2503": "mahina untis kabhi hotahe, jab chaand dekh low to roza rakho aur jab use dekh low toroze khatm karo, agar tum par badal chahajain to us ki ginti poori karo.",
  "muslim|2504": "jab us ( chaand ) ko dekh low to roza rakho urjab use dekh loto roze khatm karo auragar badal chha jayein to us ( mahine ) ki ginti poori karlo.",
  "muslim|2505": "mahina untis raton ka bhi hota hai. chaand dekhay bina roza na rakho aur use dekhay bina ra waze khatm na karo magar ye ke tum par badal chha jayein. agar tum par badal chha jayein to us ( mahine ) ki ginti poori karo.",
  "muslim|2506": "mahina us tarah, us tarah, aur us tarah hotahe \" aur teesri dafah apna angutha band karlia. ( isharay se untis 29 ki ginti bathayi.)",
  "muslim|2507": "mahina untis ka bhi hota hai.",
  "muslim|2508": "mahina isa, isa, isa ( yaani ) das, das aur nau kahotahe.",
  "muslim|2509": "mahina hamesha aise aise aur aise hai aur aap sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne apne donon haathon ke saath donon haathon ki ungli se isharah karke farmaya aur teesri martabah mein aap ne apne dayein ya bayein angothay ko band farma liya.",
  "muslim|2511": "hum ammi ummat ke log hain na hum likhte hain aur na hum hisaab karte hain mahina us tarah hota hai aur us tarah aur us tarah aur teesri martabah mein angothay ko band farmalia, aur mahina us tarah aur us tarah aur us tarah hota hai yaani makmal tees ( dinon ) ka.",
  "muslim|2514": "jab tum chaand dekh low to roza rakho aur jab chaand dekho to iftaar ( Eid ) karo agar matlaa abar aalud hoto tum tees da noon ke roze rakho.",
  "muslim|2515": ". rabi, Ibn Muslim, an Muhammad, Ibn ziyad, Hazrat Abu Hurairah razi Allah ta'ala anhu se riwayat hai ke Nabi kareem sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne irshad farmaya to tum chaand dekh kar roza rakho aur chaand dekh kar iftaar karo aur agar matlaa abar aalud hoto tum rozon ki tadaad poori karo.",
  "muslim|2516": "tum chaand dekh kar roza rakho aur chaand dekh kar iftaar ( Eid ) karo to agar tum par mahina poshidah rahe to tum tees rozon ki tadaad poori karo.",
  "muslim|2518": "tum Ramazan almubarak se na ek din aur na hi do din pehle roza rakho sawaey us aadmi ke jo us din roza rakhtatha to use chahiye ke wo rakh lay.",
  "muslim|2521": "mahina untis dinon ka bhi hota hai aur aap ne donon haathon ko teen martabah halaya aur aakhri martabah mein ek ungli ko band farmalia. ( itne yaani untis din ka hota hai)",
  "muslim|2525": "mahina us tarah aur us tarah hota hai phir aap sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne teesri martabah ek ungli kam farmali.",
  "muslim|2526": "mahina us tarah aur us tarah aur us tarah se hota hai das aur das aur nau martabah.",
  "muslim|253": "namazein apne apne auqaat par parhna. ‘ ‘ mein ne puchha: ay Allah ke Nabi! aur kiya? farmaya: ’’ walidain ke saath Hasan sulook karna. ‘ ‘ mein ne puchha: ay Allah ke Nabi! aur kiya? farmaya: ’’ Allah ki rah mein jihad karna. ‘ ‘",
  "muslim|2532": "do mahine naqis nahin hote Khalid ki hadees mein hai ke Eid ke do mahine Ramazan aur zee alhajah ke hain. Khalid ki hadees mein hai \"\" Eid ke donon mahine, Ramazan aur zulhijjah.",
  "muslim|2536": "Hazrat Bilal razi Allah ta'ala anhu raat ke wa qat hi azaan de dete the lehza tum khate peete raho yahan tak ke Hazrat Ibn maktum razi Allah ta'ala anhu ki azaan suno.",
  "muslim|2544": "abdalwars, Abdullah bin soadat qashiri, Hazrat samrah bin jandab razi Allah ta'ala anhu farmate hain ke mein ne Muhammad Rasool Allah sallallahu alaihi wasallam se suna hai aap farmate hain. ke tum mein se koi sehri kauqat Hazrat Bilal razi Allah ta'ala anhu ki azaan se dhoka na khaye aur na hi us safedi se jab tak ke wo phel na jaye.",
  "muslim|2545": "tum mein se koi aadmi Hazrat Bilal razi Allah ta'ala anhu ki azaan se dhoka na khaye aur na hi safedi se jo ke subah ke waqt satunon ki tarah hoti hai yahan tak ke wo zahr hujaye.",
  "muslim|2547": "tum mein se koi aadmi Hazrat Bilal razi Allah ta'ala anhu ki azaan se dhoka na khaye aur na us safedi se yahan tak ke Fajr zahr hujaye.",
  "muslim|2549": "sehri khaya karo kyunki sehri ke khane mein barkat hoti hai.",
  "muslim|2550": "hamareroze aur ahl kitaab ke roze ke darmiyan sehri khane kafraq hai.",
  "muslim|2552": "Hisham, Qatadah, Anas, Hazrat Zaid bin Sabit razi Allah ta'ala anhu se riwayat hai ke unhon ne farmaya ke hum ne Rasool Allah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ke saath sehri khayi phir namaz kele khare hue mein ne arz kiya ke sehri khane aur namaz ke darmiyan kitna waqfah tha aap ne farmaya pachas aayat ke barabar.",
  "muslim|2554": "log hamesha bhalai ke saath rahein ge jab tak roza jild iftaar karte rahein ge.",
  "muslim|2563": "hai sahabah rizwan Allah anham ajmayin ne arz kiya ke aap to wisaal karte hain aap sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne farmaya ke mein tumhari tarah nahin hoon kyunki mujhe to khilaya aur pilaya jata hai.",
  "muslim|2564": "( yaani bina iftaari ke musalsal roze rakhe ) lehza sahabah rizwan Allah anham ajmayin ne bhi wisaal sharwa kardia to aap ne un ko mana farmaya. aap se arz kiya gaya ke aap bhi to wo wisaal karte hain. aap ne farmaya ke mein tumhari tarah nahin hoon kyunki mujhe khilaya aur playajata hai.",
  "muslim|2567": "ke tum wisaal ke roze rakhne se bacho sahabah rizwan Allah anham ajmayin ne arz kiya ay Allah kersol sallallahu alaihi wasallam! aap bhi to wisaal ke roze rakhte hain? aap sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne farmayatam us maamle mein meri tarah nahin hokiyunka mein us halat mein raat guzartahon ke mera Rabb mujhe khilata aur pilata hai. to tum wo kaam karo jis ki tum taqat rakhte ho.",
  "muslim|2568": "jis kaam ki tum taqat rakho wo kaam karo.",
  "muslim|2569": ". ( aage ) Abu zaraa se amarah ki hadees ke manndhe.",
  "muslim|2572": "sahabah rizwan Allah anham ajmayin ne arz kyaka aap sallallahu alaihi wasallam to wisaal ke roze rakhte hain? aap sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne farmaya mein tumhari tarah nahin hoon. kyunki mera Rabb mujhe khilata aur pilata hai.",
  "muslim|2573": "Ali bin hajr, Sufyan, Hisham bin Urwah, sida Aishah razi Allah ta'ala anha farmati hain ke Rasool Allah sallallahu alaihi wasallam apni azwaj matahraat mein se kisi ka bosa lay liya karte the. Hazrat Aishah sadiqah razi Allah ta'ala anha maskrprin.",
  "muslim|2574": "Ali bin hajr, Ibn Abi Umar, Hazrat Sufyan razi Allah ta'ala anhu farmate hain ke mein ne Abdur Rahman bin Qasim se puchha ke kiya tum ne apne baap ko Aishah razi Allah ta'ala anha se riwayat bayan karte hue suna ke Nabi kareem sallallahu alaihi wasallam roza ki halat mein un ka bosa lay liya karte the? Hazrat Abdur Rahman thori der khamosh rahe phir farmaya haan.",
  "muslim|2575": ". Abu bakr bin Abi shibah, Ali bin mashar, Ubaidullah bin Umar, Qasim, sida Aishah razi Allah ta'ala anha farmati hain ke Rasool Allah sallallahu alaihi wasallam roza ki halat mein mera bosa lay liya karte the. aur tum mein se kaun hai jo apne jazbat ko qabu mein karske jis tarah ke Rasool Allah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ko a pane jazbat par control tha.",
  "muslim|2576": "Yahya bin Yahya, Abu bakr bin Abi shibah, Abu karib, Yahya, Abu Muawiyah, Aamash, Ibrahim, aswad, alqmah, syed Aishah razi Allah ta'ala anha farmati hain ke Rasool Allah sallallahu alaihi wasallam roza ki halat mein apni azwaj matahraat ka bosa lay liya karte the aur roza ki halat mein un se baghalgir hujaya karte the lekin aap sallallahu alaihi wasallam to tum mein se sab se zyada apne jazbat ko control mein rakhne wale the.",
  "muslim|2577": "Ali bin hajr, Zuhair bin harab, Sufyan, mansoor, Ibrahim, alqmah, syed ha Aishah razi Allah ta'ala anha farmati hain ke Rasool Allah sallallahu alaihi wasallam roza ki halat mein apni kisi zujah ka bosa lay liya karte the aur aap ko to tum mein se sab se zyada apne jazbat par control tha.",
  "muslim|2578": "Muhammad bin Musanna, Ibn bashar, Muhammad bin jafar, Shubah, mansoor, Ibrahim, alqmah, sida Aishah razi Allah ta'ala anha se riwayat hai ke Rasool Allah sallallahu alaihi wasallam apni kisi zujah mataharah se roza ki halat mein baghalgir hujaya karte the.",
  "muslim|2579": "haan lekin aap to tum mein sab se zyada apne jazbat par control rakhne wale the ya farmaya ke tum mein se kaun hai jo aap ki tarah apne jazbat qabu mein rakh sakay Abu asm raawi ko shak hai. ( mafhoom ek hi hai)",
  "muslim|2612": "Abu bakr bin Abi shibah, Muhammad bin Musanna, Ibn bashar, Muhammad bin jafar, ghandar, Shubah, Muhammad bin Abdur Rahman, Ibn Saad, Muhammad bin amru bin Hasan, Hazrat Jabir bin Abdullah razi Allah ta'ala anhu se riwayat hai unhon ne farmayaka Rasool Allah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ek safar mein the. aap sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne ek aadmi ko dekha ke log us ke ard gard jama hain aur us par saaya kiya gaya hai to aap sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne farmaya ke us aadmi ko kiya hoahe? logon ne arz kiya ye ek aadmi hai jis ne roza rakha hua hai tab Rasool Allah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne farmaya ye neki nahin ke tum safar mein roza ra kho.",
  "muslim|2619": "Saeed bin Umar, sahal bin Usman, soed bin Saeed, Husain bin haris, Saeed, maroan bin Muawiyah, asm, aba nazrat, Hazrat Abu Saeed khadri, Jabir bin Abdullah aur Hazrat Jabir bin Abdullah razi Allah ta'ala anhu se riwayat hai farmaya ke hum ne Rasool Allah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ke saath safar kiya to roza rakhne waala roza rakhta aur iftaar karne waala roza iftaar karleta tha aur un mein se koi kisi ko malamat nahin karta tha.",
  "muslim|2623": "roza iftaar karne wale ajr pa gaye.",
  "muslim|2625": "agar to chahe to roza rakh lay aur agar tochahe to roza iftaar karle.",
  "muslim|263": "aadmi ka apnawaldin ko gaali dena kabirah gunahon mein se hai. ‘ ‘ ( sahabah ) kehne lage: ay Allah ke Rasool! kiya koi aadmi apne walidain ko gaali deta hai? farmaya: ’’haan! insaan kisi ke baap kugali deta hai to wo a sa ke baap ko gaali deta hai. jab ye kisi ki maa ko gaali deta hai to wo us ki maa ko gaali detahe. ‘ ‘",
  "muslim|2631": "Abdullah bin muslmat, Hisham bin Saeed, Usman Ibn hean, damishqi, Hazrat Umm dardaa razi Allah ta'ala anhu se riwayat hai ke Hazrat Abu dardaa razi Allah ta'ala anhu farmate hain ke hum ne Rasool Allah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ke saath sakhat garmiyon ke dinon mein baaz safrun mein dikhaka log sakhat garmi ki wajah se apne haathon ko apne saron par rakh lete hain aur hum mein se sawaey Rasool Allah sallallahu alaihi wasallam aur Abdullah bin roahat ke koi bhi roza dar nahin tha.",
  "muslim|2635": "harun bin Saeed, Ibn wahab, amru, Abi nazar, maula Ibn abbas, Hazrat Umm fazal razi Allah ta'ala anha farmati hain. ke Rasool Allah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ke sahabah rizwan Allah anham ajmayin mein se kuchh logon ne arfah ke din roza ke baare mein shak kiya Hazrat Umm fazal razi Allah ta'ala anha farmati hain ke hum bhi Rasool Allah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ke saath the to mein ne aap sallallahu alaihi wasallam ki taraf ek pyalah bheja jis mein doodh tha arfah ke din to aap sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne wo doodh pi liya.",
  "muslim|2640": "karte the to jab Ramazan ke roze farz hogaye to jo chahe ashorah ke din roza rakhe aur jo chahe chhor de.",
  "muslim|2644": "jahiliyat wale log us din roza rakhte the to tum mein jo koi pasand karta hai ke wo roza rakhe to rakh lay aur jo koi napasand karta hai to wo chhor de.",
  "muslim|2647": "ahmd bin Usman nufli, Abu asm, Umar bin Muhammad bin zidasqalani, salim bin Abdullah, Hazrat Ibn Umar razi Allah ta'ala anhu farmate hain ke Rasool Allah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ke pass ashorah ke din ka zikr kiya gaya to aap sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne farmaya ke ye wo din hai ke jis din jahiliyat ke log roza rakhte the to jo chahe ra wazah rakhe aur jo chahe roza chhor de.",
  "muslim|2650": "ay Abu Muhammad! qareeb hojo aur khao unhon ne kaha mein roze se hoon Hazrat Abdullah ne farmaya ke hum bhi us da nun ra wazah rakhte the lekin chhor diya.",
  "muslim|2652": "Abu bakr Ibn Abi shibah, Ubaidullah bin Musa, shiban, ashas bin Abi shasha, jafar bin Abi sor, Hazrat Jabir bin samrat razi Allah ta'ala anhu se riwayat hai ke farmaya ke Rasool Allah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ashorah ke din ra wazah rakhne ka hukm farmate the aur humein us par aamadah karte the aur us ka ahtemam karte the to jab Ramazan ke roze farz kardee gaye to phir aap na humein us ka hukm farmate aur na us se mana farmate aur na hi iska ahtemam farmate.",
  "muslim|2660": "tum bhi us din ko roza rakho.",
  "muslim|2661": "tum bhi us din ko roza rakho. raawi: ahmd bin manzar, Hammad bin asama, Abu amis, Qais, sadaqah bin Abi Imran, Qais bin salim, tariq bin Shihab, Hazrat Abu Musa razi Allah ta'ala anhu",
  "muslim|2662": "Abu bakr Ibn shibah, amronaqd, Sufyan, Abu bakr, Ibn ainia, Ubaidullah Ibn Abi yazid, Hazrat Ibn abbas razi Allah ta'ala anhu se ashorah ke din ke rozon ke baare mein puchha gaya to a nahon ne farmaya ke mein nahin janta ke Rasool Allah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne us ashorah ke din ke alawah kisi aur din ki wajah se roza rakha ho aur na kisi mahine mein sawaey us mahine yaani Ramazan ke.",
  "muslim|2664": "Abu bakr bin Abi shibah, wakia bin jaraah, hajab Ibn Umar, Hazrat hukm bin Aaraj se riwayat hai farmate hain ke mein Hazrat Ibn abbas razi Allah ta'ala anhu ke pass gaya us hal mein ke wo zam zam ( ke qareeb ) apni chadar se tek lagaye baithe the to mein ne un se arz kiya ke mujhe ashore ke roze ke baare mein khabar dijiye unhon ne farmaya ke jab to mahram ka chanddikhe to ganta rah aur naven tarikh ke din ki subah roze ki halat mein kar. mein ne arz kiya ke kiya Muhammad Rasool Allah sallallahu alaihi wasallam isi tarah roza rakhte the unhon ne farmaya haan",
  "muslim|2668": "ke wo logon mein ailan karde ke jis aadmi ne roza na rakha hooah roza rakh lay. aur jis ne khalia ho to use chahiye ke wo apne roze ko raat tak poora karle.",
  "muslim|2672": "ek qurbani ke din aur doosra fitar ke din.",
  "muslim|2673": "mein ne Rasool Allah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ko farmate hue suna ke do da noon mein roza rakhna durust nahin ek qurbani ke din doosre Ramazan Eid alfitr ke din.",
  "muslim|2674": "hai ek Eid alfitr kedan doosre Eid alazha yaani qurbani ke din.",
  "muslim|2676": "Hazrat Aishah razi Allah ta'ala anha se riwayat hai, kaha: Rasool Allah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne do rozon, fitar ke din urqarbani ke din ( ke rozon ) se mana farmaya hai.",
  "muslim|2677": "tashriq ke din khane aur peene ke din hain.",
  "muslim|268": "aur Abd Allah bin Numair ne kaha: Abd Allah bin Masood razi Allah anhu ne kaha: mein ne Rasool allhasli Allah alaihi wasallam se suna ) aap farma rahe the: ’’jo shakhs us halat mein mara ke wo Allah ke saath kisi cheez ko sharik thehrata tha, wo aag mein dakhil ho ga. ‘ ‘ aur mein ( Abd Allah ) ne kaha: jo us halat mein mara ke wo Allah ke shark na karta tha, wo jannat mein dakhil ho ga.",
  "muslim|2681": "hai? to unhon ne farmaya haan! qasam hai us ghar ke Rabb ki.",
  "muslim|2683": "Abu bakr bin Abi shibah, hifas, Abu Muawiyah, Aamash, Yahya bin Yahya, Abu Muawiyah, Aamash, Abi Salih, Hazrat Abu Hurairah razi Allah ta'ala anhu se riwayat hai ke Rasool Allah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne irshad farmaya to mein se koi aadmi Jumuah ke din roza rakhe sawaey us ke ke wo us se pehle ya us ke baad roza rakhe.",
  "muslim|269": "jo kisi cheez ko Allah ke saath sharik na karta hua mara, wo jannat mein dakhil ho ga aur jo Allah ke saath kisi cheez ko thahrate hue mara, wa ha dozakh mein dakhil ho ga. ‘ ‘ yaani tauheed jannat ko wajib kar deti hai aur shark dozakh ko.",
  "muslim|2692": "jo aadmi inteqal karjae aur us par kuchh roze lazim hoon to us kawars us ki taraf se roze rakhe.",
  "muslim|2693": "tera kiya khayal hai ke agar us par koi qarz hota to kiya to use ada karti? us ne arz kiya haan! aap sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne farmaya ke Allah ta'ala ke qarz ka zyada haq hai ke use ada kiya jaye.",
  "muslim|2696": "tera kiya khayal hai? ke agar teri maa par koi qarz hota to kiya to us ki taraf se ada karti? us ne arz kiya haan! aap ne farmaya ke Allah ka qarz us baat ka zyada haq dar hai ke use ada kiya jaye aap ne farmayaka to apni maa ki taraf se roza rakh.",
  "muslim|270": "jo koi us halat mein Allah se mile ke wo us ke saath kisi cheez ko sharik nahin thehrata tha, wo jannat mein dakhil ho ga aur jo Allah se us halat mein mila ke us ke saath kisi cheez ko sharik thehrata tha, wo aag mein dakhil ho ga. ‘ ‘ Abu Ayyub ki hadees ke alfaaz mein: abuzber ne ( hadsana Jabir’’ Jabir ne humein hadees sunayi ‘ ‘ ke bajaye ) an Jabir ’’jabarse riwayat hai ‘ ‘ ke alfaaz se hadees bayan ki.",
  "muslim|2702": "jab tum mein se kisi ko khane ki taraf bulaya jaye aur wo roza dar hoto wo keh de: mein roze se hoon.",
  "muslim|2703": "jab tum mein se koi kisi din roze se hoto wo fahash goyi na kare, na jahalat waala koi kaam kare, agar koi shakhs us se gaali gluch ya ladayi jhagda ( karna ) chahe to wo kahe: mein roza dar hoon, mein roza dar hoon.",
  "muslim|2704": "Ibn Adam ke tamam aamaal us ke liye hain sawaey roze ke, wo mere liye hai aur mein hi us ki jazad doon ga. us zaat ki qasam jis ke haath mein Muhammad sallallahu alaihi wasallam ki jaan hai! roza da ar ke munh ki bu a allah kenzdik kasturi ki khushboo se zyada pasandeedah hai.",
  "muslim|2705": "roza ek dhal hai.",
  "muslim|2711": "koi shakhs nahin jo Allah ki rah mein ek din ka roza rakhe magar Allah taa li us din ( ke roze ) badle us ke chehre ko ( jahannam ki ) aag se sattar saal ki musafat tak durkrde ga.",
  "muslim|2713": "jis ne Allah ki rah mein ek din ka roza rakha Allah taa li us ke chehre ko ( jahannam ki ) aag se sattar saal ki musafat tak door kar deta hai.",
  "muslim|2716": "jo shakhs roze ki halat mein bhool gaya aur kha liya ya pi liya to wo apna roza poora kare kyunki us ko Allah ne khilaya aur pilaya hai.",
  "muslim|2717": "Saeed jariri ne Abdullah bin shaqiq se riwayat ki, kaha: mein ne Hazrat Aishah razi Allah ta'ala anha sedriaft kiya: kiya Rasool Allah sallallahu alaihi wasallam Ramazan ke siwa kisi matain mahine ke roze rakhte the? unhon ne jawaab diya: Allah ki qasam! Ramazan ke siwa aap sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne kisi matain mahine ke ( poore ) roze nahin rakhe yahan tak ke aap aage tashreef lay gaye aur na aap sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne kisi mahine ke roze tark kiye, jab tak ke us mein se ( kuchh dinon ke ) roze rakh ( na ) liye.",
  "muslim|272": "mere pass jabrail aaye aur mujhe khush khabri di ke aap ki ummat ka jo fard us halat mein maray ga ke us ne Allah ke saath kisi ko sharik nahin thahraya, wo jannat mein dakhil hoga. ‘ ‘ mein ( Abu zar ) ne kaha: chahe us ne zana kiyaho aur chori ki ho? aap sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne farmaya: ’’ agarchah us ne zana kiya ho aur chori ki ho. ‘ ‘",
  "muslim|2728": "Zuhair bin harab aurabo bakr bin Nafi ne. alfaaz inhi ke heen. do alag alag sndon ke saath Hammad se hadees bayan ki, kaha: humein Sabit ne Hazrat Anas razi Allah ta'ala anhu se riwayat ki ke Rasool Allah sallallahu alaihi wasallam roze rakhte hatta ke khajata: aap sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne roze sharwa kardee, aap sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne roze sharwa kardee. aap sallallahu alaihi wasallam roze tark karte hatta ke kaha jata: aap sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne roze rakhne chhor diye. aap sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne rozerkhane chhor diye.",
  "muslim|2739": "Allah ta'ala ke nazdeek sab se pasandeedah ( nafli ) roze Dawud alaihi assalam ke roze hain aur Allah ta'ala ke nazdeek sab se pasandeedah ( nafli ) namaz Dawud alaihi assalam ki namaz hai. wo adhi raat tak sote the aur us ka ek tihai qiyam karte the aur us ke ( aakhri ) chhatehse mein sojate the. aur ek din roza rakhte the auraik din aftarkarte ( roza na rakhte ) the.",
  "muslim|2750": "mein isi din paida hua aur isi din mujh par ( Quran ) nazil kiya gaya.",
  "muslim|2752": "jab tum tamza nun ke roze khatm kar low to us ki jagah do raze rakh lena.",
  "muslim|2753": "jab tum ramza nun ke roze khatm kar low us ke baad ek din ya do din ke roze rakh lena. Shubah ne... jin ko shak hua.. kaha mera khayal hai ke aap ne do din ke roze kaha tha.",
  "muslim|2756": "farz namaz ke baad sab se afzal namaz adhi raat ki namaz hai aur ramza nun ke mahine ke baad sab se afzal roze Allah ke mahine mahram ke roze hain.",
  "muslim|2758": "jis ne ramza nun ke roze rakhe. phir us ke baad shawal ke charoze rakhe to ye ( porasal ) musalsal roze rakhne ki tarah hai.",
  "muslim|2762": "lilatalqadr ko ( Ramazan ki ) aakhri saat raton mein tala sha karo.",
  "muslim|2764": "tum mein se kuchh logon ko ( khawab mein ) dikha ya gaya hai ke ye pehli saath ra toon mein hai aur tum mein se kuchh logon ko dikha ya gaya hai ke ye baad mein aanay wali saat raton mein hai to tum us ko baad mein aanay wali ( aakhri ) das raton mein talash karo.",
  "muslim|2765": "tum us yaani liltah alqadr ko aakhri das raton mein talash karo agar tum mein se koi kamzor par ja ye ya be bas ho ja ye to wo baqi ki saat raton mein ( kisi soorat sasti kamzori se ) maghloob na ho.",
  "muslim|2766": "jo us raat ka matla shi ho to wo use aakhri das raton mein talash kare.",
  "muslim|2767": "tum liltah alqadr ke aoqat aakhri das raton mein talash karo. ya far ma ya: \" aakhri saat raton mein ( talash karo.)",
  "muslim|2768": "mujhe ( khawab mein ) shab qadr dikha yi gayi phir mujhe mere ghar walon mein se kisi ne bedar kar diya to wo mujhe bahalwadi gayi, tum use baad mein aanay wali ( aakhri ) das raton mein tala sha karo. harmalah ne ( \"\" mujhe bahalwadi gayi \"\" ke baja ye ) \"\" mein use bhool gaya \"\" kaha.",
  "muslim|2776": "lilatalqadr ko ramza nun ki aakhri das raton mein tala sha karo.",
  "muslim|2779": "tum mein se kis ko ya da hai jab cha nad tulu hua aur wo piya lay ke ek tukde ke maanind tha ( wahi raat thi)",
  "muslim|280": "jis ne hamare khilaf aslaha uthaya, wo hum mein se nahin hai. ‘ ‘ <hiding 1> </hiding 1>",
  "muslim|285": "jis ne rukhsar pete ya gariban chalk kiya ya ahl jahiliyat ki tarah pukara, wo hum mein se nahin. ‘ ‘ ye Yahya ki hadees hai ( jo unhon ne Abu Muawiyah ke waste se bayan ki. ) albatah ( Muhammad ) Ibn Numair aur Abu bakr bin Abi shibah ( janhon ne Abu Muawiyah au rokia donon se riwayat ki ) ne ’’au ‘ ‘ ke bajaye alif ke bina ’wa ‘ ( ’’ya ‘ ‘ kebjaai’’aur ‘ ‘ ) kaha hai.",
  "muslim|288": "blashbah mein us se buri hoon jo ( gham ke izhar ke liye ) sarmondtay, chikhe chalae aur kapde pahaday. ‘ ‘",
  "muslim|290": "chughal khur jannat mein dakhil na ho ga.",
  "muslim|291": "chughal khur jannat mein dakhil na ho ga. ‘ ‘",
  "muslim|292": "chughal khur jannat mein dakhil na ho ga. ‘ ‘",
  "muslim|294": "teen ( qasam ke log ) hain, qiyamat ke din Allah un sebat nahin kare ga: manan, yaani jo ihsaan jatalane ke liye kisi ko koi cheez deta hai. wo jo jhuti qasam ke zariye se apne saman ki mang badhata hai aur jo apna tahbnd ( takhnon se neeche ) latkata hai. ‘ ‘",
  "muslim|296": "teen ( qasam ke log ) hain jin se Allah qiyamat ke din baat nahin kare ga aur na un ko paak farmaye ga ( Abu Muawiyah ) ne kaha: na un ki taraf dekhay ga ) aur un ke liye dardnaak azaab hai: boodha zani, jhoota hakamran aur takabbur karne waala yal dar muhtaj. ‘ ‘",
  "muslim|312": "be shak Allah ta'ala yaman se ek hua bheje ga jo resham sezyadah narm ho gi aur kisi aise shakhs ko na chhode gi jis ke dil mein ( Abu alqmah ne kaha: ek dane ke barabar aur Abd alazeez ne kaha: ek zarray ke barabar bhi ) imaan ho ga magar us ki rooh qabz kar lay gi. ‘ ‘ ( ek zarah bhi ho lekin imaan hoto nafa bakhsh hai.)",
  "muslim|323": "jo nek kaam pehle kar chakay ho tum ne un samit Islam qubool kiya hai. ‘ ‘ takhs ka matlab hai ibadat guzari hai.",
  "muslim|340": "yahi sarih imaan hai. ‘ ‘",
  "muslim|342": "yahi to khalis imaan hai.)",
  "muslim|343": "log hamesha ek doosre se ( fazul ) sawalat karte rahein ge yahan tak ke ye sawaal bhi ho ga ke Allah ne sab makhlooq ko paida kiya hai to phir Allah ko kis ne paida kiya hai? jo shakhs aisi koi cheez dil mein paye to kahe: mein Allah par imaan laya hoon. ‘ ‘",
  "muslim|345": "tum mein se kisi ke pass shaitan aao kar kehta hai ke falan falan cheez ko kis ne paida kiya? yahan tak ke us se kehta hai: tamharerb ko kis ne paida kiya? jab baat yahan tak pahunche to wo Allah se panah mange au ra ( mazid sochne se ) ruk jaye. ‘ ‘",
  "muslim|350": "yaqeenan log tum se har cheez ke baare mein sawaal karein ge yahan tak ke kahin ge: Allah ne har cheez ko paida kiya, phir us ko kis ne paida kiya? ‘ ‘",
  "muslim|357": "jis nun kisi musalman shakhs ke maal par, haq na hote hue, qasam khayi, wo Allah se us halat mein mile ga ke Allah ta'ala us se naaraz ho ga. ‘ ‘ Abd Allah ne kaha: phir Rasool Allah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne hamare samne kitaab Allah se us ka masdaaq ( jis se baat ki tasdiq ho jaye ) parha: ’’ blashbah jo log Allah ke saath kiye gaye ahd ( misaaq ) aur apni qasmon ka soda thori see qimat par karte hain...... ‘ aaqar aayat tak.",
  "muslim|361": "hai: ’’ jo apne maal ki hifazat mein qatal kar diya gaya, wo shaheed hai. ‘ ‘",
  "muslim|374": "blashbah imaan madinah ki janib yun simat aaye ga jaise sanp apne bill ki janib simat aata hai. ‘ ‘",
  "muslim|393": "tum kaise ho ge jab maryam ke bete tumhare darmiyan atrin ge aur tumhari peshwayi karein ge? ‘ ‘ ( jab imamat karaen ge to bhi ummat ke ek fard ki haisiat se karaen ge.)",
  "muslim|396": "jab tak sooraj Maghrib se tulu nahin hota, us waqt tak qiyamat qaim nahin ho gi. jab wo Maghrib se tulu hujaye ga to sab ke sab log imaan lay aayin ge, us din ’’kisi aise shakhs ko us ka imaan faidah nahin de ga jo pehle imaan na laya tha ya apne imaan ( ki halat ) mein koi neki na kamai thi. ‘ ‘ ( amal se tasdiq na ki thi.)",
  "muslim|400": "kiya tum jante ho ye sooraj kahan jata hai? ‘ ‘?....... us ke baad Ibn alaihi wali hadees ke hum mani ( riwayat ) hai.",
  "muslim|402": "sooraj apne mustaqir ki taraf chal raha hai. ‘ ‘ aap ne jawaab diya: ’’us ka mustaqir arsh ke neeche hai.",
  "muslim|412": "mere pass ( farishte ) aaye aur mujhe zamzam ke pass lay gaye, mera sinah chalk kiya gaya, phir zamzam ke paani se dhoya gaya, phir mujhe ( wapas apni jagah ) utara diya gaya. ‘ ‘ ( ye meraj se fora pehle ka waqia hai.)",
  "muslim|4163": "use mat kharido aur na apna ( diya hua ) sadaqah wapas low kyunki sadaqah wapas lene waala aise kutte ki tarah hai jo qay ( chatne ke liye ) us ki taraf lotta hai",
  "muslim|4167": "use mat kharido aur ( kabhi ) apna sadaqah wapas na low",
  "muslim|4169": "ay Umar! apna sadaqah wapas mat low",
  "muslim|4170": "us shakhs ki misal jo sadaqah wapas leta hai us kutte ki tarah hai jo qay karta hai, phir apni qay ki taraf lotta hai aur khata hai",
  "muslim|4174": "apne haba ko wapas lene waala apni qay ki taraf lotne wale ki tarah hai",
  "muslim|4176": "apna haba wapas lene waala kutte ki tarah hai jo qay karta hai, phir apni qay ki taraf lotta hai",
  "muslim|418": "Musa alaihi assalam gandmi rang ke unche lambe the jaise wo qabeelah shanoah ke mardon mein se hoon aur farmaya: aesi razi Allah anhu gathe hue jism ke miana qamat the. ‘ ‘ aur aap ne dozakh ke daroge Malik aur dajal ka bhi zikr farmaya.",
  "muslim|4184": "mujhe zulm par gawah mat banao",
  "muslim|4188": "jis aadmi ko Umar bhar ke liye di jane wali cheez us ke aur us ki aulad ke liye di gayi to wo isi ki hai jise di gayi, wo us shakhs ko wapas nahin mile gi jis ne di thi, kyunki us ne isa atiyah diya hai jis mein warasat jari ho gayi hai",
  "muslim|4191": "mamar ne humein Zuhri rahmat Allah alaihi se khabar di, unhon ne Abu Salamah se aur unhon ne Hazrat Jabir razi Allah anhu se riwayat ki, unhon ne kaha: wo umri jise Rasool Allah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne nafiz kiya ye hai ke aadmi kahe: ye tumhare liye aur tumhari aulad ke liye hai, albatah jab wo kahe: ye tumhare liye hai jab tak tum zindah ho, to wo uskay Malik ko wapas mil jaye ga. mamar ne kaha: Imam Zuhri rahmat Allah alaihi isi ke mutabiq fatwa dete the",
  "muslim|428": "jab quraish ne mujhe jahatlaya, mein ne hajr ( hatim ) mein khara ho gaya, Allah ta'ala ne bit almaqdas mere samne achhi tarah numayaan kar diya aur mein ne use dekh kar us ki nishaniyan un ko batani sharwa kar dein. ‘ ‘",
  "muslim|432": "abad bin awam ne kaha: humein sheebani ne khabar di, unhon ne kaha: mein ne zarban habish se Allah ta'ala ke us farman ke baare mein sawaal kiya: ’’wo do kamaan ke barabar faslay par the ya us se bhi zyada qareeb the. ‘ ‘ zar ne kaha: mujhe Abd Allah bin Masood razi Allah anhu nekhbar di ke Rasool allhasli Allah alaihi waslmnejabril alaihi assalam ko dekha, un ke chhe sau par the.",
  "muslim|442": "phir wo qareeb hua aur utar aaya aur da wakmanon ke barabar ya us se kam faslay par tha, phir us ne us ke bande ki taraf wahi ki jo wahi ki? ‘ ‘ Hazrat Aishah ne farmaya: wo to jabrel the, wo hamesha aap ke pass ansanon ki shakal mein aate the aur us dafah wo aap ke pass apni asal shakal mein aaye aur unhon ne aasmaan ke afq ko bhar diya.",
  "muslim|447": "Allah ta'ala sota nahin hai, sona us kelaiq nahin, mizan ko oopar athata aur neeche karta hai. din ka amal raat ko aur raat kaamal din ko us ke hazur pesh kiya jata hai. ‘ ‘",
  "muslim|470": "Allah ta'ala kuchh logon ko aag se nikal kar jannat mein dakhil kare ga. ‘ ‘",
  "muslim|471": "Hammad bin Zaid ne kaha: mein ne Umar waban dinarse puchha: kiya aap ne jabarban Abdullah razi Allah anhu ko Rasool allhasli Allah alaihi wasallam se ye hadees bayan karte hue suna hai ke Allah ta'ala kuchh logon ko shafaat ke zariye se aag mein se nikaley ga? to unhon ne kaha: haan.",
  "muslim|472": "blashbah kuchh log aag mein se nikaley jayein ge, wo apne chahron ke alawah ( poore ke poore ) us mein jal chakay hoon ge yahan tak ke wo jannat mein dakhil ho jayein ge. ‘ ‘",
  "muslim|474": "dozakh se chaar aadmi niklein ge, unhein Allah ta'ala ki bargah mein pesh kiya jaye ga. un mein se ek mutujah ho ga aur kahe ga: ay mere Rabb! jab to ne mujhe us se nikal hi diya hai to ab dubarah us mein na daalna, chunaanchah Allah ta'ala us ko jahannam se najaat de de ga. ‘ ‘",
  "muslim|483": "logon mein se sab se pahla shakhs mein hoon ga jo jannat ke baare mein safarsh kare ga aur tamam anbia se mere pairokaar zyada hoon ge. ‘ ‘",
  "muslim|484": "ana aksar alanbia taba yom alqiamat, wana awal min yaqra bab aljnat»",
  "muslim|485": "jannat ke baare mein sab se pahla safarsh karne waala mein ho n ga, anbia mein se kisi Nabi ki itni tasdiq nahin ki gayi jitni meri ki gayi. aur blashbah anbia mein isa bhi Nabi hoga jin ki ummat ( dawat ) mein se ek shakhs hi un ki tasdiq karta ho ga. ‘ ‘",
  "muslim|486": "mein qiyamat ke din jannat ke darwaze par aon ga au radroazah khaloon ga. jannat ka darbaan pochhe ga: aap kaun hain? mein jawaab doon ga: Muhammad! wo kahe ga: mujhe aap hi kebaremen hukm mila tha ( ke ) aap se pehle kisi ke liye darwazah na kholon. ‘ ‘",
  "muslim|487": "har Nabi ki ek ( yaqini ) dua hai jo wo mangta hai. mein chahta hoon ke mein apni dua ko qiyamat ke din apni ummat ki safarsh ke liye mehfooz rakhun. ‘ ‘",
  "muslim|488": "yaqeenan har Nabi ki ek dua hai ( jis ki qabuliyat yaqini hai. ) mein ne irada kiya hai ke un shaallah mein apni us dua ko qiyamat ke roz apni ummat ki safarsh karne ke liye mehfooz rakhun ga. ‘ ‘",
  "muslim|491": "har Nabi ki ek dua aisi hai jo ( yaqini taur par ) qubool ki jane wali hai. har Nabi naapni wo dua jaldi mang li ) jabka mein ne apni dua qiyamat ke din apni ummat ki safarsh ke liye mehfooz kar li hai, chunaanchah ye dua inshallah meri ummat ke har us fard ko pahunche gi jo a allah ke saath kisi kushrik na karte hue fot hua. ‘ ‘",
  "muslim|492": "har Nabi ke liye ek qubool ki jane wali dua hai, wo asemangta hai to ( zaroor ) qubool ki jati hai aur wo use ata kar di jati hai. mein ne apni dua qiyamat ke din apni ummat ki safarsh ke liye chhapa ( bacha ) kar rakhi hai. ‘ ‘",
  "muslim|493": "har Nabi ki ek dua hai jo us ne apni ummat ke baare mein mangi aur wo us ke liye qubool hui. aur mein chahta hoon ke inshallah mein apni dua ko qiyamat ke din apni ummat ki safarsh ke liye mokhar kar doon. ‘ ‘",
  "muslim|494": "har Nabi ki ek ( yaqini maqbol ) dua hai jo us ne apni ummat ke liye ki jabka mein ne apni dua qiyamat ke roz apni ummat ki safarsh ke liye mehfooz kar li hai. ‘ ‘",
  "muslim|500": "aag mein. ‘ ‘ phir jab wo palat gaya toap ne use bula kar farmaya: ’’ blashbah mirabap aur tumhara baap aag mein hain. ‘ ‘",
  "muslim|503": "aur apne qaribi rishta daron ko daraye ‘ ‘ nazil hui to Rasool a lalhasli Allah alaihi wasallam ne safa pahad par khare ho kar farmaya: ’’ ay Muhammad ( sallallahu alaihi wasallam ) ki beti fatima! ay Abd almtalb ki beti safiah! ay abdalmtalb ki aulad! mein Allah ta'ala ki taraf se tumhare liye kisi cheez ka ikhtiyar nahin rakhta. ( haan! ) mere maal mein se jochaho mujh se mang low. ‘ ‘",
  "muslim|510": "haan, wo kam gehri aag mein hain ( jo takhnon tak aati hai ) agar mein na hota to wo jahannam ke sab se nachlay tabqe mein hote. ‘ ‘",
  "muslim|511": "haan, mein ne un ko aag ki athaa gahraiyon mein paia to un kam gehri aag tak nikal laya. ‘ ‘",
  "muslim|513": "umeed hai qiyamat ke din meri safarsh un ko nafa de gi aur unhein athali ( kam gehri ) aao ga mein dala jaye ga jo ( bamushkil ) un ke takhnon tak pahunchti ho gi, us se ( bhi ) un ka dimagh khole ga. ‘ ‘",
  "muslim|5137": "kachi aur neem pukhtah khajooron ka khalit ( paani malars ) banayajae, phir ( us mein khamir uthne ke baad ) use piya jaye aur jis din sharaab haraam hui us zamane mein un ki aam sharaab yahi hua karti thi.",
  "muslim|5138": "Ishaq bin Abdullah bin Abi Talhah ne Anas bin Malik razi Allah ta'ala anhu se riwayat ki ke unhon ne kaha: mein Hazrat Abu abidah bin jaraah, Hazrat Abu Talhah aurhazrat Abi bin kaab razi Allah ta'ala anhu ko neem pukhtah aur khashak khajooron ki ( bani hui ) sharaab plarhatha, us waqt un ke pass aanay waala ek shakhs aaya aur kaha: sharaab haraam kardi gayi hai. Hazrat Abu talhat razi Allah ta'ala anhu ne kaha: Anas! jakar us ghade ko toddo, mein ne apna pisne waala patthar ( havan dastah ) uthaya aur us ke nachlay hissay ko us ghade par mara hatta ke wo tut gaya.",
  "muslim|514": "ahl jahannam mein se sab se kam azaab mein wo ho ga jo aag ki do jutian pahne hoga, us ki jution ki garmi se us ka dimagh khole ga. ‘ ‘",
  "muslim|5140": "Hazrat Anas razi Allah ta'ala anhu se riwayat hai ke Nabi kareem sallallahu alaihi wasallam se sharaab ko sirka banane ke mutalliq sawaal kiya gaya to aap ne farmaya: \" nahin.",
  "muslim|5141": "ya us ke banane ko na pasand farmaya, unhon nekha: mein us ko dawa ke liye banata hoon, aap sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne farmaya: \" ye dawa nahin hai, balkeh khud bimari hai.",
  "muslim|5142": "; \" sharaab un do darakhton ( ke phalon ) se banayi jati hai.: khajoor aurangorse.",
  "muslim|5147": "; \" tazua khajooron aur kachi khajooron ko aur kishmish aur khashak khajooron ko nabeez banane ke liye ek doosre ke saath na malao.",
  "muslim|5148": "kishmish aur pukhtah khajooron ko mila kar nabeez banaya jaye aorakachi aur tazah khajooron ko mila kar nabeez banaya jaye.",
  "muslim|515": "dozakhion mein se sab se halka azaab Abu talib ko ho ga, unhon ne do jutian pahan rakhi hoon gi jin se un ka dimagh khole ga. ‘ ‘",
  "muslim|5152": "tum mein sejo shakhs nabeez pee wo sirf kishmish ka nabeez pee ya sirf khashak khajooron ko nabeez pee ya sirf kachi khajooron ka nabeez pee.",
  "muslim|5154": "adh paki khajooron aur paki khajooron ko malakr nabeez na banao aur kishmish aur khashak khajooron ko mila kar nabeez na banao aur donon mein se har ek ki alag alag nabeez banao.",
  "muslim|5156": "neem pukhtah aur pukhtah khajooron ko mila kar nabeez na bina wo aur ta zaa khajooron aur kishmish ko mila kar nabeez na bina wo albatah har jans ki alag alag nabeez bina wo. \"\" Yahya ne ye bhi bata ya ke un ki Abd Allah bin Abi Qatadah razi Allah ta'ala anhu se mila qat ho yi to unhon ne Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam se isi ke maanind riwayat ki.",
  "muslim|516": "qiyamat kedan dozakhion mein se sab kam azaab us aadmi ko ho ga jis ke taloon keniche aag ke do angare rakhe jayein ge, un se us ka dimagh khole ga. ‘ ‘",
  "muslim|5160": "wakia ne akramah bin amar se unhon ne Abu kaseer hanfi se unhon ne Hazrat Abu Hurairah razi Allah ta'ala anhu se riwayat ki, kaha: Rasool Allah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne kishmish aur khajooron kachi aur khashak khajooron ( ko mila kar nabeez bina ne ) se mana kiya aur far ma ya: \" un donon mein se har ek ki alag alag nabeez bina yi ja ye.",
  "muslim|5162": "aur aap ne ahl jarsh ki taraf likha aur us baat se mana kiya ke wo khashak khajooron orkshmsh ko mila kar mashroob banayein.",
  "muslim|5164": "Abd alrazaq ne kaha: humein Ibn jarij ne khabrdi kaha: mujhe Musa bin aqbah ne bata ya unhon ne Nafi se unhon ne Hazrat Ibn Umar razi Allah ta'ala anhu se riwayat ki, ke wo kahakrte the: kachi aur tazah khajooron ko mila kar aur khashak khajooron aur kishmish ko mila kar nabeez bina ne se mana kar diya gaya.",
  "muslim|5165": "rooh ne kaha: humein Ibn jarij ne hadees bayan ki, kaha: mujhe Musa bin aqbah ne na fa se khabar di unhon ne Hazrat Ibn Umar razi Allah ta'ala anhu se riwayat ki, unhon ne kaha: kachi aur tazah khajooron ko aur ( isi tarah ) khashak khajooron aur kishmish ko mila kar nabeez banane se mana kiya gaya hai.",
  "muslim|5166": "lais ne Ibn Shihab se, unhon ne Hazrat Anas bin Malik razi Allah ta'ala anhu se riwayat ki, unhon ne un ko bataya ke Rasool Allah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne kadu ( ke banay hue ) aur roghan zift mile hue bartanon mein nabeez banane se mana farmaya.",
  "muslim|5168": "kadu ke ( banay hue ) bartan mein nabeez na banao aur na roghan zift mile hue bartan mein. \" phir Hazrat Abu Hurairah razi Allah ta'ala anhu ye kehte the: sabz ghadon se ijtinaab karo.",
  "muslim|5169": ". ( Abu Salih ne ) kaha: Hazrat Abu Hurairah razi Allah ta'ala anhu se kahagia ke hantam kiya hai? unhon ne bataya: sabz ( rang ke kapde ) ghade.",
  "muslim|517": "dozakhion mein se sab se halke azaab waala shakhs wo ho ga jis kedonon jutay aur donon tasme aage ke hoon ge, un se us ka dimagh us tarah khole ga jis tarah handiya khulti hai, wo nahin samjhe ga ke koi bhi us se zyada azaab mein hai, halanka haqeeqat mein wo un sab mein se halke azaab mein ho ga. ‘ ‘",
  "muslim|5170": "mein tum ko kadu ke ( banay hue ) bartanon, hantam, khokhli lakdi ke bartanon, roghan qarmle hue bartanon semna karta hoon. hantam wo mashkize hain jin ke munh kate hue hoon. lekin apne mashkizon se piyo aur un ka munh bandh deakro.",
  "muslim|5173": "Aamash ne Ibrahim se unhon ne aswad se, unhon ne Hazrat Aishah razi Allah ta'ala anha se riwayat ki ke Rasool Allah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne kadu ke banay hue orroghan zift mile hue bartanon se mana farmaya.",
  "muslim|5175": "samama bin hazan qashiri ne hadees bayan ki, kaha: mein ne Hazrat Aishah razi Allah ta'ala anha ki khidmat mein hazri di to mein ne un se nabeez ke mutalliq sawaal kiya, unhon ne mujhe hadees sunayi ke ( bano ) abdalqis ka wafad Nabi kareem sallallahu alaihi wasallam ke pass aaya aur unhon ne Nabi kareem sallallahu alaihi wasallam se nabeez ke mutalliq sawaal kiya, aap sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne un ko kaduke ( banay hue ) bartan, khokhli lakdi ke bartanon, roghan zift mile hue bartanon aur sabz ghadon mein nabeez banane se mana farmaya.",
  "muslim|5179": "Habib bin Abi Sabit ne Saeed bin jabeer se, unhon ne Hazrat Ibn abbas razi Allah ta'ala anhu se riwayat ki, kaha: Rasool Allah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne khokhale kadu, sabz ghadon, roghan zift mile bartanon aur khokhli lakdi ( ke bartanon ) se mana farmaya.",
  "muslim|518": "use faidah nahin phunchayn ge, ( kyunki ) us ne kisi ek din ( bhi ) ye nahin kaha tha: mere Rabb! hisaab wa kitaab ke din meri khataen maaf farmana. ‘ ‘",
  "muslim|5180": "Habib bin Abi amrah ne Saeed bin jabeer se, unhon ne Hazrat Ibn abbas razi Allah ta'ala anhu se riwayat ki, kaha: Rasool Allah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne khokhale kadu, sabz ghadon, roghan zift mile hue bartanon ( mein nabeez banane ) se aur kachi aur neem pe pukhtah khajooron ko ( mashroob banatay hue baham ) milane se mana farmaya.",
  "muslim|5181": "Yahya bin Abi Umar ne Hazrat Ibn abbas razi Allah ta'ala anhu se riwayat ki, kaha: Rasool Allah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne kadu ke ( banay hue ) bartanon, khokhli lakdi aur roghan zift mile hue bartanon se mana farmaya.",
  "muslim|5182": "Hazrat Abu Saeed khadri razi Allah ta'ala anhu se riwayat hai ke Rasool Allah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne ghadon mein nabeez banane se mana farmaya.",
  "muslim|5183": "Saeed bin Abi arubah ne Qatadah se, unhon ne Abu nazra se, unhon ne Hazrat Abu Saeed khadri razi Allah ta'ala anhu se riwayat ki ke Rasool Allah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne khokhale kadu, sabzghadon, khokhli lakdi aur roghan zift mile hue bartanon se mana farmaya.",
  "muslim|5185": "Abu mutukal ne Hazrat Abu Saeed razi Allah ta'ala anhu se riwayat ki, kaha: Rasool Allah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne sabz ghade, kadu ke ( banay hue ) bartan aur khokhli lakdi ke bartan mein ( nabeez bina kar ) peene se mana farmaya.",
  "muslim|5186": "mansoor bin hean ne Saeed bin jabeer se riwayat ki, kaha: mein Hazrat Ibn Umar razi Allah ta'ala anhu aur Hazrat Ibn abbas razi Allah ta'ala anhu ke mutalliq shahadat deta hoon ke un donon ne Rasool Allah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ke mutalliq shahadat di ke aap sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne kaduke ( banay hue ) bartanon, sabz ghadon, roghan zift mile bartanon aur khokhli lakdi ( ke bartanon ) se mana farmaya.",
  "muslim|5190": "tha? Hazrat Ibn Umar razi Allah ta'ala anhu ne kaha: logon ne yahi kaha hai, mein ne kaha: Rasool Allah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne us ( qasam ke ghadon ki nabeez ) se mana farmayatha? Hazrat Ibn Umar razi Allah ta'ala anhu ne kaha: logon ne yahi kaha hai.",
  "muslim|5191": "tha? unhon ne kaha: haan. phir taus nekha: Allah ki qasam! mein ne Hazrat Ibn Umar razi Allah ta'ala anhu se us tarah sanahe.",
  "muslim|5192": "Ibn jarij ne kaha: mujhe Ibn taus ne apne walid se khabar di, unhon ne Hazrat Ibn Umar razi Allah ta'ala anhu se riwayat ki ke ek shakhs un ke pass aaya aur puchha: kiya Rasool Allah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne mitti ke ghadon aur kadu ke ( banay hue ) bartan mein nabeez banane se mana farmayatha? unhon ne khahan.",
  "muslim|5193": "wahib ne Abdullah bin taus se, unhon ne apne walid se, unhon ne Hazrat Ibn Umar razi Allah ta'ala anhu se riwayat ki Rasool Allah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne mitti ke ghadon aur kadu ke ( banay hue ) bartan mein nabeez banane se mana farmayatha.",
  "muslim|5194": "tha? unhon ne farmaya: haan.",
  "muslim|5195": "tha. aur ( maharb bin dasar ne ) kaha: mein ne ye ( hadees ) un se ek se zyada baar sunni.",
  "muslim|521": "shashaba ne kaha: mein ne Muhammad bin ziyad se hadees sunni, unhon ne kaha: mein ne Hazrat Abu Hurairah se sunni, unhon nekha: mein nehzrt Abu Hurairah se sunni, unhon nekha: mein ne Rasool Allah sallallahu alaihi wasallam se suna, aap farma rahe the...... ( aage ) rabi ki hadees ki tarah ( hai.)",
  "muslim|5211": "har mashroob jo nasha aawar ho wo haraam hai.",
  "muslim|5212": "har mashroob jo nasha aawar ho wo haraam hai.",
  "muslim|5218": "har nasha aawar cheez khamrhe aur har nasha aawar cheez haraam hai aur jis shakhs ne duniya mein sharaab pi aur us halat mein mar gaya ke wo sharaab ka adi ho gaya tha aur us ne to bah nahin ki thi to wo aakhirat mein use nahin pee ga.",
  "muslim|5221": "har nasha aawar cheez khamar hai aur har khamar haraam hai.",
  "muslim|5222": "jis shakhs ne duniya mein sharaab pi wo aakhirat mein us se mahroom rahe ga.",
  "muslim|5224": "jis shakhs ne duniya mein sharaab pi wo aakhirat mein nahin pee ga. illa ye ke wo taubah karle.",
  "muslim|5226": "Muadh anbari ne kaha: humein Shubah ne Yahya bin abeed Abu Umar bahra ni se riwayat bayan ki kaha: mein ne Hazrat Ibn abbas razi Allah ta'ala anhu ko ye kehte ho ye suna: Rasool Allah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ke liye raat ke ibtada yi hissay mein ( khajorin ) paani mein daal di ja ti thin jab aap subah karte to use ( peete ) aur jo raat aati ( us mein ) peete aur subah ko aur agli raat ko us ke baad ka din Asr tak agar kuchh bach ja ta to khaadim ko pala dete ( ta ke khatm ho ja ye ) ya ( agar koi peene waala na ho ta ya bach ja ti to ) us ko gira dene ka hukm dete.",
  "muslim|5227": "Muhammad bin jafar ne kaha: humein Shubah ne Yahya bahra ni se hadees bayan ki, kaha: logon ne Hazrat Ibn abbas razi Allah ta'ala anhu ke samne nabeez ka zikr kiya to unhon ne kaha: Rasool Allah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ke liye peer ki raat ko mashkize mein ( paani ke saath khajoor daal kar ) nabeez bina li ja ti thi to aap use peer ko aur mangal ko Asr tak peete agar us mein se kuchh bach jata to khaadim ko pala dete ya gradite.",
  "muslim|5228": "Abu Muawiyah ne Aamash se unhon ne Abu Umar se, unhon ne Hazrat abbas razi Allah ta'ala anhu se riwayat ki, kaha: Rasool Allah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ke liye kishmish ko paani mein daal diya ja ta aap us nabeez ko us din aur us se uglay din aur us ke baad wale teesaray din ki shaam tak nosh farma tay, phir aap hukm dete to wo doosron ko pala di ja ti thi ya gira di ja ti thi.",
  "muslim|523": "meri ummat se sattar hazaar afrad jannat mein dakhil hoon ge, chaand ki see soorat mein, un ka ek groh ho ga. ‘ ‘",
  "muslim|5232": "Hasan ki walida ne Hazrat Aishah razi Allah ta'ala anha se riwayat ki, kaha: hum Rasool Allah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ke liye ek mashak mein nabeez bina tay us ka oopar ka hissah bandh diya ja ta tha us mein nichli taraf ka surakh bhi tha. hum subah ko ( khajoor ya kishmish ) daalte to aap use raat ko nosh farma tay aur raat ke waqt daalte to aap sallallahu alaihi wasallam subah ko nau sha farma tay.",
  "muslim|5238": "yahan tak ke mein razi hogaya.",
  "muslim|5245": "Jarir ne Aamash se, unhon ne Sufyan Abu Salih se, unhon ne Hazrat Jabir razi Allah ta'ala anhu se riwayat ki, kaha: ek shakhs jo Abu Humaid kahlatatha, naqia ( maqam se ) se doodh ka ek pyalah laya, jo dhanpa hua na tha to Rasool Allah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne farmaya ke to ne us ko dhanpa kyun nahin? ( agar dhanpne ko kuchh na tha to ) chahe tum us ke oopar chorai ke rukh ek lakdi ( hi ) rakh dete.",
  "muslim|525": "wo aise log hain jo dam nahin karwate, shagun nahin lete, dagne ke zariye se ilaj nahin karwate au rapne Rabb par poora baharosa karte hain. ‘ ‘",
  "muslim|5253": "; \" sooraj ghuroob hone lage to apne phel jane wale janwaron aur bachchon ko baharna bhejo yahan tak ke Isha ki tak ki aamad jahatpta rukhsat hujaye, kyunki sooraj ghuroob hone ke baad Isha ki aamad ka jahatpta khatm hone tak shitanon ko chhora jata hai.",
  "muslim|5255": "humein lais bin Saad ne hadees bayan ki, kaha: mujhe yazid bin Abdullah bin asama bin had lisi ne Yahya bin Saeed se, unhon ne jafar bin Abdullah bin hukm se, unhon ne qaqaa bin hakeem se, unhon ne Hazrat Jabir bin Abdullah razi Allah ta'ala anhu se riwayat ki, kaha: mein ne Rasool Allah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ko farmate hue suna: \" bartan dhank do, mashkize kamanah bandh do, kyunki saal mein ek raat aisi hoti hai jis mein waba nazil hoti hai. phir jis bhi un dhake bartan aur munh khale mashkize ke pass se guzarti hai. to us waba mein se ( kuchh hissah ) us mein utar jata hai.",
  "muslim|5257": "jab tum sone lago toapne gharon mein ( jalti hui ) aag na chhora karo ( use poori tarah bujha diya karo.)",
  "muslim|5264": "bayein haath se na khao kyunki shaitan bayein haath se khatahe.",
  "muslim|5265": "jab tum mein se koi shakhs khanakhaye toapne dayein haath se khaye aur jab tum mein se koi shakhs peetoapne dayein haath se pee kyunki shaitan bayein haath se khatahe urbain haath se pita hai.",
  "muslim|5268": "dayein haath se kha. wo bola ke mere se nahin ho sakta. aap sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne farmaya ke Allah kare tajah se na ho sakay. us ne isa ghuroor ki rah se kiya tha. raawi kehta hai ke wo sari zindagi us haath ko munh tak na utha saka.",
  "muslim|5269": "ay larkay: Bism Allah parh kar dahne haath se kha aur jo pass ho idhar se kha.",
  "muslim|5270": "apne aage se khao.",
  "muslim|5271": "Sufyan bin ainia ne Zuhri se, unhon ne Ubaidullah se, unhon ne Hazrat Abu Saeed razi Allah ta'ala anhu se riwayat ki, kaha: Nabi kareem sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne ( munh laga kar peene ke liye ) mashkon ko altane se mana farmaya.",
  "muslim|5272": "yunis ne Ibn Shihab se, unhon ne Ubaidullah bin Abdullah bin atba se, unhon ne Hazrat Abu Saeed khadri razi Allah ta'ala anhu se riwayat ki ke unhon ne kaha: Rasool Allah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne mashkon koaltne se ( yaani baraah rast ) un ke munh se paani peene se mana farmaya hai.",
  "muslim|5275": ". Qatadah ne kaha: hum ne puchha aur ( khare hokar ) khana? to ( Hazrat Anas razi Allah ta'ala anhu ne ) kaha: ye zyada bura orgnda ( tareeqa ) hai.",
  "muslim|5279": "tum mein se koi shakhs khare hokar har gaz na pee aur jis ne bhool karkhade hokar pi liya, wo qay karde.",
  "muslim|5283": "Muadh ne kaha: humein Shubah ne asm se hadees bayan ki, unhon ne shabi ko suna, unhon ne Hazrat Ibn abbas razi Allah ta'ala anhu se suna, unhon ne kaha: mein ne Rasool Allah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ko zamzam pilaya to aap ne khare khare piya, aap ne ( us waqt ) paani manga tha ( jab ) aap bit Allah ke pass the.",
  "muslim|5285": "hai. ke bartan ke andar sans liya jaye.",
  "muslim|5286": "samama bin Abdullah bin Anas ne Hazrat Anas razi Allah ta'ala anhu se riwayat ki ke Rasool Allah sallallahu alaihi wasallam bartan mein ( se paani peete hue us se munh hata kar ) teen martabah sans lete the.",
  "muslim|5287": "ye ( tareeqa ) zyada sair karne waala, zyada mehfooz aur zyada mazedar hai. \"\" Hazrat Anas razi Allah ta'ala anhu ne kaha: mein ( bhi ) peene ki cheez mein teen martabah sans leta hoon.",
  "muslim|5289": "dayan, us ke baad phir dayan ( maqdam hoga)",
  "muslim|5292": "Imam Malik bin Anas ne Abu Hazim se, unhon ne Hazrat sahal bin saadi razi Allah ta'ala anhu se riwayat ki ke Rasool Allah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ke pass peene ki koi cheez aayi to aap sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne us se piya. aap sallallahu alaihi wasallam ke dayein taraf ek larka tha aur bayein taraf bare log the, aap sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne larkay se farmaya ke to mujh ko bare logon ko pehle dene ki ijazat deta hai? wo bola ke nahin Allah ki qasam mein apna hissah kisi doosre ko nahin dena chahta. ye sun kar aap sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne us larkay ke haath mein de diya.",
  "muslim|5295": "; \" jab tum mein se koi shakhs khanakhaye to wo us waqt tak apna haath saaf na kare, jab tak use khud na chat lay ya kisi aur ko na chatoale.",
  "muslim|5297": "Abu Muawiyah ne Hisham bin Urwah se, unhon ne Abdur Rahman bin Saad se, unhon ne Hazrat kaab bin Malik razi Allah ta'ala anhu ke bete se, unhon ne apne walid se riwayat ki, kaha: Rasool Allah sallallahu alaihi wasallam teen a naglion se khate the aur saaf karne se pehle apna haath ( teen anglian ) chat lete the.",
  "muslim|5298": "Abdullah bin Numair ne kaha: humein Hisham ne Abdur Rahman bin Saad se hadees bayan ki ke Abdur Rahman bin kaab. ya Abdullah bin kaab. ne apne walid kaab ( bin Malik ) razi Allah ta'ala anhu se riwayat ki ke unhon ne un ko hadees sunayi ke Rasool Allah sallallahu alaihi wasallam teen ungliyon se khate the aur jab khane se farigh hote to un ko chat lete the.",
  "muslim|5300": "tum nahin jante us ke kis hasemin barkat hai.",
  "muslim|5301": "jab tum mein se kisi shakhs kalqmah gar jaye to wo use a tha laaor us par jo naapsandedah cheez ( tanka, mitti ) lagi hai us ko achhi tarah saaf karle aur use khale, us luqmay ko shaitan kelee na chhode, aur jab tak apni ungliyon ko chat na lay. us waqt tak apne haath ko rumal se saaf na kare, kyunki use maloom nahin ke us ke khane ke kis hissay mein barkat hai.",
  "muslim|5303": "Jarir ne Aamash se, unhon ne Abu Sufyan se, unhon ne Hazrat Jabir razi Allah ta'ala anhu se riwayat ki, kaha: mein ne Nabi kareem sallallahu alaihi wasallam ko farmate hue suna: shaitan tum mein se har ek ki har halat mein us ke pass hazir hotahe hatta ke khane ke waqt bhi, jab tum mein se kisi se luqmah girjaye to jo kuchh use lag gaya hai. use saaf karke khale aur use shaitan ke liye na chhode aur jab ( khane se ) farigh hotoa pani anglian chat lay kyunki use pata nahin ke us ke khane ke kis hissay mein barkat hai.",
  "muslim|5306": "jab tum mein se kisi ka luqmah gar jaye to wo us se naapsandedah cheez ko door karle aur khale aur us ko shaitan ke liye na chhode. \" aurap ne humein pyalah saaf karne ka hukm diya aur farmaya: \" tum nahin jante ke tumhare khane ke kis hissay mein barkat hai.",
  "muslim|5307": "jab tum mein se koi shakhs khanakhaye to apni ungliyon ko chat lay, kyunki wo nahin janta ke un mein se kis mein barkat hai.",
  "muslim|5325": "ishaq bin Abd Allah bin Abi Talhah se riwayat hai ke unhon ne Hazrat Anas razi Allah ta'ala anhu se suna keh rahe the: ek darzi ne Rasool Allah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ko apne tayar kiye hue khane ki dawat di, Hazrat Anas bin ma luck razi Allah ta'ala anhu ne kaha: mein Rasool Allah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ke saath us khane par gaya, us ne Rasool Allah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ke samne joki roti aur shorbah rakha, us mein kadu aur chhote takdon ki soorat mein mehfooz kiya hua gosht tha Hazrat Anas razi Allah ta'ala anhu ne kaha: mein ne dekha ke Rasool Allah sallallahu alaihi wasallam piya lay ki charon taraf se kadu tala sha karrhethe. ( Hazrat Anas razi Allah ta'ala anhu ne ) kaha: mein isi din se kadu ko pasand karta hoon.",
  "muslim|5326": "sulaiman bin Mughirah ne Sabit se, unhon ne Hazrat Anas razi Allah ta'ala anhu se riwayat ki, kaha: ek shakhs ne Rasool Allah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ko kha ne ki dawat di mein bhi aap ke saath gaya. aap ke liye shorbah la ya gaya us mein kadu ( bhi ) tha Rasool Allah sallallahu alaihi wasallam us mein se kadu kha ne lage wo aao ko achha lag raha tha. jab mein ne ye baat dekhi to mein kadu ( ke tukde ) aap ke samne karne laga aur khud na kha ye. Hazrat Anas razi Allah ta'ala anhu ne kaha: us din ke baad se mujhe kadu bahut achha lagta hai.",
  "muslim|5335": "hai ke koi shakhs sathiyon se ijazat liye bina akthi dodokhajorin khaye.",
  "muslim|5336": "aise ghar ke log bhooke nahin rehte jin ke pass khajorin hoon.",
  "muslim|5337": "Aishah razi Allah ta'ala anha! jis ghar mein khajorin na ho n us mein rahne wale bhooke hain Aishah! jis ghar mein khajorin na ho n us mein rahne wale bhooke hain. jis ghar mein khajorin na ho n us mein rahne wale bhooke hain. ya farmaya ) us ghar ke low ga bhooke rah ja tay hain. aap ne ye kalimaat doya teen baar farma ye.",
  "muslim|5338": "jis shakhs ne subah ke waqt madinah ke dopthrile medanon ke darmiyan ki saath khajorin kha lein, us ko shaam tak koi zahar nuqsaan nahin pahuncha ye ga.",
  "muslim|5339": "jis ne subah ko saat ajua khajorin khalin us din use zahar nuqsaan pahuncha sakay ga na ja do.",
  "muslim|5341": "( madinah ke ) balayi hissay ki ajua khajooron mein shafahe ya ( farmaya: ) subah ke awal waqt mein un ka istemaal taria qa hai.",
  "muslim|5342": "khambi min ( wo khana jo salwi ke saath bani asra yel ke liye aasmaan ki janib se atratha ) ki ek qasam hai aur us ka paani aankhon ke liye shafa hai.",
  "muslim|5345": "khambi us min mein se hai jise Allah taa li ne bani asra yel ke liye nazil kiya tha aur us ka paani aankhon ke liye shafa hai.",
  "muslim|5346": "khambi us min mein se hai jise Allah taa li ne Hazrat moo see alaihi assalam ko ( aasmaan se ) utaar kar ata kiya tha aur us ka paani aankhon ke liye shafa hai.",
  "muslim|5347": "khambi us min mein se hai jise Allah azujal ne bani asral par ( aasmaan se ) utara tha aur us ka paani aankhon ke liye shafahe.",
  "muslim|5348": "khambi us min mein se hai aur us ka paani aankhon ke liye shafa hai.",
  "muslim|5349": "un mein se siyah pilo chano. \" hum ne arz ki, Allah ke Rasool Allah sallallahu alaihi wasallam! yun lagta hai jaise aap ne bakrian chara yi ho n aap sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne farmaya: \" haan koi Nabi nahin jis ne bakrian na chara yi hoon. \" ya isi tarah ki baat irshad farma yi.",
  "muslim|5350": "salnon mein se umdah ya ( farmaya ) umdah salan sirka hai.",
  "muslim|5352": "sirka umdah salan hai sirka umdah salan hai.",
  "muslim|5367": "do aadmiyon ka khana teen ke liye kafayat karne waala hotahe aur teen ka khana chaar ko kaafi hota hai.",
  "muslim|5370": "ek aadmi ka khana do aadmiyon ke liye kaafi hojata hai aur do ka khana chaar ke liye kaafi hojata hai.",
  "muslim|5371": "ek aadmi ka khana do aadmiyon ke liye kaafi hojata hai. aur do aadmiyon ka khana cha ra ke liye kaafi hojata hai. aur chaar ka khana aath ke liye kaafi hojata hai.",
  "muslim|5372": "kafir saat aanton mein khata hai jabka momin ek aant mein khata hai.",
  "muslim|5374": "waqad bin Muhammad bin Zaid se riwayat hai ke unhon ne Nafi se suna, unhon ne kaha: Hazrat Ibn Umar razi Allah ta'ala anhu ne ek miskeen ko dekha wo us ke samne kha na rakhte rahe rakhte rahe kaha: wo shakhs bahut zyada kha na khata raha unhon ( Ibn Umar razi Allah ta'ala anhu ) ne kaha: aainda ye shakhs mere haan na aaye kyunki mein ne Rasool Allah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ko ye farma tay hue suna, bula shabah kafir saat aanton mein khata hai.",
  "muslim|5377": "momin ek aant mein khata hai jabka kafir saat aanton mein khata hai.",
  "muslim|5385": "jo shakhs chandi ke bartan mein pita hai wo apne pait mein ghataght jahannam ki aag bhar raha hai.",
  "muslim|5387": "jo shakhs sone ya cha nadi ke bartan mein pita hai wo apne pait mein ghataght jahannam ki aag bhar raha hai.",
  "muslim|5400": "resham pahno dibaaj pahno aur na sone aur chandi ke bartan mein piyo aur na un ( qimti dhaton ) ki rakabiyon ( pleton ) mein kha wakiyunka ye bartan duniya mein un ( kafar ) ke liye hain.",
  "muslim|5410": "ra yasham na pahno, kyunki jis ne duniya mein use pahna wo aakhirat mein us ko nahin pahne ga.",
  "muslim|5417": "sawaey do ya teen ya chaar ungliyon ( ki pati ) ke.",
  "muslim|5420": "mein ne ye tumhare pass us liye nahin bheja tha ke tum us ko pahan low, mein ne tumhare pass us liye bheja tha ke tum us ko kat kar auraton mein dopate bant do.",
  "muslim|5424": "tha wo farmachke hain? aap sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne farmaya: \" mein ne ye tumhare pass us liye nahin bheja ke tum us ko pahno, mein ne tumhare pass us liye bheja hai ke tum us ki qimat se faidah uthao.",
  "muslim|5425": "; \" jis shakhs ne dena mein ra yasham pahna wo aakhirat mein us ko nahin pahne ga.",
  "muslim|5427": "ye ( aba ) taqwi ikhtiyar karne walon ke liye munasib nahin hai.",
  "muslim|543": "koi musalman nahin jis ki farz namaz ka waqt ho jaye, phir wo us ke liye achhi tarah wuzu kare, achhi tarah khushu se use ada kare aur ahsan andaz se ruku kare, magar wo namaz us ke pichhle gunahon ka kafarah ho gi jab tak wo kabirah gunah ka irtakaab nahin karta aur ye baat hamesha ke liye ki. ‘ ‘",
  "muslim|5440": "Hammam ne kaha: humein Qatadah ne hadees bayan ki, kaha: hum ne Hazrat Anas bin ma luck razi Allah ta'ala anhu se po chha: Rasool Allah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ko kis qasam ka libaas zyada mahbub tha ya Rasool Allah sallallahu alaihi wasallam koziadah achha lagta tha? unhon ne kaha: dhari dar ( yamni ) chadar.",
  "muslim|5443": "inhi dukapdon mein Rasool Allah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ki wafat ho yi thi. Ibn hatim ne apni hadees mein kaha: moo ta tahbnd.",
  "muslim|5449": "ab anqrib ho n ge.",
  "muslim|545": "qatibah bin Saeed, Abu Bakr bin Abi shibah aur Zuhair bin harab ne kaha: ( us hadees ke alfaaz qatibah aur Abu Bakr kehen ) humein wakia ne Sufyan ke hawale se Abu nazar se hadees sunayi, unhon ne Abu Anas se riwayat ki ke Hazrat Usman razi Allah anhu ne almaqaad ke pass wuzu kiya, kiya kehne lage: kiya mein tumhein Rasool Allah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ka wuzu ( kar ke ) na dakhaon? phir har azu ko teen teen baar dhoya. qatibah ne apni riwayat mein ye izafah kiya: Sufyan ne kaha: Abu nazar ne aboans se riwayat bayan karte hue kaha: un ( Usman razi Allah anhu ) ke pass Rasool a allah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ke sahabah mein se kayi log mojod the.",
  "muslim|5450": "ab anqrib hoja ain ge. Hazrat ja bar razi Allah ta'ala anhu ne kaha: meri biwi ke pass ek ghala fa tha mein us se kehta tha: use mujh se door rakho, aur wo kehti thi Rasool Allah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne farmaya tha: \" anqrib ghala fa hua karein ge.",
  "muslim|5452": "ek bistar mard ke liye hai ek us ki biwi ke liye tisra bistar mehman ke liye aur chotha bistar shaitan ke liye hai.",
  "muslim|5453": "jo shakhs takabbur se kapda ghaseet karchle Allah taa li us ki taraf nazar tak nahin kare ga.",
  "muslim|5455": "jo shakhs takabbur se kapda ghaseet kar chalta hai qiyamat ke din Allah taa li us ki taraf nazar nahin farma ye ga.",
  "muslim|5457": "jis shakhs ne takabbur se kapda ghasita Allah taa li qiyamat ke din us ki taraf nazar tak nahin farma ye ga.",
  "muslim|5462": "Abd Allah! apni chadar oopar karlo. \" mein ne apni chadar oopar karli. aap ne far ma ya: \" aur zyada kar low \" mein ne aurziadah oopar ki, phir mein us koopar karta raha hatta ke baaz low gon ne arz ki kahan tak ( oopar kare )? aap sallallahu alaihi wasallam nefar ma ya: \" pandliyon ke adhe hisson tak.",
  "muslim|5465": "ek shakhs apne balon aur apni chadron par atrata ho a chal raha tha khacha nak us ko zamin mein dhansa diya gaya aur wo qiyamat tak zamin mein dhansta chala ja ye ga.",
  "muslim|5467": "ek shakhs akadta hua apni do chadron mein chala ja raha tha apne aap par atararha tha Allah taa li ne use zamin mein dhansa diya wo qiyamat tak zamin mein dhansta chala ja ye ga.",
  "muslim|5481": "Muadh bin Hisham ne humein hadees bayan ki, kaha: mujhe mere walid ne Qatadah se hadees sunayi, unhon ne Hazrat Anas razi Allah ta'ala anhu se riwayat ki ke Nabi kareem sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne ahl ajm ki taraf khat likhne ka irada kiya to aap se arz ki gayi ke wo log sirf us khat ko qubool karte hain jis par mahr lagi ho, us par Rasool Allah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne chandi ki ek anguthi banoai. kaha: mujhe isa lagta hai ke mein ( ab bhi ) Rasool Allah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ke haath mein us ( anguthi ) ki safedi ko dekh rahahon.",
  "muslim|5482": "Muhammad Rasool Allah \" naqsh karaya.",
  "muslim|5493": "tha ke mein un donon mein se kisi ungli mein anguthi pahnon, phir unhon ne darmiyani aur ( angothay ki taraf se ) us ke saath wali ungli ki taraf isharah kiya.",
  "muslim|5495": "jab tum mein se koi shakhs juta pahne to dayein ( paaon ) se ibtada kare aur jab juta ataray to bayein ( paaon ) se abtadakre aur donon jutay pahne ya donon jutay utaar de.",
  "muslim|5496": "tum mein se koi shakhs ek jutay mein na chale, donon jutay pahne ya donon jutay utaar de.",
  "muslim|5499": "aadmi apne bayein haath se khaye, ya ek juta pahan karchle aur isa kapda pahne jis mein bahar nikalnay wale aaza ( sir, haath, paaon ) kelee surakh na hoon aur ek hi kapda us tarah kamar aur ghutnon ke gard bandhay ke us ki sharmagaa zahr ho.",
  "muslim|550": "panchon namazein aur ( har ) Jumuah ( doosre ) Jumuah tak darmiyani mudat ke gunahon ka kafarah ( un ko mitanay wale ) hain jab tak kabirah gunahon ka irtakaab na kiyajae. ‘ ‘",
  "muslim|5501": "lais ne Abu Zubair se, unhon ne Hazrat Jabir razi Allah ta'ala anhu se riwayat ki ke Rasool Allah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne haath paaon wagairah ko bandkardine waala libaas pahanne, ek kapde sekmar aur ghutnon ko bandhanay aur chat let kar ek paaon ko doosre ke oopar ( rakhte hue us ko ) athane se mana farmaya.",
  "muslim|5502": "ek juta pahan kar na chalo aur ek chadar ( hotoas ) ko ghatne khare karke un ke aur kamar ke gard na bandho, bayein haath se na khao, haath paaon band kardine waala kapda na pahno aur jab chat lete hoto ek tang ko doosri tang ( khadi kar ke us ) par na rakho.",
  "muslim|5503": "tum mein se koi shakhs chat let kar apni tang kudosri tang ( khadi karke us ) par na rakhe.",
  "muslim|551": "panchon namazein aur ek Jumuah ( doosre ) Jumuah tak darmiyani mudat ke gunahon kakfarah hain. ‘ ‘",
  "muslim|5510": "yahud oraor nasara ( balon ko ) rang nahin laga tay tum un ki mukhalfat karo ( balon ko rang laga wo.)",
  "muslim|5514": "farishte us ghar mein dakhil nahin hote jis mein kutta ho na ( us ghar mein jis mein ) koi tasveer ho.",
  "muslim|5515": "farishte us ghar mein dakhil nahin hote jis mein kutta ho na ( us ghar mein jis mein ) koi tasveer ho.",
  "muslim|552": "karte the: ’’jab ( insaan ) kabirah gunahon se ijtinaab kar raha ho to paanch namazein, ek Jumuah ( doosre ) Jumuah tak aur ek Ramazan doosre Ramazan tak, darmiyan ke arsay mein hone wale gunahon ko mitanay ka sabb hain. ‘ ‘",
  "muslim|5523": "Abu asama ne Hisham ( bin Urwah ) se, unhon ne apne walid se, unhon ne Hazrat Aishah razi Allah ta'ala anha se riwayat ki, kaha: Rasool Allah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ek safar se wapas aaye, mein neroin dar kapda darwaze ka pardah banaya hua tha jis par paron wale ghodon ki tasveerein thin to aap ne mujhe ( utaar ne ka ) hukm diya to mein ne us ko atardiya.",
  "muslim|5525": "; \" qiyamat ke din shadid tarin azaab mein pade hue logon mein se wo ( bhi ) hoon ge jo Allah ta'ala ki paida ki hui ( jandar ) ashya ke jaisi ( mushaba ) banane ki koshish karte hain.",
  "muslim|5535": "jo low ga tasveerein bina tay hain unhein qiyamat ke din azaab diya ja ye ga, un se kaha ja ye ga jin ko tum ne takhleeq kiya ( ab un ko zindah karo.)",
  "muslim|5546": "( rahmat ke ) farishte ( safarke ) un rafiqon ke saath nahin chalte jin ke darmiyan kutta hoor na ( un ke saath jin ke pass ) ghanti ho.",
  "muslim|5548": "ghanti shaitan ki bansri hai.",
  "muslim|5550": "( janwar ko ) munh par mara ja ye ya munh par nishani sabat ki jaye.",
  "muslim|5552": "jis ne use ( munh par ) dagahe us par Allah ki lanat ho.",
  "muslim|5553": "Hazrat Umm Salamah razi Allah ta'ala anha ke aazaad kardah ghala mim naam Abu Abd Allah ne hadees bayan ki ke unhon ne Hazrat Ibn abbas razi Allah ta'ala anhu se suna, wo farmarhe the Rasool Allah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne ek gadha dekha jis ke chehre ko nishani laga ne ke liye dagha gaya tha aap ne us ko bahut bura khayal kiya, unhon ne ( Hazrat Ibn abbas razi Allah ta'ala anhu ) ne kaha: Allah ki qasam! mein jo hissah chehre se sab se zyada door ho us ke alawah kisi jagah nishani sabat nahin kar ta. phir unhon ne apne gadhe ke baare mein hukm diya to us ki sarin ( ke wo hissay jahan dam halate waqt lagti hai ) par nishani sabat ki gayi ye pehle aadmi hain janhon ne us jagah dagne ka aaghaz kiya.",
  "muslim|5555": "Muhammad bin jafar ne kaha: humein Shubah ne Hisham bin Zaid se hadees bayan ki, unhon ne kaha: mein ne Hazrat Anas razi Allah ta'ala anhu ko ye hadees bayan karte ho ye suna, ke jab un ki walid ke haan bacha paida hua to wo log us bachche ko Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam ke pass lay gaye ta ke aap use ghati dein us waqt Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam oonton ke ek bade mein the aur bakrion ko nishan laga rahe the Shubah ne kaha: mera ghalb guman ye hai ke unhon ne ( Hazrat Anas razi Allah ta'ala anhu ) ne kaha tha ( aap sallallahu alaihi wasallam ) un ( bakrion ) ke ka noon par nishan laga rahe the. ( oonton ko lagane ke baad bakrion ko bhi waheen la kar nishan laga rahe the.)",
  "muslim|5559": "mein ne Nafi se po chha: qaza kiya hai? unhon ne kaha: bachche ke sir ke kuchh hissay ke bal monddee ja ain aur kuchh hissay ko chhor diya ja ye.",
  "muslim|5565": "Allah ne bal jodnay wali aur jadoane wali ( donon ) par lanat ki hai.",
  "muslim|5568": "amru bin mar ha ne kaha: mein ne Hasan bin Muslim se suna, wo safiah bint shibah se hadees bayan karrhe the, unhon ne Hazrat Aishah razi Allah ta'ala anha se riwayat ki ke Ansaar ki ek larki ne shadi ki, wo bimar hogayi thi jis se us ke bal jhad gaye the un logon ne us ke balon ke saath bal jodnay ka irada kiya to unhon ne Rasool Allah sallallahu alaihi wasallam se us ke mutalliq siwa la kiya, aap sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne balon mein jod lagane wali aur jod lagwaney wali ( donon ) par lanat farmayi.",
  "muslim|5587": ": \" tamha rey namon mein se Allah taa li ke nazdeek sab se zyada pasandeedah naam Abd Allah aur Abdur Rahman hain.",
  "muslim|5593": "Ansaar ne achha kiya, mere naam par naam rakho, meri kanit par ( apni ) kanit na rakho.",
  "muslim|5597": "mere naam par naam rakho aur meri kanit par kanit na rakho. \" amru nekha \" Hazrat Abu Hurairah razi Allah ta'ala anhu se ra wait hai \" kaha aur \" mein ne suna \" nahin kaha.",
  "muslim|5599": "aflah ( zyada kamiyab ), rabah ( munafah waala ), yasar ( aasani waala ) aur Nafi ( nafa pahunchane waala)",
  "muslim|560": "jab tum mein se koi kisi thos cheez ( patthar, dahila, tailt paper wagairah ) se astanja kare to taaq adad mein kare aur jab tum mein se koi wuzu kare tunak mein paani dalay, phir naak jahade. ‘ ‘",
  "muslim|5600": "apne larkay ( ghulam, khaadim ) ka naam rabah, yasar, aflah, aur Nafi na rakho.",
  "muslim|5607": "Abu bakr bin Abi shibah, Muhammad bin Musanna urmahmd bin bashar ne kaha: humein Muhammad bin jafar ne hadees bayan ki, Muhammad bin jafar aurabidallah ke walid Muadh ne Shubah se, unhon ne Ata bin Abi Maimunah se, unhon ne Abu rafa se, unhon ne Hazrat Abu Hurairah razi Allah ta'ala anhu se riwayat ki ke Hazrat zainab ( bint Umm Salamah razi Allah ta'ala anha ) ka naam brah tha to kaha gaya ke wo ( naam batatey waqt khud ) apni parsai bayan karti hain, to Rasool Allah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne un ka naam zainab rakh diya. hadees ke alfaaz Ibn bashar ke alawah baqi sab ke ( bayan kardah ) hain. Ibn Abi shibah ne kaha: humein Muhammad bin jafar ne Shubah se hadees bayan ki.",
  "muslim|5611": "Allah ta'ala ke nazdeek qiyamat kedan sab sezyadah ganda orghzab kamsthaq shakhs wo hoga joshhanshaa kahlata hoga, Allah ke siwa koi aur badshah nahin hai.",
  "muslim|562": "jo wuzu kare wo naak jahade aur jo astanja kare wo taaq adad mein kare. ‘ ‘",
  "muslim|5634": "Ali bin hashim ne Talhah bin Yahya se isi sanad ke saath hadees bayan ki, magar unhon ne kaha: to unhon ( Hazrat Umar razi Allah ta'ala anhu ) ne kaha: Abu manzar! ( Abi bin kaab razi Allah ta'ala anhu ki kanit ) kiya aap ne Rasool Allah sallallahu alaihi wasallam se ye hadees sunni thi? unhon ne kaha: haan, Ibn khatab! to aap Rasool Allah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ke sahabah karam rizwan Allah anham ajmayin ke liye azaab na banein aur unhon ne Hazrat Umar razi Allah ta'ala anhu ka qol: subhanallah aur us ke baad ka hissah zikr nahin kiya.",
  "muslim|5635": "kaun hai \"? mein ne kaha: mein. aap bahar tashreef la ye aur aap farma rahe the \" mein, mein ( kaisa jawaab hai?)",
  "muslim|564": "jab tum mein se koi neend se bedar ho to teen naak jahade, shaitan us ki naak ke banson par raat guzarta hai. ‘ ‘",
  "muslim|5641": "Hazrat Anas bin Malik razi Allah ta'ala anhu se riwayat hai ke ek shakhs ne Rasool Allah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ke hujre mein jaha nika Rasool Allah sallallahu alaihi wasallam chooday phal ka ek teer ya kayi tirle kar uthe jaise mein Rasool Allah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ko dekh raha ho n ke aap khamoshi se us ki aankhon mein wo teer chabho ne ke amka nun ka jaizah lay rahe the.",
  "muslim|5642": "jis ne ijazat ke bina low gon ke ghar mein tank jhank ki, unhein aja zat hai ke wo us ki aankh pahuddin.",
  "muslim|5643": "agar koi shakhs ijazat ke bina tamha rey haan jaha nikay aur tum kankri marker us ki aankh phoddo to tum par koi gunah nahin hai ( koi sazaya jarmanah nahin.)",
  "muslim|5644": "yazid bin zariya, Ismail bin alaihi aur hashim ne yo nas se, unhon ne amru bin Saeed se, unhon ne abuzraa se, unhon ne Hazrat Jarir bin Abd Allah razi Allah ta'ala anhu se riwayat ki, kaha: Rasool Allah sallallahu alaihi wasallam se achanak nazar parja ne ke baare mein po chha to aap ne mujhe hukm diya ke mein apni nazar hata lon.",
  "muslim|5646": "soar ped la ko salaam kare, chalne waala baithe ho ye ko salaam kare aur kam low ga zyada logon ko salaam karein.",
  "muslim|565": "tum mein se koi shakhs jab thos cheez se astanja kare to taaq adad mein kare. ‘ ‘",
  "muslim|5652": "jab ahl kitaab tum koslam karein to tum un ke jawaab mein \" walaikum \" ( ortam par ) kaho.",
  "muslim|5653": "tum log \" walaikum \" ( aur tum par ) kaho.",
  "muslim|5654": "( us par ) tum ( alaikum ) ( tajah par ho ) kaho.",
  "muslim|5656": "Sufyan bin Uyainah ne humein Zuhri se hadees bayan ki unhon ne Urwah se, unhon ne Hazrat Aishah razi Allah ta'ala anha se riwayat ki, kaha: yahudion ki ek jamaat ne Rasool Allah sallallahu alaihi wasallam se milne ke liye ijazat talab ki aur unhon ne kaha ( alsam alaikum ) ( aap par moo te ho! ) Hazrat Aishah razi Allah ta'ala anha ne kaha: balkeh tum par maut ho aur lanat ho. Rasool Allah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne far ma ya: Aishah! Allah taa li har maan mile mein narmi pasand far ma ta hai. Hazrat Aishah razi Allah ta'ala anha ne arz ki: kiya aap ne sananhin ke unhon ne kiya kaha tha? aap sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne far ma ya: mein ne ( wa alaikum ) ( aur tum parho ) keh diyatha.",
  "muslim|5661": "yahud nasara ko salaam kehne mein abtadanah karo aur jab tum un mein se kisi ko raaste mein malo ( to baja ye us ke wo ye kaam kare ) tum use raaste ke tang hissay ki taraf ja ne par majborkrdo.",
  "muslim|5663": ". Yahya bin Yahya ne kaha: humein hashim ne siyare se khabar di, unhon ne Sabit bina ni se, unhon ne Hazrat Anas razi Allah ta'ala anhu se riwayat ki, ke Rasool Allah sallallahu alaihi wasallam un ( Ansaar ) ke ladkon ke pass se guzre to aap ne un ko salaam kiya.",
  "muslim|5665": "Shubah ne siyar se riwayat ki, kaha: mein Sabit banani ke saath ja raha tha wo kuchh bachchon ke pass se guzre to unhein salaam kiya, phir Sabit ne ye hadees bayan ki ke wo Hazrat Anas razi Allah ta'ala anhu ke saath ja rahe the wo bachchon ke pass se guzre to unhon ne un ko salaam kiya. aur Hazrat Anas razi Allah ta'ala anhu ne hadees bayan ki ke wo Rasool Allah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ke saath ja rahe the aap sallallahu alaihi wasallam bachchon ke pass se guzre to un ko salaam kiya,",
  "muslim|5666": "tamha rey liye mere pass aanay ki yahi ijazat hai ke hijab utha diya ja ye aur tum mere raz ki baat sun low, ( ye ijazat us waqt tak hai ) hatta ke mein tumhein rok doon",
  "muslim|5673": "suno! koi shakhs kisi shadi shadah aurat ke pass raat ko na rahe, illa ye ke us ka khawind ho ya mahram ( ghair shadi shadah aurat ke pass rehna orziadah sakhti se mamnoa hai.)",
  "muslim|5674": "; \" tum ( ajnabi ) auraton ke haan jane se bacho. Ansaar mein se ek shakhs ne kaha: Allah ke Rasool sallallahu alaihi wasallam! dewar/jeth ke mutalliq aap ka kyakhiyal hai? aap sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne farmaya; \" dewar/jeth to maut hai.",
  "muslim|5676": "Ibn wahab ne kaha: mein ne lais bin Saad se suna, keh rahe the: hamo ( dewar/jeth ) khawind kabhai hai ya khawind ke rishta daron mein us jaisa rishta rakhne waala, maslan: us ka chicha zad wagairah.",
  "muslim|5683": "lais ne na fa se unhon ne Hazrat Ibn Umar razi Allah ta'ala anhu se aur unhon ne Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam se riwayat ki ke aap ne far ma ya: tum mein se koi shakhs kisi doosre ko us ki jagah se na utha ye ke phir wahan ( khud ) baitth jaye",
  "muslim|5684": "koi shakhs kisi doosre shakhs ko us ki jagah se na utha ye ke phir wahan baitth jaye \", balkeh khale ho kar betho aur wasaat paida karo.",
  "muslim|5686": "tum mein se koi shakhs apne bha yi ko us jagah se na utha yeka phir us ki jagah par baitth jaye. \" ( salim ne kaha ) Hazrat Ibn Umar razi Allah ta'ala anhu ka ye tareeq tha ke koi shakhs un ke liye ( khud bhi ) apni jagah se uthtaa to wo us ki jagah par na bethte the.",
  "muslim|5694": "jab teen shakhs ( mojod ) hoon to ek ko chhor kar do aadmi aao pas mein sargoshi na karein.",
  "muslim|5696": "jab tum teen log ( ek saath ) hoto ek ko chhor kardo aadmi baham sargoshi na karein, yahan tak ke tum bahut se logon mein mil jao, kahin isa na hukah ye ( doki sargoshi ) use gamzdah karde.",
  "muslim|5697": "; \" jab tum teen log hoto apne saathi ko chhor kar do aapas mein sargoshi na karein kyunki ye cheez us ko gham zadah karde gi.",
  "muslim|5699": "Allah ke naam se, wo aap ko bachaye aur har bimari se shafa de aur hasad karne wale ke shar se jab wo hasad kare aurnzar lagane wali har aankh ke sharse ( aap komahfuz rakhe.)",
  "muslim|570": "( un ) ediyon ke liye aag ka azaab hai. wuzu achhi tarah kiya karo. ‘ ‘",
  "muslim|5700": "haan. \" Hazrat Jibreel alaihi assalam ne ye kalimaat kahe: \" mein Allah ke naam se aap ko dam kartahon, har cheez se ( hifazat ke liye ) jo aap ko takleef de, har nafs aur har hasad karne wali aankh ke shar se, Allah aap ko shafa de, mein Allah ke naam se aao pe ko dam kar ta hoon.",
  "muslim|5701": "nazar haq ( Sabit shadah baat ) hai.",
  "muslim|5702": "nazar haq ( Sabit shadah baat ) hai, agar koi aisi cheez hoti jo taqder par sabqat lay jasakti to nazarsbqat hai jati. aur jab ( nazar bad ke ilaj kelee ) tum se ghusl karne ke liye kaha jaye to ghusl karlo.",
  "muslim|5709": "takleef door karde, ay sab logon ke palne wale! us ko shafa ata kar, to shafa dene waala hai, teri shafa ke siwa koi shafa nahin, aisi shafa ( de ) jo ( zarah barabar ) bimari ko na chhode.",
  "muslim|5712": "takleef door farmade, ay sab ansanon ke palne wale! shafa tere hi haath mein hai, tere siwa us takleef ko door karne waala aur koi nahin.",
  "muslim|5714": "bamuzat \" ( panah dalwanay wale kuchh kalimaat ) hain.",
  "muslim|5715": "Malik ne Ibn Shihab se, unhon ne Urwah se, unhon ne Hazrat Aishah razi Allah ta'ala anha se riwayat ki, ke jab Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam bima ra hote to aap khud par moazat ( moaztin aur digar panah dalwanay wali duayein aur aayat ) parhte aur phoonk maarte. jab aap ki takleef shadid ho gayi to mein aap par parhti aur aap ki taraf se mein aap ka apna haath us ki barkat ki umeed ke saath ( aap ke jism athar par ) phirti.",
  "muslim|5725": "zainab bint Umm Salamah razi Allah ta'ala anha ne Umm almomnin Hazrat Umm Salamah razi Allah ta'ala anha se riwayat ki ke Rasool Allah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne apni zujah Hazrat Umm Salamah razi Allah ta'ala anha ke ghar mein ek larki ke baare mein jis ke chehre ( ke ek hissay ) ka rang badla hua dekha farmaya: \" us ko nazar lag gayi hai us ko dam karao. \" aap ki murad us ke chehre ki peela hut se thi.",
  "muslim|5732": "apne dam ke kalimaat mere samne pesh karo dam mein koi harj nahin jab tak us mein shark na ho.",
  "muslim|5741": "har bimari ki dawa hai, jab koi dawa bimari par theek bitha di jati hai to mariz Allah ta'ala kehkam se tandrust hojatahe.",
  "muslim|5742": "bakir ne kaha ke asm bin Umar bin Qatadah ne unhein hadees sunayi ke Hazrat Jabir bin Abdullah razi Allah ta'ala anhu ne maqne ( bin sanan tabi ) ki ayaadat ki, phir farmaya: mein ( us waqt tak ) yahan se nahin jaon ga jab tak ke tum pachhne na lagwalo, kyunki mein ne Rasool Allah sallallahu alaihi wasallam se suna hai, aap farmate hain; \" yaqeenan us mein shafahe.",
  "muslim|5744": "Hazrat Jabir razi Allah ta'ala anhu se riwayat ki ke Hazrat Umm Salamah razi Allah ta'ala anhu ne Rasool Allah sallallahu alaihi wasallam se pachhne lagwaney ke mutalliq ijazat talab ki to Nabi kareem sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne Hazrat abotiba razi Allah ta'ala anhu ko hukm diya ke unhein pachhne lagayin. unhon ne ( Jabir razi Allah ta'ala anhu ) ne kaha: Hazrat Abu tayyaba razi Allah ta'ala anhu Hazrat Umm Salamah razi Allah ta'ala anha ke razai bhai the ya nabalig larkay the. ( aur unhon ne haath ya paaon aisi jagah pachhne lagaejanhin dekhna mahram ya bachche ke liye jaiz hai.)",
  "muslim|575": "ediyon ke liye aag ka azaab hai",
  "muslim|5751": "; \" bakhar jahannam ki lapton se hai, us ko paani se thanda karo.",
  "muslim|5752": "; \" bakhar ki shiddat jahannam ki lapton se hai, us ko paani se thanda karo.",
  "muslim|5755": "bakhar jahannam ki lapton se hai us ko paani se thanda karo.",
  "muslim|5757": "us ( bakhar ) ko paani se thandakro. \" aur kaha ( wo kahten: ) \" ye jahannam ki lapton se hai.",
  "muslim|5759": "bakhar jahannam ke josh se hai, us ko paani se thandakro.",
  "muslim|576": "wapas jao aur apna wuzu khub achhi tarah karo- ‘ ‘ wo wapas gaya, ( hukm par amal kiya ) phir namaz parhi.",
  "muslim|5766": "shonez sam ( maut ) ke alawah har bimari se shafa hai. \" \" sam: maut hai aur haba soda ( se murad ) shonez ( zersiyaa ) hai.",
  "muslim|5768": "maut ke siwa koi bimari nahin jis ki shonez ke zareese shafa na ho ti ho.",
  "muslim|5773": "taaoon azaab ki alamat hai, Allah ta'ala ne apne bandon mein kuchh logon ko taaoon mein mabatlakia, jab tum taaoon ke baare mein suno to wahan mat jao aur jab us sarzamin mein taaoon waqa hujaye jahan tum hoto wahan se mat bhago. \"\" ye qanbi ki hadees hai, qatibah ne bhi us tarah bayan kiyahe.",
  "muslim|5774": "ye taaoon ek azaab hai jotam se pehle logon par maslat kiya gaya tha, ya ( farmaya: ) bani israel par maslat kiyagia tha, agar ye kisi alaqemen hoto tum us se bhag kar wahan se na nikalna aur agar kisi ( doosri ) sir zamin mein ( taaoon ) mojod hoto tum us mein dakhil na hona.",
  "muslim|5775": "ye ek azaab yasza hai jise Allah ta'ala ne bani israel ke ek groh par bheja tha, ya ( farmaya: ) un logon par jo tum se pehle the, lehza tum jab kisi sarzamin mein us ke ( phelne ke ) mutalliq suno to us mein us ke hote hue dakhil na hona aur jab ye tum par war da hujaye to us sebhag karohan se na nikalna.",
  "muslim|5777": "ke aap sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne farmaya: ye bimari ( taaoon ek ) azaab hai jo tum se pehle ek ummat ko hua tha. phir wo zamin mein rah gaya. kabhi chala jata hai, kabhi phir aata hai. lehza jo koi kisi mulk mein sune ke wahan taaoon hai, to wo wahan na jaye aur jab us ke mulk mein taaoon namudaar ho to wahan se bhagay bhi nahin.",
  "muslim|578": "jis ne wuzu kiya aur khub achhi tarah wuzu kiya, to us ke jism se us kegnaa kharij ho jate hain hatta ke us ke nakhunon keniche se bhi nikal jate hain. ‘ ‘",
  "muslim|5792": "koi marz khud bakhud doosre ko nahin lag ja ta. aur us ke saath ye bayan karte \" bimar oonton waala ( apne oont ) sehat mand oonton wale ke pass na la ye. \" yo nas ki hadees ke maanind.",
  "muslim|5794": "ala ke walid ( Abd ar-Rahman ) ne Hazrat Abu Hurairah razi Allah ta'ala anhu se riwayat ki ke Rasool Allah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne far ma ya:: kisi se khud bakhud marz ka lag jana khopdi se alokanklna, satare ke ghaeb ho ne aur tulu ho ne se baarish barsna aur safar ( ki nahost ) ki koi haqeeqat nahin.",
  "muslim|5795": "kisi se koi marz la zami taur par nahin chamt ja ta. na bad shaguni koi cheez hai, na chala way ( ghol bia bani ) ki koi haqeeqat hai.",
  "muslim|5796": "kisi se koi marz khud bakhud nahin chamatta, na chala wa koi cheez hai, na safar ki ( nahost ) koi haqeeqat hai.",
  "muslim|5798": "bad shaguni ki koi haqeeqat nahin aur shagun mein se achhi nek faal hai. \" arz ki gayi. Allah ke Rasool sallallahu alaihi wasallam! faal kiya hai? ( wo shagun se kis tarah mukhtalif hai? ) aap sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne far ma ya: \" ( faal ) nek kalimah hai to tum mein se koi shakhs santa hai.",
  "muslim|5801": "kisi se koi marz khud bakhud nahin lagta barashgon ki koi cheez nahin aur mujhe nek faal achhi lagti hai. \" kaha aap se arz ki gayi: nek faal kiya hai? far ma ya: \" pakeezah kalimah ( daya huslah afzayi ya da na yi par mabni koi jumlah.)",
  "muslim|5802": "kisi par lazmi taur par bimar ee lag ja ne ki koi haqeeqat nahin bad shaguni koi shay nahin aur mein achhi faal ko pasand karta hoon.",
  "muslim|5803": "la zami taur par khud bakhud kisi se bimar ee lag ja ne ki koi haqeeqat nahin, khopdi se alunklna koi cheez nahin, bad shaguni kuchh nahin aur mein nek fa la ko pasand karta hoon.",
  "muslim|5804": "Imam Malik ne Ibn Shihab se, unhon ne Abd Allah bin Umar razi Allah ta'ala anhu ke do beton hamza aur salim se, unhon ne Hazrat Abd Allah bin Umar razi Allah ta'ala anhu se riwayat ki ke Rasool Allah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne far ma ya: adam moafqat ( naszadari ) ghari, aurat aur ghode mein ho sakti hai.",
  "muslim|5807": "agar kisi cheez mein kisi namoafqat ka ho na bar haq ho sakta hai to wo ghode aurat aur makaan mein hai.",
  "muslim|5809": "agar kisi cheez mein adam moafqat ho to ghode, makaan aur aurat mein ho gi.",
  "muslim|5810": "agar ye baat ho to aurat, ghode aur ghar mein ho gi. \" aap ki murad adam moafqat se thi.",
  "muslim|5812": "Ibn jarij ne kaha: mujhe Abu Zubair ne bata ya ke unhon ne Hazrat Jabir razi Allah ta'ala anhu se suna, wo Rasool Allah sallallahu alaihi wasallam se khabrde rahe the ke Rasool Allah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne far ma ya: agar kisi cheez mein ye baat ho gi to ghar, kadm aur ghodemen ho gi.",
  "muslim|5813": "tum ka hanon ke pass na ja ya karo. \" mein ne arz ki: hum bad shaguni lete the, aap ne far ma ya: \" ye ( badshgoni ) mehaz ek khayal hai jo koi insaan apne dil mein mahsus karta hai, ye tumhein ( kisi kaam se ) na roke.",
  "muslim|5821": "jo shakhs kisi ghib ki khabar yan suna ne wale ke pass aaye aur us se kisi cheez ke baare mein pochhe to chalis raton tak us shakhs ki namaz qubool nahin hoti.",
  "muslim|5849": "( pehle ) anbia alaihi assalam mein se ek Nabi ko kisi chionti ne ka t liya, unhon ne chiontion ki poori basti ke baare mein hukm diya to wo jala di gayi. us par Allah taa li ne un ke taraf wahi ki ke ek chionti ke katne ki wajah se aap ne ummaton mein se ek aisi ummat ( bari aabadi ) ko hila ki kar diya. jo Allah ki tasbeeh karti thi?",
  "muslim|585": "ay imaan wali qaum ke diyari! tum sab par salamati ho, hum bhi agar Allah nechaha to tumhare saath milne wale hain. ‘ ‘ us ke baad Ismail bin jafar ki riwayat ki tarah hai. haan Malik ki riwayat mein ye alfaaz hain: ’’ to kuchh logon ko mere hoz se hataya jaye ga. ‘ ‘ ( illa, yaani khabardar ke bajaye fa, yaani ’to ‘ ka lafz hai.)",
  "muslim|5852": "ek aurat ko billi ke sabb se azaab diya gaya, us ne billi ko qaid kar ke rakha yahan tak ke wo mar gayi. wo aurat us ki wajah se jahannam mein chali gayi, us aurat ne jab billi ko qaid kiya to na us ko khila ya pala ya aur na us ko chhora hi ke wo zamin ke andar aur oopar rahne wale chhote chhote janwar kha leti.",
  "muslim|5855": "ek aurat ko billi ke maamle mein azaab diya gaya. us aurat ne na use khila ya na pala ya aur na us ko chhora ke wo zamin ke chhote ja nor kha leti.",
  "muslim|5862": "Allah ta'ala far ma ta hai.. Ibn Adam dahar ( waqt, zamane ) ko bura kehta hai jabka ( Rabb ) dahar mein hi hoon. raat aur din ( janhin insaan waqt kehta hai ) mere haath mein hain.",
  "muslim|5863": "Allah taa li far ma ta hai. Ibn Adam mujhe izadita hai ( nara za karta hai ) wo zamane ko bura kehta hai jabka mein hi ( Rabb ) dharhon, ra te aur din ko paltta hoon.",
  "muslim|5864": "Allah azujal ne irshad far ma ya: Ibn Adam mujhe iza deta hai wo kehta hai. \" haye zamane ( waqt ) ki namaradi! \" tum mein se koi \" haye zamane ki namaradi! \" ( jaisa jumlah ) na kahe, kyunki dahar ( ka Malik ) mein hoon. raat aur din ko paltta hoon aur mein jab cha hoon ga un ki basaat lapait do ga.",
  "muslim|5865": "tum mein se koi shakhs ye na kahe ke \" haye zamane ki namaradi! \" kyunki Allah taa li hi zamane ( ka Malik ) hai.",
  "muslim|5866": "zamane ko bura mat kaho kyunki Allah taa li hi zamanah ( ka Malik ) hai.",
  "muslim|5867": "tum mein se koi shakhs zamane ko bura na kahe, kyunki Allah taa li hi zamane ( ka Malik ) hai aur tum mein se koi shakhs anb ( angoor aur us ki bail ) ko karam na kahe, kyunki karam ( asal ) mein musalman aadmi ho ta hai.",
  "muslim|5868": "( angoor aur us ki bail ko ) karam na kaho, kyunki ( haqeeqat mein ) karam moo min ka dil ho ta hai.",
  "muslim|5869": "( a angoor aur us ki bail ) ko karam na kaho, kyunki karam ( asal mein ) musalman aadmi ho ta hai.",
  "muslim|587": "kiya mein tumhein aisi jiz se aagaah na karun jis ke zariye se Allah ta'ala gunah mita deta hai au ra darjaat buland farmata hai? ‘ ‘ sahabah ne arz ki: ay Allah kersol kyun nahin! aap ne farmaya: ’’nagoarion bawajood achhi tarah wazukarna, masajid tak zyada qadam chalna, ek namaz ke baad doosri namaz ka intizaar karna, sau yahi rabat ( shaitan ke khilaf jung ki chhaoni ( hai. ‘ ‘)",
  "muslim|5870": "tum mein se koi shakhs ( angoor aur us ki bail ko ) karam na kahe kyunki karam to moo min ka dil hai.",
  "muslim|5871": "Hammam bin manba ne kaha: ye aha dis hain jo Abu Hurairah razi Allah ta'ala anhu ne humein Rasool Allah sallallahu alaihi wasallam se suna ain. unhon ne kayi ahadees bayan kein un mein ye bhi thi: aur Rasool Allah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne far ma ya: tum mein se koi shakhs angoor aur us ki bail ko karam na kahe, kyunki karam to musalman aadmi ho ta hai.",
  "muslim|5872": "( angoor aur us ki bail ko ) karam na kaha karo. lekin hablah keh low. \" aap ki murad angoor se thi.",
  "muslim|5875": "tum mein se koi shakhs ( kisi ghulam ko ) mera bandah na kahe, pas tum sab Allah ke bandeho, albatah ye keh sakta hai. mera joan aur na ghulam ye kahe: merarab ( palne waala ) albatah mera syed ( aaqa keh sakta hai. \"\" hadees nambar5876. Abu Muawiyah aur wakia donon ne Aamash se isi sanad ke saath riwayat ki un donon ki hadees mein hai. \"\" ghala mim apne aaqa ko mera moo la na kahe. \"\" abumaaoia ki hadees mein mazid ye alfa za hain. \"\" kyunki tamha ra maula Allah azujal hai.)",
  "muslim|5880": "tum mein se koi shakhs ye na kahe. miraji ganda ho gaya hai, balkeh ye kahe, ke miraji bujhal ho gaya hai. ( ya meri tabiyat kharaab ho gayi hai.)",
  "muslim|5883": "jis shakhs ko rehan ( khushboo dar phool ya tahni ) di jaye to wo use mastard na kare kyunki wo utha ne mein halki aur khushboo mein umdah hai",
  "muslim|5884": "Nafi ne kaha: Hazrat Ibn Umar razi Allah ta'ala anhu jab khushboo ka dhuan lete to udka dhuan lete, us mein kisi aur cheez ki aamezash na ho ti aur kafoor ka dhuan lete. us mein kuchh aud mila lete, phir bata ya ke Rasool Allah sallallahu alaihi wasallam isi tarah khushboo ka dhuan lete ( aur kapdon mein basatay ) the.",
  "muslim|590": "masar ne maqdam bin sharih se aur unhon ne apne walid se riwayat ki, unhon ne kaha: mein ne Hazrat Aishah se puchha, mein ne kaha: Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam jab ghar tashreef late to kis baat ( kaam ) se aaghaz farmate the? unhon ne farmaya: masoak se.",
  "muslim|591": "Sufyan ne maqdam bin sharih se baqi mandah sabiqah sanad se Hazrat Aishah se riwayat ki ke Nabi sallallahu Allah alaihi waslmajb apne ghar tashreef late to masoak se aaghaz farmate.",
  "muslim|600": "munchin achhi tarah tarasho aur dadhian badhao",
  "muslim|601": "Abu bakr bin Nafi ne apne walid se, unhon ne Hazrat Ibn Umar razi Allah anhu se aur unhon ne Nabi sallallahu Allah alaihi waslmarwait ki ke aap ne munchin achhi tarah taraashne aur dadhi badhane ka hukm diya.",
  "muslim|602": "mashrkon ki mukhalfat karo, munchin achhi tarah tarasho aur dadhian badhao. ‘ ‘",
  "muslim|603": "munchin achhi tarah kato aur dadhian badhao, majus ki mukhalfat karo. ‘ ‘",
  "muslim|610": "jab tum mein se koi qazae hajat ki jagah par baithe to na qable ki taraf munh kare aur na hi us ki taraf pusht kare",
  "muslim|612": "Yahya bin Saeed ne Muhammad bin Yahya se, unhon ne apne chicha wasa bin haban se riwayat ki, unhon ne kaha: mein masjid mein namaz parh rahatha aur Abd Allah bin Umar razi Allah anhu apni past qable ki taraf laga kar baithe hue the. jab mein ne apni namaz poori kar li to apna pehlu badal kar un ki taraf munh kar liya to Abd Allah razi Allah anhu ne farmaya: kuchh log kehte hain: jab tum qazae hajat ke liye betho, jo bhi ho, qable ki taraf aur bit almaqdas ki taraf munh kar ke na betho. Abd Allah razi Allah anhu ne farmaya: halanka mein ghar ki chhat par chadha to mein ne Rasool Allah sallallahu alaihi wasallam kodikha ke qazae hajat ke liye do anton par bit almaqdas ki taraf rukh kar ke baithe hue the.",
  "muslim|618": "tum do sakhat lanat wale kaamon se bacho. ‘ ‘ sahabah karam ne arz ki: ay Allah ke Rasool! sakhat lanat wale wo do kaam kaun se hain? aap ne farmaya: ’’jo insaan logon ki guzargah mein ya un ki saaya dar jagah mein ( jahan wo aaraam karte hain ) qazae hajat karta hai ( log un donon kaamon par us ko sakhat bura bhala kehte hain. ) ‘ ‘",
  "muslim|620": "do mukhtalif sndon se Shubah se riwayat hai, unhon ne Ata bin Abi Maimunah se aur unhon ne Hazrat Anas razi Allah anhu se suna, wo kehte the: Rasool Allah sallallahu alaihi wasallam qazae hajat ke liye khali jagah jate to mein aur mere jaisa ek larka paani ka bartan aur ek nezah athate ( aur door tak aap ka saath dete ) aur aap paani se astanja karte.",
  "muslim|639": ". ( abdalar zaq ne ) kaha: Sufyan ( Sauri ) jab bhi amru ( bin Qais malaai ) ka tazkarah karte to un ki tareef karte.",
  "muslim|648": "jab tum mein se kisi ke bartan mein kutta zabaan ke saath pi lay aur wo us cheez ko baha de, pharbartan ko saat dafah dhole. ‘ ‘",
  "muslim|650": "jab kutta tum mein se kisi ke bartan mein pi lay to wo use saat dafah dhoye. ‘ ‘",
  "muslim|6501": "tumhari maa, phir tumhari maa, phir tumhari maa, phir tumhara baap, phir jo tumhara zyada qaribi ( rishta dar ) ho, ( phir jo us ke baad ) tumhara qaribi ho. \" ( isi tarteeb se aage haq dar banein ge.)",
  "muslim|6504": "kiya tumhare walidain zindah hain? \" us ne kaha: ji haan, aap sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne kaha: ji haan, aap sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne farmaya: \" phir un ( ki khidmat baja lane ) mein jihad karo. ( apni jaan aur maal ko un ki khidmat mein sirf karo.)",
  "muslim|651": "jab tumhare bartan mein se kutta pi lay to us ki taharat ( paak hona ) ye hai ke use saat dafah dhoye, pehli dafah mitti ke saath dhoye. ‘ ‘",
  "muslim|6511": "us shakhs ki naak khak aalud ho gayi, phir us ki naak khak aalud ho gayi, phir us ki naak khak aalud ho gayi. \" puchha gaya: Allah ke Rasool! wo kaun shakhs hai? farmaya: \" jis ke hote hue us ke maa baap, un mein se kisi ek ko ya donon ko badhape ne paia, phir wo ( un ki khidmat kar ke ) jannat mein dakhil na hua.",
  "muslim|6514": "apne walid ke saath sab se bara nek sulook ye hai ke insaan us shakhs se bhi bahut achha sulook kare jis ke saath us ke walid ka mohabbat ka rishta tha.",
  "muslim|6516": "neki achha khalaq hai, aur gunah wo hai jo tumhare dil mein khatkay aur tum napasand karo ke logon ko us ka pata chale.",
  "muslim|6519": "raham ( khoni rishton ka sara silsilah ) arsh ke saath chimta hua hai aur ye kehta hai: jis ne mere taluq ko jod kar rakha Allah us ke saath taluq jode ga aur jis ne mere taluq ko tod diya Allah ta'ala us se taluq tod lay ga.",
  "muslim|652": "jab tum mein se kisi ke bartan mein se kutta pi lay to us ki pakeezgi ye hai ke use saat dafah dhoye. ‘ ‘",
  "muslim|6520": "qataa karne waala jannat mein dakhil nahin ho ga. \"\" Ibn Abi Umar ne bataya ke Sufyan ne kaha: yaani qataa rahmi karne waala.",
  "muslim|6521": "qataa rahmi karne waala jannat mein dakhil nahin ho ga.",
  "muslim|6523": "jo shakhs ye chahta ho ke us par us ka rizq kashadah kiya jaye ya us ke chhode hue ko mokhar kiya jaye ( khud us ki aur us ki chhodi hui ashya, aamaal aur aulad ki Umar lambi ho ) wo silah rahmi kare.",
  "muslim|6524": "jo shakhs ye chahta ke us ke liye us ke rizq mein kashadgi ki jaye aur jo us ne chhor jana hai us ki muhlat lambi ki jaye to wo silah rahmi kare.",
  "muslim|6526": "ek doosre se bughz na rakho, ek doosre se hasad na karo, ek doosre se rogrdani na karo aur Allah ke bande ( ek doosre ke ) bhai bin kar raho. kisi musalman ke liye halaal nahin ke teen din se zyada apne bhai se taluq tark kiye rakhe.",
  "muslim|6532": "kisi musalman ke liye halaal nahin ke wo teen din se zyada apne bhai ko chhor de ( qataa taluq kar ke rakhe ke ) donon ek doosre se malin to ye bhi munh mor lay aur wo bhi munh mor lay aur donon mein se behtar wo hai jo salaam mein pahal kare.",
  "muslim|6534": "momin ke liye halaal nahin ke teen din se zyada apne ( musalman ) bhai se taluq tark kare.",
  "muslim|6535": "teen din ke baad ( bhi ) rothe rehna jaiz nahin hai.",
  "muslim|6536": "badagmani se door raho kyunki badagmani sab se zyada jhuti baat hai, doosron ke zahri aib talash karo na doosron ke batni aib dhondo, maal wa daulat mein ek doosre ke saath masabqat na karo, ek doosre se hasad na karo, aapas mein bughz na rakho, ek doosre se rogrdani na karo, aur Allah ke aise bande bin kar raho jo aapas mein bhai bhai hain.",
  "muslim|6537": "ek doosre se tark taluq mat karo, ek doosre se rogrdani na karo, doosron ke aib talash na karo, tum mein se koi kisi ki bia par bia na kare aur Allah ke aise bande bin jao jo aapas mein bhai bhai hain.",
  "muslim|6538": "ek doosre se hasad na karo, ek doosre se bughz na rakho, doosron ke zahri aib talash na karo, doosron ke batni aib mat dhondo, ek doosre ke liye dhoke se qeematein na badhao, aur Allah ke aise bande bin jao jo aapas mein bhai bhai hain.",
  "muslim|6540": "ek doosre se bughz na rakho, ek doosre se rogrdani na karo, daulat ka hasool aur namaish mein ek doosre se maqablah na karo aur Allah ke aise bande bin jao jo aapas mein bhai bhai hain.",
  "muslim|6543": "Allah ta'ala tumhari surton aur tumhare amwal ki taraf nahin dekhta, lekin wo tumhare dilon aur aamaal ki taraf dekhta hai.",
  "muslim|6547": "logon ke aamaal har hafte mein do baar pesh kiye jate hain, peer ke din aur jamarat ke din aur har imaan rakhne wale bande ki maghfirat kar di jati hai, us bande ke siwa ke us ke aur us ke bhai ke darmiyan adawat aur bughz hota hai. to ( un ke baare mein ) kaha jata hai: un donon ko chhor do, ya mokhar kar do yahan tak ke donon ( adawat chhor kar ek doosre ki taraf ) wapas aao jayein.",
  "muslim|6548": "Allah ta'ala qiyamat ke din farmaye ga: mere jalal ki bina par ek doosre se mohabbat karne wale kahan hain? aaj mein unhein apne saaye mein rakhun ga, aaj ke din jab mere saaye ke siwa aur koi saaya nahin.",
  "muslim|6551": "mariz ki ayaadat karne waala wapas aanay tak jannat ke darmiyan guzarne wali rosh par hota hai.",
  "muslim|6553": "ek musalman jab apne musalman bhai ki ayaadat karta hai to wapas aanay tak musalsal jannat ki ek rosh mein mojod hota hai.",
  "muslim|6562": "ek momin ko koi kanta nahin chabhata ya us se zyada koi takleef nahin hoti magar Allah ta'ala us se us ka ek darjah buland kar deta hai ya us ki bina par us ka ek gunah mita deta hai.",
  "muslim|6563": "ek momin ko jab bhi koi kanta chabhata hai ya us se badh kar koi takleef hoti hai to Allah ta'ala us ki wajah se us ka ek gunah mita deta hai.",
  "muslim|6565": "koi bhi museebat nahin jis mein koi musalman mabatla ho magar us ki bina par us ka koi gunah us se hata diya jata hai hatta ke wo kanta bhi jo use chabhata hai ( aur kisi gunah ka kafarah bin jata hai.)",
  "muslim|6566": "musalman par koi bhi museebat nahin aati, chahe ek kanta hi ( chabha ) ho magar us ki wajah se us ki ghaltian maaf kar di jati hain ya us ko us ki kuchh ghaltion ka kafarah bina diya jata hai. \"\" yazid ko pata nahin ke Urwah ne un donon mein se kaun sa jumlah bola tha.",
  "muslim|6567": "koi bhi museebat nahin jo momin par aati hai, hatta ke wo kanta bhi jo use chabhata hai to Allah us ke badle us ke liye ek neki likh deta hai ya us ki wajah se us ki koi ghalti maaf kar di jati hai.",
  "muslim|6568": "momin ko koi takleef nahin pahunchti, na thakawat, na bimari, na gham hatta ke koi fikr bhi jo use fikrmand kar de magar us ke badle us ke gunahon ko mita diya jata hai.",
  "muslim|6570": "Umm saib ya ( farmaya: ) Umm masib! tahin kiya hua? kiya tum shiddat se kanp rahi ho? \" unhon ne kaha: bakhar hai, Allah ta'ala us mein barkat na de! aap ne farmaya: \" bakhar ko bura na kaho, kyunki ye Adam ki aulad ke gunahon ko us tarah door karta hai jis tarah bhati lohe ke zang ko door karti hai.",
  "muslim|6576": "zulm se bacho, kyunki zulm qiyamat ke din ( dilon par chahane wali ) zulmatein hoon gi. bakhal aur house se bacho, kyunki tum se pehle logon ko bakhal wa house ne halak kar diya, isi ne un ko aksaiya to unhon ne apne ( ek doosre ke ) khun bahae aur apni harmat wali chizon ko halaal kar liya.",
  "muslim|6577": "zulm qiyamat ke din kayi zulmatein ( tareekiyan ) hoon gi.",
  "muslim|658": "tum mein se koi thahre hue paani mein ghusl janabat na kare. ‘ ‘ ( Abu saib ne ) kaha: ay Abu Hurairah! wo kiya kare? unhon ne jawaab diya: wo ( us mein se ) paani lay lay.",
  "muslim|6580": "qiyamat ke din tum sab haqdaron ke huqooq un ko ada karo ge, hatta ke us bakri ka badlah bhi jis ke sing tod diye gaye hoon ge, singon wali bakri se poora poora liya jaye ga.",
  "muslim|6585": "ek musalman doosre musalman ke liye ek imarat ke maanind hai, jis ki ek ( aint ) doosri ( aint ) ko mazboot karti hai.",
  "muslim|6586": "musalmanon ki ek doosre se mohabbat, ek doosre ke saath raham dilli aur ek doosre ki taraf altafat wa taaun ki misal ek jism ki tarah hai, jab us ke ek azu ko takleef hoti hai to baqi sara jism bidari aur bakhar ke zariye se ( sab aaza ko ek doosre ke saath mila kar ) us ka saath deta hai.",
  "muslim|6588": "musalman ( baham ) ek hi insaan ki tarah hain, agar us ke sir mein takleef ho to bakhar aur be khwabi ke zariye se baqi sara jism us ka saath deta hai.",
  "muslim|6591": "ek doosre ko bura bhala kehne wale jo kuchh bhi kehte hain, us ka wabaal pahal karne wale par hai jab tak mazloom had se tajaooz na kare.",
  "muslim|6592": "sadqe ne maal mein kabhi koi kami nahin ki aur maaf karne se Allah ta'ala bande ko izzat hi mein badhata hai aur koi shakhs ( sirf aur sirf ) Allah ki khatir toaza ( anksaar ) ikhtiyar nahin karta magar Allah ta'ala us ka maqam buland kar deta hai.",
  "muslim|6594": "Allah ta'ala duniya mein jis shakhs ki pardah poshi karta hai, qiyamat ke din bhi us ka pardah rakhe ga.",
  "muslim|6595": "duniya mein koi bandah kisi ( doosre ) bande ka aib nahin chhapata magar qiyamat ke roz Allah ta'ala us ke aib chhapa lay ga.",
  "muslim|6599": "jo shakhs narm khoi se mahroom kar diya jaye wo bhalai se mahroom kar diya jata hai.",
  "muslim|6601": "Aishah! Allah ta'ala narmi karne waala aur narmi ko pasand farmata hai aur narmi ki bina par wo kuchh ata farmata hai jo darshat mizaji ki bina par ata nahin farmata, wo us ke alawah kisi bhi aur baat par itna ata nahin farmata.",
  "muslim|6602": "narmi jis cheez mein bhi hoti hai us ko zeenat bakhsh deti hai aur jis cheez se bhi narmi nikal di jati hai use badsort kar deti hai.",
  "muslim|6608": "ek sadeeq ke shayan shan nahin ke wo zyada lanat karne waala ho.",
  "muslim|6612": "blashbah zyada lanat karne wale qiyamat ke roz na shahadat dene wale hoon ge aur na shafaat karne wale.",
  "muslim|6616": "ay Allah! mein sirf ek bashr hoon, us liye mein jis musalman ko bura bhala kahoon ya us par lanat karun ya us ko koray marun to use us ke liye pakeezgi ( ka zariya ) aur rahmat bina de.",
  "muslim|6619": "ay Allah! mein tajah se ahd leta hoon jis mein to mere saath hargaz khilaf warzi nahin farmaye ga ke mein ek bashr hi hoon, mein jis kisi momin ko takleef pahnchaon, use bura bhala kahoon, us par lanat karun, use koray marun to un tamam baton ko qiyamat ke din us ke liye rahmat, pakeezgi aur aisi qurbat bina de jis ke zariye se to use apna qurb ata farmaye.",
  "muslim|6623": "ay Allah! mein jis bandah momin ko bura bhala kahoon to us ke liye use qiyamat ke din apni qurbat mein badal dena.",
  "muslim|6624": "ay Allah! mein ne tere hazur pukhtah ahd liya hai jis mein to mere saath hargaz khilaf warzi nahin farmaye ga ke koi bhi momin jise mein ne takleef pahunchayi ho ya use bura bhala kaha ho ya use koray se mara ho, use to qiyamat ke din us ke liye ( gunahon ka ) kafarah bina dena.",
  "muslim|6630": "badtareen ansanon mein se do rakha shakhs ( bhi ) hota hai. wo un logon se ek chehre ke saath milta hai aur un logon se doosre chehre ke saath milta hai.",
  "muslim|6632": "tum logon mein se badtareen shakhs use pao ge jis ke do chehre hain, un ke pass ek chehra lay kar aata hai aur un ke pass doosra chehra lay kar aata hai.",
  "muslim|6636": "kiya mein tum ko ye na bataon ke badtareen haraam kiya hai? ye chughli hai jo logon ki zabaan par ruan ho jati hai. \" aur Muhammad sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne farmaya: \" insaan sach bolta rehta hai yahan tak ke ( Allah ta'ala ke haan ) wo sadeeq likh diya jata hai aur jhoot bolta rehta hai hatta ke us ko kazab likh diya jata hai.",
  "muslim|6637": "sach neki aur achhai ke raaste par lay jata hai aur neki jannat ki taraf lay jati hai, ek aadmi sach bolta rehta hai hatta ke wo Allah ke haan sadeeq likh diya jata hai aur jhoot fasaq wa fajor ki taraf lay jata hai aur fasaq wa fajor ( jahannam ki ) aag ki taraf lay jata hai aur ek aadmi jhoot bolta rehta hai, yahan tak ke Allah ta'ala ke nazdeek use kazab likh diya jata hai.",
  "muslim|6643": "( koi shakhs ) pachhad dene se taqat nahin hota. taqtor ( mazboot ) wo hai jo gusse ke waqt khud ko qabu mein rakhta hai.",
  "muslim|6649": "jab Allah ta'ala ne jannat mein Hazrat Adam alaihi assalam ki soorat bina li to jab tak chaha un ( ke jasd ) ko wahan rakha. Iblees us ke irdgird ghoom kar dekhne laga ke wo kaisa hai. jab us ne dekha ke wo ( jism ) andar se khokhala hai to us ne jaan liya ke use us tarah paida kiya gaya ke ye khud par qabu nahin rakh sakta.",
  "muslim|6651": "jab tum mein se koi shakhs apne ( musalman ) bhai se laday to chehre ( par marne ) se ijtinaab kare.",
  "muslim|6653": "jab tum mein se koi shakhs apne bhai se laday to chehre ( par marne ) se bachche.",
  "muslim|6654": "jab tum mein se koi shakhs apne bhai se laday to us ke chehre par tamanchah na maare.",
  "muslim|6658": "Allah ta'ala un logon ko azaab de ga jo duniya mein logon ko azaab dete hain.",
  "muslim|6660": "blashbah Allah ta'ala un logon ko mabatlae azaab kare ga jo duniya mein logon ko azaab mein mabatla karte hain.",
  "muslim|6661": "un teeron ko un ki nokon ( ki taraf se ) pakdo.",
  "muslim|6662": "Hammad bin Zaid ne amru bin dinar se, unhon ne Hazrat Jabir bin Abdullah razi Allah anhu se riwayat ki ke ek shakhs chand teer lay kar masjid mein se guzra, us ne un ke pikan khol rakhe the, aap ne hukm diya ke wo unhein pikanon ( aage wale lohe ke nokdar hisson ) ki taraf se pakade takeh wo kisi musalman ko kharach na laga dein.",
  "muslim|6664": "jab tum mein se koi shakhs majlis ya bazar mein se guzre aur us ke haath mein teer hoon to wo unhein un ke pikanon ( nokdar hisson ) se pakade, phir ( tanbia hai ) un ke nokile hissay ki taraf se pakade, phir ( takid hai ) un ke nokile hisson ki taraf se pakade. \"\" kaha: to Hazrat Abu Musa razi Allah anhu ne kaha: Allah ki qasam! ( hamara ye hal hai ke ) hum ne marnay se pehle ( apni isi zindagi mein ) un teeron ko ek doosre ke chahron ki taraf sidha kar liya hai.",
  "muslim|6665": "jab tum mein se koi shakhs hamari masjid ya hamare bazar mein se guzre aur us ke pass teer hoon to wo unhein apni hatheli se un ke tez nokdar hisson ki taraf se pakade, kahin isa na ho ke us ka koi hissah musalmanon mein se kisi shakhs ko lag jaye. \"\" ya farmaya: \"\" wo un ke pikanon ko apni muthi mein pakade.",
  "muslim|6666": "jis ne apne bhai ki taraf lohe ke kisi hathiyar se isharah kiya to us par farishte lanat karte rehte hain yahan tak ke wo us kaam ko tark kar de, chahe wo us ka maa baap jaya bhai hi kyun na ho.",
  "muslim|6668": "tum mein se koi shakhs apne bhai ki taraf hathiyar se isharah na kare, kyunki tum mein se koi shakhs nahin janta ke shayad shaitan achanak us ke haath mein use harkat de ( aur wo doosre musalman ko lag jaye ) aur wo ( jis ke haath se hathiyar chale ) jahannam ke gadhay mein gar jaye.",
  "muslim|6669": "ek shakhs raaste par chala ja raha tha, us ne raaste par ek kante dar tahni dekhi to use ( ek taraf ) hata diya. Allah ta'ala ke use us ka inaam diya to us ki bakhshish farma di.",
  "muslim|6670": "ek shakhs raaste se oopar padi hui darakht ki ek shakh ke pass se guzra to us ne kaha: Allah ki qasam! mein us shakh wa musalmanon ke raaste se hata doon ka takeh ye un ko iza na de to us shakhs ko jannat mein dakhil kar diya gaya.",
  "muslim|6672": "ek darakht musalmanon ko aziat deta tha, chunaanchah ek shakhs aaya aur use kat diya to wo jannat mein dakhil ho gaya.",
  "muslim|6675": "ek aurat ko billi ki wajah se azaab diya gaya, us ne billi ko bandhay rakha hatta ke wo mar gayi to wo isi wajah se jahannam mein dakhil ho gayi, kyunki jab us ne billi ko bandha to na us ko khilaya, na pilaya aur na us ko chhora ke wo ( khud hi ) zamin ke kidey makore kha leti.",
  "muslim|6679": "ek aurat apni billi ya bale ki wajah se dozakh mein chali gayi jis ko us ne bandh kar rakha tha, na khud us ko khilaya aur na use chhora ke zamin ke chhote mote janwar chunaa kha leti, yahan tak ke wo kamzor ho kar mar gayi.",
  "muslim|6680": "izzat Allah azujal ka tahbnd hai aur kabriyai us ( ke kandhon ) ki chadar hai. jo shakhs un ( safat ) ke maamle mein mere madmaqabil mein aaye ga, mein use azaab doon ga.",
  "muslim|6682": "bahut se ghubar mein ate hue ( ghareeb alotan, musafir ) bakharay hue balon wale, darwazon se dhatkar diye jane wale log aise hain ke agar un mein se koi Allah ta'ala par ( aitmad kar ke ) qasam kha lay to Allah ta'ala us ki qasam poori kar deta hai.",
  "muslim|6683": "jab ek shakhs ( ye ) kehta hai: log halak ho gaye to wo unhein halak kar deta hai. \"\" ( Imam Muslim ke ek shagird ) aboashaq ne kaha: mujhe ( yaani taur par ) maloom nahin ke ( kaf ke ) zabar ke saath ahlkham ( us ne unhein halak kar diya hai ) ya pesh ke saath ahlkham ( un sab se badh kar halak karne waala hai ).",
  "muslim|6685": "mujhe jabrel musalsal hamsae ke saath Hasan sulook ke liye kehte rahe, hatta ke mujhe yaqeen hone laga ke wo zaroor inhi warasat mein sharik kar dein ge.",
  "muslim|6688": "abuzar! jab tum shorba pakao to us mein paani zyada rakho aur apne padosiyon ko yaad rakho.",
  "muslim|6689": "jab tum shorbay waala salan pakao to us mein paani zyada rakho, phir apne hamsaiyon mein se kisi ( zaroorat mand ) gharane ko dekho aur us mein se kuchh achhe tariqe se un ko bhajwa do.",
  "muslim|6690": "neki mein kisi cheez ko haqeer na samjho, chahe yahi ho ke tum apne ( musalman ) bhai ko khultay hue chehre se malo.",
  "muslim|6691": "tum ( abhi us ki ) shafaat karo, tumhein bhi ajr diya jaye ga aur Allah ta'ala apne Nabi ki zabaan se wahi faislah jari karae ga jo us ko pasand ho ga.",
  "muslim|6695": "jis shakhs ne do larkiyon ki un ke balig hone tak parwarish ki, qiyamat ke din wo aur mein us tarah aayin ge. \" aur aap sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne apni ungliyon ko malaya.",
  "muslim|6696": "jis kisi musalman ke teen bachche fot ho jayein to use aag sirf qasam poora karne ke liye chahwe gi.",
  "muslim|6698": "tum mein se jis aurat ke bhi teen bachche fot ho jayein aur wo un ( par sabr karte hue un ) ka sawaab Allah se talab kare to wo zaroor jannat mein dakhil ho gi. \" un mein se ek aurat ne kaha: ya do ( bachche fot ho jayein? ) Allah ke Rasool! to aap ne farmaya: \" ya do bachche ( fot ho jayein.)",
  "muslim|6700": "teen bachche jo bloghat ki Umar ko nahin pahunche.",
  "muslim|6708": "ruhein ek doosre ke saath rahne wali jamaaten hain. un mein se jo ek doosre ( ki ek jaisi safat ) se aagaah ho gin un mein yakjai ( ulfat ) ho gayi aur ( safat ke ikhtelaaf ki bina par ) jo ek doosre se grezan rahein wo baham mukhtalif ho gin.",
  "muslim|6710": "tum ne us ke liye kiya tayar kar rakha hai? \" us ne kaha: Allah aur us ke Rasool ki mohabbat. aap ne farmaya: \" tum isi ke saath ho ge jis se tum ko mohabbat hai.",
  "muslim|6718": "aadmi isi ke saath ho ga jis se wo mohabbat karta hai.",
  "muslim|6721": "ye momin ke liye fori basharat hai.",
  "muslim|6776": "jo log tum se pehle the wo kitaab Allah ke baare mein ikhtelaaf karne se halak ho gaye.",
  "muslim|6777": "tum us waqt tak Quran parhte raho jab tak tumhare dil us par ek doosre ke saath moafqat karte rahein ( Quran ke maani tumhare dil par wazeh hote ja rahe hoon ) jab tum us mein ikhtelaaf karne lago to uth jao.",
  "muslim|6778": "tum us par ek doosre ke saath moafqat aur mutabiqat karte rahein, chunaanchah jab tumhara ikhtelaaf sharwa ho jaye to uth jao.",
  "muslim|6780": "Allah ta'ala ke nazdeek sab se badh kar bughz ke qabil wo shakhs hai jo sakhat jhagdalo ho.",
  "muslim|6781": "tum zaroor un logon ke tariqon par balshat bar balshat aur haath bar haath chalte jao ge jo tum se pehle the ( bina un ke tariqe ikhtiyar karo ge, un se zarah barabar aage peeche na ho ge ) hatta ke agar wo sande ke bill mein ghase to tum bhi un ke peeche ghaso ge. \" hum ne arz ki: Allah ke Rasool! kiya yahud aur nasara ( ke peeche chalin ge? ) aap ne farmaya: \" to ( aur ) kun ke?",
  "muslim|6784": "ghulu mein gahre utarne wale halak ho gaye. \" aap ne teen baar ye baat irshad farmayi.",
  "muslim|6785": "qiyamat ki alamaat mein se ye ( bhi ) hain ke ilm uth jaye ga, jahalat jagzein ho jaye gi, sharaab pi jane lage gi aur zana khal kar hone lage ga.",
  "muslim|6788": "qiyamat se kuchh arsa pehle wo ayam hoon ge jin mein ilm uth jaye ga, jahal tari ho jaye ga aur un dinon harj ki kasrat ho jaye gi aur harj ( se murad ) logon ka qatal hai.",
  "muslim|6793": "zamanah baham qareeb ho jaye ga aur ilm kam ho jaye ga. \" phir isi ke maanind bayan kiya.",
  "muslim|6804": "jis shakhs ne hidayat ki dawat di use us hidayat ki perwi karne walon ke ajr ke barabar ajr mile ga aur un ke ajr mein koi kami nahin ho gi aur jis shakhs ne kisi gumrahi ki dawat di, us par us ki perwi karne walon ke barabar gunah ( ka bojh ) ho ga aur un ke gunahon mein koi kami nahin ho gi.",
  "muslim|6808": "chalte raho, ye jamdan hai. mafrdon 0logon se alag ho kar tanha ho jane wale ) bazi lay gaye. \" logon ne puchha: Allah ke Rasool! mafrdon se kiya murad hai? farmaya: \" kasrat se Allah ko yaad karne wale ( mard ) aur Allah ko yaad karne wali ( auratein.)",
  "muslim|6809": "Allah ta'ala ke nananwe naam hain, jis ne un ki hifazat ki wo jannat mein dakhil ho jaye ga aur Allah Witr ( taaq ) hai, Witr ko pasand karta hai. \" aur Ibn Abi Umar ki riwayat mein hai: \" jis ne un ko shumar kiya.",
  "muslim|6811": "jab tak tum mein se koi shakhs dua kare to qatiat ke saath ( asrar karte hue ) dua kare aur ye na kahe: ay Allah! agar to chahe to mujhe de de, kyunki Allah ko majbur karne waala koi nahin hai.",
  "muslim|6812": "jab tum mein se koi shakhs dua kare to ye na kahe: ay Allah! agar to chahe to mujhe bakhsh de, balkeh wo pakhtagi aur asrar se sawaal kare aur bari ragbat ka izhar kare, kyunki dene ke liye Allah ta'ala ke liye koi cheez bari nahin hai.",
  "muslim|6814": "tum mein se koi shakhs kisi nuqsaan ( museebat ) ki wajah se, jo us par nazil ho, maut ki tamna na kare. agar asne lamhalah maut mangni bhi ho to yun kahe: ay Allah! mujhe us waqt tak zindah rakh jab tak zindagi mere liye behtar ho aur mujhe wafat de jab maut mere liye behtar ho.",
  "muslim|6816": "na hota: \" tum mein se koi shakhs maut ki tamna na kare \" to mein maut ki tamna karta.",
  "muslim|6817": "tha, to mein us ( maut ) ki dua karta.",
  "muslim|6819": "tum mein se koi shakhs hargaz maut ki tamna na kare, na maut aanay se pehle us ke liye dua kare kyunki jab tum mein se koi shakhs mar gaya to us ka amal manqata ho gaya ( mazid amal ki muhlat khatm ho gayi ) aur momin ki Umar us ki bhalai hi mein izafah karti hai.",
  "muslim|6820": "jo shakhs Allah se milne ko mahbub rakhe, Allah us se milne ko mahbub rakhta hai aur jo Allah se milne ko napasand kare, Allah bhi us se milne ko napasand karta hai.",
  "muslim|6828": "jo shakhs Allah se mulaqat ko pasand kare, Allah bhi us se mulaqat ko pasand karta hai aur jo shakhs Allah se mulaqat ko napasand kare, Allah bhi us se milne ko napasand karta hai.",
  "muslim|6829": "Allah ta'ala farmata hai: mera bandah mere baare mein jo guman karta hai, mein ( us ko poora karne ke liye ) us ke pass hota hoon aur jab wo mujhe pukarta hai to mein us ke saath hota hoon.",
  "muslim|6830": "Allah azujal farmata hai: jab mera bandah ek balshat mere qareeb aata hai to mein ek haath us ke qareeb aata hoon aur jab wo ek haath mere qareeb aata hai to mein donon haathon ki lambai ke barabar us ke qareeb aata hoon aur jab wo chal kar mere pass aata hai to mein dod kar us ke pass jata hoon.",
  "muslim|6841": "ay hamare Rabb! humein duniya mein bhi achhai ata farma aur aakhirat mein bhi achhai ata farma aur humein dozakh ke azaab se bacha.",
  "muslim|6843": "koi shakhs jab subah kare aur jab shaam kare to sau baar \" subhanallah wabhamdh \" kahe to qiyamat ke roz koi shakhs us se behtar amal lay kar nahin aaye ga, sawaey us ke jo itni baar ( ye kalimaat ) kahe ya us se zyada baar kahe.",
  "muslim|6846": "do kalme hain jo zabaan par halke hain aur mizan mein bhari hain aur Allah ko bahut mahbub hain: \" subhanallah wabhamdh Subhan alazeem \" Allah har us cheez se paak hai jo us ke shayan shan nahin aur sab hamd isi ko sazawar hai, Allah har us cheez se paak hai jo us ke shayan shan nahin aur azmath ki har sifat se mutsaf hai.",
  "muslim|6847": "ye baat ke mein \" subhanallah walhamdallah wala ilah illa allah wallah akbar \" kahoon, mujhe un tamam chizon se zyada mahbub hai jin par sooraj tulu hota hai.",
  "muslim|6850": "abumaaoia ne kaha; humein abumalk ashaji ne apne walid se hadees bayan ki, kaha: jab koi shakhs musalman hota to Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam us ko namaz sikhate, phir us ko hukm dete ke un kalimaat ke saath dua kiya kare: Allahumma aghfrli warhamni wahdani wafni warzaqni",
  "muslim|6861": "jis shakhs ne sooraj ke Maghrib se tulu hone se pehle taubah kar li, Allah ta'ala us ki taubah ko qubool farma lay ga.",
  "muslim|6868": "kiya mein tumhein jannat ke khazanon mein se ek kalimah na bataon? \".. ya farmaya:.. \" jannat ke khazanon mein se ek khazaney ka pata na bataon? \" mein ne arz ki: kyun nahin ( zaroor bataen ), aap sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne farmaya: \" la hol wala quat illa ballah",
  "muslim|6877": "amru naqd aur Zuhair bin harab ne mujhe hadees bayan ki, unhon ne kaha: humein Sufyan bin Uyainah ne hadees bayan ki, unhon ne kaha: mujhe sami ne abusaleh se hadees bayan ki, unhon ne Hazrat Abu Hurairah razi Allah anhu se riwayat ki ke Rasool Allah sallallahu alaihi wasallam insaan ke haq mein bura Sabit hone wale faislay, badbakhti ke aao lene, apni takleef par dushmanon ke khush hone aur ajiz kar dene wali azmaish se panah manga karte the. amru ne apni hadees ( ki sanad ) mein kaha: Sufyan ne kaha: mujhe shak hai ke ( shayad ) mein ne un baton mein se koi ek baat badha di hai.",
  "muslim|6887": "ay Allah! mein tere naam se jeeta hoon aur tere naam se wafat paaon ga \" aur jab bedar hote to farmate: \" Allah ki hamd hai jis ne humein wafat dene ke baad zindah kar diya aur isi ki taraf ( qiyamat ke roz ) zindah ho kar jata hai.",
  "muslim|6894": "Allah ta'ala ki hamd hai jis ne humein khilaya, pilaya, ( har tarah se ) kaafi hua aur humein thikana diya. kitne log hain jin ka na koi kafayat karne waala hai na thakana dene waala.",
  "muslim|6900": "( hamari taraf se ) Allah ki hamd aur us ke inaam ki khubsurati ( ke aetraf ) ka sunne waala ye baat doosron ko bhi suna de. ay hamare Rabb! hamare saath rah, hum par ihsaan kar, mein aag se Allah ki panah mangte hue ye dua kar raha hoon.",
  "muslim|6904": "karte the: \" ay Allah! mein tajah se hidayat, taqwi, paak damni, aur ( dil ka ) ghana mangta hoon.",
  "muslim|6920": "jab tum marg ki baang suno to Allah ta'ala se us ke fazal ka sawaal karo, kyunki ( us waqt ) us ne ek farishte ko dekha hai aur jab tum gadhe ki aawaz suno to shaitan se Allah ki panah mango kyunki us ne shaitan ko dekha hai.",
  "muslim|6925": "jise Allah ne apne farishton ke liye ya ( un samit ) apne tamam bandon ke liye muntakhib farmaya hai: subhanallah wabhamdh \" mein ( har nemat ke liye ) Allah ki hamd ke saath har nashayan cheez se us ki pakeezgi bayan karta hoon.",
  "muslim|6926": "kiya mein tumhein wo kalimah na bataon jo Allah ta'ala ko sab se zyada mahbub hai? \" mein ne kaha: Allah ke Rasool! mujhe wo kalimah bataiye jo Allah ta'ala ko sab se zyada mahbub hai, to aap sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne farmaya: \" Allah ta'ala ko sab sezyadah mahbub kalimah subhanallah wabhamdh hai.",
  "muslim|6927": "koi musalman bandah nahin jo apne bhai ki peeth peeche us ke liye dua kare, magar ek farshta ( hai jo ) kehta hai: tumhein bhi us ke maanind mile.",
  "muslim|6928": "jis shakhs ne apne bhai ke liye us ki peeth peeche dua ki to jo farshta us ke saath maqrar hai wo kehta hai: Aameen aur tumhein bhi isi ke maanind ata ho.",
  "muslim|6932": "Allah ta'ala us baat par ( apne ) bande se razi hota hai ke wo ek khana khaye aur us par Allah ki hamd kare ya peene ki koi cheez ( paani, doodh wagairah ) pee aur us par Allah ki hamd kare.",
  "muslim|6934": "tum mein se kisi shakhs ki dua us waqt tak qubool hoti hai jab tak wo jild bazi karte hue ye nahin kehta: mein ne dua ki, lekin mere haq mein qubool nahin hoti.. ya nahin hui.",
  "muslim|6935": "tum mein se kisi bhi shakhs ki dua qubool hoti hai jab tak wo jild bazi na kare aur ye ( na ) kahe: mein ne apne Rabb se dua ki to us ne mujhe meri dua ka jawaab nahin diya ( meri dua qubool nahin ki.)",
  "muslim|6938": "mein ne jannat ke andar jhank kar dekha to mein ne ahl jannat mein aksariyat faqrah ki dekhi aur mein ne dozakh mein jhank kar dekha to mein ne dozakh mein aksariyat auraton ki dekhi.",
  "muslim|6942": "jannat mein rahne walon mein sab se kam tadaad auraton ki hai.",
  "muslim|6945": "mein ne apne baad koi azmaish nahin chhodi jo mardon ke liye auraton ( ki azmaish ) se badh kar nuqsaan pahunchane wali ho.",
  "muslim|6946": "mein apne baad logon mein koi isa fitnah chhor kar nahin ja raha jo mardon ke liye auraton se badh kar nuqsaan pahunchane waala ho.",
  "muslim|6963": "agar tum ( log ) gunah na karo to ( tumhari jagah ) Allah ta'ala aisi makhlooq ko paida farma de jo gunah karein ( phir Allah se taubah karein aur ) wo un ki maghfirat farma de.",
  "muslim|6964": "agar tum aise hote ke tumhare ( namah aamaal mein kuchh bhi ) gunah na hote jin ki Allah ta'ala tumhare liye bakhshish farmata to wo aisi qaum ko ( us duniya mein ) lay aata jin ke gunah hote aur wo un ke liye un ( gunahon ) ki maghfirat farmata.",
  "muslim|6965": "us zaat ki qasam jis ke haath mein meri jaan hai! agar tum ( log ) gunah na karo to Allah ta'ala tum ko ( us duniya se ) lay jaye aur ( tumhare badle mein ) aisi qaum ko lay aaye jo gunah karein aur Allah ta'ala se maghfirat mangin to wo un ki maghfirat farmaye.",
  "muslim|6969": "Allah ta'ala ne jab makhlooq ko paida farmaya to apni kitaab mein likh diya aur wo ( kitaab ) arsh ke oopar us ke pass hai: yaqeenan meri rahmat mere ghazab par ghalb ho gi.",
  "muslim|6970": "Allah azujal ne farmaya: meri rahmat mere ghazab par sabqat lay gayi hai.",
  "muslim|6971": "Allah ta'ala ne jab makhlooq ke baare mein faislah farma liya to us ne apni kitaab mein apne oopar lazim karte hue likh diya, wo us ke pass rakhi hui hai: yaqeenan meri rahmat mere ghazab par ghalb rahe gi.",
  "muslim|6972": "Allah ta'ala ne rahmat ke ek sau hissay kiye, nananwe hissay apne pass rok kar rakh liye aur ek hissah zamin par utara, isi ek hissay mein se makhlooq ek doosre par raham karti hai hatta ke ek chopaia us dar se apna sam apne bachche oopar utha leta hai ke kahin us ko lag na jaye.",
  "muslim|6973": "Allah ta'ala ne sau rahmaten paida kein, us ne ek rahmat apni makhlooq mein rakhi aur ek kam sau rahmaten ( aaindah ke liye ) apne pass chhapa kar rakh lein.",
  "muslim|6975": "Allah ta'ala ki sau rahmaten hain, un mein se ek rahmat hai jis ke zariye se makhlooq aapas mein ek doosre par raham karti hai aur nananwe ( rahmaten ) qiyamat ke din ke liye ( mehfooz ) hain.",
  "muslim|6979": "agar momin ko ye ilm ho jaye ke Allah ta'ala ke pass saza kiya hai to koi shakhs us ki jannat ki umeed hi na rakhe, aur agar kafir ko ye pata chal jaye ke Allah ke pass rahmat kis qadr hai to koi ek bhi us ki jannat se mayus na ho.",
  "muslim|6991": "Allah ta'ala se badh kar koi nahin jise madhi ( us ki rahmat wa inayat ka iqraar aur us par us ki tareef ) pasand ho, isi liye us ne khud apni madhi farmayi hai aur koi nahin jo Allah se badh kar ghairat mand ho, isi liye us ne be hayai ke tamam kaam, un mein se jo zahr hain aur jo poshidah hain, haraam kar diye hain.",
  "muslim|6992": "Allah se badh kar koi gheor nahin hai, isi liye us ne be hayai ke tamam kaam, un mein se jo zahr hain aur jo poshidah hain haraam kar diye hain, Allah ta'ala se badh kar koi nahin hai jise madhi zyada pasand ho.",
  "muslim|6995": "Allah ta'ala ghairat farmata hai aur beshak momin bhi ghairat karta hai. Allah ki ghairat us baat par hoti hai ke momin aise kaam ka irtakaab kare jo us ne us par haraam kiya hai.",
  "muslim|6998": "Allah azujal se badh kar koi gheor nahin hai.",
  "muslim|6999": "momin ( doosre ) momin ke liye ghairat karta hai ( ke us ki harmat pamal na ki jaye ) aur Allah ta'ala to ghairat mein us se badh kar hai.",
  "muslim|7006": "kiya to hamare saath namaz mein shamil hua? \" us ne arz ki: haan, farmaya: \" tera gunah bakhsh diya gaya hai.",
  "muslim|7011": "jab qiyamat ka din ho ga to Allah ta'ala ( ek marhale par ) har musalman ko ek yahudi ya nasrani ata kar de ga, phir farmaye ga: ye jahannam se tumhare liye chhatkare ka zariya banay ga.",
  "muslim|7012": "jo musalman bhi fot hota hai Allah ta'ala us ki jagah par ek yahudi ya ek nasrani ko dozakh mein dakhil kar deta hai. \" kaha: Umar bin Abdul Aziz ne Hazrat abubardah ko teen baar us Allah ki qasam di jis ke siwa koi ibadat ke laeq nahin khwaqi un ke walid ne unhein Rasool Allah sallallahu alaihi wasallam se ye hadees bayan ki thi. unhon ne un ( Umar bin Abdul Aziz ) ke samne qasam khayi. ( Qatadah ne ) kaha: Saeed ne mujh se ye bayan nahin kiya ke unhon ne un se qasam li aur na unhon ne aon ki ( bathayi hui ) baat par koi aetraz kiya.",
  "muslim|7417": "duniya momin ka qaid khanah aur kafir ki jannat hai.",
  "muslim|7420": "Ibn Adam kehta hai mera maal, mera maal. \" farmaya \" Adam alaihi assalam ke bete! tere maal mein se tere liye sirf wahi hai jo tum ne kha karfana kardia, ya pahan kar purana kardia, ya sadaqah karke aage bhej diya.",
  "muslim|7424": "mit ke peeche teen cheezain hoti hain un mein se do lot aati hain aur ek saath rah jati hai us ke ghar wale, us ka maal aur us ka amal us ke peeche rah ja tay hain, ghar wale aur maal lot aao tay hain aur amal saath rah jata hai.",
  "muslim|7428": "jab tum mein se koi shakhs us ki taraf dekhay jise maal aur jamal mein fazilat hasil hai to us ko bhi dekhay jo us se kamtar hai, jis par ( khud ) use fazilat hasil hai.",
  "muslim|7430": "us ki taraf dekho jo ( maal war jamal mein ) tum se kamtar hai, us ki taraf mat dekho jo tum se faiq hai, ye laeq tar hai uskay ke tum Allah ki nemat ko haqeer na samjho ge. \"\" Abu Muawiyah nekha: \"\" ( wo nemat ) jo tum par ki gayi.",
  "muslim|7440": "ay Allah! Muhammad ( sallallahu alaihi wasallam ) ke gharoalon ke rizq ko zindagi barkaraar rakhne jitna karde.",
  "muslim|7444": "Aamash ne Ibrahim se unhon ne aswad se aur unhon ne Hazrat Aishah razi Allah ta'ala anha se riwayat ki kaha: Rasool Allah ne kabhi matwatar teen din sair ho kar gandam ki roti nahin khayi yahan tak ke aap apni rah par rawana ho gaye.",
  "muslim|7464": "un azaab diye gaye logon ke haan ( un ke gharon mein dakhil na ho na magar us soorat mein ke tum ( Allah kegzab ke darse ) rorhe ho. agar tum ro nahin rahe hoto un ke haan dakhil na hona isa na ho ke tum par bhi wahi azaab aaja ye jo un par aayatha.",
  "muslim|7468": "bewah ormskin ke liye mehnat karne waala Allah ki rah mein jihad karne wale ki tarah hai. aur mera ( Abd Allah bin muslma ka ) khayal hai ke unhon ( Malik rahmat Allah alaihi ) ne kaha: wo ( Allah ke samne ) us qiyam karne wale ki tarah hai jo waqfah karta hai na tahakta hai aur us roze dar ki tarah hai jo roza nahin chhodta.",
  "muslim|7475": "Allah ta'ala ne irshad farmaya ke sharik banae jane walon mein sab se zyada mein sharakat se mastaghni hoon. jis shakhs ne bhi koi amal kiya aur us mein mere saath kisi aur kushrik kiya to mein use us ke shark ke saath akilachhoddita hoon.",
  "muslim|7476": "jo shakhs ( apnaamal logon ko ) sanata hai Allah us ke baare mein ( hone waala faislah ) logon ko sanaey ga ( aur use rasoakre ga ) aur jo ( logon ko ) dikhata phirta hai Allah ta'ala us ke baare mein logon ko dikha de ga. ( ke us ka anjam kiya hua)",
  "muslim|7477": "jo shakhs ( logon ko ) sanatahe Allah ta'ala us ke baare mein ( sab ko ) sanwayega aur jo ( apnaamal ) logon ko dikhata hai Allah ta'ala us ke baare mein logon ko dakhayega.",
  "muslim|7479": "Saeed bin Umar washashi ne kaha: humein Sufyan ne waled bin harab. sidne kaha: mirakhiyal hai unhon ( Sufyan ) ne kaha: ( waled ) Ibn Haris bin Abi Musa. se riwayat ki unhon ne kaha: mein ne Salamah bin khil se suna unhon ne kaha: mein ne Hazrat jandab razi Allah ta'ala anhu ke alawah aur kisi ko ye kehte hue nahin suna. mein ne Rasool Allah sallallahu alaihi wasallam se sanahe, wo kehte hain. mein ne Rasool Allah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ko farmate hue suna ( aage ) jis tarah ( Sufyan ) chori ki hadees ( 7478 ) mein hai.",
  "muslim|7481": "( baaz auqaat ) bandah koi kalimah keh deta hai jis ki wajah se dozakh mein us se bhi zyada door utar jata hejtani doori mashriq aur Maghrib ke darmiyan hai.",
  "muslim|7482": "bandah koi isa kalimah keh deta hai ke us ko wazeh taur par pata nahin ho ta ke us mein kiya hai, us ki wajah se wo dozakh mein us se zyada door jagarta hai jitni doori mashriq aur Maghrib ke darmiyan hai.",
  "muslim|7489": "use doosri chahink aayi to aap ne farmaya \" us shakhs ko zukaam hai.",
  "muslim|7490": "jama yi shaitan ki taraf se hai lahzatam mein se jab kisi shakhs ko jamai aaye to wo jahan tak us ko rok sakay roke.",
  "muslim|7491": "jab tum mein se kisi shakhs ko jamai aaye to wo apne munh par haath rakh kar us ko roke kyunki ( isa na karne se ) shaitan andar dakhil ho ta hai.",
  "muslim|7492": "jab tum mein se kisi kujmayi aaye to wo use apne haath se roke kyunki shaitan andar dakhil hota hai.",
  "muslim|7493": "jab tum mein se kisi shakhs ko namaz mein jamai aaye to wo jitna us ke bas mein hoas ko roke kyunki shaitan andar dakhil hota hai.",
  "muslim|7495": "farishton ko nor se paida kiya gaya hai aur janon ko aag ke sholay se auradam alaihi assalam ko us ( maaday ) se paida kiya gaya hai jis ko tumhare liye jaan kiya gaya hai.",
  "muslim|7500": "momin ka muamalah ajeeb hai. us ka harmaamlah us ke liye bhalai ka hai. aur ye baat momin ke siwa kisi aur komisr nahin. use khushi aur khushhali mile toshkar karta hai. aur ye us ke liye achha hota hai aur agar use koi nuqsaan pahunche to ( Allah ki raza ke liye ) sabr kar ta hai, ye ( abhi ) us ke liye bhalai hoti hai.",
  "muslim|7505": "Abu mamar se riwayat hai ke ek shakhs khadahwa umrah mein se kisi amer ki tareef karne laga tohzrt muqdaad razi Allah ta'ala anhu us shakhs par mitti dalne lage, aur kaha: Rasool Allah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne humein ye hukm diyatha ke hum madhi saraon ke munh mein mitti dalin.",
  "muslim|7506": "tha: \" jab tum madhi saraon ko dekho to un ke chahron mein mitti dalo.",
  "muslim|7508": "mein ne khawab mein dekha ke mein masoak karraha hoon, do aadmiyon ne mujhe apni apni janib khincha, un mein se ek doosre se bara tha, mein ne masoak chhote ko pakda di to mujh se kaha gaya: bare ko dein, chunaanchah mein ne wo bare ke hawale kardi.",
  "muslim|7509": "Hisham ne apne walid ( Urwah ) se riwayat ki, unhon ne kaha: Hazrat Abu Hurairah razi Allah ta'ala anhu ahadees bayan karrhe the aur aawaz lagarhe the: ay hujre ke Malik! sanee, ay hujre ke Malik! sanee, us waqt Hazrat Aishah razi Allah ta'ala anha ( andar ) namaz parh rahi thin. unhon ne jab namaz makmal ki to Urwah se kaha: tum ne abhi use aur us ki kahi hui baat nahin sunni? Nabi kareem sallallahu alaihi wasallam ( ek waqt mein ) ek baat ( hadees ) irshad farmate the, agar koi ganne waala use ganta to gun sakta tha.",
  "muslim|7510": "mujh se ( sunni hui baatein ) mat likho, jis ne Quran majid ( ke saath us ke alawah meri koi baat ( hadees ) likhi wo us ko mita de, albatah meri hadees ( yaad rakh karage ) bayan karo, us mein koi harj nahin, aur jis ne mujh par. Hammam ne kaha: mera khayal hai ke unhon ( Zaid bin aslam ) ne kaha: jaan bojh kar jhoot bandhaua a pana thikana jahannam mein banale.",
  "muslim|841": ". Ayyub ne Abu qalaba se aur unhon ne Hazrat Anas razi Allah anhu se riwayat ki, unhon ne kaha: Bilal razi Allah anhu ko hukm diya gaya ke dahri azaan aur akhri qamat kahin.",
  "muslim|845": "Muhammad bin jafar ne kaha: humein Hisham ne apne walid se hadees bayan ki, unhon ne Hazrat Aishah se riwayat ki, unhon ne kaha: Ibn Umm maktum Rasool allhasli Allah alaihi wasallam ke liye azaan diya karte the, halanka wo nabeena the.",
  "muslim|857": "jab mozan azaan kehta hai to shaitan peeth pher kar guz maartaa hua jata hai. ‘ ‘",
  "muslim|860": "Hammam bin manba ne Hazrat Abu Hurairah razi Allah anhu se aur unhon ne nabisli Allah alaihi wasallam se mazkorah bala riwayat ke maanind bayan kiya, magar unhon ne ( ma yadri kam sallallahu ke bajaye ) un yadri kaif sallallahu ’’wo nahin janta kaise namaz parhi ‘ ‘ kaha.",
  "muslim|862": "Ibn jarij ne Ibn Shihab se aur unhon ne salim bin Abd Allah se riwayat ki ke Hazrat Ibn Umar ne kaha: Rasool allhasli Allah alaihi wasallam jab namaz ke liye khare hote to apne donon haath buland karte hatta ke aap ke kandhon ke samne aao jate, phir Allah akbar kehte, phir jab ruku karna chahte to yahi kehte aur jab ruku se sir athate to bhi isa karte aur jab sajde se apna sir athate toaisa na karte the.",
  "muslim|865": ". abooanah ne Qatadah se, unhon ne nasr bin asm se aur unhon ne Hazrat Malik bin hoers razi Allah anhu se riwayat ki ke Rasool allhasli Allah alaihi wasallam jab Allah akbar kehte to apne donon haath buland karte yahan tak ke unhein apne kanon ke barabar lay jate aur jab ruku karte to ( phir ) apne donon haath buland karte yahan tak ke unhein apne kanon ke barabar lay jate aur jab ruku se apna sir athate to sama Allah lemon hamdh kehte aur isa hi karte.",
  "muslim|867": "Abu Salamah bin Abd ar-Rahman se riwayat hai ke Hazrat Abu Hurairah razi Allah anhu unhein namaz parha rahe the to jab bhi wo jahakte aur ( sir aur jism ko oopar ) athate to Allah akbar kehte, phir jab salaam phira to kaha: Allah ki qasam! mein namaz mein tum sab ki nasbat Rasool allhasli Allah alaihi wasallam se zyada mashabahat rakhta hoon.",
  "muslim|871": "Yahya bin Abi kaseer ne Abu Salamah se riwayat ki ke Hazrat Abu Hurairah razi Allah anhu namaz mein jab bhi ( sir ) athate aur jahakate, takbeer kehte, us par hum ne kaha: Abu Hurairah razi Allah anhu! ye takbeer kiya hai? unhon ne kaha: yaqeenan yahi Rasool allhasli Allah alaihi wasallam ki namaz hai.",
  "muslim|875": "us shakhs ki koi namaz nahin jis ne Umm alqari ( fathaa ) nahin parhi. ‘ ‘",
  "muslim|880": "jis ne koi namaz parhi aur us mein Umm alquran na parhi ‘ ‘... aage Sufyan ki hadees ke maanind hai aur ( Malik bin Anas aur Ibn jarij ) donon ki riwayat mein hai: ’’ Allah azujal ne farmaya: mein ne namaz apne aur apne bande ke darmiyan adhi adhi taqsim ki hai, us ka adha hissah mere liye hai aur adha mere bande ke liye. ‘ ‘",
  "muslim|903": "Abd ar-Rahman bin Humaid ne kaha: mujhe Abu Zubair ne taus ke hawale se Hazrat Ibn abbas razi Allah anhu se hadees bayan ki, unhon ne kaha: Rasool allhasli Allah alaihi wasallam humein tashahad yun sikhate the jaise aap humein Quran ki surat sikhate the.",
  "muslim|908": "kaho: ay Allah! Muhammad aur Muhammad ki aal par rahmat farma, jaise to ne Ibrahim ki aal par rahmat farmayi, blashbah to sazawar hamd, azmaton waala hai. ay Allah! Muhammad par aur Muhammad ki aal par barkat nazil farma, jaise to ne Ibrahim ki aal par barkat nazil farmayi, blashbah to sazawar hamd hai, azmaton waala hai. ‘ ‘",
  "muslim|911": "kaho: ay Allah! rahmat farma Muhammad par aur aap ki azwaj aur aap ki aulad par, jaise to ne Ibrahim ki aal par rahmat farmayi aur barkat nazil farma Muhammad par aur aap ki azwaj aur aap ki aulad par, jaise to ne barkat nazil farmayi Ibrahim ki aal par, blashbah to saza war hamd hai, azmaton waala hai. ‘ ‘",
  "muslim|912": "jis ne mujh par ek baar darod bheja Allah ta'ala us par das baar rahmat nazil farmaye ga.",
  "muslim|913": "jab Imam sama Allah lemon hamdh ( Allah ne sun liya jis ne us ki tareef ki ) kahe to tum kaho: Allahumma, Rabbana luck Alhamd ( ay Allah! hamare Rabb! sab tareef tere liye hai ) kyunki jis ka qol farishton ke qol ke muafaq ho gaya us ke guzashta gunah maaf kar diye jayein ge. ‘ ‘",
  "muslim|915": "jab Imam Aameen kahe to tum bhi Aameen kaho kyunki jis ki Aameen farishton ki Aameen ke muafaq ho jaye gi, us ke sabiqah gunah maaf kar diye jayein ge. ‘ ‘",
  "muslim|918": "jab tum mein se ek shakhs Aameen kahe aur farishte aasmaan mein Aameen kahin aur Aameen doosri ke muafaq ho jaye to us shakhs ke pichhle gunah maaf kar diye jate hain",
  "muslim|920": "jab qari ﴿ghair almaghzob alaihum waala alzalin﴾ kahe aur jo us ke peeche hai wo ( bhi ) Aameen kahe aur us ka kehna aasmaan walon ki kahi hui ( Aameen ) ke muafaq ho jaye to us ke pichhle gunah maaf kar diye jate hain. ‘ ‘",
  "muslim|932": "Imam se aage na badho, jab wo takbeer kahe to tum takbeer kaho, jab wo ﴿wala alzalin﴾ kahe to tum Aameen kaho aur jab wo ruku kare to tum ruku karo aur jab wo sama Allah lemon hamdh kahe to tum Allahumma, Rabbana luck Alhamd kaho. ‘ ‘",
  "muslim|933": "jab wo ﴿wala alzalin﴾ kahe to tum Aameen kaho ‘ ‘ aur ye hissah badhaya: ’’ aur tum us se pehle ( sir ) na uthao. ‘ ‘",
  "muslim|934": "yaqeenan Imam ek dhal hai ( tum us ke peeche peeche raho ), chunaanchah jab wo baitth kar namaz padhe to tum bhi baitth kar namaz parho aur jab wo sama Allah lemon hamdh kahe to tum Allahumma, Rabbana luck Alhamd kaho kyunki jab zamin wale ka kaha hua aasmaan walon ke kehne ke muafaq ho jaye ga to us ke sabiqah gunah bakhsh diye jayein ge. ‘ ‘",
  "muslim|935": "Imam us liye banaya gaya hai ke us ki perwi ki jaye, jab wo takbeer kahe to tum takbeer kaho aur jab wo ruku kare to tum ruku aur jab wo sama Allah lemon hamdh kahe to tum Allahumma, Rabbana luck Alhamd kaho, aur jab wo khara ho kar namaz padhe to tum bhi khare ho kar parho aur jab wo baitth kar padhe to tum bhi sab ke sab baitth kar namaz parho. ‘ ‘",
  "muslim|963": "jo shakhs Imam se pehle ( ruku wasajod se ) sir athata hai kiya wo us baat se nahin darta ke Allah ta'ala us ke sarko gadhe ke sir jaisa bina de? ‘ ‘",
  "muslim|964": "jo shakhs apni namaz mein Imam se pehle sir athata hai wo us baat se mehfooz nahin ke Allah ta'ala us ki soorat gadhe ki soorat mein badal de",
  "muslim|966": "jo log namaz mein apni nazrin aasmaan ki taraf athate hain wo har soorat ( apni us harkat se ) baz aao jayein warna ( ho sakta hai un ki nazar ) un ki taraf na lote ( salb kar li jaye. ) ‘ ‘",
  "muslim|967": "log namaz mein dua ke waqt apni nazrin aasmaan ki taraf buland karne se lazman baz aao jayein ya ( phir isa ho sakta hai ke ) un ki nazrin achk li jayein. ‘ ‘",
  "muslim|972": "barabar ho jao aur juda juda khare na ho ke us se tumhare dil baham mukhtalif ho jayein, mere saath tum mein se pukhtah aqal wale danish mand ( khare ) hoon, un ke baad wo jo ( danish mandi mein ) un ke qareeb hoon, phir wo jo un ke qareeb hoon. ‘ ‘ Abu Masood razi Allah anhu ne farmaya: aaj tum ek doosre se shadid tarin ikhtelaaf rakhte ho.",
  "muslim|974": "mere saath tum mein se pukhtah aqal wale aur danish mand khare hoon, phir wo jo ( us mein ) un ke qareeb hoon ( phir wo jo un ke qareeb hoon, phir wo jo un ke qareeb hoon ) teen baar farmaya: aur tum bazaron ke good mud groh ( bannay ) se bacho. ‘ ‘",
  "muslim|975": "apni safon ko barabar kiya karo kyunki safon ka barabar karna namaz ki takmeel ka hissah hai <hiding 2> </hiding 2>",
  "muslim|978": "tum har soorat apni safon ko barabar rakho warna Allah ta'ala lazman tumhare rukh ek doosre ki mukhalif samton mein kar de ga. ‘ ‘",
  "muslim|982": "aage badho aur ( baraah rast ) meri aqtada karo aur jo log tumhare baad hoon wo tumhari aqtada karein, kuchh log musalsal peeche rehte jayein hatta ke Allah ta'ala un ko peeche kar de ga. ‘ ‘",
  "muslim|984": "agar tum jaan low, ya log jaan lein ke agli saf mein kiya ( fazilat ) hai to us par qarah andazi ho. ‘ ‘ Ibn harab ne ( fi alsaf almaqdam lakant qaraat ke bajaye ) fi alsaf alawal ma kant illa qaraat ’’pehli saf mein kiya hai to qarah ke siwa kuchh na ho ‘ ‘ kaha.",
  "muslim|985": "mardo ki behtareen saf pehli aur badtareen saf aakhri hai jabka auraton ki behtareen saf aakhri aur badtareen saf pehli hai.",
  "muslim|987": "Hazrat sahal bin Saad razi Allah anhu se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: mein ne mardon ko dekha ke chaadarein tang hone ki wajah se wo bachchon ki tarah apni chaadarein gardanon mein bandhay hue nabisli Allah alaihi wasallam ke peeche namaz parh rahe the, us par kisi kehne wale ne kaha: ay auraton ki jamaat! tum us waqt tak apne saron ko ( sajde se ) na uthana jab tak mard ( sir na ) utha lein. ( khadankhoastah kisi mard ke sattar ka koi hissah khila hua na ho. ye baat aapsli Allah alaihi wasallam ki mojudgi mein kahi gayi aur aap ne kehne wale ko na toka.)",
  "muslim|988": "jab tum mein se kisi se us ki biwi masjid jane ki ijazat mange to wo use na roke. ‘ ‘",
  "muslim|990": "Allah ki bandiyon ko Allah ki masajid se na ruko. ‘ ‘",
  "muslim|991": "jab tumhari auratein tum se masajid mein jane ki ijazat mangin to unhein ijazat de do",
  "muslim|992": "raat ko auraton ko masajdon mein jane se na ruko. ‘ ‘ to Abd Allah bin Umar razi Allah anhuma ke ek bete ne kaha: hum un ko nahin chhoden ge ke wo jayein aur use kharabi aur bagar ( ka zariya ) bina lein. ( mujahid ne ) kaha: Ibn Umar razi Allah anhuma ne use sakhat danta au ra kaha: mein kehta hoon Rasool allhasli Allah alaihi wasallam ne farmaya aur to kehta hai hum unhein nahin chhoden ge",
  "muslim|994": "auraton ko raat ke waqt masajdon ki taraf nikalnay ki ijazat do. ‘ ‘ to un ke bete ne, jis ko waqad kaha jata tha, kaha: tab wo us ko kharabi wa bagad bina lein gi. ( mujahid ne ) kaha: Ibn Umar razi Allah anhuma ne us ke seene par mara aur kaha: mein tumhein Rasool allhasli Allah alaihi wasallam se hadees suna raha hoon aur to kehta hai: nahin",
  "muslim|995": "auraton ko, jab wo tum se ijazat talab karein to masajdon mein jo un ke hissay hain un ( ke hasool ) se ( unhein ) na ruko. ‘ ‘ Bilal ne kaha: Allah ki qasam! hum un ko zaroor roken ge. Abd Allah bin Umar razi Allah anhuma ne farmaya aur to kehta hai: hum unhein zaroor roken ge",
  "muslim|996": "jab tum auraton mein se koi isha ki namaz mein shamil ho to wo us raat khushboo na lagaye. ‘ ‘",
  "muslim|997": "jab tum mein se koi masjid mein jaye to wo khushboo ko haath na lagaye. ‘ ‘",
  "muslim|998": "jis aurat ko ( bakhoor ) khushbudar dhuan lag jaye, wo hamare saath Isha ki namaz mein hazir na ho. ‘ ‘",
  "muslim|999": "sulaiman bin Bilal ne Yahya bin Saeed se aur unhon ne amrah bint Abd alrahman se riwayat ki ke unhon ne Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam ki zujah Hazrat Aishah razi Allah anha se suna, wo farmati thin ke auraton ne ( banao singhar ke ) jo naye andaz nikal liye hain agar Rasool allhasli Allah alaihi wasallam dekh lete to unhein masjid mein aanay se rok dete, jis tarah bani israel ki auraton ko rok diya gaya tha. mein ne amrah se puchha: kiya bani israel ki auraton ko masjid mein aanay se rok diya gaya tha? unhon ne kaha: haan.",
  "tirmidhi|1913": "jo shakhs larkiyon ki parwarish se dochar ho, phir un ki parwarish se aanay wali musibaton par sabr kare to ye sab ladkiyan us ke liye jahannam se aad banein gi“. Imam Tirmidhi kehte hain: ye hadees Hasan hai.",
  "tirmidhi|1914": "jis ne do larkiyon ki kafalat ki to mein aur wo jannat mein us tarah dakhil hoon ge“, aur aap ne kefiat batane ke liye apni donon ungliyon ( shahadat aur darmiyani ) se isharah kiya. Imam Tirmidhi kehte hain: 1- ye hadees us sanad se Hasan ghareeb hai, 2- Muhammad bin abeed ne Muhammad bin Abdul Aziz ke wastah se isi sanad se kayi hadisen riwayat ki hai aur sanad bayan karte hue kaha hai: «an Abi bakr bin abeed Allah bin Anas» halanka sahih yun hai «an abeed Allah bin Abi bakr bin Anas».",
  "tirmidhi|3591": "ay Allah! mein tajah se buri adton, bure kaamon aur buri khwahshon se panah mangta hoon“. Imam Tirmidhi kehte hain: 1- ye hadees Hasan ghareeb hai 2- aur ziyad bin elaqah ke chicha ka naam qatbah bin Malik hai aur ye Nabi akram sallallahu alaihi wasallam ke sahabah mein se hain.",
};
